window.MagnolieI18n.registerCatalog("hsb", {"messages":{"<figure class='autorenbild'><img class='autorenfoto' src='maik-walter.jpg' alt='Porträt von Maik Walter'><figcaption>Maik Walter, Programmierer von Magnolie und Autor dieses Handbuchs.</figcaption></figure><p><b>Maik Walter</b> ist der Programmierer von Magnolie Organizer und Magnolie Notes sowie der Autor dieses Handbuchs. Er ist Vater von drei Kindern, arbeitet in der Pflege und verfügt über mehr als zwanzig Jahre Linux-Erfahrung.</p><p>Das Magnolie-Projekt entstand auf Wunsch eines Nutzers. Es ist ein Ein-Mann-Hobbyprojekt, das Maik in seiner Freizeit entwickelt und pflegt, nicht ein Projekt eines Unternehmens oder eines großen Entwicklungsteams.</p><div class='beispiel'><b>Warum diese Seite auch als Nachweis dient</b>Sie hält fest, wer die Software und das Buch geschaffen hat, weshalb das Projekt entstand und aus welchem praktischen Hintergrund seine Entscheidungen hervorgingen. So können Nutzer das unabhängige Magnolie-Projekt von einem anonymen kommerziellen Produkt unterscheiden.</div><p>Erfahrungen aus dem Pflegealltag, direkte Wünsche von Nutzern und die langjährige Vertrautheit mit Linux prägen das Ziel des Projekts: Die Funktionen sollen für Menschen unterschiedlichen Alters und mit sehr verschiedenen technischen Kenntnissen verständlich bleiben, während ihr technisches Verhalten dennoch präzise dokumentiert wird.</p><div class='merke'><b>Direkte Rückmeldung</b>Es gibt keine eigene Marketing- oder Supportabteilung. Klare Fehlerberichte, genaue Schritte, Bildschirmfotos und konkrete Beispiele erreichen das Projekt direkt und helfen dabei, spätere Versionen und dieses Handbuch zu verbessern.</div>":"<figure class='autorenbild'><img class='autorenfoto' src='maik-walter.jpg' alt='Portret Maika Waltera'><figcaption>Maik Walter, programowar Magnolie a awtor tuteje přiručki.</figcaption></figure><p><b>Maik Walter</b> je programowar Magnolie Organizer a Magnolie Notes kaž tež awtor tuteje přiručki. Je nan třoch dźěći, dźěła w hladanskim powołanju a ma wjace hač dwaceći lět nazhonjenjow z Linuxom.</p><p>Projekt Magnolie je na přeće wužiwarja nastał. Je to hobbyjowy projekt jednoho muža, kotryž Maik w swojim swobodnym času wuwiwa a hladźi, nic projekt předewzaća abo wulkeho wuwiwarskeho teama.</p><div class='beispiel'><b>Čehodla je tuta strona tež dopokaz</b>Wona dokumentuje, štó je software a knihu stworzył, čehodla je projekt nastał a z kotreho praktiskeho pozadka jeho rozsudy pochadźeja. Wužiwarjo móža tuž njewotwisny projekt Magnolie wot anonymneho komercielneho produkta rozeznawać.</div><p>Nazhonjenja ze wšědneho hladanskeho dźěła, direktne přeća wužiwarjow a dołholětna znajomosć Linuxa zaměr projekta postajeja: funkcije maja za ludźi rozdźělneho starstwa a z rozdźělnymi techniskimi znajomosćemi zrozumliwe wostać, mjeztym zo so jich techniske zadźerženje dale dokładnje dokumentuje.</p><div class='merke'><b>Direktne měnjenje</b>Wosebity marketingowy abo podpěrowanski wotrjad njeeksistuje. Jasne zmylkowe rozprawy, dokładne kroki, wobrazowki a konkretne přikłady projekt direktnje docpěwaja a pomhaja, pozdźiše wersije a tutu přiručku polěpšić.</div>","<h3>A reminder does not appear</h3><p>First make sure that reminders are switched on and that the Organizer may notify you at all: under Windows check the notification settings for Magnolie Organizer, and remember that no reminder is raised once you have quit the program completely.</p><p>Under Linux, open a terminal (<kbd>Ctrl</kbd>+<kbd>Alt</kbd>+<kbd>T</kbd>) and enter:</p><div class='beispiel'><b>Command</b>magnolie-organizer --probe</div><p>The Organizer demonstrates a reminder and reports which display it found, whether the reminder service is running, and how the sound was played. The cause is usually stated clearly in this report.</p><p>For more detailed troubleshooting on either system, go to the <i>Notification</i> page and temporarily select <b>Keep a troubleshooting log</b>, reproduce the problem, and then click <span class='knopfwort'>Show log</span>. Logging is off by default.</p><h3>The tray icon is missing or reports an error</h3><p>First enable the tray applet under <i>Settings ▸ General</i>. On GNOME, also enable the AppIndicator extension; on Cinnamon, allow XApp status icons. Start <i>magnolie-organizer</i> from a terminal and read the first tray-related message. It usually names the missing AppIndicator, XApp, or StatusNotifier component. Logging out and in once may be necessary after installing it. Under Windows, allow Magnolie Organizer in the taskbar-corner or additional-icons settings and check that the program is still running.</p><div class='merke'><b>Locale affects diagnostic text</b>Terminal and library messages follow the active locale and can therefore differ from the Organizer language. Run <i>locale</i> to see it. For a reproducible English report, use <i>LC_ALL=C magnolie-organizer</i>; this changes only that invocation and does not change your saved Organizer language.</div><h3>The spell checker does not underline anything</h3><p>The dictionary for your language is probably missing. Under Linux install it from a terminal, for US English:</p><div class='beispiel'><b>Command</b>sudo apt install hunspell-en-us</div><p>Under Windows, install the language features under <i>Settings ▸ Time &amp; language ▸ Language &amp; region ▸ Language options</i>.</p><h3>The map service cannot find the address</h3><p>Under <span class='knopfwort'>Settings ▸ Contacts</span>, check that <i>Country for searches</i> contains the correct country. To calculate a route, your own address must also be complete because it is used as the starting point.</p><h3>The computer does not wake up</h3><p>If the system does not permit wake-up calls, the reminder appears only after the computer wakes.</p><h3>The book does not open</h3><p>Under Linux, start the Organizer in a terminal with the command <i>magnolie-organizer</i>; any messages will appear there. The <i>--help</i> option lists all startup modes. Under Windows, the usual cause is a missing display component: install or repair the current <b>Microsoft Edge WebView2 Runtime</b> and start the Organizer again.</p><div class='merke'><b>If in doubt</b>Create a backup first (page <b data-page='backing-up-and-restoring' class='knopfwort'></b>). You can then experiment without putting your data at risk.</div><h3>A dialog does not fully block mouse clicks behind it</h3><p>Under Linux, complete background blocking requires WebKitGTK 2.38 or later. With WebKitGTK 2.36 on an older distribution, avoid clicking behind an open dialog. Keyboard focus, Tab trapping and Escape still remain limited to the uppermost dialog.</p>":"<h3>Dopomnjeće so njezjewi</h3><p>Přepruwujće najprjedy, hač su dopominanja zapinjene a hač Organizer smě wam zdźělenki pokazać: pod Windows přepruwujće zdźělenske nastajenja za Magnolie Organizer. Po dospołnym skónčenju programa so dopomnjeće wjace njezjewi.</p><p>Pod Linuxom wočińće terminal (<kbd>Ctrl</kbd>+<kbd>Alt</kbd>+<kbd>T</kbd>) a zapodajće:</p><div class='beispiel'><b>Přikaz</b>magnolie-organizer --probe</div><p>Organizer pokazuje testowe dopomnjeće a rozprawja, kotru wobrazowku je namakał, hač słužba dopominanjow běži a kak je so zynk wothrał. Přičina je zwjetša w rozprawje jasnje podata.</p><p>Za dokładniše pytanje zmylka dźiće na stronku <i>Zdźělenki</i>, zapńće nachwilnje <b>Protokol za pytanje zmylkow wobchować</b>, zopakujće problem a klikńće potom na <span class='knopfwort'>Protokol pokazać</span>. Po standardźe je protokolowanje wupinjene.</p><h3>Systemowy symbol faluje abo zmylk zdźěluje</h3><p>Zmóžńće najprjedy systemowy applet pod <i>Nastajenja ▸ Powšitkowne</i>. W GNOME zmóžńće tež rozšěrjenje AppIndicator, w Cinnamon XApp-statusowe symbole. Startujće <i>magnolie-organizer</i> w terminalu a čitajće prěnju powěsć wo systemowym symbolu. Wona zwjetša mjenuje falowacu komponentu AppIndicator, XApp abo StatusNotifier. Po instalaciji móže być trěbne, so jónu wotzjewić a zaso přizjewić. Pod Windows dowolće Magnolie Organizer w nastajenjach róžka nadawkoweje lajsty abo přidatnych symbolow a přepruwujće, hač program hišće běži.</p><div class='merke'><b>Lokala diagnostiski tekst wobwliwuje</b>Powěsće terminala a bibliotekow slěduja aktiwnej lokali a móža so tohodla wot rěče Organizera rozeznawać. Z <i>locale</i> ju widźiće. Za wospjetujomnu jendźelsku rozprawu wužijće <i>LC_ALL=C magnolie-organizer</i>; to změni jenož tute zawołanje, nic składowanu rěč Organizera.</div><h3>Prawopisna kontrola ničo njepodšmórnuje</h3><p>Najskerje słownik wašeje rěče faluje. Pod Linuxom instalujće jón w terminalu, za amerisku jendźelšćinu:</p><div class='beispiel'><b>Přikaz</b>sudo apt install hunspell-en-us</div><p>Pod Windows instalujće rěčne funkcije pod <i>Nastajenja ▸ Čas &amp; rěč ▸ Rěč &amp; region ▸ Rěčne opcije</i>.</p><h3>Kartowa słužba adresu njenamaka</h3><p>Přepruwujće pod <span class='knopfwort'>Nastajenja ▸ Kontakty</span>, hač <i>Kraj za pytanja</i> prawy kraj wobsahuje. Za wobličenje ruty dyrbi tež waša adresa dospołna być, dokelž so jako start wužiwa.</p><h3>Ličak so njewubudźi</h3><p>Jeli system budźenske wołanja njedowoli, so dopomnjeće hakle po wubudźenju ličaka zjewi.</p><h3>Kniha so njewočini</h3><p>Pod Linuxom startujće Organizer w terminalu z přikazom <i>magnolie-organizer</i>; powěsće so tam pokazuja. Opcija <i>--help</i> wšitke startowe modusy nalistuje. Pod Windows je zwučena přičina falowaca pokazowanska komponenta: instalujće abo reparujće aktualny <b>Microsoft Edge WebView2 Runtime</b> a startujće Organizer znowa.</p><div class='merke'><b>W dwělu</b>Wutworće najprjedy zawěsćensku kopiju (strona <b data-page='backing-up-and-restoring' class='knopfwort'></b>). Potom móžeće bjez strašenja wašich datow eksperimentować.</div><h3>Dialog kliknjenja myše w pozadku nic dospołnje njeblokuje</h3><p>Pod Linuxom trjeba dospołne blokowanje pozadka WebKitGTK 2.38 abo nowši. Z WebKitGTK 2.36 na staršej distribuciji njeklikajće za wočinjenym dialogom. Fokus tastatury, wobmjezowanje tasta Tab a Escape wostanu na najwyši dialog wobmjezowane.</p>","<h3>AES-256-GCM</h3><p>Authenticated encryption used by Magnolie to keep data confidential and detect tampering.</p><h3>APK</h3><p>An Android application package; Magnolie Notes is installed and updated from a signed APK.</p><h3>AppImage</h3><p>A self-contained Linux application file that runs without installing a DEB or RPM package.</p><h3>Backup</h3><p>A separately kept copy from which Organizer data can be restored after loss or damage; unlike a recovery snapshot, it should also protect against failure of the data disk.</p><h3>Bluetooth</h3><p>A short-range wireless technology. Magnolie can use RFCOMM as a phone fallback; an independently configured HFP connection can carry call audio.</p><h3>Cache</h3><p>Temporary reusable data, such as a weather response, that can be discarded and retrieved or created again.</p><h3>CalDAV</h3><p>A WebDAV-based protocol that Magnolie uses to synchronize calendars with a Nextcloud server.</p><h3>CardDAV</h3><p>A WebDAV-based protocol that Magnolie uses to synchronize contacts with a Nextcloud server.</p><h3>Checksum</h3><p>A value calculated from a file. Magnolie publishes or verifies SHA-256 checksums so a changed or wrong download can be detected.</p><h3>DEB</h3><p>An installation package for Debian, Ubuntu, Linux Mint, and related Linux systems.</p><h3>Desktop</h3><p>In this handbook, the Linux or Windows computer edition of Magnolie Organizer, as distinct from Magnolie Notes on Android.</p><h3>DPAPI</h3><p>The Windows Data Protection API; Magnolie uses its current-user protection for locally stored integration secrets.</p><h3>Ed25519</h3><p>A digital-signature algorithm used by the Linux update path to verify the authenticity of a release manifest.</p><h3>End-to-end encryption</h3><p>Protection in which content is encrypted for the communicating endpoints, so a forwarding service or mailbox does not receive the plaintext.</p><h3>Fingerprint</h3><p>A compact representation of a cryptographic identity. Comparing it or the derived code helps detect the wrong partner or a changed key.</p><h3>Firewall</h3><p>Software that permits or blocks network traffic by rule. Its permission for a Magnolie port neither creates Internet forwarding nor replaces a router or VPN.</p><h3>HFP</h3><p>The Bluetooth Hands-Free Profile for call audio and headset controls; it is separate from Magnolie phone control and RFCOMM data transfer.</p><h3>HKDF</h3><p>A key-derivation function used by the Magnolie phone protocol to derive separate cryptographic session keys.</p><h3>HMAC</h3><p>A keyed message-authentication code used to prove knowledge of a secret and detect altered protocol data.</p><h3>HTTPS</h3><p>HTTP protected by TLS; Magnolie uses it for services such as Nextcloud and update or weather requests.</p><h3>ICS</h3><p>The common iCalendar exchange format for calendar and task data, including files with an <b>.ics</b> suffix.</p><h3>IPv4</h3><p>The older Internet Protocol address family, commonly written as four decimal numbers such as <b>192.168.1.20</b>.</p><h3>IPv6</h3><p>The newer Internet Protocol address family, written in hexadecimal groups and supported by Magnolie network listeners where available.</p><h3>KDE Connect</h3><p>The paired desktop-and-Android service that provides Magnolie's SMS path and has its own discovery and TLS security.</p><h3>Local IP address</h3><p>The IPv4 or IPv6 address assigned to a device on its current network; it can change and is not necessarily reachable from the Internet.</p><h3>Local network</h3><p>The home or workplace network on which devices can reach each other directly; local discovery does not by itself make a listener local-only.</p><h3>Magnolienbaum</h3><p>Magnolie's secure exchange system for confirmed branches, direct sharing, delegation, and selected synchronization between devices or people.</p><h3>mDNS</h3><p>Multicast DNS, used on the local network to discover Magnolienbaum and Magnolie phone services without entering an address manually.</p>":"<h3>AES-256-GCM</h3><p>Awtentifikowane zaklučowanje, kotrež Magnolie wužiwa, zo by daty dowěrliwe wobchowała a manipulacije spóznała.</p><h3>APK</h3><p>Pakćik Androidoweho nałoženja; Magnolie Notes so ze signowaneho APK instaluje a aktualizuje.</p><h3>AppImage</h3><p>Samostatna Linuxowa nałoženska dataja, kotraž bjez instalacije DEB- abo RPM-pakćika běži.</p><h3>Zawěsćenska kopija</h3><p>Separatnje wobchowana kopija, z kotrejež dadźa so daty Organizera po zhubjenju abo wobškodźenju wobnowić; na rozdźěl wot wobnowjenskeje kopije ma tež před wupadnjenjom datoweho diska škitać.</p><h3>Bluetooth</h3><p>Drótowa technologija za krótke wotstawki. Magnolie móže RFCOMM jako narunanje za telefon wužiwać; separatnje zarjadowany HFP-zwisk móže zynk zawołanja přenjesć.</p><h3>Cache</h3><p>Nachwilne znowawužiwajomne daty, na přikład wotmołwa wjedra, kotrež dadźa so zaćisnyć a znowa wobstarać abo wutworić.</p><h3>CalDAV</h3><p>Protokol na zakładźe WebDAV, kotryž Magnolie za synchronizaciju protykow ze serwerom Nextcloud wužiwa.</p><h3>CardDAV</h3><p>Protokol na zakładźe WebDAV, kotryž Magnolie za synchronizaciju kontaktow ze serwerom Nextcloud wužiwa.</p><h3>Kontrolna suma</h3><p>Hódnota, kotraž so z dataje wobliči. Magnolie wozjewja abo přepruwuje kontrolne sumy SHA-256, zo by změnjene abo wopačne sćehnjenje spóznała.</p><h3>DEB</h3><p>Instalaciski pakćik za Debian, Ubuntu, Linux Mint a přiwuzne Linuxowe systemy.</p><h3>Desktop</h3><p>W tutej přiručce Linuxowa abo Windowsowa ličakowa edicija Magnolie Organizer, na rozdźěl wot Magnolie Notes na Androidźe.</p><h3>DPAPI</h3><p>Windows Data Protection API; Magnolie wužiwa škit aktualneho wužiwarja za lokalnje składowane integraciske potajnstwa.</p><h3>Ed25519</h3><p>Algoritmus digitalneje signatury, kotryž Linuxowy aktualizaciski puć za přepruwowanje awtentiskosće wersijoweho manifesta wužiwa.</p><h3>Zaklučowanje wot kónca do kónca</h3><p>Škit, při kotrymž so wobsah za komunikowace kónčne dypki zaklučuje, tak zo dale sposrědkujaca słužba abo póštowy kašćik jasny tekst njedóstanje.</p><h3>Palčikowy wotćišć</h3><p>Kompaktne předstajenje kryptografiskeje identity. Přirunanje jeho abo z njeho wotwodźeneho koda pomha wopačneho partnera abo změnjeny kluč spóznać.</p><h3>Wohnjowa murja</h3><p>Software, kotraž syćowy wobchad po prawidłach dowoli abo blokuje. Dowolnosć za port Magnolie ani internetowe dalesposrědkowanje njewutwori ani router abo VPN njenaruna.</p><h3>HFP</h3><p>Bluetooth Hands-Free Profile za zynk zawołanjow a wodźenje słuchatkow; je separatny wot telefonoweho wodźenja Magnolie a přenjesenja datow RFCOMM.</p><h3>HKDF</h3><p>Funkcija za wotwodźenje klučow, kotruž telefonowy protokol Magnolie za separatne kryptografiske posedźenske kluče wužiwa.</p><h3>HMAC</h3><p>Aw tentifikaciski kod powěsće z klučom, kotryž znajomosć potajnstwa dopokazuje a změnjene protokolowe daty spóznaje.</p><h3>HTTPS</h3><p>Z TLS škitany HTTP; Magnolie jón za słužby kaž Nextcloud a naprašowanja wo aktualizacije abo wjedro wužiwa.</p><h3>ICS</h3><p>Powšitkowny iCalendar-wuměnjenski format za protykowe daty a nadawki, inkluziwnje datajow z kóncowku <b>.ics</b>.</p><h3>IPv4</h3><p>Starša adresowa swójba internetoweho protokola, zwjetša jako štyri decimalne ličby kaž <b>192.168.1.20</b> napisana.</p><h3>IPv6</h3><p>Nowša adresowa swójba internetoweho protokola, w heksadecimalnych skupinach napisana a wot syćowych słuchakow Magnolie podpěrana, hdźež je k dispoziciji.</p><h3>KDE Connect</h3><p>Sparowana słužba desktopa a Androida, kotraž SMS-puć Magnolie poskića a swójske namakanje a TLS-wěstotu ma.</p><h3>Lokalna IP-adresa</h3><p>IPv4- abo IPv6-adresa, kotraž je gratej w jeho aktualnej syći připokazana; móže so změnić a njeje nutnje z interneta docpějomna.</p><h3>Lokalna syć</h3><p>Domjaca abo dźěłowa syć, w kotrejž móža so graty direktnje docpěć; lokalne namakanje słuchak samo po sebi na lokalnu syć njewobmjezuje.</p><h3>Magnolienbaum</h3><p>Wěsty wuměnjenski system Magnolie za wobkrućene hałuzy, direktne dźělenje, delegowanje a wubranu synchronizaciju mjez gratami abo ludźimi.</p><h3>mDNS</h3><p>Multicast DNS, kotryž so w lokalnej syći za namakanje słužbow Magnolienbauma a telefona Magnolie bjez manuelneho zapodanja adresy wužiwa.</p>","<h3>Bold, italic, underline, and strikethrough</h3><p>As soon as you start writing or select some text, a small row of four letters appears above the page: <span class='knopfwort'>B</span> <span class='knopfwort'>I</span> <span class='knopfwort'>U</span> <span class='knopfwort'>S</span>.</p><ol class='schritte'><li>Select the text: click before it, hold down the mouse button, and drag to the end.</li><li>Click <b>B</b> to make the text bold.</li><li>Click <b>B</b> again to remove the bold formatting.</li></ol><p>You can do the same from the keyboard: <kbd>Ctrl</kbd>+<kbd>B</kbd> for bold, <kbd>Ctrl</kbd>+<kbd>I</kbd> for italic, <kbd>Ctrl</kbd>+<kbd>U</kbd> for underline, and <kbd>Ctrl</kbd>+<kbd>D</kbd> for strikethrough. When the cursor is in formatted text, the corresponding letter is highlighted.</p><h3>The spell checker</h3><p>Under <span class='knopfwort'>Settings ▸ Font</span>, select <i>Check spelling</i>. Misspelled words are then underlined in red.</p><p><b>Right-click</b> one of these words to open a sheet of suggested corrections. Click a suggestion to use it. At the bottom is <i>Add to dictionary</i>, for proper names that the Organizer does not yet recognize.</p><div class='merke'><b>The editing menu</b>Right-click to display Cut, Copy, Paste, and Select All. On a note page, the menu also contains the four formatting options. Suggested corrections appear only when you right-click an actual misspelling. This menu is also available in Magnolie text fields for links and for group and notebook names.</div>":"<h3>Tučne, kursiwne, podšmórnjene a přešmórnjene</h3><p>Hdyž započnjeće pisać abo tekst wubjerjeće, zjewi so nad stronu mały rynk štyrjoch pismikow: <span class='knopfwort'>B</span> <span class='knopfwort'>I</span> <span class='knopfwort'>U</span> <span class='knopfwort'>S</span>.</p><ol class='schritte'><li>Wubjerće tekst: klikńće před nim, dźeržće myšacu tastu a ćehńće hač do kónca.</li><li>Klikńće <b>B</b>, zo by tekst tučny był.</li><li>Klikńće <b>B</b> hišće raz, zo byšće tučne formatowanje wotstronili.</li></ol><p>Samsne móžeće z tastaturu činić: <kbd>Ctrl</kbd>+<kbd>B</kbd> za tučne, <kbd>Ctrl</kbd>+<kbd>I</kbd> za kursiwne, <kbd>Ctrl</kbd>+<kbd>U</kbd> za podšmórnjene a <kbd>Ctrl</kbd>+<kbd>D</kbd> za přešmórnjene. Hdyž je kursor we formatowanym teksće, so přisłušny pismik wuzběhnje.</p><h3>Prawopisna kontrola</h3><p>Pod <span class='knopfwort'>Nastajenja ▸ Pismo</span> wubjerće <i>Prawopis kontrolować</i>. Wopak napisane słowa so potom čerwjenje podšmórnu.</p><p>Klikńće na tajke słowo z <b>prawej myšacej tastu</b>, zo by so łopjeno z namjetami korekturow wočiniło. Klikńće namjet, zo byšće jón wužił. Deleka je <i>Do słownika přidać</i> za swójske mjena, kotrež Organizer hišće njeznaje.</p><div class='merke'><b>Wobdźěłowanski meni</b>Prawe kliknjenje pokazuje Wutřihać, Kopěrować, Zasadźić a Wšitko wubrać. Na noticowej stronje wobsahuje meni tež štyri formatowanske opcije. Namjety korekturow so jenož zjewja, hdyž na woprawdźe wopak napisane słowo prawe kliknjeće. Tutón meni je tež w tekstowych polach Magnolie za wotkazy a mjena skupinow a notatnikow k dispoziciji.</div>","<h3>Choose the type yourself</h3><p>The first field for a postal address or phone number is intentionally blank. The gray hints <i>e.g. Private</i> and <i>e.g. Mobile</i> are only examples and are not saved. Click the blank field to see all suggestions, or type your own label straight away.</p><p>For postal addresses, the available suggestions are <i>Address</i>, <i>Head office</i>, <i>Secondary office</i>, <i>Work</i>, and <i>Private</i>. You can also use your own labels, such as <i>Care unit</i>, <i>Holiday home</i>, or <i>Delivery address</i>. Enter the street, postal code, city, and country, if required, below the label.</p><p>For phone numbers, choose from <i>Landline</i>, <i>Mobile</i>, <i>Work</i>, <i>Private</i>, <i>Fax</i>, and <i>Pager</i>. Here too, you can type your own labels, such as <i>Reception</i>, <i>Care service</i>, or <i>Emergency</i>. Use <b>+ Phone number</b> and <b>+ Address</b> to add as many rows as you need; the minus sign removes only the corresponding row.</p><p>Email addresses work in the same way. The type field starts blank and displays the gray hint <i>e.g. Work</i>. Click it to choose <i>Home</i>, <i>Private</i>, <i>Work</i>, or <i>Other</i>. You can type your own label, such as <i>Club</i>, directly into the field. Enter the actual email address beside it. Use <b>+ Email address</b> to add further addresses.</p><h3>Anniversaries and other details</h3><p>Open <b>More fields</b>. The anniversary type also starts blank and displays only the gray hint <i>e.g. Birthday</i>. Click it to choose from all known types, including birthday, death anniversary, wedding anniversary, name day, and anniversary. Alternatively, type your own occasion. The entry is saved only when it has a date. If the year is unknown, enter only day and month; no age is calculated. Use <b>+ Event</b> to add further anniversaries.</p><h3>Emergency contacts</h3><p>In the same section, emergency contacts appear inside dashed borders. The relationship field has no default selection and displays the gray hint <i>e.g. Son</i>. Click it to choose options including son, daughter, carer, neighbor, or partner. You can type other relationships directly into the field.</p><p>Enter the person’s name and phone number below. Use <b>+ Emergency contact</b> to add as many people as you need; each has its own dashed border. Ordinary postal addresses no longer have this border. All emergency contacts remain visible on the contact card and are included when printing and exchanging data.</p><h3>Note, appointments, and tasks</h3><p>The <b>Note</b> is once again visible on the standard contact form rather than hidden under <i>More fields</i>.</p><p>Under <b>Appointments for this person</b>, the title starts blank and displays the gray hint <i>e.g. Doctor appointment</i>. Click it to choose typical appointments such as Doctor appointment, Meeting, Phone call, House call, or Authority appointment; you can still enter any title you wish. Use <b>+ More appointments</b> to add as many appointments as needed, including their dates and times.</p><p>The same applies under <b>Tasks for this person</b>: the blank field displays <i>e.g. Send documents</i> and offers Send documents, Errands, Call, and other typical tasks. Use <b>+ More tasks</b> to create multiple linked tasks. You can type your own titles directly at any time.</p><div class='merke'><b>Your custom labels are retained</b>When contacts are saved, exchanged as vCards, merged, or synchronized, your own labels are not replaced with generic ones.</div>":"<h3>Typ sami wubjerće</h3><p>Prěnje polo za póštowu adresu abo telefonowe čisło je womyslnje prózdne. Šěre pokiwy <i>na př. Priwatne</i> a <i>na př. Mobilny telefon</i> su jenož přikłady a so njeskładuja. Klikńće do prózdneho pola, zo byšće wšitke namjety widźeli, abo zapodajće hnydom swójske pomjenowanje.</p><p>Za póštowe adresy su namjety <i>Adresa</i>, <i>Hłowne sydło</i>, <i>Dalše sydło</i>, <i>Dźěło</i> a <i>Priwatne</i> k dispoziciji. Móžeće tež swójske pomjenowanja wužiwać, na př. <i>Hladanska jednotka</i>, <i>Dowolowy dom</i> abo <i>Doručenska adresa</i>. Zapodajće pod pomjenowanjom dróhu, póštowe čisło, město a, jeli trjeba, kraj.</p><p>Za telefonowe čisła wubjerće <i>Festna syć</i>, <i>Mobilny telefon</i>, <i>Dźěło</i>, <i>Priwatne</i>, <i>Faks</i> abo <i>Pager</i>. Tež tu móžeće swójske pomjenowanja zapodać, na př. <i>Recepcija</i>, <i>Hladanska słužba</i> abo <i>Nuzowy kontakt</i>. Z <b>+ Telefonowe čisło</b> a <b>+ Adresa</b> přidajće telko rjadkow, kelkož trjeba; minusowe znamješko jenož přisłušny rjad wotstroni.</p><p>E-mejlowe adresy runje tak funguja. Typowe polo je najprjedy prózdne a pokazuje šěry pokiw <i>na př. Dźěło</i>. Klikńće, zo byšće <i>Doma</i>, <i>Priwatne</i>, <i>Dźěło</i> abo <i>Druhe</i> wubrali. Swójske pomjenowanje, na př. <i>Towarstwo</i>, móžeće direktnje do pola napisać. Zapodajće woprawdźitu e-mejlowu adresu pódla toho. Z <b>+ E-mejlowa adresa</b> dalše adresy přidajće.</p><h3>Róčnicy a druhe podaćow</h3><p>Wočińće <b>Dalše pola</b>. Tež typ róčnicy započina prózdny a pokazuje jenož šěry pokiw <i>na př. Narodniny</i>. Klikńće, zo byšće ze wšitkich znatych typow wubrali, mjez druhim narodniny, posmjertnu róčnicu, kwasnu róčnicu, mjenski dźeń a róčnicu. Abo zapodajće swójsku składnosć. Zapisk so jenož składuje, hdyž datum ma. Jeli lěto njeje znate, zapodajće jenož dźeń a měsac; staroba so njewobliči. Z <b>+ Podawk</b> dalše róčnicy přidajće.</p><h3>Nuzowe kontakty</h3><p>W samsnym wotrězku so nuzowe kontakty znutřka smužkowanych ramikow zjewja. Polo poměra nima standardny wuběr a pokazuje šěry pokiw <i>na př. Syn</i>. Klikńće, zo byšće mjez druhim syna, dźowku, hladarja, susoda abo partnera wubrali. Druhe poměry móžeće direktnje do pola zapodać.</p><p>Zapodajće pod tym mjeno wosoby a telefonowe čisło. Z <b>+ Nuzowy kontakt</b> móžeće telko wosobow přidać, kelkož trjeba; kóžda ma swójsku smužkowanu ramiku. Zwyčajne póštowe adresy tutu ramiku wjace nimaja. Wšitke nuzowe kontakty wostanu na kontaktowej karće widźomne a so při ćišćenju a wuměnje datow sobu zapřijeja.</p><h3>Notica, terminy a nadawki</h3><p><b>Notica</b> je zaso na standardnym kontaktowym formularje widźomna, město zo by pod <i>Dalše pola</i> schowana była.</p><p>Pod <b>Terminy za tutu wosobu</b> je titul najprjedy prózdny a pokazuje šěry pokiw <i>na př. Termin pola lěkarja</i>. Klikńće, zo byšće typiske terminy wubrali, na př. Termin pola lěkarja, Zetkanje, Telefonat, Domjacy wopyt abo Termin na zarjedźe; móžeće wšak tež kóždy swójski titul zapodać. Z <b>+ Dalše terminy</b> přidajće telko terminow z datumami a časami, kelkož trjeba.</p><p>Samsne płaći pod <b>Nadawki za tutu wosobu</b>: prózdne polo pokazuje <i>na př. Dokumenty pósłać</i> a skići Dokumenty pósłać, Nákupy, Zawołać a druhe typiske nadawki. Z <b>+ Dalše nadawki</b> móžeće wjacore zwjazane nadawki wutworić. Swójske titule móžeće kóždy čas direktnje zapodać.</p><div class='merke'><b>Waše swójske pomjenowanja so wobchowaja</b>Hdyž so kontakty składuja, jako vCard wuměnjeja, zjednoćeja abo synchronizuja, so waše swójske pomjenowanja z powšitkownymi njezaměnja.</div>","<h3>Edit</h3><p>Click an appointment in the month overview, week view, or day view. The appointment sheet opens over the book and displays all its details. Make your changes, then click <span class='knopfwort'>Edit appointment</span> at the bottom right. Press <kbd>Esc</kbd> to close the sheet without making changes.</p><h3>Delete</h3><p>Open the appointment and click <span class='knopfwort'>Delete</span> at the bottom left. A confirmation prompt appears over the appointment sheet. Click <span class='knopfwort'>Delete</span> again to confirm.</p><div class='merke'><b>Nothing disappears immediately</b>Deleted items first go to the <b>Recycle bin</b>, from which you can recover them if the recycle bin is enabled. See page <b data-page='the-recycle-bin' class='knopfwort'></b> for instructions.</div><h3>Reschedule an appointment</h3><p>You cannot drag an appointment to another day with the mouse. Open it and change <b>Date</b> and, if necessary, <b>Through</b>. Then click <span class='knopfwort'>Edit appointment</span> to apply the change.</p>":"<h3>Wobdźěłać</h3><p>Klikńće na termin w měsacnym přehladźe, tydźenskim abo dnjowym napohladźe. Terminowe łopjeno so nad knihu wočini a wšitke podrobnosće pokazuje. Změńće, što trjeba, a klikńće potom deleka naprawo na <span class='knopfwort'>Termin wobdźěłać</span>. Z <kbd>Esc</kbd> łopjeno bjez změnow začiniće.</p><h3>Zhašeć</h3><p>Wočińće termin a klikńće deleka nalěwo na <span class='knopfwort'>Zhašeć</span>. Nad terminowym łopjenom so prašenje wo wobkrućenje zjewi. Klikńće <span class='knopfwort'>Zhašeć</span> hišće raz, zo byšće wobkrućili.</p><div class='merke'><b>Ničo hnydom njezmiznje</b>Zhašane zapiski dźědu najprjedy do <b>Papjernika</b>, z kotrehož móžeće je wobnowić, jeli je papjernik zmóžnjeny. Nawod najdźeće na stronje <b data-page='the-recycle-bin' class='knopfwort'></b>.</div><h3>Termin přesunyć</h3><p>Termin njeda so z myšku na druhi dźeń ćahnyć. Wočińće jón a změńće <b>Datum</b> a, jeli trjeba, <b>Hač do</b>. Klikńće potom na <span class='knopfwort'>Termin wobdźěłać</span>, zo byšće změnu nałožili.</p>","<h3>Explicitly share a note</h3><p>Open the note you want and select <span class='knopfwort'>Share together</span>. The note becomes shared only after you confirm the security prompt and the other party accepts the transfer. Subsequent changes to the heading, text, embedded images and PDF files are transmitted in both directions.</p><p>The other party receives a system notification and sees the number and total size of the attachments. With <b>Accept and remember</b>, consent remains in effect, but only for this note and this confirmed branch. Further changes then arrive automatically.</p><div class='merke'><b>Only this note</b>Other notebooks and pages remain private. A size limit applies to the attachments transferred together; if they exceed it, the Organizer tells you before sending them.</div><h3>Working with a small group</h3><p>If several confirmed branches are connected, <b>Workgroup (all)</b> appears when you share an entry. This lets you send the same appointment, contact or note to every member. Each member must still accept new offers individually.</p><div class='achtung'><b>A changed key is detected</b>The key of a confirmed branch cannot be replaced without your knowledge. Deliberately remove the old connection, and compare a new fingerprint especially carefully.</div>":"<h3>Noticu wuraznje dźělić</h3><p>Wočińće požadanu noticu a wubjerće <span class='knopfwort'>Zhromadnje dźělić</span>. Notica so hakle dźěli, hdyž wěstotne prašenje wobkrućeće a druha strona přenjesenje akceptuje. Pozdźiše změny nadpisma, teksta, zasadźenych wobrazow a PDF-datajow so potom we woběmaj směrje přenošuja.</p><p>Druha strona dóstanje systemowu powěsć a widźi ličbu a cyłkownu wulkosć přiwěškow. Z <b>Akceptować a spomjatkować</b> wostanje přizwolenje płaćiwe, ale jenož za tutu noticu a tutu wobkrućenu hałuzu. Dalše změny potom awtomatisce dochadźeja.</p><div class='merke'><b>Jenož tuta notica</b>Druhe notatniki a strony wostanu priwatne. Za zhromadnje přenjesene přiwěški płaći limit wulkosće; jeli jón překročuja, Organizer wam to před pósłanjem zdźěli.</div><h3>Dźěło z małej skupinu</h3><p>Jeli je wjacore wobkrućenych hałuzow zwjazanych, zjewi so při dźělenju zapiska <b>Dźěłowa skupina (wšitcy)</b>. Tak móžeće samsny termin, kontakt abo noticu wšitkim čłonam pósłać. Kóždy čłon dyrbi nowe poskitki dale sam akceptować.</p><div class='achtung'><b>Změnjeny kluč so spóznaje</b>Kluč wobkrućeneje hałuzy njeda so bjez wašeho wědomja narunać. Wotstrońće stary zwisk z wotpohladom a přirunajće nowy palčikowy wotćišć wosebje dokładnje.</div>","<h3>Finding anything again</h3><p>The wide <b>Search</b> field searches groups, notebooks, page titles, written text, and the names of embedded files. Clear it to display all pages again.</p><h3>Arranging things your way</h3><p><span class='knopfwort'>Customize</span> opens the notebook manager. There you can move groups and notebooks with the arrow buttons, sort them alphabetically, or move a notebook to another group.</p><h3>Links, images, and PDF files</h3><p>Above the writing area are buttons for adding a web or email link, an image, or a PDF file. Once selected, the item is securely embedded in the note, so the original file can then be moved. Each image or PDF file can be up to 8 MiB. Drag the dotted divider handle above the attachments down to see more of the note text, or up to enlarge the previews. In a small window or with a shallow attachment area, images and PDF files automatically appear as compact icons.</p><div class='merke'><b>Included in a complete backup</b>Your notes, their organization, and their attachments are all included in the data backup. There is no separate option for exporting notes under <i>Export</i>. Printed notes include their titles and text, but not embedded images or PDF pages.</div>":"<h3>Wšitko zaso namakać</h3><p>Šěroke polo <b>Pytać</b> přepytuje skupiny, notatniki, titule stronow, napisany tekst a mjena zasadźenych datajow. Wuprózdńće je, zo bychu so zaso wšitke strony pokazali.</p><h3>Po swojim wašnju rjadować</h3><p><span class='knopfwort'>Přiměrić</span> wočini zrjadowak notatnikow. Tam móžeće skupiny a notatniki z šipkowymi tastami přesuwać, alfabetisce sortěrować abo notatnik do druheje skupiny přesunyć.</p><h3>Wotkazy, wobrazy a PDF-dataje</h3><p>Nad pisanskej plochu su tasty za přidawanje weboweho abo e-mejloweho wotkaza, wobraza abo PDF-dataje. Po wuběru so objekt wěsće do noticy zasadźi, tak zo móžeće originalnu dataju pozdźišo přesunyć. Kóždy wobraz abo PDF smije hač do 8 MiB měć. Ćehńće dypkowanu dźělatku nad přiwěškami dele, zo byšće wjace teksta noticy widźeli, abo horje, zo byšće přehlady powjetšili. W małym woknje abo při niskej přiwěškowej płosćinje so wobrazy a PDF-dataje awtomatisce jako kompaktne symbole pokazuja.</p><div class='merke'><b>W dospołnej zawěsćenskej kopiji zapřijate</b>Waše noticy, jich rjadowanje a přiwěški su wšitke w zawěsćenju datow zapřijate. Pod <i>Eksport</i> njeje wosebita opcija za eksport noticow. Wućišćane noticy wobsahuja swoje titule a tekst, ale nic zasadźene wobrazy abo PDF-strony.</div>","<h3>Google Keep</h3><p>Open <i>takeout.google.com</i> on the phone, select only Keep, request the export and choose the resulting ZIP here. Individual Keep JSON or HTML files also work. Titles, text, check-list marks, times and the first label are retained; the first label becomes the notebook.</p><h3>Samsung Notes and ColorNote</h3><p>For Samsung Notes, export notes as <b>text</b>, or as HTML where offered, and choose the file or folder. A Samsung PDF is not a note-file import: share a single PDF to Magnolie Notes if you want it attached to a note. For ColorNote use an unencrypted <b>text export</b>; Magnolie Notes cannot read an encrypted ColorNote backup.</p><h3>Evernote, Simplenote and Standard Notes</h3><ul><li><b>Evernote:</b> export a notebook as <b>.enex</b>. Title, content and available creation and change times are read; ENEX resources and attachments are not.</li><li><b>Simplenote:</b> active notes in its JSON export are read; trashed notes are skipped.</li><li><b>Standard Notes:</b> note items in its JSON export are read; tags and other item types are skipped.</li></ul><h3>Joplin, Markdown and text</h3><p>For Joplin choose a <b>Markdown-directory export</b>, not a JEX archive. Ordinary Markdown and text folders work as well. A leading Markdown heading becomes the title; otherwise Magnolie Notes uses a short first line or the filename.</p><div class='merke'><b>Attachments need a separate path</b>Embedded Keep or ENEX attachments are not part of these file readers. Share a supported image or PDF directly as described on page <b data-page='android-share-into-notes' class='knopfwort'></b>.</div>":"<h3>Google Keep</h3><p>Wočińće <i>takeout.google.com</i> na telefonje, wubjerće jenož Keep, požadajće eksport a wubjerće tu nastatu ZIP-dataju. Jednotliwe JSON- abo HTML-dataje Keep tež funguja. Titule, tekst, marki kontrolnych lisćinow, časy a prěnje pomjenowanje so wobchowaja; prěnje pomjenowanje budźe notatnik.</p><h3>Samsung Notes a ColorNote</h3><p>Ze Samsung Notes eksportujće notice jako <b>tekst</b> abo, jeli so poskića, jako HTML a wubjerće dataju abo rjadowak. Samsungowy PDF njeje import noticoweje dataje: dźělće jednotliwy PDF z Magnolie Notes, jeli ma noticy připowěsnjeny być. Za ColorNote wužijće njezaklučowany <b>tekstowy eksport</b>; Magnolie Notes zaklučowanu zawěsćensku kopiju ColorNote čitać njemóže.</p><h3>Evernote, Simplenote a Standard Notes</h3><ul><li><b>Evernote:</b> Eksportujće notatnik jako <b>.enex</b>. Titul, wobsah a eksistowace časy wutworjenja a změny so čitaja; ENEX-resursy a přiwěški nic.</li><li><b>Simplenote:</b> Aktiwne notice w jeho JSON-eksporće so čitaja; notice w papjerniku so přeskoča.</li><li><b>Standard Notes:</b> Noticowe objekty w jeho JSON-eksporće so čitaja; taflički a druhe typy objektow so přeskoča.</li></ul><h3>Joplin, Markdown a tekst</h3><p>Za Joplin wubjerće <b>Markdownowy rjadowakowy eksport</b>, nic JEX-archiw. Zwyčajne rjadowaki Markdown a tekst tež funguja. Započatne Markdownowe nadpismo budźe titul; hewak wužiwa Magnolie Notes krótku prěnju linku abo datajowe mjeno.</p><div class='merke'><b>Přiwěški trjebaja separatny puć</b>Zasadźene přiwěški Keep abo ENEX njejsu dźěl tutych datajowych čitakow. Dźělće podpěrany wobraz abo PDF direktnje kaž na stronje <b data-page='android-share-into-notes' class='knopfwort'></b> wopisane.</div>","<h3>History</h3><p>Choose 30 days, 90 days, one year or all entries, then select blood pressure, pulse, temperature, weight, BMI or blood glucose. Blood pressure draws Systolic and Diastolic together. Mixed blood-sugar units are shown in one mmol/L series. Each graph has a closed frame on all four sides.</p><h3>Print</h3><p><span class='knopfwort'>Choose print or export content…</span> opens the health preview. Select <span class='knopfwort'>Blank template</span> or output with recorded values, and restrict dated records with <span class='knopfwort'>From</span> and <span class='knopfwort'>Through</span>. Available sections are Vital readings, the blood-sugar table with an optional insulin scheme, the Medication plan, a Single progress report with table and graph, or All six graphs arranged three on the left and three on the right. Tables continue on further sheets. The output is A4 landscape.</p><p>The general print window also honours the health rows you select. A blank health form deliberately prints all three writable tables.</p><h3>ODS and deletion</h3><p><span class='knopfwort'>ODS</span> exports the same chosen sections to a spreadsheet. A progress export contains the values used for its graph. <span class='knopfwort'>Delete</span> beside a row asks for confirmation and then removes it immediately; health rows do not go to the recycle bin. Make a backup first if you may need the record later.</p>":"<h3>Historija</h3><p>Wubjerće 30 dnjow, 90 dnjow, jedne lěto abo wšitke zapiski, potom krejny ćišć, puls, temperaturu, wahu, BMI abo krejny cokor. Krejny ćišć rysuje systolisku a diastolisku hódnotu hromadźe. Měšane jednotki krejneho cokora so w jednej rjadźe mmol/L pokazuja. Kóždy diagram ma na wšitkich štyrjoch stronach začinjenu ramiku.</p><h3>Ćišćenje</h3><p><span class='knopfwort'>Wobsah za ćišćenje abo eksport wubrać…</span> wočini přehlad Strowoty. Wubjerće <span class='knopfwort'>Prózdnu předłohu</span> abo wudaće z registrowanymi hódnotami a wobmjezujće datowane zapiski z <span class='knopfwort'>Wot</span> a <span class='knopfwort'>Hač do</span>. K dispoziciji su Vitalne hódnoty, tabela krejneho cokora z opcionalnej insulinskej schemu, Medikaciski plan, Jednotliwa rozprawa wuwića z tabelu a diagramom abo Wšitke šěsć diagramow, tři nalěwo a tři naprawo. Tabele so na dalšich łopjenach pokročuja. Wudaće je A4 w prěčnym formaće.</p><p>Powšitkowne ćišćenske wokno tež wubrane strowotne rjadki respektuje. Prózdny strowotny formular z wotpohladom wšitke tři popisujomne tabele ćišći.</p><h3>ODS a zhašenje</h3><p><span class='knopfwort'>ODS</span> eksportuje samsne wubrane wotrězki do tabeloweho dokumenta. Eksport wuwića wobsahuje hódnoty jeho diagrama. <span class='knopfwort'>Zhašeć</span> pódla rjada wo wobkrućenje prosy a jón potom hnydom wotstroni; strowotne rjadki do papjernika njeńdu. Wutworće najprjedy zawěsćensku kopiju, jeli móžeće zapisk pozdźišo trjebać.</p>","<h3>In the Organizer</h3><ul><li><kbd>Ctrl</kbd>+<kbd>1</kbd> through <kbd>Ctrl</kbd>+<kbd>7</kbd> – open visible sections in the current tab order</li><li><kbd>Ctrl</kbd>+<kbd>F</kbd> – open or focus search for the current section</li><li><kbd>Ctrl</kbd>+<kbd>Alt</kbd>+<kbd>H</kbd> – switch the accessibility helper frame on or off</li><li><kbd>F11</kbd> – full-screen mode</li><li><kbd>Esc</kbd> – close only the uppermost dialog or sheet</li></ul><h3>In calendars and Settings</h3><ul><li><kbd>Arrow keys</kbd> – move between dates, hours or settings tabs</li><li><kbd>Home</kbd> / <kbd>End</kbd> – first or last day, hour or tab</li><li><kbd>Page Up</kbd> / <kbd>Page Down</kbd> – previous or next month or displayed period; with <kbd>Shift</kbd>, previous or next year</li><li><kbd>Enter</kbd> / <kbd>Space</kbd> – activate the focused date, hour or action</li></ul><h3>In dialogs</h3><p><kbd>Tab</kbd> and <kbd>Shift</kbd>+<kbd>Tab</kbd> stay inside the uppermost dialog. If a confirmation lies over an edit sheet, the first Escape closes the confirmation and a second can close the sheet. Focus then returns to the invoking control or corresponding list or calendar item.</p><h3>While writing</h3><ul><li><kbd>Ctrl</kbd>+<kbd>B</kbd> – bold</li><li><kbd>Ctrl</kbd>+<kbd>I</kbd> – italic</li><li><kbd>Ctrl</kbd>+<kbd>U</kbd> – underline</li><li><kbd>Ctrl</kbd>+<kbd>D</kbd> – strikethrough</li></ul><h3>On the lock screen</h3><ul><li><b>Digits</b> – enter the code</li><li><kbd>Backspace</kbd> – delete the last digit</li><li><kbd>Enter</kbd> – unlock</li><li><kbd>Esc</kbd> – discard the code</li></ul><h3>In this handbook</h3><ul><li><kbd>&rarr;</kbd> / <kbd>&larr;</kbd> – turn pages</li><li><kbd>Home</kbd> / <kbd>End</kbd> – beginning or end</li><li><kbd>Ctrl</kbd>+<kbd>F</kbd> – search all handbook pages and select a result to jump to that page</li><li><kbd>Ctrl</kbd>+<kbd>P</kbd> – print</li></ul>":"<h3>W Organizerje</h3><ul><li><kbd>Ctrl</kbd>+<kbd>1</kbd> hač <kbd>Ctrl</kbd>+<kbd>7</kbd> – widźomne wotrězki w aktualnym porjedźe rajtarkow wočinić</li><li><kbd>Ctrl</kbd>+<kbd>F</kbd> – pytanje za aktualny wotrězk wočinić abo fokusować</li><li><kbd>Ctrl</kbd>+<kbd>Alt</kbd>+<kbd>H</kbd> – pomocnu ramiku přistupnosće zapinać abo wupinać</li><li><kbd>F11</kbd> – połno wobrazowkowy modus</li><li><kbd>Esc</kbd> – jenož najwyši dialog abo łopjeno začinić</li></ul><h3>W protykach a Nastajenjach</h3><ul><li><kbd>Šipkowe tasty</kbd> – mjez datumami, hodźinami abo rajtarkami nastajenjow pohibować</li><li><kbd>Home</kbd> / <kbd>End</kbd> – prěni abo posledni dźeń, hodźina abo rajtark</li><li><kbd>Page Up</kbd> / <kbd>Page Down</kbd> – předchadny abo přichodny měsac či pokazana doba; z <kbd>Shift</kbd> předchadne abo přichodne lěto</li><li><kbd>Enter</kbd> / <kbd>Mjezotasta</kbd> – fokusowany datum, hodźinu abo akciju aktiwizować</li></ul><h3>W dialogach</h3><p><kbd>Tab</kbd> a <kbd>Shift</kbd>+<kbd>Tab</kbd> wostawatej znutřka najwyšeho dialoga. Hdyž je wobkrućenje nad wobdźěłowanskim łopjenom, začini prěni Escape wobkrućenje a druhi móže łopjeno začinić. Fokus so potom k wołacemu wodźenskemu elementej abo wotpowědnemu zapiskej lisćiny či protyki wróći.</p><h3>Při pisanju</h3><ul><li><kbd>Ctrl</kbd>+<kbd>B</kbd> – tučne</li><li><kbd>Ctrl</kbd>+<kbd>I</kbd> – kursiwne</li><li><kbd>Ctrl</kbd>+<kbd>U</kbd> – podšmórnjenje</li><li><kbd>Ctrl</kbd>+<kbd>D</kbd> – přešmórnjenje</li></ul><h3>Na zawrjenskim wobrazowce</h3><ul><li><b>Ličby</b> – kod zapodać</li><li><kbd>Backspace</kbd> – poslednju ličbu zhašeć</li><li><kbd>Enter</kbd> – wotblokować</li><li><kbd>Esc</kbd> – kod zaćisnyć</li></ul><h3>W tutym přiručce</h3><ul><li><kbd>&rarr;</kbd> / <kbd>&larr;</kbd> – strony listować</li><li><kbd>Home</kbd> / <kbd>End</kbd> – spočatk abo kónc</li><li><kbd>Ctrl</kbd>+<kbd>F</kbd> – wšitke strony přiručki přepytować a wuslědk wubrać, zo by so k wotpowědnej stronje přešło</li><li><kbd>Ctrl</kbd>+<kbd>P</kbd> – ćišćeć</li></ul>","<h3>Incoming connections</h3><ul><li><b>8737 TCP</b> – Magnolienbaum messages; <b>8737 UDP</b> – its older local discovery.</li><li><b>8741 TCP</b> – Magnolie phone connection.</li><li><b>1716 UDP</b> and the first free <b>1716–1764 TCP</b> port – KDE Connect.</li><li><b>5353 UDP</b> – mDNS discovery for Magnolienbaum and phone connection.</li></ul><p>The Magnolienbaum and phone TCP listeners accept IPv4 and IPv6 on available network interfaces. Discovery is local, but this does not itself restrict a routed listener to the local network. Bluetooth/RFCOMM uses no IP firewall port. Nextcloud is outgoing HTTPS, normally TCP 443.</p><h3>Linux</h3><p>The Debian package installs the UFW application profile <b>Magnolie Organizer</b> but does not activate it during installation. When Magnolienbaum or the phone connection is enabled and UFW is active, Magnolie asks through <i>pkexec</i> before allowing the complete profile. The stored rule remains when a feature is switched off, although its listener closes. The firewalld file supplied for manual use covers only Magnolienbaum and mDNS.</p><h3>Windows</h3><p>Magnolie requests an administrator confirmation when a required rule is missing. Its program-bound TCP and UDP rules cover the listed services on all Windows network profiles.</p><div class='achtung'><b>A local firewall is not a router</b>An allow rule does not create NAT forwarding, a public address or a VPN. Do not expose ports to the Internet merely to make local discovery work.</div>":"<h3>Dochadźace zwiski</h3><ul><li><b>8737 TCP</b> – powěsće Magnolienbauma; <b>8737 UDP</b> – jeho starše lokalne namakanje.</li><li><b>8741 TCP</b> – telefonowy zwisk Magnolie.</li><li><b>1716 UDP</b> a prěni swobodny port <b>1716–1764 TCP</b> – KDE Connect.</li><li><b>5353 UDP</b> – mDNS-namakanje za Magnolienbaum a telefonowy zwisk.</li></ul><p>TCP-słuchaki Magnolienbauma a telefona akceptuja IPv4 a IPv6 na k dispoziciji stejacych syćowych powjerchach. Namakanje je lokalne, ale to rutowany słuchak samo po sebi na lokalnu syć njewobmjezuje. Bluetooth/RFCOMM žadyn IP-port wohnjoweje murje njetrjeba. Nextcloud je won dźacy HTTPS, zwjetša TCP 443.</p><h3>Linux</h3><p>Debianowy pakćik instaluje UFW-nałoženski profil <b>Magnolie Organizer</b>, ale při instalaciji jón njeaktiwizuje. Hdyž je Magnolienbaum abo telefonowy zwisk zmóžnjeny a UFW aktiwny, Magnolie přez <i>pkexec</i> wo dowolnosć dospołneho profila prosy. Składowane prawidło po wupinjenju funkcije wostanje, hačrunjež so jeho słuchak začini. Za manuelne wužiwanje dodata firewalld-dataja zapřija jenož Magnolienbaum a mDNS.</p><h3>Windows</h3><p>Magnolie wo administratorske wobkrućenje prosy, hdyž trěbne prawidło faluje. Jeje na program zwjazane TCP- a UDP-prawidła zapřijimaja nalistowane słužby we wšitkich Windowsowych syćowych profilach.</p><div class='achtung'><b>Lokalna wohnjowa murja router njeje</b>Dowolace prawidło ani NAT-dalesposrědkowanje, zjawnu adresu abo VPN njewutwori. Njewustajće porty do interneta jenož za to, zo by lokalne namakanje fungowało.</div>","<h3>Individual notification for an appointment</h3><p>The global default stops at two hours. In an appointment, <span class='knopfwort'>Individual notification</span> offers one through seven days. Once a value is chosen, <span class='knopfwort'>Also use the default notification</span> decides whether the later standard reminder follows. Under the expanded <span class='knopfwort'>Reminders</span> area, up to 32 display reminders can use minutes, hours, or days before START or END, up to one year. Imported EMAIL, absolute, future, or otherwise unsupported alarms stay visible as read-only information and are not delivered as Magnolie reminders.</p><h3>Tasks</h3><p>A task with a due date can use <span class='knopfwort'>remind me on the due date</span>, a one-to-seven-day Custom notification, or both. Without a due time, delivery is at 8 a.m.; completed tasks are skipped. A selected reminder without a due date cannot be scheduled. Personal Sync preserves the custom lead time, while ordinary task export does not include reminder metadata.</p><h3>Birthdays and anniversaries</h3><p>First enable reminders globally, then select <span class='knopfwort'>Also remind me about anniversaries</span>. Choose the day itself or one through seven days beforehand and, when using an advance notice, optionally select <span class='knopfwort'>Remind me again on the day itself</span>. Anniversary notifications are scheduled for 8 a.m. and use wording such as <i>tomorrow</i>, <i>the day after tomorrow</i>, or <i>in 7 days</i>. February 29 moves to February 28 in a non-leap year.</p><div class='merke'><b>No medical or alarm-clock guarantee</b>Notifications depend on the running service, the operating system, and its permissions. Keep another reliable alarm for anything safety-critical.</div>":"<h3>Indiwiduelne zdźělenje za termin</h3><p>Powšitkowny standard kónči při dwěmaj hodźinomaj. W terminje poskića <span class='knopfwort'>Indiwiduelne zdźělenje</span> jedyn hač sydom dnjow. Po wuběru rozsudźi <span class='knopfwort'>Tež standardne zdźělenje wužiwać</span>, hač pozdźišo standardne dopomnjeće slěduje. W rozšěrjenym wobłuku <span class='knopfwort'>Dopominanja</span> móže hač do 32 wobrazowkowych dopominanjow mjeńšiny, hodźiny abo dny před START abo END, hač do jednoho lěta, wužiwać. Importowane EMAIL-alarmy, absolutne, přichodne abo hewak njepodpěrane alarmy wostanu jako jenož čitajomne informacije widźomne a so jako dopominanja Magnolie njedoručuja.</p><h3>Nadawki</h3><p>Nadawk z datumom dospěća móže <span class='knopfwort'>na dnju dospěća dopominać</span>, indiwiduelne zdźělenje jedyn hač sydom dnjow do toho abo wobě wužiwać. Bjez časa dospěća so zdźělenje w 8 hodź. doruči; dokónčene nadawki so přeskoča. Wubrane dopomnjeće bjez datuma dospěća njeda so naplanować. Personal Sync wobchowa indiwiduelny předčas, normalny eksport nadawkow metadaty dopominanja njewobsahuje.</p><h3>Narodniny a róčnicy</h3><p>Zmóžńće najprjedy dopominanja powšitkownje, potom <span class='knopfwort'>Tež na róčnicy dopominać</span>. Wubjerće samsny dźeń abo jedyn hač sydom dnjow do toho a při zažnym zdźělenju na přeće <span class='knopfwort'>Na samsnym dnju hišće raz dopominać</span>. Zdźělenki róčnicow su na 8 hodź. planowane a wužiwaja tekst kaž <i>jutře</i>, <i>pojětrze</i> abo <i>za 7 dnjow</i>. 29. februar so w njepřestupnym lěće na 28. februar přesunje.</p><div class='merke'><b>Žana medicinska abo budźakowa garantija</b>Zdźělenki wotwisują wot běžaceje słužby, dźěłoweho systema a jeho dowolnosćow. Za wšitko, štož je za wěstotu rozsudne, wobchowajće druhi spušćomny alarm.</div>","<h3>Linux desktop</h3><p>Organizer role; Wi-Fi and manual RFCOMM fallback for <b>magnolie-phone/1</b>; KDE Connect SMS; selected Android app notifications with explicit opt-in; granular call controls; local contact backends and encrypted backups.</p><h3>Windows desktop</h3><p>Organizer role; Wi-Fi plus conditionally available RFCOMM when Windows grants Bluetooth access, an enabled radio is present, and the phone is paired in Windows system settings. Windows consent, hardware, driver, or operating-system policy can instead report <b>permission_missing</b>, <b>no_hardware</b>, <b>disabled</b>, or <b>os_restricted</b>. KDE Connect SMS and granted dial, incoming-call, answer, and end controls are supported. Receiving selected Android app notifications (<b>selected_notifications_readonly</b>) is currently <b>not_implemented</b> on Windows. Windows Contacts and optional Microsoft Graph with a DPAPI-protected refresh token are supported.</p><h3>Android phone</h3><p>Magnolie Notes role; Wi-Fi plus RFCOMM fallback; permitted call actions, but no HFP audio or native Magnolie SMS. Android permissions and roles can restrict contacts and calls. Cloud backup is disabled. The encrypted recovery journal is <b>not a backup</b>: it remains inside app data and is unavailable after clearing app data, uninstalling Magnolie Notes, or losing the device.</p><div class='achtung'><b>Backup and encryption scope</b>Main-data backups exclude phone identity, peers, <b>phone.db</b>, KDE pairing, Magnolienbaum queues, and Android data. The Windows Magnolienbaum files <b>baum.json</b>, <b>baum-post.json</b>, and <b>baum-eingang.json</b> are not encrypted by the main Organizer password. Protect the Windows account and back them up deliberately; never publish keys or diagnostic databases.</div>":"<h3>Linuxowy desktop</h3><p>Róla Organizera; Wi-Fi a manuelne RFCOMM-narunanje za <b>magnolie-phone/1</b>; SMS přez KDE Connect; wubrane zdźělenki Androidowych nałoženjow z wuraznym přizwolenjom; podrobne wodźenje zawołanjow; lokalne kontaktowe pozadki a zaklučowane zawěsćenske kopije.</p><h3>Windowsowy desktop</h3><p>Róla Organizera; Wi-Fi a pod wuměnjenjem RFCOMM, hdyž Windows přistup k Bluetooth dowoli, zapnjeny radijowy grat eksistuje a telefon je w systemowych nastajenjach Windows sparowany. Přizwolenje, hardware, ćěrjak abo prawidła systema móža město toho <b>permission_missing</b>, <b>no_hardware</b>, <b>disabled</b> abo <b>os_restricted</b> zdźělić. SMS přez KDE Connect a dowolene wuzwolenje, staw dochadźaceho zawołanja, přiwzaće a skónčenje so podpěruja. Přijimanje wubranych zdźělenkow Androidowych nałoženjow (<b>selected_notifications_readonly</b>) je pod Windows tuchwilu <b>not_implemented</b>. Windows Contacts a opcionalny Microsoft Graph z refresh-tokenom škitanym přez DPAPI so podpěrujetej.</p><h3>Androidowy telefon</h3><p>Róla Magnolie Notes; Wi-Fi a RFCOMM jako narunanje; dowolene zawołanske akcije, ale žadyn HFP-zynk ani swójska SMS-funkcija Magnolie. Dowolnosće a róle Androida móža kontakty a zawołanja wobmjezować. Cloudowa zawěsćenska kopija je wupinjena. Zaklučowany wobnowjenski žurnal <b>zawěsćenska kopija njeje</b>: wostanje znutřka datow nałoženja a po zhašenju datow nałoženja, wotinstalowanju Magnolie Notes abo zhubjenju grata njeje k dispoziciji.</p><div class='achtung'><b>Wobłuk zawěsćenja a zaklučowanja</b>Zawěsćenske kopije hłownych datow njewobsahuja telefonowu identitu, partnerow, <b>phone.db</b>, sparowanje KDE, čakanske rynki Magnolienbauma ani Androidowe daty. Windowsowe dataje Magnolienbauma <b>baum.json</b>, <b>baum-post.json</b> a <b>baum-eingang.json</b> njejsu z hłownym hesłom Organizera zaklučowane. Škitajće Windowsowe konto a zawěsćće je wědomje; njewozjewjajće ženje kluče abo diagnostiske datowe banki.</div>","<h3>Magnolie phone data</h3><p>Port 8741 and the optional RFCOMM service carry the same authenticated phone protocol. Pairing combines static and ephemeral X25519 keys, HKDF, HMAC and the six-digit comparison; sessions protect messages with AES-GCM, direction binding and sequence numbers. Wi-Fi has priority. Manual traffic may use the verified Bluetooth fallback, while <b>auto_wifi</b> and <b>wifi_only</b> traffic is rejected over RFCOMM.</p><h3>SMS and calls are different layers</h3><p>KDE Connect uses its own local discovery, mutually authenticated TLS and pinned certificate for SMS. Magnolie phone control can request dialing and granted call actions, but it does not carry the conversation sound. The mobile network carries the call; an independently configured Bluetooth hands-free profile may carry audio when the operating system supports it.</p><h3>What Personal Sync excludes</h3><p>Its encrypted phone channel does not turn Personal Sync into a complete Organizer copy. Calendar, contacts, anniversaries, planners, health data, SMS, notifications and call data are outside its note/task/notebook schema.</p><div class='merke'><b>One secure layer does not replace another</b>System Bluetooth pairing, Magnolie code comparison, application grants and the optional audio profile each have a separate purpose.</div>":"<h3>Telefonowe daty Magnolie</h3><p>Port 8741 a opcionalna słužba RFCOMM přenošujetej samsny awtentifikowany telefonowy protokol. Sparowanje kombinuje statiske a nachwilne kluče X25519, HKDF, HMAC a šěsćličbowe přirunanje; posedźenja škitaja powěsće z AES-GCM, zwjazanjom směrka a sekvencnymi čisłami. Wi-Fi ma prioritu. Manuelny wobchad smě wobkrućene Bluetoothowe narunanje wužiwać, mjeztym zo so wobchad <b>auto_wifi</b> a <b>wifi_only</b> přez RFCOMM wotpokazuje.</p><h3>SMS a zawołanja stej rozdźělnej runinje</h3><p>KDE Connect wužiwa swójske lokalne namakanje, wzajomnje awtentifikowane TLS a připinjene certifikat za SMS. Telefonowe wodźenje Magnolie móže wuzwolenje a dowolene zawołanske akcije požadać, ale zynk rozmołwy njepřenošuje. Mobilna syć přenošuje zawołanje; separatnje zarjadowany Bluetoothowy profil za swobodne ruce móže zynk přenošować, hdyž system to podpěruje.</p><h3>Što Personal Sync wuwostaja</h3><p>Jeho zaklučowany telefonowy kanal z Personal Sync žanu dospołnu kopiju Organizera nječini. Protyka, kontakty, róčnicy, planowaki, strowotne daty, SMS, zdźělenki a daty zawołanjow njejsu dźěl jeho schemy za notice, nadawki a notatniki.</p><div class='merke'><b>Jedna wěsta runina druhu njenaruna</b>Systemowe Bluetoothowe sparowanje, přirunanje koda Magnolie, dowolnosće nałoženja a opcionalny zynkowy profil maja kóždy swójski nadawk.</div>","<h3>Main Organizer data</h3><p>With password protection enabled, a random 256-bit data key encrypts the main data with AES-256-GCM. PBKDF2-HMAC-SHA-256 derives the key that wraps this data key. A password change therefore rewraps the stable data key instead of exposing and rewriting every entry. Without password protection, the main data is not promised to be encrypted.</p><h3>Integration secrets</h3><p>Under Windows, DPAPI for the current user protects such values as the Magnolienbaum private identity, phone master key, KDE identity and Nextcloud or Graph tokens. Telephone queue payloads are additionally stored with AES-GCM. Under Linux, the Nextcloud app password uses Secret Service without an unsafe file fallback; telephone and KDE private keys instead rely on private directories and file mode 0600.</p><p>Those integration stores are separate from the main Organizer password and from a complete data backup. Linux file permissions and Windows account protection do not defend against malware already running as your user.</p><div class='achtung'><b>Not every metadata field is secret</b>Identifiers, timestamps, sizes, hashes, transport policy and discovery names can remain visible locally or on the network even where message contents and private keys are protected.</div>":"<h3>Hłowne daty Organizera</h3><p>Při zmóžnjenym hesłowym škiće zaklučuje připadny 256-bitowy datowy kluč hłowne daty z AES-256-GCM. PBKDF2-HMAC-SHA-256 wotwodźi kluč, kotryž tutón datowy kluč wobaluje. Změna hesła tuž stabilny datowy kluč znowa wobaluje, město zo by kóždy zapisk wotkryła a znowa napisała. Bjez hesłoweho škita zaklučowanje hłownych datow garantowane njeje.</p><h3>Integraciske potajnstwa</h3><p>Pod Windows škita DPAPI aktualneho wužiwarja hódnoty kaž priwatnu identitu Magnolienbauma, hłowny telefonowy kluč, KDE-identitu a tokeny Nextcloud abo Graph. Wobsah telefonoweho čakanskeho rynka so přidatnje z AES-GCM składuje. Pod Linuxom wužiwa nałoženske hesło Nextcloud Secret Service bjez njewěsteho narunanja přez dataju; priwatne telefonowe a KDE-kluče pak so na priwatne rjadowaki a datajowy modus 0600 spušćeja.</p><p>Tute integraciske składy su separatne wot hłowneho hesła Organizera a dospołneje zawěsćenskeje kopije. Linuxowe datajowe prawa a škit Windowsoweho konta před złowólnym programom hižo pod wašim wužiwarskim kontom nješkitatej.</p><div class='achtung'><b>Nic kóžde metadatowe polo je potajne</b>Identifikatory, časowe kołki, wulkosće, haše, transportowe prawidła a namakanske mjena móža lokalnje abo w syći widźomne wostać, tež hdyž stej wobsah powěsće a priwatne kluče škitanej.</div>","<h3>Main data and standard backups</h3><p>Appointments, tasks, contacts, notes and notebooks with their attachments, anniversaries, planner and health data, settings and the recycle bin live in the main file.</p><div class='beispiel'><b>Linux</b>~/.local/share/magnolie-organizer/daten.json</div><div class='beispiel'><b>Windows</b>%LOCALAPPDATA%\\Magnolie Organizer\\daten.json</div><p>Click <span class='knopfwort'>Create backup</span> in the footer only after the current save has finished. With an empty <b>Backup folder</b> under <span class='knopfwort'>Settings ▸ Security ▸ Backups</span>, Linux writes a dated <i>sicherung-….json</i> beside its data file. Windows writes a dated <i>magnolie-sicherung-….json</i> to <i>Documents\\Magnolie Organizer\\Sicherungen</i>.</p><h3>A folder on another device</h3><p>Choose a USB drive or secure network folder with <span class='knopfwort'>Choose folder …</span>; a copy on the same disk cannot help after that disk fails. Linux writes a separately password-encrypted JSON backup when the chosen folder is outside its data location. Windows writes a password-encrypted <b>.magnolie</b> complete archive whenever a folder is explicitly selected. Four characters are accepted but weak: use a long, unique passphrase and keep it separately.</p><h3>Using the right restore path</h3><ul><li><span class='knopfwort'>Restore backup …</span> under <i>Security ▸ Backups</i> opens a platform main-data <b>.json</b> file.</li><li><span class='knopfwort'>Settings ▸ Import ▸ Magnolie complete archive (.magnolie) …</span> opens a portable <b>.magnolie</b> archive from Linux or Windows.</li></ul><p>The Organizer validates the selected file before replacing data and creates a mandatory recovery snapshot of the current state. A restore replaces the complete main-data set; the first synchronization afterwards sends no deletions.</p><div class='achtung'><b>Know the scope</b>Neither format is a complete image of the device. Phone and KDE pairing, <b>phone.db</b>, window and reminder state, the personal dictionary, account secrets and the Magnolienbaum identity with its branches and queues are stored separately. Under Windows, the Magnolienbaum files remain outside the main password transaction. The overview on page <b data-page='platform-security-matrix' class='knopfwort'></b> lists these boundaries.</div><div class='merke'><b>Passwords remain distinct</b>The Organizer updates its internal recovery snapshots when its password changes. Existing independently protected external JSON backups and <b>.magnolie</b> archives keep the passphrase assigned when they were created.</div>":"<h3>Hłowne daty a standardne zawěsćenske kopije</h3><p>Terminy, nadawki, kontakty, notice a notatniki z přiwěškami, róčnicy, planowakowe a strowotne daty, nastajenja a papjernik su w hłownej dataji.</p><div class='beispiel'><b>Linux</b>~/.local/share/magnolie-organizer/daten.json</div><div class='beispiel'><b>Windows</b>%LOCALAPPDATA%\\Magnolie Organizer\\daten.json</div><p>Klikńće na <span class='knopfwort'>Zawěsćensku kopiju wutworić</span> w noze hakle po zakónčenju aktualneho składowanja. Při prózdnym <b>Rjadowaku zawěsćenskich kopijow</b> pod <span class='knopfwort'>Nastajenja ▸ Wěstota ▸ Zawěsćenske kopije</span> pisa Linux datowany <i>sicherung-….json</i> pódla datoweje dataje. Windows pisa datowany <i>magnolie-sicherung-….json</i> do <i>Documents\\Magnolie Organizer\\Sicherungen</i>.</p><h3>Rjadowak na druhim graće</h3><p>Wubjerće USB-ćěrjak abo wěsty syćowy rjadowak z <span class='knopfwort'>Rjadowak wubrać …</span>; kopija na samsnym disku při jeho wupadnjenju njepomha. Linux pisa separatnje hesłom zaklučowanu JSON-kopiju, hdyž je wubrany rjadowak zwonka datoweho městna. Windows pisa hesłom zaklučowany dospołny archiw <b>.magnolie</b>, hdyž rjadowak wuraznje wubjerjeće. Štyri znamješka so akceptuja, ale su słabe: wužijće dołhu jónkróćnu hesłowu sadu a wobchowajće ju separatnje.</p><h3>Prawy wobnowjenski puć wužiwać</h3><ul><li><span class='knopfwort'>Zawěsćensku kopiju wobnowić …</span> pod <i>Wěstota ▸ Zawěsćenske kopije</i> wočini platformowu hłownu dataju <b>.json</b>.</li><li><span class='knopfwort'>Nastajenja ▸ Import ▸ Dospołny archiw Magnolie (.magnolie) …</span> wočini přenosujomny archiw <b>.magnolie</b> z Linuxa abo Windowsa.</li></ul><p>Organizer přepruwuje wubranu dataju před narunanjom datow a wutwori winowatu wobnowjensku kopiju aktualneho stawa. Wobnowjenje cyłu sadźbu hłownych datow naruna; prěnja synchronizacija po tym žane zhašenja njesćele.</p><div class='achtung'><b>Wobłuk znajeć</b>Žadyn format njeje dospołny wobraz grata. Telefonowe a KDE-sparowanje, <b>phone.db</b>, staw wokna a dopominanjow, wosobinski słownik, kontowe potajnstwa a identita Magnolienbauma z hałuzami a čakanskimi rynkami so separatnje składuja. Pod Windows wostanu dataje Magnolienbauma zwonka hłowneje hesłoweje transakcije. Přehlad na stronje <b data-page='platform-security-matrix' class='knopfwort'></b> tute hranicy nalistuje.</div><div class='merke'><b>Hesła wostanu rozdźělne</b>Organizer swoje nutřkowne wobnowjenske kopije při změnje hesła aktualizuje. Eksistowace separatnje škitane eksterne JSON-kopije a archiwy <b>.magnolie</b> wobchowaja hesłowu sadu z časa wutworjenja.</div>","<h3>Map</h3><p><span class='knopfwort'>Map</span> displays the address on a map: in <i>GNOME Maps</i>, if available, or otherwise in <i>OpenStreetMap</i> in your browser. You can also select <i>Google Maps</i> in the settings. Where no map application is installed, the address opens in your default browser.</p><div class='merke'><b>Do not forget the country</b>To help the mapping service find the street, the Organizer appends the country, which is <i>Germany</i> by default. If your contacts live elsewhere, change this in the settings.</div><h3>Route</h3><p>Under <i>Settings ▸ Contacts</i>, select <b>Route: calculate directions immediately</b>. The map button on every contact card will then read <span class='knopfwort'>Route</span>. Your own address saved in the settings is the starting point, and the address on the contact card is the destination. If your own address is incomplete or unusable, the Organizer alerts you.</p><h3>Message</h3><p>If a person has several email addresses, the contact card displays each one separately. Synchronization with GNOME Contacts also includes the complete list and any contact photo stored there. When you import or synchronize again, additional addresses are added; differences in capitalization do not create duplicates.</p><p>Click the email address itself or <span class='knopfwort'>Message</span> to open a new, already addressed message in your email program — whichever program your system opens for mail. The recipient field contains <i>First name Last name &lt;Email address&gt;</i> rather than only the email address.</p><h3>Social media</h3><p>Under <b>More fields ▸ Social media</b>, use <b>+ Social media</b> to add WhatsApp, Threema, Facebook, Instagram, Signal, Mastodon, Teams, Snapchat, TikTok, YouTube, Telegram, X, LinkedIn, Reddit, SMS, phone calls, or a custom service, together with the relevant phone number, handle, or profile address. For phone-based services, click the field to choose from the phone numbers on the contact card; you can still type a different number.</p><p>Every fixed service has a monochrome Magnolie symbol. A custom service can use the general network symbol or a Magnolie symbol for Twitch, IRC, Discord, Matrix, Slack, or GitHub. These small Magnolie icons first try to open a suitable installed program, such as Whatsie, ZapZap, Valent, KDE Connect, Skype, or Linphone. With Valent-Mint 1.0.0-13 or later, the SMS icon uses the compose interface to open a new draft addressed directly to the selected phone number. Desktop launchers and URI schemes also work with programs installed through Flatpak or Snap, such as Thunderbird. When selecting a custom program, you can use <i>flatpak:APP-ID</i> or <i>snap:Name</i>. If no suitable program is installed, the Organizer uses the secure web service. A custom service without its own action requires a secure HTTPS address. The gear icon beside an entry reveals the option to choose a specific HTTPS website or program command only when needed. Save and Cancel remain visible at the bottom while you scroll through the contact card. You can hide these communication icons under <span class='knopfwort'>Settings ▸ Contacts</span>.</p><div class='merke'><b>Dialling and texting</b>The handset icon can ask a paired Android phone to dial; the SMS icon writes through a paired KDE Connect device. Both are described from page <b data-page='kde-sms' class='knopfwort'></b> onwards. The sound of a call always stays on the phone.</div>":"<h3>Karta</h3><p><span class='knopfwort'>Karta</span> pokazuje adresu w <i>GNOME Maps</i>, jeli su k dispoziciji, hewak w <i>OpenStreetMap</i> we wobhladowaku. W nastajenjach móžeće tež <i>Google Maps</i> wubrać. Bjez kartoweho nałoženja so adresa w standardnym wobhladowaku wočini.</p><div class='merke'><b>Kraj njezabudźće</b>Organizer adresu wo kraj rozšěri, zo by kartowa słužba dróhu namakała; standard je <i>Němska</i>. Jeli waše kontakty hdźe druhej bydla, změńće to w nastajenjach.</div><h3>Ruta</h3><p>Wubjerće pod <i>Nastajenja ▸ Kontakty</i> <b>Ruta: puć hnydom wobličić</b>. Kartowe tłóčatko na kontaktowej karće potom <span class='knopfwort'>Ruta</span> rěka. Waša w nastajenjach składowana adresa je start, adresa na kontaktowej karće cil. Jeli je waša adresa njedospołna abo njewužiwajomna, Organizer was warnuje.</p><h3>Powěsć</h3><p>Při wjacorych e-mejlowych adresach pokazuje kontaktowa karta kóždu separatnje. Synchronizacija z GNOME Contacts zapřija dospołnu lisćinu a składowane kontaktowe foto. Při dalšim imporće abo synchronizaciji so dalše adresy přidaja; rozdźěle w pisanskej wulkosći duplikaty njewutworja.</p><p>Klikńće na adresu abo <span class='knopfwort'>Powěsć</span>, zo byšće nowu, hižo adresowanu powěsć w swojim e-mejlowym programje wočinili. Pólo přijimarja wobsahuje <i>Předmjeno Swójbne mjeno &lt;E-mejlowa adresa&gt;</i>, nic jenož adresu.</p><h3>Socialne medije</h3><p>Pod <b>Dalše pola ▸ Socialne medije</b> přidajće z <b>+ Socialne medije</b> WhatsApp, Threema, Facebook, Instagram, Signal, Mastodon, Teams, Snapchat, TikTok, YouTube, Telegram, X, LinkedIn, Reddit, SMS, telefonowe zawołanja abo swójsku słužbu z čisłom, wužiwarskim mjenom abo profilowej adresu. Za telefonowe słužby móžeće čisło z karty wubrać abo druhe zapodać.</p><p>Kóžda festna słužba ma monochromny symbol Magnolie. Swójska słužba móže powšitkowny syćowy symbol abo symbol za Twitch, IRC, Discord, Matrix, Slack abo GitHub wužiwać. Symbole najprjedy přihódny instalowany program kaž Whatsie, ZapZap, Valent, KDE Connect, Skype abo Linphone wočinjeć pospytaja. Wot Valent-Mint 1.0.0-13 wužiwa SMS-symbol formular za nowy na wubrane čisło adresowany naćisk. Startowaki a URI-schemy funguja tež z Flatpak- abo Snap-programami kaž Thunderbird. Za swójski program móžeće <i>flatpak:APP-ID</i> abo <i>snap:Name</i> wužiwać. Bjez přihódneho programa wužiwa Organizer wěstu websłužbu. Swójska słužba bjez akcije trjeba wěstu HTTPS-adresu. Zubate kolesko pokazuje wuběr wěsteho websydła abo programoweho přikaza jenož po potrjebje. Składowanje a Přetorhnjenje wostanetej při skrolowanju widźomnej. Komunikaciske symbole móžeće pod <span class='knopfwort'>Nastajenja ▸ Kontakty</span> schować.</p><div class='merke'><b>Zawołać a SMS pisać</b>Telefonowy symbol móže sparowany Android wo wuzwolenje prosyć; SMS-symbol pisa přez sparowany grat KDE Connect. Wobě funkciji stej wot strony <b data-page='kde-sms' class='knopfwort'></b> wopisanej. Zynk zawołanja přeco na telefonje wostanje.</div>","<h3>New and already present</h3><p>After a file or folder import, Magnolie Notes reports how many notes were taken over and how many were already present. A duplicate is recognized from the normalized <b>title and text</b>. Filename, source, notebook and date do not distinguish it, so the same wording from another source is skipped as already present. Notes already stored without an import identity are not compared retroactively.</p><h3>Where the notes go</h3><p>Keep uses its first label or the notebook <b>Google Keep</b>. Evernote, Simplenote and Standard Notes use a notebook carrying their product name. Plain files use a recognized source or <b>Imported</b>. Existing notebook names are reused; directory names do not create a notebook hierarchy.</p><h3>ZIP safety limits</h3><p>A ZIP may contain at most <b>5,000 entries</b>, with at most <b>8 MiB</b> uncompressed per entry and <b>64 MiB</b> uncompressed altogether. Nested and multipart ZIP files are not read. A damaged archive or a violated ZIP limit rejects the complete archive instead of importing an uncertain partial result.</p><h3>When nothing arrives</h3><p><i>No readable notes were found in this file.</i> means that no nonblank title or text was produced. <i>The import failed.</i> also covers malformed or oversized ZIP files. A repeated direct share may use the first wording instead of explicitly saying that the note was a duplicate.</p><div class='achtung'><b>Keep the export until you have checked it</b>Open several imported notes, inspect notebooks, check-list marks and dates, and compare the reported number. Only then remove the original export.</div>":"<h3>Nowe a hižo eksistowace</h3><p>Po imporće dataje abo rjadowaka Magnolie Notes zdźěli, kelko noticow je přewzała a kelko hižo eksistowaše. Duplikat so po normalizowanym <b>titulu a teksće</b> spóznaje. Datajowe mjeno, žórło, notatnik a datum jón njerozeznaja, tuž so samsny tekst z druheho žórła jako eksistowacy přeskoči. Notice, kotrež su hižo bjez importoweje identity składowane, so wróćo njepřirunuja.</p><h3>Hdźe notice dóńdu</h3><p>Keep wužiwa swoje prěnje pomjenowanje abo notatnik <b>Google Keep</b>. Evernote, Simplenote a Standard Notes wužiwaja notatnik ze swojim produktowym mjenom. Zwyčajne dataje wužiwaja spóznate žórło abo <b>Importowane</b>. Eksistowace mjena notatnikow so znowa wužiwaja; rjadowakowe mjena žanu hierarchiju notatnikow njewutworja.</p><h3>Wěstotne mjezy ZIP</h3><p>ZIP smě maksimalnje <b>5.000 zapiskow</b> wobsahować, z maksimalnje <b>8 MiB</b> njekomprimowane na zapisk a <b>64 MiB</b> dohromady. Zasadźene a wjacedźělne ZIP-dataje so nječitaja. Wobškodźeny archiw abo překročena ZIP-mjeza cyły archiw wotpokaza, město zo by njewěsty dźěl importowała.</p><h3>Hdyž ničo njedóńdźe</h3><p><i>W tutej dataji njejsu so čitajomne notice namakali.</i> rěka, zo žadyn njeprózdny titul abo tekst njenasta. <i>Import je so njeporadźił.</i> płaći tež za wopak wutworjene abo přewulke ZIP-dataje. Wospjetne direktne dźělenje móže prěnje sformułowanje wužiwać, město zo by duplikat wuraznje mjeniło.</p><div class='achtung'><b>Eksport wobchowajće, doniž njejsće jón přepruwowali</b>Wočińće wjacore importowane notice, přepruwujće notatniki, marki kontrolnych lisćinow a datumy a přirunajće zdźělenu ličbu. Hakle potom originalny eksport wotstrońće.</div>","<h3>Nextcloud</h3><p>A server platform that Magnolie can use for CalDAV and CardDAV synchronization and for a separate WebDAV mailbox.</p><h3>Notification</h3><p>A message shown by the operating system, for example for a due reminder, an incoming call, or permitted Android app information.</p><h3>Pairing</h3><p>The deliberate association of two devices or branches, including identity checks and the permissions granted to that partner.</p><h3>PDF</h3><p>A fixed-layout document format used by Magnolie for print output and supported note attachments.</p><h3>Personal Sync</h3><p>Synchronization of notes, notebooks, and own tasks between one person's desktop and one phone marked as an own device; it excludes calendars, contacts, and shared Magnolienbaum entries.</p><h3>Port</h3><p>A numbered TCP or UDP endpoint through which a network service receives traffic, such as TCP 8741 for the Magnolie phone connection.</p><h3>Recovery snapshot</h3><p>An integrity-checked short-term copy of the complete main-data set inside Magnolie's data location; it is not a backup against disk or device loss.</p><h3>Recycle bin</h3><p>Local retention for supported deleted Organizer items, from which they can be restored until they expire or are removed permanently.</p><h3>RFCOMM</h3><p>A Bluetooth serial-data transport used as a permitted manual fallback for the Magnolie phone protocol; it uses no IP firewall port.</p><h3>SHA-256</h3><p>A cryptographic hash function used for file checksums, attachment identities, and other integrity checks.</p><h3>SMS</h3><p>A mobile-network text message. In Magnolie Organizer, reading and sending SMS uses KDE Connect rather than Magnolie Notes or Personal Sync.</p><h3>Synchronization</h3><p>The controlled comparison and exchange of changes between stores, with Magnolie-specific conflict, permission, and deletion safeguards.</p><h3>Time zone</h3><p>A regional rule set such as <b>Europe/Berlin</b> that relates local dates and times to absolute instants.</p><h3>TLS</h3><p>Transport Layer Security, which encrypts a network connection and authenticates its peer by certificate; KDE Connect uses mutually authenticated TLS.</p><h3>Tray</h3><p>The desktop notification area beside the clock, where Magnolie can remain available while its main window is hidden.</p><h3>UFW</h3><p>Uncomplicated Firewall, a Linux firewall frontend for which the Debian package supplies an optional Magnolie application profile.</p><h3>URI</h3><p>A standardized resource identifier, including addresses such as <b>https:</b> links and <b>sms:</b> recipients.</p><h3>vCard</h3><p>A standard contact exchange format, usually stored in a <b>.vcf</b> file and supported by Magnolie import and export.</p><h3>VPN</h3><p>A virtual private network that can securely connect devices or networks over another network; Magnolie does not create one automatically.</p><h3>Wayland</h3><p>A modern Linux display protocol under which the compositor controls details such as exact window placement.</p><h3>WebDAV</h3><p>HTTP-based access to remote files and collections; Magnolie uses a Nextcloud WebDAV folder as an optional message mailbox.</p><h3>Wi-Fi</h3><p>A wireless IP network and the preferred transport for Magnolie phone connections and Personal Sync.</p><h3>X11</h3><p>The traditional Linux window-system protocol, under which Magnolie can restore an exact window position where the window manager permits it.</p><h3>XDG</h3><p>Freedesktop.org conventions and environment variables that define standard Linux locations for data, configuration, and state files.</p><h3>ZIP</h3><p>A compressed archive format accepted by selected Magnolie imports under strict entry, size, path, and compression-ratio limits.</p>":"<h3>Nextcloud</h3><p>Serwerowa platforma, kotruž Magnolie za synchronizaciju CalDAV a CardDAV kaž tež za separatny WebDAV-póštowy kašćik wužiwa.</p><h3>Zdźělenka</h3><p>Powěsć dźěłoweho systema, na přikład wo dospětym dopomnjeću, dochadźacym zawołanju abo dowolenych informacijach Androidoweho nałoženja.</p><h3>Sparowanje</h3><p>Wědome zwjazanje dweju gratow abo hałuzow, inkluziwnje přepruwowanja identity a dowolnosćow za partnera.</p><h3>PDF</h3><p>Dokumentowy format z krutym natwarom, kotryž Magnolie za ćišćenske wudaće wužiwa a jako přiwěšk noticy podpěruje.</p><h3>Personal Sync</h3><p>Synchronizacija noticow, notatnikow a swójskich nadawkow mjez desktopom jedneje wosoby a jednym jako swójski grat markěrowanym telefonom; protyki, kontakty a dźělene zapiski Magnolienbauma su wuwzate.</p><h3>Port</h3><p>Ličbowany TCP- abo UDP-kónčny dypk za přijimanje syćoweho wobchada, na přikład TCP 8741 za telefonowy zwisk Magnolie.</p><h3>Wobnowjenska kopija</h3><p>Na integritu přepruwowana krótko wobchowana kopija cyłych hłownych datow w datowym městnje Magnolie; njeje zawěsćenje před zhubjenjom diska abo grata.</p><h3>Papjernik</h3><p>Lokalne wobchowanje podpěranych zhašanych zapiskow Organizera, kotrež dadźa so hač do spadnjenja abo trajneho wotstronjenja wobnowić.</p><h3>RFCOMM</h3><p>Bluetoothowy transport serielnych datow jako dowolene manuelne narunanje telefonoweho protokola Magnolie; žadyn port IP-wohnjoweje murje njetrjeba.</p><h3>SHA-256</h3><p>Kryptografiska hašowa funkcija za kontrolne sumy datajow, identity přiwěškow a druhe přepruwowanja integrity.</p><h3>SMS</h3><p>Tekstowa powěsć mobilneje syće. W Magnolie Organizer so SMS přez KDE Connect čitaja a sćelu, nic přez Magnolie Notes abo Personal Sync.</p><h3>Synchronizacija</h3><p>Kontrolowane přirunanje a wuměna změnow mjez składami z wěstotnymi prawidłami Magnolie za konflikty, dowolnosće a zhašenja.</p><h3>Časowe pasmo</h3><p>Regionalna sada prawidłow kaž <b>Europe/Berlin</b>, kotraž lokalne datumy a časy z absolutnymi wokomikami zwjazuje.</p><h3>TLS</h3><p>Transport Layer Security, kotraž syćowy zwisk zaklučuje a partnera z certifikatom awtentifikuje; KDE Connect wužiwa wzajomnje awtentifikowane TLS.</p><h3>Systemowe polo</h3><p>Zdźělenski wobłuk desktopa pódla časnika, hdźež Magnolie při schowanym hłownym woknje k dispoziciji wostanje.</p><h3>UFW</h3><p>Uncomplicated Firewall, Linuxowy powjerch wohnjoweje murje, za kotryž Debianowy pakćik opcionalny profil Magnolie dodawa.</p><h3>URI</h3><p>Standardizowany identifikator resursy, na přikład adresy <b>https:</b> a přijimarjo <b>sms:</b>.</p><h3>vCard</h3><p>Standardny wuměnjenski format kontaktow, zwjetša w dataji <b>.vcf</b>, kotryž import a eksport Magnolie podpěrujetej.</p><h3>VPN</h3><p>Wirtuelna priwatna syć za wěste zwjazanje gratow abo syćow přez druhu syć; Magnolie ju awtomatisce njewutwori.</p><h3>Wayland</h3><p>Moderny Linuxowy wobrazowkowy protokol, pod kotrymž kompozitor podrobnosće kaž eksaktnu poziciju wokna kontroluje.</p><h3>WebDAV</h3><p>Přistup na zakładźe HTTP k zdalnym datajam a zběrkam; Magnolie wužiwa WebDAV-rjadowak Nextcloud jako opcionalny póštowy kašćik powěsćow.</p><h3>Wi-Fi</h3><p>Bjezgrotowa IP-syć a preferowany transport za telefonowe zwiski Magnolie a Personal Sync.</p><h3>X11</h3><p>Tradicionalny Linuxowy protokol woknoweho systema, pod kotrymž móže Magnolie eksaktnu poziciju wobnowić, jeli to woknowy zrjadowak dowoli.</p><h3>XDG</h3><p>Konwencije a wokolinowe wariable Freedesktop.org za standardne Linuxowe městna datow, konfiguracije a statusowych datajow.</p><h3>ZIP</h3><p>Komprimowany archiwowy format, kotryž wubrane importy Magnolie pod striktnymi mjezami za zapiski, wulkosć, puće a komprimaciski poměr akceptuja.</p>","<h3>People responsible</h3><p>Use <span class='knopfwort'>People</span> to add, rename, or remove people. On the task form, you can select one or more people. Colored initials beside the task then show who is responsible.</p><h3>Filter the list</h3><p>Above the task list, you can select a person and a date range if required. <span class='knopfwort'>Clear selection</span> displays everything again. The printed output uses exactly the same people and date filters.</p><h3>Set a reminder for the due date</h3><p>When creating or editing a task, select <b>remind me on the due date</b>. The reminder appears in the morning and also names the people responsible. Reminders must be enabled globally for this to work.</p><p>Under <b>Custom notification</b>, you can also choose a lead time of one to seven days. The field starts blank and displays the gray hint <i>e.g. 1 day before</i>. You can use the due-date reminder and the custom lead time either together or separately.</p><div class='merke'><b>A task for an appointment</b>On the appointment sheet, you can link an existing task or create a new one. You can also give the new task its own reminder there.</div><div class='achtung'><b>When exporting</b>A task export includes the title, due date, priority, status, and note. People, reminders, and appointment links are retained only in a complete backup.</div>":"<h3>Zamołwite wosoby</h3><p>Z <span class='knopfwort'>Wosoby</span> móžeće wosoby přidać, přemjenować abo wotstronić. We formularje nadawka móžeće jednu abo wjacore wosoby wubrać. Barbojte iniciály pódla nadawka potom pokazuja, štóž je za nje zamołwity.</p><h3>Lisćinu filtrować</h3><p>Nad lisćinu nadawkow móžeće po potrjebje wosobu a datumowy wobłuk wubrać. <span class='knopfwort'>Wuběr anulować</span> pokazuje zaso wšitko. Wotćišćane wuslědki wužiwaja runje samsne wosobowe a datumowe filtry.</p><h3>Dopomnjeće na termin nastajić</h3><p>Hdyž nadawk wutworjeće abo wobdźěłujeće, wubjerće <b>na dnju termina dopomnić</b>. Dopomnjeće so rano jewi a mjenuje tež zamołwite wosoby. Zo by to fungowało, dyrbja dopomnjeća globalnje zmóžnjene być.</p><p>Pod <b>Swójska zdźělenka</b> móžeće tež předčas jedneho hač sydom dnjow wubrać. Polo je spočatnje prózdne a pokazuje šěru pomoc <i>na př. 1 dźeń do toho</i>. Dopomnjeće na termin a swójski předčas móžeće hromadźe abo separatnje wužiwać.</p><div class='merke'><b>Nadawk k terminej</b>Na kartce termina móžeće eksistowacy nadawk zwjazać abo nowy wutworić. Nowemu nadawkej móžeće tam tež hnydom swójske dopomnjeće dać.</div><div class='achtung'><b>Při eksporće</b>Eksport nadawka wobsahuje titul, termin, prioritu, status a noticu. Wosoby, dopomnjeća a zwiski z terminami so jenož w dospołnej zawěsćenskej kopiji zachowaja.</div>","<h3>Select contact cards</h3><p>Open <span class='knopfwort'>Selection options</span> in the footer. All names appear on the left with a checkbox; the right side previews the selected cards. Use <span class='knopfwort'>All</span> and <span class='knopfwort'>None</span>, then choose <span class='knopfwort'>Print now</span>, <span class='knopfwort'>ODS</span>, or <span class='knopfwort'>Delete selection</span>.</p><p>Deleting requires confirmation. With the recycle bin enabled, the contacts go there; otherwise they are removed permanently. Derived anniversaries are removed as well, while linked appointments and tasks remain and are merely disconnected from the contacts.</p><h3>Merge duplicate contact cards</h3><p>Duplicates inevitably accumulate over the years: the same person may appear twice, once with a postal address and once with a phone number. Use <span class='knopfwort'>Merge duplicate contact cards</span> under <span class='knopfwort'>Settings ▸ Contacts</span> to resolve them.</p><p>The Organizer searches for matching names, email addresses, and phone numbers. Capitalization in email addresses is ignored; national phone numbers and the same numbers with a country code are treated as identical. The Organizer shows how many groups it found, provides examples, and asks for confirmation <b>twice</b> before making any changes.</p><p>When contacts are merged, the most complete card is retained and all email addresses, phone numbers, and postal addresses are combined. <i>Straße</i>, <i>Strasse</i>, and <i>Str.</i> are treated as equivalent. Notes are appended to one another. A copy of every removed card remains in the recycle bin under <i>Duplicates</i>.</p><div class='achtung'><b>Check the results</b>Take a moment to inspect several merged contact cards. If anything is incorrect, recover the copy from the recycle bin.</div>":"<h3>Kontaktowe karty wubrać</h3><p>W noze wočińće <span class='knopfwort'>Wuběranske opcije</span>. Nalěwo so wšitke mjena z kontrolnymi kašćikami pokazuja, naprawo je přehlad wubranych kartow. Wužijće <span class='knopfwort'>Wšitko</span> abo <span class='knopfwort'>Žane</span> a potom <span class='knopfwort'>Nětko ćišćeć</span>, <span class='knopfwort'>ODS</span> abo <span class='knopfwort'>Wuběr zhašeć</span>.</p><p>Zhašenje dyrbi so wobkrućić. Jeli je papjernik zmóžnjeny, dóńdu kontakty tam; hewak so na přeco wotstronja. Wotwodźene róčnicy so tež wotstronja, zwjazane terminy a nadawki pak wobchowaja so a jenož zwisk z kontaktami zhubja.</p><h3>Dwójne kontaktowe karty zjednoćić</h3><p>Za lěta so duplikaty nimoměry nahromadźa: samsna wosoba móže dwójce eksistować, jónu z póštowej adresu a jónu z telefonowym čisłom. Wužijće <span class='knopfwort'>Dwójne kontaktowe karty zjednoćić</span> pod <span class='knopfwort'>Nastajenja ▸ Kontakty</span>, zo byšće je porjedźili.</p><p>Organizer pyta za samsnymi mjenami, e-mejlowymi adresami a telefonowymi čisłami. Wulkopisanje w e-mejlowych adresach so ignoruje; narodne telefonowe čisło a samsne čisło z kodom kraja so jako identiske wobhladuje. Organizer pokazuje, kelko skupin je namakał, poda přikłady a prosy <b>dwójce</b> wo wobkrućenje, prjedy hač změny přewjedźe.</p><p>Při zjednoćenju so najdospołniša karta wobchowa a wšitke e-mejlowe adresy, telefonowe čisła a póštowe adresy so zjednoća. <i>Straße</i>, <i>Strasse</i> a <i>Str.</i> so jako samsne wobhladuja. Noticy so jedna druhej připowěsćuja. Kopija kóždeje wotstronjeneje karty wostanje w papjerniku pod <i>Duplikaty</i>.</p><div class='achtung'><b>Wuslědk přepruwować</b>Wobhladajće sej někotre zjednoćene kontaktowe karty. Jeli něšto njetrjechi, wobnowće kopiju z papjernika.</div>","<h3>Startup and tray diagnostics</h3><p><i>magnolie-organizer --debug</i> continues the requested operation and writes startup, imports, session, single-instance, window, and tray events to <i>${XDG_STATE_HOME:-~/.local/state}/magnolie-organizer/debug.log</i>. The directory is private to the user and the file is created with owner-only permissions. At 2 MiB it rotates; <i>debug.log.1</i> and <i>debug.log.2</i> retain at most two older portions.</p><h3>Reminder troubleshooting</h3><p>The optional reminder log is <i>${XDG_DATA_HOME:-~/.local/share}/magnolie-organizer/wecker.log</i>. Enable <span class='knopfwort'>Keep a troubleshooting log</span> under <span class='knopfwort'>Settings ▸ Notifications</span> only while investigating a problem. It keeps at most 200 lines and removes dated lines older than 30 days. <span class='knopfwort'>Show log</span> opens a prepared diagnostic view; disabling logging stops new entries.</p><div class='achtung'><b>Logs can contain personal details</b>Reminder titles, names, times, paths, session details, errors, and technical identifiers may occur. Read the file before sharing it, remove unrelated lines, and switch logging off afterwards. File permissions protect it from other local users under normal conditions, but not from software already running as your account.</div>":"<h3>Diagnostika starta a systemoweho pola</h3><p><i>magnolie-organizer --debug</i> požadanu operaciju pokročuje a pisa podawki starta, importow, posedźenja, jednotliweje instance, wokna a systemoweho pola do <i>${XDG_STATE_HOME:-~/.local/state}/magnolie-organizer/debug.log</i>. Rjadowak je priwatny za wužiwarja a dataja ma jenož wobsydźerske prawa. Při 2 MiB so wotwjertuje; <i>debug.log.1</i> a <i>debug.log.2</i> wobchowatej maksimalnje dwaj staršej dźělaj.</p><h3>Pytanje zmylkow dopominanjow</h3><p>Opcionalny protokol je <i>${XDG_DATA_HOME:-~/.local/share}/magnolie-organizer/wecker.log</i>. Zmóžńće <span class='knopfwort'>Protokol za pytanje zmylkow wobchować</span> pod <span class='knopfwort'>Nastajenja ▸ Zdźělenki</span> jenož za čas analyzy. Wón wobchowa maksimalnje 200 linkow a wotstroni datowane linki starše hač 30 dnjow. <span class='knopfwort'>Protokol pokazać</span> wočini přihotowany diagnostiski napohlad; wupinjenje nowe zapiski zastaji.</p><div class='achtung'><b>Protokole móža wosobinske podrobnosće wobsahować</b>Titule dopominanjow, mjena, časy, puće, posedźenske podrobnosće, zmylki a techniske identifikatory móža so jewić. Čitajće dataju před dźělenjom, wotstrońće njepotrjebne linki a wupńće protokolowanje. Datajowe prawa ju normalnje před druhimi lokalnymi wužiwarjemi škitaja, ale nic před programom, kotryž hižo pod wašim kontom běži.</div>","<h3>Tasks, appointments, and contacts</h3><p>In a task, select a branch under <b>Delegate to</b>. Share a saved appointment from its appointment sheet, or a contact from its contact card. The Organizer asks for confirmation again before sending.</p><p>New notes and tasks from a confirmed trusted branch are accepted automatically. Offers from untrusted branches, and content types that are not handled automatically, remain under <span class='knopfwort'>Settings ▸ Magnolienbaum</span> until you <b>Accept</b> or <b>Reject</b> them.</p><h3>Optional contact synchronization</h3><p>Magnolie Organizer for Linux 2.0.4 and Windows 2.0.4 can synchronize contacts directly with Magnolie Notes for Android 1.0.5. This is <b>off by default for every partner</b>. The branch must be confirmed and trusted. Explicitly switch on contact synchronization for that partner and use its separate manual <span class='knopfwort'>Synchronize contacts</span> button. Android asks for permission to read and write contacts only when you switch the feature on or start it.</p><div class='achtung'><b>Contacts are never included silently</b><span class='knopfwort'>Synchronize everything</span> continues to synchronize notes and tasks only. The automatic note and task synchronization that Android can run at most once every six hours also excludes contacts.</div><p>The following fields can travel in both directions: names, company, several phone numbers, email addresses and postal addresses, note, birthday, and contact photo. Photos may be JPEG, PNG, or WebP and may contain up to about 2 MiB or 2,800,000 data-URL characters. No cloud account and no Microsoft or Google app ID is required.</p><h3>Safe merging instead of overwriting</h3><p>Contacts are linked by a stable technical binding, not by comparing names. A photo is never used to decide whether two contacts match. Transfer is direct and end-to-end encrypted. Synchronization merges additively and preserves data: an empty value on the other device deletes nothing; a nonempty local value is retained if values conflict; and phone, email, and address lists are combined.</p><h3>Optional deletion synchronization</h3><p>Complete deletion synchronization is a separate option for each partner and is <b>off by default</b>. It is considered only when you press the manual <span class='knopfwort'>Synchronize contacts</span> button, never by <span class='knopfwort'>Synchronize everything</span> or Android's Wi-Fi automatic synchronization. Before anything can be deleted, a preview and warning dialog lists new and changed contacts, possible duplicates, and deletion suggestions.</p><div class='achtung'><b>A deletion is only a suggestion</b>Deletion suggestions are never applied automatically, even for a trusted branch. Select each deletion separately and confirm it once more with the displayed contact name and partner. There is no <i>Select all</i> for deletions.</div><p>One run permits at most 10 deletions and at most 10% of the contacts stably bound to that partner; at least one individual deletion remains possible. If either limit would be exceeded, Organizer or the app blocks the deletions. An empty or incomplete contact collection, a collection below 50% of the last bound collection, or a communication or permission error produces no deletion suggestions.</p><p>Only a contact that was previously linked by a stable binding can be suggested for deletion. Mere absence, a similar name, or a contact photo is not enough. After individual confirmation, the desktop Organizer moves the contact to the recycle bin. Android deletes exactly the bound system contact, and only after confirmation.</p><h3>Duplicates remain under your control</h3><p>Possible duplicates are suggested conservatively only when they have an unambiguous phone number or email address in common, or the same name and company. They are never merged automatically. Confirm each merge separately. The result preserves data and combines nonempty values and lists; on Android, a confirmed merge can lead to the corresponding system contact.</p><h3>Note attachments in both directions</h3><p>Organizer and the Android app actually transfer note attachments both ways. Supported images are JPEG, PNG, WebP, and GIF; PDF files are supported as well. Each attachment is limited to 12,000,000 data-URL characters and all attachments of one note together to 24,000,000. Android can display images and can open a received PDF or other supported file securely through its FileProvider.</p><p>Android also adapts acceptance of new attachments to the phone's free storage. It keeps a 256 MiB reserve. For each newly accepted note, attachments may use at most 1% of the currently usable free storage. Across the app, raw attachment data may use at most the smaller of 512 MiB and 10% of the usable storage above the reserve.</p><div class='achtung'><b>If storage is insufficient</b>Existing attachments remain untouched. New attachments that are too large are skipped, and Android reports this instead of damaging the note or silently removing an existing file.</div><h3>Full synchronization</h3><p><span class='knopfwort'>Synchronize everything</span> sends all local notes with stable sharing identifiers and all tasks owned by this branch. Tasks received from elsewhere are not reflected back. An encrypted synchronization request asks the trusted other side for its complete corresponding data. Replies contain no further request, so they cannot form a loop.</p><p>Magnolie Notes can run the same full synchronization automatically while its visible receiving service is running and Android reports an active Wi-Fi connection. It runs at most once every six hours and needs no SSID or location permission.</p><p>If a device is switched off, transmissions wait and retry after 1, 2, 5, 10, 30, and 60 minutes, then hourly. After seven days, they are abandoned.</p><h3>Completion is reported back</h3><p>If the other party marks an accepted task as completed, the new status returns to its creator as a <b>Completion confirmation</b>.</p><div class='merke'><b>Encrypted and authenticated</b>All messages are end-to-end encrypted. Pinned keys, authenticated envelopes, and replay protection prevent unnoticed key replacement, alteration, and reuse of old messages.</div>":"<h3>Zadania, spotkania i kontakty</h3><p>W zadaniu wybierz oddział w sekcji <b>Przekaż do</b>. Udostępnij zapisane spotkanie z arkusza spotkań lub kontakt z karty kontaktów. Organizator prosi o ponowne potwierdzenie przed wysłaniem.</p><p>Nowe notatki i zadania z potwierdzonego zaufanego oddziału są akceptowane automatycznie. Oferty z niezaufanych oddziałów i typy treści, które nie są obsługiwane automatycznie, pozostają w <span class='knopfwort'>Ustawieniach ▸ Magnolienbaum</span> do czasu, aż je <b>zaakceptujesz</b> lub <b>odrzucisz</b>.</p><h3>Opcjonalna synchronizacja kontaktów</h3><p>Magnolie Organizer dla Linux 2.0.4 i Windows 2.0.4 może synchronizować kontakty bezpośrednio z Magnolie Notes dla Androida 1.0.5. Opcja ta jest <b>domyślnie wyłączona dla każdego partnera</b>. Oddział musi być potwierdzony i zaufany. Jawnie włącz synchronizację kontaktów dla tego partnera i użyj osobnego ręcznego przycisku <span class='knopfwort'>Synchronizuj kontakty</span>. Android pyta o pozwolenie na odczyt i zapis kontaktów dopiero po włączeniu lub uruchomieniu tej funkcji.</p><div class='achtung'><b>Kontakty nigdy nie są uwzględniane w trybie cichym</b><span class='knopfwort'>Synchronizuj wszystko</span> nadal synchronizuje tylko notatki i zadania. Automatyczna synchronizacja notatek i zadań, którą Android może uruchamiać najwyżej raz na sześć godzin, również wyklucza kontakty.</div><p>Poniższe pola mogą przemieszczać się w obie strony: imiona i nazwiska, firma, kilka numerów telefonów, adresy e-mail i adresy pocztowe, notatka, urodziny i zdjęcie kontaktu. Zdjęcia mogą mieć format JPEG, PNG lub WebP i mogą zawierać do około 2 MiB lub 2 800 000 znaków adresu URL danych. Nie jest wymagane żadne konto w chmurze ani identyfikator aplikacji Microsoft ani Google.</p><h3>Bezpieczne łączenie zamiast nadpisywania</h3><p>Kontakty są łączone stabilnym powiązaniem technicznym, a nie poprzez porównywanie nazw. Zdjęcie nigdy nie służy do ustalenia, czy dwa kontakty pasują do siebie. Transfer jest bezpośredni i całkowicie szyfrowany. Synchronizacja łączy addytywnie i chroni dane: pusta wartość na drugim urządzeniu niczego nie usuwa; w przypadku konfliktu wartości zachowywana jest niepusta wartość lokalna; oraz listy telefonów, adresów e-mail i adresów są łączone.</p><h3>Opcjonalna synchronizacja usuwania</h3><p>Całkowita synchronizacja usuwania jest osobną opcją dla każdego partnera i jest <b>domyślnie wyłączona</b>. Jest to brane pod uwagę tylko wtedy, gdy naciśniesz ręczny przycisk <span class='knopfwort'>Synchronizuj kontakty</span>, nigdy przez <span class='knopfwort'>Synchronizuj wszystko</span> lub automatyczną synchronizację Wi-Fi Androida. Zanim będzie można cokolwiek usunąć, pojawia się okno dialogowe podglądu i ostrzeżenia zawierające listę nowych i zmienionych kontaktów, możliwych duplikatów oraz sugestii usunięcia.</p><div class='achtung'><b>Usunięcie to tylko sugestia</b>Sugestie usunięcia nigdy nie są stosowane automatycznie, nawet w przypadku zaufanego oddziału. Wybierz każde usunięcie z osobna i potwierdź je jeszcze raz wyświetlaną nazwą kontaktu i partnerem. Nie ma opcji <i>Wybierz wszystko</i> do usunięcia.</div><p>Jedno uruchomienie pozwala na maksymalnie 10 usunięć i maksymalnie 10% kontaktów stabilnie powiązanych z tym partnerem; możliwe jest przynajmniej jedno indywidualne usunięcie. Jeśli którykolwiek z limitów zostanie przekroczony, Organizator lub aplikacja zablokuje usunięcie. Pusta lub niekompletna kolekcja kontaktów, kolekcja poniżej 50% ostatniej powiązanej kolekcji lub błąd komunikacji lub pozwolenia nie powoduje żadnych sugestii usunięcia.</p><p>Do usunięcia można zasugerować tylko kontakt, który był wcześniej połączony stabilnym powiązaniem. Sama nieobecność, podobne nazwisko czy zdjęcie kontaktowe nie wystarczą. Po indywidualnym potwierdzeniu Organizator na pulpicie przenosi kontakt do kosza. Android usuwa dokładnie powiązany kontakt systemowy i dopiero po potwierdzeniu.</p><h3>Duplikaty pozostają pod Twoją kontrolą</h3><p>Ewentualne duplikaty są sugerowane ostrożnie tylko wtedy, gdy mają jednoznaczny wspólny numer telefonu lub adres e-mail albo tę samą nazwę i firmę. Nigdy nie są łączone automatycznie. Potwierdź każde połączenie osobno. Wynik zachowuje dane i łączy niepuste wartości i listy; w systemie Android potwierdzone połączenie może prowadzić do odpowiedniego kontaktu systemowego.</p><h3>Załączniki do notatek w obu kierunkach</h3><p>Organizator i aplikacja na Androida faktycznie przesyłają załączniki do notatek w obie strony. Obsługiwane obrazy to JPEG, PNG, WebP i GIF; Obsługiwane są również pliki PDF. Każdy załącznik jest ograniczony do 12 000 000 znaków adresu URL danych, a wszystkie załączniki zawierające jedną notatkę łącznie do 24 000 000. Android może wyświetlać obrazy i bezpiecznie otwierać odebrany plik PDF lub inny obsługiwany plik za pośrednictwem narzędzia FileProvider.</p><p>Android dostosowuje także akceptację nowych załączników do wolnej pamięci telefonu. Utrzymuje rezerwę 256 MiB. Dla każdej nowo zaakceptowanej notatki załączniki mogą zająć maksymalnie 1% aktualnie dostępnego wolnego miejsca. W całej aplikacji nieprzetworzone dane załączników mogą zajmować co najwyżej mniej niż 512 MiB i 10% dostępnej przestrzeni dyskowej powyżej rezerwy.</p><div class='achtung'><b>Jeśli pamięć jest niewystarczająca</b>Istniejące załączniki pozostają niezmienione. Nowe zbyt duże załączniki są pomijane, a Android zgłasza to zamiast uszkodzić notatkę lub po cichu usunąć istniejący plik.</div><h3>Pełna synchronizacja</h3><p><span class='knopfwort'>Synchronizuj wszystko</span> wysyła wszystkie lokalne notatki ze stabilnymi identyfikatorami udostępniania i wszystkimi zadaniami należącymi do tej gałęzi. Zadania otrzymane z innego miejsca nie są odzwierciedlane. Zaszyfrowane żądanie synchronizacji prosi zaufaną drugą stronę o pełne, odpowiednie dane. Odpowiedzi nie zawierają dalszych żądań, więc nie mogą tworzyć pętli.</p><p>Magnolie Notes może automatycznie przeprowadzić tę samą pełną synchronizację, gdy działa usługa odbierania widoczności, a system Android zgłasza aktywne połączenie Wi-Fi. Uruchamia się najwyżej raz na sześć godzin i nie wymaga identyfikatora SSID ani pozwolenia na lokalizację.</p><p>Jeśli urządzenie jest wyłączone, transmisja czeka i ponawia próbę po 1, 2, 5, 10, 30 i 60 minutach, a następnie co godzinę. Po siedmiu dniach są one porzucane.</p><h3>Ukończenie jest zgłaszane z powrotem</h3><p>Jeśli druga strona oznaczy zaakceptowane zadanie jako ukończone, nowy status powraca do twórcy w postaci <b>Potwierdzenia ukończenia</b>.</p><div class='merke'><b>Zaszyfrowane i uwierzytelnione</b>Wszystkie wiadomości są szyfrowane od początku do końca. Przypięte klucze, uwierzytelnione koperty i ochrona przed ponownym odtwarzaniem zapobiegają niezauważonej wymianie kluczy, zmianom i ponownemu wykorzystaniu starych wiadomości.</div>","<h3>The alphabetical index</h3><p>Along the right edge of the left-hand page are the letters <b>A</b> to <b>Z</b> and a <b>#</b> for everything else. Click a letter to display all names beginning with it. Letters with no entries are faded.</p><p>When you create a new contact card, the index automatically moves to the correct letter so that you can see the new entry immediately.</p><h3>The search field</h3><p>A search field appears above the list. Type a few letters and the list displays only matching entries. The Organizer searches last names, first names, companies, all cities, email addresses, phone numbers, and every emergency contact.</p><div class='beispiel'><b>Example</b>You remember only that the painter is based in Essen. Type <i>Essen</i> in the search field and every entry from Essen appears.</div><p>Click the <b>✕</b> in the search field, or clear the field, to display all entries again.</p><h3>Sort by first or last name</h3><p>Contacts are normally sorted by last name: <i>Müller, Hans</i>. If you prefer the reverse order, set <span class='knopfwort'>Settings ▸ Contacts ▸ Sorting</span> to <i>By first name (Hans Müller)</i>. The contact then appears as <i>Hans Müller</i>, and the alphabetical index also uses the first name.</p>":"<h3>Alfabetiski indeks</h3><p>Po prawym kromje lěweje strony su pismiki <b>A</b> hač <b>Z</b> a <b>#</b> za wšitko druhe. Klikńće na pismik, zo byšće wšitke mjena z tutym započatkom pokazali. Pismiki bjez zapiskow su wosłabjene.</p><p>Hdyž nowu kontaktowu kartu wutworiće, skoči indeks awtomatisce k prawemu pismikej, zo byšće nowy zapisk hnydom widźeli.</p><h3>Pytanske polo</h3><p>Nad lisćinu je pytanske polo. Zapodajće někotre pismiki a lisćina pokazuje jenož hodźace zapiski. Organizer přepytuje swójbne mjena, předmjena, firmy, wšitke města, e-mejlowe adresy, telefonowe čisła a wšitke nuzowe kontakty.</p><div class='beispiel'><b>Přikład</b>Wěsće hišće jenož, zo moler w Essen bydli. Zapodajće <i>Essen</i> do pytanskeho pola a wšitke zapiski z Essen so pokažu.</div><p>Klikńće na <b>✕</b> w pytanskim polu abo polo wuprózdńće, zo byšće zaso wšitke zapiski widźeli.</p><h3>Po předmjenje abo swójbnym mjenje sortěrować</h3><p>Kontakty so zwjetša po swójbnym mjenje sortěruja: <i>Müller, Hans</i>. Jeli maće radšo nawopačne porjad, stajće <span class='knopfwort'>Nastajenja ▸ Kontakty ▸ Sortěrowanje</span> na <i>Po předmjenje (Hans Müller)</i>. Kontakt so potom jako <i>Hans Müller</i> pokazuje a alfabetiski indeks tež předmjeno wužiwa.</p>","<h3>Vital readings</h3><p>Enter the date and time, Systolic and Diastolic pressure, pulse, temperature, weight and height in one row. <span class='knopfwort'>Measurement situation</span> records context. BMI is calculated from the height and weight in that same row; the latest stored pair is also summarized in History. Use <span class='knopfwort'>Save changes</span> or <span class='knopfwort'>Discard changes</span>. The double-page table keeps earlier rows on numbered pages.</p><h3>Colour guide</h3><p>The colours are general adult reference aids, not a diagnosis. For blood pressure, 90–129 systolic together with 60–84 diastolic is green; 130–139 or 85–89 is orange; red begins at 140 systolic or 90 diastolic. Without a meal context, blood glucose is green at 3.5–5.5 mmol/L and red below 3.5 or at least 13.9; fasting, before-meal and after-meal contexts use their own ranges. Pulse, temperature and BMI have separate guides. Personal targets can differ. Recheck an unexpected value and discuss repeated deviations with a doctor. For acute symptoms, contact the local emergency service.</p><h3>Blood sugar and insulin</h3><p>Record date, time, value, mmol/L or mg/dL, the actually injected IE and the situation. The value selector converts the entered and saved value between the two units. An insulin scheme can name Long-acting and Short-acting insulin, add fixed basal units and several documented rules. Rules have a fixed index number; the first matching rule is highlighted as a preview. Number fields have no permanent spinner arrows: use a point or a comma, arrow keys for 0.1 steps, and Shift+arrow for 0.5 IE where offered.</p><div class='achtung'><b>Insulin safety</b>Never dose insulin according to a handbook example or colour alone. The preview does not write the amount actually injected; enter that field yourself and follow the plan agreed with your medical team.</div><h3>Medication plan</h3><p>Record name, strength, form, Morning, Noon, Evening, Night, amount and unit, reason, and notes. Forms include Tablet, Drops, Powder, Spray, Pen and Other. The plus button opens different doses for each weekday. The online index is informational and requires the installed application.</p>":"<h3>Vitalne hódnoty</h3><p>Zapodajće datum a čas, systoliski a diastoliski ćišć, puls, temperaturu, wahu a wysokosć do jednoho rjada. <span class='knopfwort'>Měrjenska situacija</span> kontekst składuje. BMI so z wysokosće a wahy samsneho rjada wobliči; najnowši por so tež w Historiji zjima. Wužijće <span class='knopfwort'>Změny składować</span> abo <span class='knopfwort'>Změny zaćisnyć</span>. Dwustronska tabela starše rjadki na čisłowanych stronach wobchowa.</p><h3>Barbny nawod</h3><p>Barby su powšitkowne orientaciske pomocy za dorosćenych, nic diagnoza. Při krejnym ćišću je 90–129 systolisce a 60–84 diastolisce zelene; 130–139 abo 85–89 oranžowe; čerwjene započina při 140 abo 90. Bjez konteksta jědźe je krejny cokor při 3,5–5,5 mmol/L zeleny a pod 3,5 abo wot 13,9 čerwjeny; nacpołny, před jědźu a po jědźi maja swójske wobłuki. Puls, temperatura a BMI maja separatne pokiwy. Wosobinske cile móža so rozeznawać. Přepruwujće njewočakowanu hódnotu a rozmołwjejće z lěkarjom wo wospjetnych wotchilenjach. Při akutnych symptomach kontaktujće lokalnu nuzowu słužbu.</p><h3>Krejny cokor a insulin</h3><p>Składujće datum, čas, hódnotu, mmol/L abo mg/dL, woprawdźe injektowane IE a situaciju. Wuběrak hódnoty zapodatu a składowanu hódnotu mjez jednotkomaj přeliči. Insulinska schema móže dołho- a krótko skutkowacy insulin pomjenować, feste bazalne jednotki a wjacore dokumentowane prawidła přidać. Prawidła maja feste indeksowe čisło; prěnje hodźace so prawidło je jako přehlad wuzběhnjene. Ličbowe pola nimaja trajne šipki: wužijće dypk abo komu, šipki za kroki 0,1 a Shift+šipku za 0,5 IE, hdźež so poskića.</p><div class='achtung'><b>Insulinska wěstota</b>Njedozujće ženje insulin po přikładźe přiručki abo jenož po barbje. Přehlad woprawdźe injektowane mnóstwo njepisa; zapodajće jo sami a slědujće planej, kotryž sće ze swojim medicinskim teamom dojednali.</div><h3>Medikaciski plan</h3><p>Składujće mjeno, sylnosć, formu, rano, připołdnju, wječor, w nocy, mnóstwo a jednotku, přičinu a notice. Formy su tableta, kapki, prošk, spray, pen a druhe. Plusowe tłóčatko rozdźělne dozy za kóždy dźeń tydźenja wočini. Online-indeks je jenož informaciski a trjeba instalowane nałoženje.</p>","<h3>Who created it?</h3><p>Magnolie Organizer and this handbook were created by <b>Maik Walter</b>.</p><h3>The license</h3><p>Both are <b>free software</b> released under version 3 of the GNU General Public License, or any later version. In plain language, this means:</p><ul><li>You may use the program as often and for as long as you wish, whether privately, with your family or in your business.</li><li>You may give copies to other people, including friends and acquaintances.</li><li>You may modify it if you have the ability and wish to do so.</li><li>If you distribute a modified version, it must again be released under the same license so that everyone benefits.</li></ul><p>It is published in the hope that it will be useful, but <i>without any warranty</i>. The complete license text is available on your computer at <i>/usr/share/common-licenses/GPL-3</i>.</p><h3>A final word</h3><div class='merke'><b>☕ I would be delighted if you bought me a coffee.</b>maik3531@gmail.com</div><div class='achtung'><b>An email address remains optional</b>If you would like to receive a Contributor-Key and have it assigned, you should provide an email address. Without an address, the key cannot be delivered, but nobody is obliged to provide one. Magnolie remains fully and unrestrictedly usable in all functions without a key. Entering a Contributor-Key only removes the <b>No valid coffee allowance</b> branding; it does not unlock any function. Magnolie remains free software under the GNU General Public License; a coffee does not purchase the software, a warranty, or a regular support contract.</div><p>You will find the same message in the Organizer under <span class='knopfwort'>Settings ▸ About</span>. You can also reopen this handbook there and check for a new version of the program.</p>":"<h3>Štó je to wutworił?</h3><p>Magnolie Organizer a tute podręčnik je <b>Maik Walter</b> wutworił.</p><h3>Licenca</h3><p>Wobaj stej <b>swobodna software</b> pod GNU General Public License wersije 3 abo kóždej pozdźišej wersiju. Jednorišo rjeknjene to woznamjenja:</p><ul><li>Móžeće program tak husto a tak dołho wužiwać, kaž chceće, priwatnje, ze swójbu abo we wobchodźe.</li><li>Móžeće kopije druhim ludźom dać, tež přećelam a znajomym.</li><li>Móžeće program změnić, jeli to zamóžeće a chceće.</li><li>Jeli změnjenu wersiju rozdźělujeće, dyrbi zaso pod samsnej licencu wozjewjena być, zo bychu wšitcy z njeje měli wužitk.</li></ul><p>Wozjewja so z nadźiju, zo budźe wužitny, ale <i>bjez kóždeje rukowanja</i>. Dospołny licencny tekst namakaće na ličaku pod <i>/usr/share/common-licenses/GPL-3</i>.</p><h3>Na kóncu</h3><div class='merke'><b>☕ Wjeselił bych so, hdy byšće mi kofej kupili.</b>maik3531@gmail.com</div><div class='achtung'><b>E-mejlowa adresa wostanje dobrowólna</b>Jeli chceće Contributor-Key dóstać a sej jón připokazać dać, dyrbiće e-mejlowu adresu podać. Bjez adresy njeda so kluč pósłać, ale nichtó njeje winowaty, ju podać. Magnolie wostanje bjez kluča we wšěch funkcijach dospołnje a bjez wobmjezowanjow wužiwajomna. Zapodaće Contributor-Key jenož marku <b>No valid coffee allowance</b> wotstroni; žanu funkciju njewotamknje. Magnolie wostanje swobodna software pod GNU General Public License; kofej software, rukowanje abo prawidłowny podpěrowanski zrěčenje njekupuje.</div><p>Samsnu powěsć namakaće w Organizerje pod <span class='knopfwort'>Nastajenja ▸ Wo programje</span>. Tam móžeće tež tute podręčnik znowa wočinić a za nowej wersiju programa hladać.</p>","<p><b>KDE Connect is the only SMS path.</b> Pair it in the Organizer and accept the matching request on both devices. The desktop Organizer uses this direct interface; Magnolie Notes and <b>magnolie-phone/1</b> do not read or send SMS.</p><h3>History and live messages</h3><p>If the paired KDE Connect peer supports conversation requests, the Organizer retrieves conversation history and then adds live incoming and outgoing messages. Without that peer capability, only live messages and sending are available. Stable and content-based identities deduplicate history, retransmissions, and live events.</p><h3>Reply and compose</h3><p>Open a conversation to reply, or compose from a contact and choose the number. Sending is blocked above <b>10 segments</b>; check normalized substitutions before confirming.</p><div class='merke'><b>No READ_SMS claim</b>The KDE Connect Android app supplies messages under its own permissions. Magnolie Notes does not claim <b>READ_SMS</b>. Personal Sync never transfers SMS history.</div>":"<p><b>KDE Connect je jenički puć za SMS.</b> Sparujće jón w Organizerje a přiwzmiće hodźace so naprašowanje na woběmaj gratajomaj. Desktopowy Organizer wužiwa tute direktne zwjazanišćo; Magnolie Notes a <b>magnolie-phone/1</b> SMS ani nječitatej ani njesćelej.</p><h3>Historija a live-powěsće</h3><p>Jeli sparowany partner KDE Connect konwersaciske naprašowanja podpěruje, wotwoła Organizer konwersacisku historiju a přida potom dochadźace a wotchadźace live-powěsće. Bjez tuteje zamóžnosće partnera stej jenož live-powěsće a słanje k dispoziciji. Stabilne a na wobsahu bazowace identity wotstronjeja duplikaty historije, znowasłanjow a live-podawkow.</p><h3>Wotmołwić a zestajić</h3><p>Wočińće konwersaciju, zo byšće wotmołwili, abo zestajće powěsć z kontakta a wubjerće čisło. Słanje nad <b>10 segmentami</b> so blokuje; přepruwujće normalizowane narunanja před wobkrućenjom.</p><div class='merke'><b>Žane žadanje READ_SMS</b>Nałoženje KDE Connect za Android staja powěsće pod swójskimi dowolnosćemi k dispoziciji. Magnolie Notes sej <b>READ_SMS</b> nježada. Personal Sync SMS-historiju ženje njepřenjesuje.</div>","<p><b>Magnolie Organizer</b> is the same program on Linux and on Windows: the same book, the same seven sections, the same twenty languages, the same data format. <b>Magnolie Notes</b> adds notes and tasks on an Android phone or tablet and exchanges them with the computer through the Magnolienbaum.</p><h3>Requirements</h3><ul><li><b>Operating system:</b> Linux Mint 21 or later, Ubuntu 22.04 or later, Debian 12 or later, Fedora, or any other distribution by way of the AppImage — or Windows 10 version 2004 or later, or Windows 11, in each case 64 bit. Magnolie Notes needs Android 8.0 or later.</li><li><b>Memory:</b> 2 gigabytes is enough; 4 gigabytes provides plenty of room.</li><li><b>Disk space:</b> about 3 megabytes on Linux, about 230 megabytes on Windows, where the application brings its own runtime. Add room for your own data: text needs very little, while embedded images and PDF files add up.</li><li><b>Display:</b> at least 1024 × 768 pixels.</li><li><b>Additional components:</b> nothing to do by hand. A Linux package installation adds the GTK and WebKit interface libraries, spell checking and encryption by itself; the AppImage and the Windows application already carry everything with them. Windows additionally uses the Microsoft Edge WebView2 runtime, which is present on current installations — and if it is missing, the program says so plainly.</li><li><b>Internet:</b> not required for day-to-day use. You need a connection to retrieve public holidays and school holidays, synchronize with online accounts, check for updates, and view maps or routes. The Magnolienbaum itself works inside your own network without any connection to the outside world.</li></ul><p>Magnolie Notes is installed from an APK file rather than from an app store. Page <b data-page='android-apk-transfer' class='knopfwort'></b> describes how to get it onto the phone safely.</p><div class='merke'><b>Good to know</b>The Organizer runs entirely on your own device. Your appointments and addresses do not leave it unless you explicitly choose to send or synchronize them.</div>":"<p><b>Magnolie Organizer</b> je samsny program pod Linuxom a Windowsom: samsna kniha, samsnych sydom wotrězkow, samsnych dwaceći rěčow a samsny datowy format. <b>Magnolie Notes</b> přidawa notice a nadawki na Androidowym telefonje abo tableće a wuměnja je z ličakom přez Magnolienbaum.</p><h3>Žadanja</h3><ul><li><b>Dźěłowy system:</b> Linux Mint 21 abo nowši, Ubuntu 22.04 abo nowši, Debian 12 abo nowši, Fedora abo druha distribucija přez AppImage; abo Windows 10 wersija 2004 abo nowši či Windows 11, přeco 64-bitowy. Magnolie Notes trjeba Android 8.0 abo nowši.</li><li><b>Pomjatk:</b> 2 gigabajtaj dosahatej, 4 gigabajty dadźa dosć ruma.</li><li><b>Diskowy rum:</b> něhdźe 3 megabajty pod Linuxom, něhdźe 230 megabajtow pod Windows, hdźež nałoženje swójske běžne wokoliny sobu přinjese. Přidajće rum za swójske daty; tekst trjeba mało, zasadźene wobrazy a PDF-dataje wjace.</li><li><b>Wobrazowka:</b> znajmjeńša 1024 × 768 pikselow.</li><li><b>Přidatne komponenty:</b> Ničo manuelnje. Linuxowy pakćik sam GTK- a WebKit-biblioteki, prawopis a zaklučowanje přida; AppImage a Windowsowe nałoženje maja wšitko sobu. Windows wužiwa tež Microsoft Edge WebView2 Runtime, kotryž je zwjetša instalowany; jeli faluje, program to jasnje zdźěli.</li><li><b>Internet:</b> za wšědne wužiwanje njetrěbny. Zwisk trjebaće za swjate dny a šulske prózdniny, online-synchronizaciju, aktualizacije a karty abo ruty. Magnolienbaum funguje w swójskej syći bjez zwiska won.</li></ul><p>Magnolie Notes so z APK-dataje instaluje, nic z nałoženskeho wobchoda. Strona <b data-page='android-apk-transfer' class='knopfwort'></b> wěste přenjesenje na telefon wopisuje.</p><div class='merke'><b>Dobre wědźeć</b>Organizer běži dospołnje na wašim graće. Terminy a adresy jón njezapustja, chiba zo wědomje sćeleće abo synchronizujeće.</div>","<p><b>Nextcloud</b> is storage space on a server on the Internet. Many people rent such space; some run it on a small computer at home. Magnolie Organizer can use such a server for two entirely separate purposes.</p><h3>Two purposes, one login</h3><ul><li><b>Calendars and contacts</b> – your appointments and addresses are compared with the server, so that a telephone or a second computer shows the same entries. The technical names for this are <b>CalDAV</b> for calendars and <b>CardDAV</b> for address books. You do not need to remember them.</li><li><b>The mailbox</b> – a letterbox in a folder on the server. A message to another Organizer waits there whenever the direct connection cannot be reached. The technical name for such a folder is <b>WebDAV</b>.</li></ul><p>Both use the same server address, the same user name and the same password. You can switch each purpose on by itself; neither one needs the other.</p><div class='merke'><b>Where all of this is</b>Everything belonging to Nextcloud is on one single page: <span class='knopfwort'>Settings ▸ Synchronization</span>. There is no separate Nextcloud tab anywhere.</div><div class='merke'><b>You do not have to do any of this</b>The Organizer works perfectly well without a server. If your entries are only ever needed on this computer, simply leave this page untouched.</div>":"<p><b>Nextcloud</b> je składowanski rum na serwerje w interneće. Někotři ludźo tajki rum najmuja, druzy jón na małym ličaku doma wobhospodarja. Magnolie Organizer móže serwer za dwaj dospołnje separatnej zaměraj wužiwać.</p><h3>Dwaj zaměraj, jedne přizjewjenje</h3><ul><li><b>Protyki a kontakty</b> – terminy a adresy so ze serwerom přirunuja, zo by telefon abo druhi ličak samsne zapiski pokazał. Techniske mjena stej <b>CalDAV</b> za protyki a <b>CardDAV</b> za adresniki.</li><li><b>Póštowa kašćik</b> – kašćik w zapisu na serwerje. Powěsć za druhi Organizer tam čaka, hdyž direktny zwisk njeje k dispoziciji. Techniske mjeno je <b>WebDAV</b>.</li></ul><p>Wobaj wužiwatej samsnu serwerowu adresu, wužiwarske mjeno a hesło. Kóždy zaměr da so separatnje zapinać.</p><div class='merke'><b>Hdźe wšitko namakaće</b>Wšitko k Nextcloud je na jednej stronje: <span class='knopfwort'>Nastajenja ▸ Synchronizacija</span>. Separatny rajtark Nextcloud njeje.</div><div class='merke'><b>Njetrjebaće ničo zarjadować</b>Organizer tež bjez serwera funguje. Jeli daty jenož na tutym ličaku trjebaće, wostajće stronu njesměnjenu.</div>","<p><i>Magnolie-Notes-1.0.5.apk</i> is a release APK signed with the project's own <b>production certificate</b>. The release scripts reject a missing signing configuration, an Android debug certificate, or a certificate fingerprint other than the explicitly expected SHA-256 fingerprint. The app nevertheless comes from outside Google Play, so Android asks you to approve the particular app that opens the APK.</p><h3>Allow this source and install normally</h3><ol class='schritte'><li>On the phone, open <i>Files</i> or <i>Downloads</i> and tap the checked APK. If you downloaded it directly, you may instead open the completed browser download.</li><li>If Android says that this source may not install unknown apps, open the offered settings page. Enable <i>Allow from this source</i> only for the current file manager, browser, messenger, or transfer app.</li><li>Return to the installation and tap <span class='knopfwort'>Install</span>. Read the app name and any Android warning before proceeding.</li><li>On some Android and Play Protect versions, the safe exception is hidden. Open <span class='knopfwort'>More details</span>, <span class='knopfwort'>Further details</span>, or <span class='knopfwort'>Details</span>, then choose <span class='knopfwort'>Install anyway</span>. Continue only for the official APK with the matching SHA-256 value.</li><li>When installation finishes, open Magnolie Notes from the normal app list.</li></ol><div class='achtung'><b>Do not switch off Play Protect globally</b>A one-file exception after checking origin and hash is different from disabling protection for every app. Leave Play Protect enabled. If Android offers no per-file continuation, stop and check the APK, Android updates, storage space, and administrator or family policies instead of weakening the whole phone.</div><h3>Close the temporary opening</h3><p>After installation, open Android settings for the browser, file manager, messenger, or transfer app that opened the APK. Under <i>Install unknown apps</i>, switch <i>Allow from this source</i> off again. This does not remove Magnolie Notes; it merely prevents that source from starting another installation without a new decision.</p><h3>Install an update without deleting data</h3><p>Download the newer official APK, verify its new published SHA-256 value, and open it exactly as above. Android recognizes the same application ID and production certificate and offers an update. <b>Do not uninstall the existing app first.</b> A normal update retains its private notes, tasks, settings, and pairing data. Make a current backup before an important update nevertheless.</p><h3>If Android reports a signature conflict</h3><p>Stop. The installed app and the new APK were signed by different certificates, so Android correctly refuses to replace one with the other. This can happen after an old debug build, an unofficial rebuild, or a file from another source. Recheck the official release and certificate information. Export or back up accessible data before considering removal. Blindly uninstalling the app can erase its private data and does not prove that the replacement is genuine.</p><h3>Permissions after installation</h3><p>Magnolie Notes asks for a permission when a corresponding feature needs it. Review the Android explanation and grant only what you intend to use; refusing an optional permission should leave unrelated features available. Permissions for notifications, nearby devices or Bluetooth, contacts, telephone functions, and files can be reviewed later in <i>Android Settings ▸ Apps ▸ Magnolie Notes ▸ Permissions</i>. Names and grouping vary by Android vendor and version.</p><h3>If installation fails</h3><ul><li><b>“App not installed”:</b> check free storage, Android 8.0 or newer, a complete download, and a possible signature conflict.</li><li><b>The APK cannot be opened:</b> use the Android file manager, make sure the name still ends in <i>.apk</i>, and transfer it again if a messenger changed or unpacked it.</li><li><b>The install button does nothing:</b> close screen filters or overlay apps temporarily and reopen the installer; never grant unrelated accessibility control just to install an APK.</li><li><b>A work, school, child, or managed phone refuses it:</b> the device policy may prohibit installation outside its approved store. Ask the administrator or use an unmanaged personal device; do not try to bypass the policy.</li><li><b>The app closes after installation:</b> restart the phone once, install pending Android updates, note the exact message and Android version, and report them together with the release filename and verified hash. Do not publish private notes or pairing secrets in a diagnostic report.</li></ul><figure data-image-manifest='android-apk-install-anyway'><div class='achtung'><b>IMAGE MISSING - manifest requirement</b>Real screenshots are required for the ordinary Android installer, the per-source permission, the genuinely hidden Details/Install anyway route, successful completion, and resetting the source permission. Capture each state on supported real Android versions and vendors. The manifest must record device model, Android/build version, installer or Play Protect version, locale, exact APK SHA-256, capture date, crop, and redactions. No mock-up may be presented as an Android system dialog.</div><figcaption>The wording and order can differ between Android versions; this placeholder intentionally does not imitate them.</figcaption></figure>":"<p><i>Magnolie-Notes-1.0.5.apk</i> je wozjewjenska APK, podpisana ze swójskim <b>produkciskim certifikatom</b> projekta. Wozjewjenske skripty falowacu konfiguraciju, Androidowy debugowy certifikat abo hinaši hač wočakowany SHA-256-wotćišć wotpokazuja. Nałoženje přińdźe zwonka Google Play, tohodla Android wo dowolnosć nałoženja prosy, kotrež APK wočinja.</p><h3>Žórło dowolić a instalować</h3><ol class='schritte'><li>Na telefonje wočińće <i>Dataje</i> abo <i>Sćehnjenja</i> a podótkńće so přepruwowaneje APK. Při direktnym sćehnjenju móžeće dokónčene sćehnjenje browsera wočinić.</li><li>Jeli Android instalowanje njeznatych nałoženjow zakazuje, wočińće nastajenja. Zmóžńće <i>Z tutoho žórła dowolić</i> jenož za aktualny datajowy rjadowak, browser, messenger abo přenjesenske nałoženje.</li><li>Wróćće so a podótkńće so <span class='knopfwort'>Instalować</span>. Čitajće mjeno a warnowanje.</li><li>W někotrych wersijach je wěsta wuwzaća schowana. Wočińće <span class='knopfwort'>Wjace podrobnosćow</span>, <span class='knopfwort'>Dalše podrobnosće</span> abo <span class='knopfwort'>Podrobnosće</span>, potom <span class='knopfwort'>Najebać toho instalować</span>. Jenož při oficialnej APK z hodźacym so SHA-256 pokročujće.</li><li>Po instalaciji wočińće Magnolie Notes z lisćiny nałoženjow.</li></ol><div class='achtung'><b>Play Protect powšitkownje njewupinać</b>Wuwzaća za jednu přepruwowanu dataju njeje wupinjenje škitowanja za wšitko. Wostajće Play Protect zmóžnjeny. Jeli Android žane jednotliwe pokročowanje njeskići, přepruwujće APK, aktualizacije, rum a prawidła administratora abo swójby, město zo byšće telefon wosłabili.</div><h3>Nachwilnu dowolnosć zaso začinić</h3><p>Po instalaciji wočińće Androidowe nastajenja nałoženja, kotrež APK wočiniło. Pod <i>Njeznate nałoženja instalować</i> wupńće <i>Z tutoho žórła dowolić</i>. To Magnolie Notes njewotstroni, ale dalšej instalaciji bjez noweho rozsuda zadźěwa.</p><h3>Aktualizaciju bjez zhašenja datow instalować</h3><p>Sćehńće nowšu oficialnu APK, přepruwujće nowy SHA-256 a wočińće ju kaž horjeka. Android samsny ID a certifikat spóznaje a aktualizaciju poskići. <b>Eksistowace nałoženje najprjedy njeodinstalujće.</b> Normalna aktualizacija notice, nadawki, nastajenja a sparowanje wobchowa. Před wažnej aktualizaciju zawěsćće daty.</p><h3>Hdyž Android konflikt podpisa zdźěli</h3><p>Zastajće. Instalowane nałoženje a nowa APK matej rozdźělnej certifikataj. Přičina móže być stara debugowa wersija, njeoficialny natwar abo druhe žórło. Přepruwujće oficialne wozjewjenje a certifikat. Před wotstronjenjom daty eksportujće abo zawěsćće. Slepe wotinstalowanje móže priwatne daty zhašeć a njedopokazuje prawosć narunanja.</p><h3>Dowolnosće po instalaciji</h3><p>Magnolie Notes wo dowolnosć prosy, hdyž ju funkcija trjeba. Dowolće jenož, što chceće wužiwać; wotpokazanje opcionalneje dowolnosće njezwisne funkcije njeblokuje. Dowolnosće za zdźělenki, bliske graty abo Bluetooth, kontakty, telefon a dataje přepruwujće pod <i>Androidowe nastajenja ▸ Nałoženja ▸ Magnolie Notes ▸ Dowolnosće</i>. Mjena po zhotowjerju a wersiji wariěruja.</p><h3>Jeli instalacija so njeporadźi</h3><ul><li><b>„Nałoženje njeinstalowane“:</b> přepruwujće rum, Android 8.0 abo nowši, dospołne sćehnjenje a konflikt podpisa.</li><li><b>APK njeda so wočinić:</b> wužiwajće Androidowy datajowy rjadowak, přepruwujće <i>.apk</i> a přenjesće znowa.</li><li><b>Instalowanske tłóčatko ničo nječini:</b> začińće filtry a překrywanske nałoženja a instalator znowa wočińće; njedowolće njewotwisnu bjezbarjernosćowu kontrolu.</li><li><b>Słužbny, šulski, dźěćacy abo rjadowany telefon wotpokazuje:</b> prawidła móža instalaciju zwonka wobchoda zakazać. Prašejće administratora abo wužiwajće priwatny grat; prawidła njewobchadźejće.</li><li><b>Nałoženje so po instalaciji začini:</b> telefon znowa startujće, aktualizacije instalujće a dokładnu powěsć, Androidowu wersiju, datajowe mjeno a přepruwowany wotćišć zdźělće. Priwatne notice ani sparowanske potajnstwa njewozjewjajće.</li></ul><figure data-image-manifest='android-apk-install-anyway'><div class='achtung'><b>WOBRAZ FALUJE – žadanje manifesta</b>Trěbne su woprawdźite wobrazowki normalneho instalatora, dowolnosće žórła, schowaneho puća Podrobnosće/Najebać toho instalować, wuspěšneho dokónčenja a cofjenja dowolnosće. Zapisajće model, Androidowu/natwarnu wersiju, instalator abo Play Protect, lokalu, dokładny SHA-256 APK, datum, wotrězk a začornjenja. Žana napodobnjenka njesmě so jako Androidowy systemowy dialog prezentować.</div><figcaption>Sformułowanje a porjad po wersijach wariěrujetej; tutón narunanski element je z wotpohladom njenapodobnja.</figcaption></figure>","<p><kbd>Ctrl</kbd>+<kbd>F</kbd> opens or focuses the search for the current section when no other modal sheet is blocking it.</p><ul><li>Calendar, Tasks, Anniversaries, Planner and Health open the common results dialog.</li><li>Contacts and Notes focus their existing search fields.</li></ul><h3>The results dialog</h3><p>Enter part of a title, name, date, note or other searchable value. The dialog displays at most <b>100</b> results. If more entries match, narrow the query. Select a result to open that entry.</p><p>Once focus is among the result buttons, <kbd>Up</kbd> and <kbd>Down</kbd> move cyclically between them. From the search field, use <kbd>Tab</kbd> first to reach the results.</p><div class='merke'><b>Calendar shortcut</b>A right-click on <span class='knopfwort'>Today</span> opens the Calendar appointment search without first changing the displayed date.</div>":"<p><kbd>Ctrl</kbd>+<kbd>F</kbd> wočini abo fokusuje pytanje za aktualny wotrězk, jeli druhe modalne łopjeno tomu njezadźěwa.</p><ul><li>Protyka, Nadawki, Róčnicy, Planowak a Strowota wočinja zhromadny dialog wuslědkow.</li><li>Kontakty a Notice fokusuja swoje hižo eksistowace pytanske pola.</li></ul><h3>Dialog wuslědkow</h3><p>Zapodajće dźěl titula, mjena, datuma, noticy abo druheje pytajomneje hódnoty. Dialog pokazuje maksimalnje <b>100</b> wuslědkow. Jeli wjace zapiskow wotpowěduje, wobmjezujće pytanje. Wubjerće wuslědk, zo byšće zapisk wočinili.</p><p>Hdyž je fokus mjez tłóčatkami wuslědkow, pohibujetej <kbd>Up</kbd> a <kbd>Down</kbd> cyklisce mjez nimi. Z pytanskeho pola wužijće najprjedy <kbd>Tab</kbd>, zo byšće k wuslědkam dóšli.</p><div class='merke'><b>Skrótšenka Protyki</b>Kliknjenje z prawej myšacej tastu na <span class='knopfwort'>Dźensa</span> wočini pytanje za terminami w Protyce, bjez toho zo by so najprjedy pokazany datum změnił.</div>","<p><span class='knopfwort'>Consider deletions during manual synchronization</span> is a separate, bilateral permission. Even when enabled, a remote deletion is only a proposal: Magnolie Notes never silently removes the local item.</p><h3>Decide item by item</h3><p>For each proposal choose deletion or keeping and restoring. An item changed since synchronization receives an extra warning and requires the separate action <span class='knopfwort'>Delete despite change</span>. A nonempty notebook cannot be removed.</p><h3>Several proposals</h3><p>A decision may be remembered only for eligible proposals in the current run. Large groups cross a safety threshold and require another confirmation that names the affected item types. This threshold is the smaller of ten items and ten percent of the synchronized stock, with a minimum of one.</p><p>Turning off the deletion permission stops new proposals without turning off note or task synchronization. Replacing the phone starts an additive baseline so old device history cannot silently delete entries on the replacement.</p><div class='achtung'><b>Read both versions first</b>A conflict or changed item may contain work absent from the other device. Open it before approving permanent removal; choose keeping and restoring when uncertain.</div>":"<p><span class='knopfwort'>Zhašenja při manuelnej synchronizaciji wobkedźbować</span> je separatna dwustronska dowolnosć. Samo po zmóžnjenju je zdalne zhašenje jenož namjet: Magnolie Notes lokalny objekt ženje mjelčo njezhaša.</p><h3>Wo kóždym objekće rozsudźić</h3><p>Za kóždy namjet wubjerće zhašenje abo wobchowanje a wobnowjenje. Wot synchronizacije změnjeny objekt dóstanje přidatne warnowanje a trjeba separatnu akciju <span class='knopfwort'>Najebać změny zhašeć</span>. Njeprózdny notatnik njeda so wotstronić.</p><h3>Wjacore namjety</h3><p>Rozsud da so jenož za přihódne namjety aktualneho běha spomjatkować. Wulke skupiny překročuja wěstotnu hranicu a trjebaja dalše wobkrućenje z typami potrjechenych objektow. Hranica je mjeńša hódnota z dźesać objektow a dźesać procentow synchronizowaneho stawa, znajmjeńša jedyn.</p><p>Wupinjenje dowolnosće nowe namjety zastaji, bjez zo by synchronizaciju noticow abo nadawkow wupinało. Narunanje telefona startuje přidawacu zakładnu sadźbu, zo njeby historija stareho grata zapiski na nowym mjelčo zhašała.</p><div class='achtung'><b>Najprjedy wobě wersiji čitać</b>Konflikt abo změnjeny objekt móže dźěło wobsahować, kotrež na druhim graće faluje. Wočińće jón před trajnym wotstronjenjom; w dwělu wubjerće wobchowanje a wobnowjenje.</div>","<p><span class='knopfwort'>Selection options</span> in the footer opens the entries of the current section. The button is initially visible; <span class='knopfwort'>Settings ▸ General ▸ Show the “Selection options” button</span> can hide or restore it. In Planner and Health, the same footer button is named <span class='knopfwort'>Print</span> and opens that section's own output choices.</p><h3>Select and preview</h3><p>Calendar offers the stored appointments of the displayed month, Tasks follows the selected people and date period, and Contacts, Notes and Anniversaries offer their corresponding entries. Synchronized calendar occurrences are not included in this selection. Use <span class='knopfwort'>All</span>, <span class='knopfwort'>None</span> or the individual checkboxes. The right-hand side previews up to 200 cards for speed; <span class='knopfwort'>Print now</span> nevertheless sends every selected entry to the system print dialog.</p><p>Public and school holidays are calendar markings rather than appointments and therefore are not separate selection entries. Embedded images and PDF pages in Notes are also not part of the text printout. Planner output is explained on page <b data-page='the-year-at-a-glance' class='knopfwort'></b>; Health reports and spreadsheets on page <b data-page='progress-printing-ods-and-deleting-records' class='knopfwort'></b>.</p><h3>Paper or PDF</h3><p>For paper, choose the printer and its settings in the system dialog. On Linux, select <span class='knopfwort'>Print to File</span> to create a PDF. On Windows, select <span class='knopfwort'>Microsoft Print to PDF</span>, then choose the file name and folder. Check the system preview before confirming.</p><h3>Other actions in the selection sheet</h3><p><span class='knopfwort'>Delete selection</span> removes checked Contacts, Tasks, appointments, Notes or Anniversaries only after confirmation. With the recycle bin enabled, they go there; otherwise deletion is permanent. A selected recurring source appointment represents its entire series. Only Contacts additionally offers <span class='knopfwort'>ODS</span> for a LibreOffice spreadsheet.</p><h3>Printing this handbook</h3><p><span class='knopfwort'>Print / PDF</span> below the handbook prepares the entire book, not Organizer entries. Every A4 landscape sheet contains one open double page with leather cover, ring binding and two handbook pages. Use the same Linux or Windows PDF choice described above.</p>":"<p><span class='knopfwort'>Wuběranske opcije</span> w noze wočinja zapiski aktualneho wotrězka. Tłóčatko je spočatnje widźomne; <span class='knopfwort'>Nastajenja ▸ Powšitkowne ▸ Tłóčatko „Wuběranske opcije“ pokazać</span> je schowa abo wobnowi. W Planowaku a Strowoće rěka samsne tłóčatko <span class='knopfwort'>Ćišćeć</span> a wočini wotrězkowe wudaće.</p><h3>Wubrać a přehlad pokazać</h3><p>Protyka poskića składowane terminy pokazaneho měsaca, Nadawki slěduja wubranym wosobam a dobje, a Kontakty, Notice a Róčnicy swoje zapiski. Synchronizowane protykowe wustupjenja we wuběrje njejsu. Wužijće <span class='knopfwort'>Wšitko</span>, <span class='knopfwort'>Ničo</span> abo kašćiki. Naprawo so za spěšnosć hač do 200 kartow pokazuje; <span class='knopfwort'>Nětko ćišćeć</span> přiwšěm wšitke wubrane zapiski do systemoweho dialoga sćele.</p><p>Zjawne a šulske swjate dny su marki, nic terminy, a njejsu separatne zapiski wuběra. Zasadźene wobrazy a PDF-strony Noticow tež njejsu w tekstowym wudaću. Planowak wopisuje strona <b data-page='the-year-at-a-glance' class='knopfwort'></b>; strowotne rozprawy a tabele strona <b data-page='progress-printing-ods-and-deleting-records' class='knopfwort'></b>.</p><h3>Papjer abo PDF</h3><p>Za papjer wubjerće ćišćak a nastajenja w systemowym dialogu. Pod Linux wubjerće <span class='knopfwort'>Do dataje ćišćeć</span>, pod Windows <span class='knopfwort'>Microsoft Print to PDF</span> a potom mjeno a rjadowak. Přepruwujće systemowy přehlad.</p><h3>Druhe akcije na wuběranskim łopjenje</h3><p><span class='knopfwort'>Wuběr zhašeć</span> wubrane kontakty, nadawki, terminy, notice abo róčnicy hakle po wobkrućenju wotstroni. Ze zmóžnjenym papjernikom dóńdu tam, hewak je zhašenje trajne. Wubrany žórłowy termin wospjetowanja reprezentuje cyłu seriju. Jenož Kontakty poskića přidatnje <span class='knopfwort'>ODS</span> za LibreOffice.</p><h3>Tutu přiručku ćišćeć</h3><p><span class='knopfwort'>Ćišćeć / PDF</span> pod přiručku přihotuje cyłu knihu, nic zapiski Organizera. Kóžde A4-łopjeno w prěčnym formaće wobsahuje jednu wočinjenu dwustronsku stronu z kožanym wobalom, kólnami a dwěmaj stronomaj. Wužijće samsny PDF-wuběr Linuxa abo Windowsa.</p>","<p><span class='knopfwort'>Settings ▸ About</span> shows the current program version, the license, the author and the installed handbook version. <span class='knopfwort'>Open manual</span> and <span class='knopfwort'>Update manual …</span> are separate actions.</p><h3>Updating the handbook</h3><ol class='schritte'><li>Click <span class='knopfwort'>Update manual …</span>. This always retrieves current release information.</li><li>If a newer handbook is available, compare the displayed version and SHA-256 checksum.</li><li>The Organizer downloads the package into a temporary file, limits its size and verifies SHA-256 before opening it. Under Linux that package is the DEB, which it hands to your software manager; under Windows it is the complete installer.</li><li>Confirm the installation yourself — in the software manager under Linux, or in the visible installer under Windows, where you leave <b>User handbook</b> selected.</li></ol><div class='achtung'><b>No automatic installation</b>The Organizer never installs anything unattended. It never runs sudo or dpkg and never asks for your system password; it only opens a package that has passed verification, and you confirm it. Your personal data are not touched by an update.</div><h3>Checking for a new Organizer version</h3><p>By default, the Organizer checks at startup, no more than once every 24 hours, whether a new version is available on GitLab. This requires an internet connection. Clear the checkbox if you do not want it to check daily.</p><ol class='schritte'><li>Open <span class='knopfwort'>Settings ▸ About</span>.</li><li>Click <span class='knopfwort'>Check now</span>.</li><li>If a new version is available, another button appears for downloading it.</li><li>Install what you downloaded as described on page <b data-page='installing-the-organizer' class='knopfwort'></b>.</li></ol><h3>Updating on Fedora</h3><p>If you downloaded a newer RPM yourself, open a terminal in that folder and enter <i>sudo dnf upgrade ./magnolie-organizer-2.0.4-1.noarch.rpm</i>.</p><div class='merke'><b>Offline remains useful</b>If there is no network connection or the release data are invalid, a clear error appears. An installed handbook stays fully readable and your data are not affected.</div>":"<p><span class='knopfwort'>Nastajenja ▸ Wo programje</span> pokazuje wersiju programa, licencu, awtora a wersiju přiručki. <span class='knopfwort'>Přiručku wočinić</span> a <span class='knopfwort'>Přiručku aktualizować …</span> stej separatnej akciji.</p><h3>Přiručku aktualizować</h3><ol class='schritte'><li>Klikńće na <span class='knopfwort'>Přiručku aktualizować …</span>; to přeco aktualne wersijowe informacije wobstara.</li><li>Při nowšej přiručce přirunajće wersiju a kontrolnu sumu SHA-256.</li><li>Organizer pakćik do nachwilneje dataje sćahuje, wulkosć wobmjezuje a SHA-256 před wočinjenjom přepruwuje. Pod Linux je to DEB za softwareowy zrjadowak, pod Windows dospołny instalator.</li><li>Wobkrućće instalaciju sami, pod Linux w zrjadowaku abo pod Windows we widźomnym instalatorje, hdźež <b>Wužiwarska přiručka</b> wubrana wostanje.</li></ol><div class='achtung'><b>Žana awtomatiska instalacija</b>Organizer ničo bjez dohlada njeinstaluje, njestartuje sudo ani dpkg a wo systemowe hesło njeprosy; jenož přepruwowany pakćik wočini a wy wobkrućeće. Wosobinske daty so njedótkaja.</div><h3>Nowu wersiju Organizera přepruwować</h3><p>Po standardźe přepruwuje Organizer při starće maksimalnje jónu za 24 hodźin, hač je nowa wersija na GitLab. To trjeba internet. Wupńće kašćik, jeli dnjowe přepruwowanje nochceće.</p><ol class='schritte'><li>Wočińće <span class='knopfwort'>Nastajenja ▸ Wo programje</span>.</li><li>Klikńće na <span class='knopfwort'>Nětko přepruwować</span>.</li><li>Při nowej wersiji so sćehnjenske tłóčatko zjewi.</li><li>Instalujće sćehnjene kaž na stronje <b data-page='installing-the-organizer' class='knopfwort'></b>.</li></ol><h3>Fedora aktualizować</h3><p>Za samostatnje sćehnjeny nowši RPM wočińće terminal w rjadowaku a zapodajće <i>sudo dnf upgrade ./magnolie-organizer-2.0.4-1.noarch.rpm</i>.</p><div class='merke'><b>Offline wostanje wužitne</b>Bjez syće abo při njepłaćiwych wersijowych datach so jasny zmylk zjewi. Instalowana přiručka wostanje čitajomna a daty so njezměnja.</div>","<p>A <b>pairing file</b> spares both sides all the typing and all the code reading. You create it once and hand it over to the other person.</p><ol class='schritte'><li>Open <span class='knopfwort'>Settings ▸ Magnolia tree</span> and go down to <b>Pairing file</b>.</li><li>Enter the address at which this computer can be reached into the field. The address must be a plain numeric IPv4 or IPv6 address.</li><li>Click <span class='knopfwort'>Create pairing file …</span> and choose where the file should be saved.</li></ol><p>The Organizer saves a file ending in <b>.magnolie-paarung</b> and tells you the exact location.</p><div class='achtung'><b>The file is a key, not a letter</b>The file contains the one-time key itself, unencrypted. Anyone who obtains the file within its validity can connect as a branch. Never send it through an open channel, and never leave it lying on a shared drive.</div><div class='merke'><b>It expires after 15 minutes</b>After a quarter of an hour the file is worthless and can no longer be used. If it takes longer, simply create a new one. A file that has been used once cannot be used a second time.</div>":"<p><b>Sparowanska dataja</b> woběmaj stronam pisaće a čitanje koda zalutuje. Jónu ju wutworiće a druhej wosobje přepodaće.</p><ol class='schritte'><li>Wočińće <span class='knopfwort'>Nastajenja ▸ Magnolienbaum</span> a dźiće k <b>Sparowanska dataja</b>.</li><li>Zapodajće čisłowu adresu IPv4 abo IPv6 tutoho ličaka.</li><li>Klikńće <span class='knopfwort'>Sparowansku dataju wutworić…</span> a wubjerće městno.</li></ol><p>Organizer składuje dataju z kónčnicu <b>.magnolie-paarung</b> a zdźěli městno.</p><div class='achtung'><b>Dataja je kluč, nic list</b>Wobsahuje njeklučowany jednorazowy kluč. Kóždy z płaćiwej dataju móže so jako hałuz zwjazać. Njesćelće ju po wotewrjenym kanalu ani njeskładujće na zhromadnym běhadle.</div><div class='merke'><b>Po 15 mjeńšinach spadnje</b>Potom so hižo njeda wužiwać. Jeli dlěje trjebaće, wutworće nowu. Jónu wužita dataja njeda so druhi raz wužiwać.</div>","<p>A <b>recovery snapshot</b> is an integrity-checked copy of the complete main-data set kept inside the Organizer's own data location. It is a short-term safety net before mistakes and risky operations, not a backup against disk loss. Find it under <span class='knopfwort'>Settings ▸ Security ▸ Recovery snapshots</span>.</p><h3>Scheduled and mandatory snapshots</h3><p>Choose <i>Off</i>, every 6 hours, every 12 hours, daily or weekly under <b>Snapshot interval</b>; weekly is the default. Scheduling is checked only while the installed Organizer is running and unlocked. An overdue snapshot is caught up after the data is next opened, and the program checks again every 15 minutes while it remains open. <b>Last snapshot</b> and <b>Next snapshot</b> refer to this scheduled series.</p><p>Separate mandatory snapshots are made before synchronization, contact import, merging or deletion, and every restore. If such a point cannot be created, the risky operation does not start.</p><h3>Creating and checking one yourself</h3><ol class='schritte'><li>Click <span class='knopfwort'>Create snapshot now</span>.</li><li>Find the new line by date, time and reason.</li><li>Use <span class='knopfwort'>Preview</span> to verify the payload and see summary counts. The preview does not list individual names or entries.</li></ol><p>Each line also shows size, integrity and the total object count. A damaged payload is marked <i>Damaged</i> and cannot be restored. Photos and note attachments are included; device-specific account access data are not. With Organizer password protection, snapshots are encrypted and are re-encrypted when that password is changed or removed.</p><h3>Restoring or deleting</h3><p><span class='knopfwort'>Restore completely</span> replaces the entire present main-data set. The Organizer first creates a protected <i>Before restore</i> snapshot, then gives the restored data a new synchronization epoch and quarantines old deletion records. The first synchronization sends no deletions, so inspect the result before continuing. <span class='knopfwort'>Delete</span> permanently removes one selected snapshot after confirmation.</p><div class='merke'><b>Automatic housekeeping</b>Manual snapshots are pinned. The journal otherwise retains up to eight weekly points, six monthly representatives, 20 recent pre-operation points and five recent pre-restore points. Its total budget is at most 1 GiB or five percent of the volume, and it keeps a 1-GiB free-space reserve. Keep tested backups on another device for permanent protection.</div>":"<p><b>Wobnowjenska kopija</b> je kopija dospołneje hłowneje datoweje sadźby z přepruwowanej integritu znutřka datoweho městna Organizera. Je krótodobna wěstotna syć před zmylkami a rizikowymi operacijemi, nic zawěsćenje přećiwo zhubjenju tačele. Namakajće ju pod <span class='knopfwort'>Nastajenja ▸ Wěstota ▸ Wobnowjenske kopije</span>.</p><h3>Planowane a winowate kopije</h3><p>Wubjerće <i>Wupinjene</i>, kóžde 6 hodźin, kóžde 12 hodźin, dnjowje abo tydźensce pod <b>Interwal kopijow</b>; standard je tydźenski. Plan so jenož přepruwuje, mjeztym zo instalowany Organizer běži a je wotblokowany. Zapozdźena kopija so po přichodnym wočinjenju datow nachwata a program při wočinjenju kóžde 15 mjeńšin znowa přepruwuje. <b>Poslednja kopija</b> a <b>Přichodna kopija</b> so na tutu planowanu seriju poćahujetej.</p><p>Separatne winowate kopije so před synchronizaciju, importom, zjednoćenjom abo zhašenjom kontaktow a kóždym wobnowjenjom wutworja. Jeli so tajki dypk njeda wutworić, rizikowa operacija njestartuje.</p><h3>Kopiju sam wutworić a přepruwować</h3><ol class='schritte'><li>Klikńće <span class='knopfwort'>Nětko wobnowjensku kopiju wutworić</span>.</li><li>Namakajće nowy rjad po datumje, času a přičinje.</li><li>Wužijće <span class='knopfwort'>Přehlad</span>, zo byšće daty přepruwowali a zličby zjeća widźeli. Přehlad jednotliwe mjena ani zapiski njenalistuje.</li></ol><p>Kóždy rjad tež wulkosć, integritu a cyłkownu ličbu objektow pokazuje. Wobškodźene daty su jako <i>Wobškodźene</i> markěrowane a njedadźa so wobnowić. Fota a noticowe přiwěški su zapřijate; gratowe přistupowe daty kontow nic. Při hesłowym škiće Organizera su kopije zaklučowane a so při změnje abo wotstronjenju hesła znowa zaklučuja.</p><h3>Wobnowić abo zhašeć</h3><p><span class='knopfwort'>Dospołnje wobnowić</span> cyłu aktualnu hłownu datowu sadźbu naruna. Organizer najprjedy škitanu kopiju <i>Před wobnowjenjom</i> wutwori, potom wobnowjenym datam nowu synchronizacisku epochu da a stare zhašenske zapiski do karanteny staji. Prěnja synchronizacija žane zhašenja njesćele, tuž přepruwujće wuslědk před pokročowanjom. <span class='knopfwort'>Zhašeć</span> wubranu kopiju po wobkrućenju trajnje wotstroni.</p><div class='merke'><b>Awtomatiske rjedźenje</b>Manuelne kopije su připinjene. Žurnal hewak hač do wosom tydźenskich dypkow, šěsć měsacnych zastupnikow, 20 najnowšich dypkow před operaciju a pjeć před wobnowjenjom wobchowa. Cyłkowny budźet je maksimalnje 1 GiB abo pjeć procentow wolumena a 1 GiB swobodneho ruma wostanje. Za trajny škit wobchowajće přepruwowane zawěsćenja na druhim graće.</div>","<p>A branch that you no longer need can be removed. Every confirmed branch has an area <b>Manage connection</b> in its line.</p><ol class='schritte'><li>Open <span class='knopfwort'>Settings ▸ Magnolia tree</span>.</li><li>Find the line of the branch by its name.</li><li>Click <span class='knopfwort'>Remove connection</span> under <b>Manage connection</b>.</li><li>Read the question carefully and confirm it.</li></ol><h3>What disappears, and what stays</h3><ul><li>Removed: the synchronization state, messages still waiting, and the stored details of this connection.</li><li>Kept: everything you have already accepted. Tasks, notes and contacts from this branch stay in your Organizer.</li></ul><p>The other side is not asked. Its own entry for you remains there until that person removes it as well.</p><div class='merke'><b>Reconnecting is possible at any time</b>Removing is not a punishment and nothing is lost by it. You simply start again with the search, a pairing file, or the Internet address.</div>":"<p>Njetrěbna hałuz da so wotstronić. Kóžda wobkrućena hałuz ma <b>Zwisk rjadować</b>.</p><ol class='schritte'><li>Wočińće <span class='knopfwort'>Nastajenja ▸ Magnolienbaum</span>.</li><li>Namakajće hałuzu po mjenje.</li><li>Klikńće <span class='knopfwort'>Zwisk wotstronić</span> pod <b>Zwisk rjadować</b>.</li><li>Wobkrućće prašenje.</li></ol><h3>Što zmiznje a što wostanje</h3><ul><li>Synchronizaciski staw, čakace powěsće a daty zwiska so wotstronja.</li><li>Hižo přiwzate nadawki, notice a kontakty wostanu.</li></ul><p>Druha strona so njepraša a swój zapisk wobchowa, doniž jón sama njewotstroni.</p><div class='merke'><b>Znowazwjazanje je přeco móžne</b>Ničo so njezhubja. Započńće z pytanjom, sparowanskej dataju abo internetowej adresu.</div>","<p>A desktop can request that the phone <b>dial</b>. The current Android implementation uses <b>TelecomManager.placeCall</b> directly; it does not merely open the system dialer and therefore does not promise a general dialer confirmation. Incoming-call state and caller number are separate opt-ins. Even with permission, Android 12 and later may omit the number from its call-state callback; older versions can also report a withheld number. A withheld, unavailable, unshared, or permission-blocked number remains blank and the desktop shows it as unavailable. <b>answer_call</b> and <b>end_call</b> are separate grants and also depend on Android version, telephony support, system role, and permission.</p><h3>Current-call safety</h3><p>Each call has a changing revision. Answer applies only to the currently ringing call; end includes the expected revision and <b>offhook</b> state. Stale commands fail instead of affecting a newer call. The active dialog follows ringing, connected, and ended states.</p><h3>Useful context</h3><p>When available, it shows the matched contact, phone battery at event time, duration, and a private call note.</p><div class='achtung'><b>Audio stays on the phone</b>There is no HFP audio path. Platform or Android limits can leave individual controls unavailable even after a Magnolie grant.</div>":"<p>Desktop móže telefon wo <b>wuzwolenje</b> prosyć. Aktualna Androidowa implementacija wužiwa direktnje <b>TelecomManager.placeCall</b>; njewočinja jenož systemowy wuzwolak a tuž powšitkowne dalše wobkrućenje njeslubja. Staw dochadźaceho zawołanja a čisło zawołarja stej separatnej dowolnosći. Samo z dowolnosću móže Android 12 a nowši čisło wuwostajić; starše wersije móža zatajene čisło zdźělić. Zatajene, njedocpějomne, njedźělene abo blokowane čisło wostanje prózdne. <b>answer_call</b> a <b>end_call</b> stej separatnej dowolnosći a wotwisujetej tež wot Androida, telefonije, systemoweje róle a dowolnosće.</p><h3>Wěstota aktualneho zawołanja</h3><p>Kóžde zawołanje ma so měnjacu rewiziju. Přiwzaće płaći jenož za runje zwonjące zawołanje; skónčenje wobsahuje wočakowanu rewiziju a staw <b>offhook</b>. Zestarjene přikazy so njeporadźa, město zo bychu nowše zawołanje wobwliwowali. Dialog slěduje zwonjenju, zwiskej a skónčenju.</p><h3>Wužitny kontekst</h3><p>Jeli je k dispoziciji, pokazuje hodźacy so kontakt, bateriju telefona za čas podawka, trajanje a priwatnu zawołansku noticu.</p><div class='achtung'><b>Zynk wostanje na telefonje</b>HFP-zynkowy puć njeje. Platformowe abo Androidowe mjezy móža jednotliwe elementy samo po dowolnosći Magnolie njedocpějomne wostajić.</div>","<p>A long list is shown in portions. The Organizer displays the first <b>250</b> entries and, below them, a line naming how many further entries there are, together with <span class='knopfwort'>Show more</span> and, if there are still a great many, <span class='knopfwort'>Show all</span>.</p><p><span class='knopfwort'>Show more</span> adds the next 250 entries; <span class='knopfwort'>Show all</span> displays the remainder in one step. You will meet this line in the task list, in a notebook and in the anniversary list.</p><h3>Nothing has gone missing</h3><p>This is a matter of display speed only, so that a book holding thousands of entries can still be leafed through without waiting. Every entry that is not yet displayed is stored, is searched, is printed and is exported exactly as before. The counted line tells you plainly how many are waiting.</p><p>Each list keeps its own portion size while the program is running. Search and filter do not conflict with it: they narrow the list first, and only the result is portioned.</p><div class='merke'><b>The quickest way to one entry</b>Instead of clicking through the portions, use the search field of that section. It looks through all entries, not only those on display.</div>":"<p>Dołha lisćina so po dźělach pokazuje. Organizer pokazuje prěnich <b>250</b> zapiskow a deleka ličbu zbytnych kaž tež <span class='knopfwort'>Wjace pokazać</span> a při wulkej ličbje <span class='knopfwort'>Wšitko pokazać</span>.</p><p><span class='knopfwort'>Wjace pokazać</span> přida 250 zapiskow; <span class='knopfwort'>Wšitko pokazać</span> cyły zbytk. To namakaće w nadawkach, notatnikach a róčnicach.</p><h3>Ničo njeje so zhubiło</h3><p>Dźělenje jenož pokazanje pospěša. Wšitke zapiski su składowane, pytajne, ćišćomne a eksportowalne.</p><p>Kóžda lisćina ma swójsku wulkosć dźěla. Pytanje a filtrowanje najprjedy lisćinu wobmjezujetej.</p><div class='merke'><b>Najspěšniši puć k zapiskej</b>Wužiwajće pytanske polo; přepytuje wšitke zapiski.</div>","<p>A paired telephone is not always reachable. Under <span class='knopfwort'>Settings ▸ Synchronization</span> the line then reads that the telephone is paired, followed by <span class='knopfwort'>Offline</span>. Two different buttons help, and they do quite different things.</p><h3>Reconnect</h3><p>The button <span class='knopfwort'>Reconnect</span> only tries again. The acquaintance stays as it is. Use it first, whenever the telephone was merely switched off, out of the flat or off the wireless network.</p><h3>Renew pairing</h3><p>The button <span class='knopfwort'>Renew pairing</span> appears only in one case: the telephone is reachable, but its KDE Connect trust no longer matches. That happens after the app has been newly installed on the telephone.</p><ol class='schritte'><li>Click <span class='knopfwort'>Renew pairing</span>.</li><li>Read the question. It states that only the KDE trust for this telephone is removed and built anew.</li><li>Confirm, or choose <span class='knopfwort'>Cancel</span>.</li><li>Then compare the verification key on both devices again.</li></ol><div class='merke'><b>Nothing of yours is lost</b>Magnolie Notes, your notes and the stored conversations remain untouched by the renewal.</div>":"<p>Sparowany telefon njeje přeco docpějomny. Pod <span class='knopfwort'>Nastajenja ▸ Synchronizacija</span> steji potom <span class='knopfwort'>Offline</span>.</p><h3>Znowa zwjazać</h3><p><span class='knopfwort'>Znowa zwjazać</span> jenož znowa pospytuje a sparowanje wobchowa. Wužijće to při wupinjenym telefonje abo falowacej syći.</p><h3>Sparowanje wobnowić</h3><p><span class='knopfwort'>Sparowanje wobnowić</span> so zjewi, hdyž telefon je docpějomny, ale dowěra KDE Connect hižo njetrjechi, na přikład po nowej instalaciji.</p><ol class='schritte'><li>Klikńće <span class='knopfwort'>Sparowanje wobnowić</span>.</li><li>Čitajće prašenje wo znowanatwarje dowěry KDE.</li><li>Wobkrućće abo wubjerće <span class='knopfwort'>Přetorhnyć</span>.</li><li>Přirunajće znowa přepruwowanski kluč.</li></ol><div class='merke'><b>Waše daty so njezhubja</b>Magnolie Notes, notice a rozmołwy wostanu njesměnjene.</div>","<p>A remote deletion is a <b>proposal</b>, never automatic. You may decide per item, or apply and remember a decision for the remaining eligible proposals in that synchronization run. <b>Delete all</b> and <b>Restore all</b> are available when the run can continue safely; the current item is checked again before any decision is applied.</p><h3>Safeguards</h3><p>Unusually large groups of proposals cross a safety threshold and interrupt the run for explicit review. Changed items become conflicts, nonempty notebooks cannot be removed, and other mass, conflict, or dependency conditions also interrupt bulk processing. Tombstones and retention prevent old deletion history from targeting a replacement phone.</p><h3>Trash kinds</h3><p>Android and desktop report notes, tasks, notebooks, and attachments. Restore requires the parent and content; otherwise it returns <b>restore_unavailable</b>.</p><div class='merke'><b>Independent grant</b>Revoking <b>personal_deletions_sync</b> stops proposals without disabling notes or tasks.</div>":"<p>Zdalené zhašenje je <b>namjet</b>, ženje awtomatiske. Móžeće wo kóždym zapisku rozsudźić abo rozsud za zbytne přihódne namjety tutoho synchronizaciskeho běha nałožić a sej jón spomjatkować. <b>Wšitko zhašeć</b> a <b>Wšitko wobnowić</b> stej k dispoziciji, hdyž móže běh wěsće pokročować; aktualny zapisk so znowa přepruwuje, prjedy hač so rozsud nałoži.</p><h3>Škitne naprawy</h3><p>Njezwučene wulke skupiny namjetow překročuja wěstotnu hranicu a přetorhnu běh za wurazne přepruwowanje. Změnjene zapiski budu konflikty, njeprózdne noticniki njehodźa so wotstronić a druhe masowe, konfliktowe abo wotwisnosćowe wuměnjenja tež masowe wobdźěłanje přetorhnu. Zhašenske znamjenja a wobchowanje zadźěwaja tomu, zo stara zhašenska historija narunanski telefon potrjechi.</p><h3>Družiny papjeroweho koša</h3><p>Android a desktop zdźělatej noticy, nadawki, noticniki a přiwěški. Wobnowjenje trjeba nadrjadowany zapisk a wobsah; hewak wróći <b>restore_unavailable</b>.</p><div class='merke'><b>Njewotwisna dowolnosć</b>Wotwołanje <b>personal_deletions_sync</b> zastaji namjety, bjeztoho zo by noticy abo nadawki znjemóžniło.</div>","<p>A trip, a training course or a visit from a tradesperson may last several days. The appointment sheet has two date fields for this purpose.</p><p>Date fields use day, month, and year segments. Tab and Shift+Tab move between them, and the mouse wheel changes the selected segment. Entering only four digits for day and month adds the current year. If a required date is cleared, it returns to today; optional filter, task, and recurrence-end dates may remain empty.</p><ol class='schritte'><li>Enter the first day under <b>Date</b>.</li><li>Select the last day under <b>Through</b>. The Organizer does not allow a date earlier than the start date.</li><li>For a timed appointment, the time on the left applies on the first day and the time on the right applies on the last day.</li><li>For a holiday or another period with no specific time, select <b>all day</b>.</li><li>Click <span class='knopfwort'>Add appointment</span>.</li></ol><h3>In the Calendar</h3><p>The appointment appears on <b>every calendar day it covers</b> in the month view, the appointment overview, and the week, day and print views. You can change its start and end at any time when editing it.</p><h3>When importing and exporting</h3><p>The date range is preserved in calendar files, Lotus files and synchronization with online accounts. For all-day appointments in calendar files, the Organizer converts the technical end date so that no extra day is displayed.</p><div class='merke'><b>Only one day?</b>If both date fields contain the same date, the entry behaves like any ordinary appointment.</div>":"<p>Pućowanje, kurs abo wopyt rjemjeslnika móže wjacore dny trać. Terminowe łopjeno ma za to dwě datumowej poli.</p><p>Datumowe pola su do segmentow dźeń, měsac a lěto rozdźělene. Tab a Shift+Tab mjez nimi přechadźujetej, myšace kolesko wubrany segment změnja. Jeli jenož štyri ličby za dźeń a měsac zapodaće, so aktualne lěto přida. Hdyž so trěbny datum wuprózdni, wróći so na dźensniši dźeń; opcionalne datumy filtrow, nadawkow a kónca wospjetowanja móža prózdne wostać.</p><ol class='schritte'><li>Zapodajće prěni dźeń pod <b>Datum</b>.</li><li>Pod <b>Hač do</b> wubjerće posledni dźeń. Organizer njedowoli datum před započatkom.</li><li>Při terminje z časom płaći čas nalěwo za prěni dźeń a čas naprawo za posledni dźeń.</li><li>Za dowol abo druhu dobu bjez konkretneho časa wubjerće <b>cyły dźeń</b>.</li><li>Klikńće <span class='knopfwort'>Termin přidać</span>.</li></ol><h3>W protyce</h3><p>Termin so na <b>kóždym protykowym dnju, kotryž wobsahuje</b>, zjewi: w měsacnym napohladźe, přehladźe terminow, tydźenskim a dnjowym napohladźe kaž tež při ćišćenju. Při wobdźěłowanju móžeće jeho započatk a kónc kóždy čas změnić.</p><h3>Při imporće a eksporće</h3><p>Datumowy wobłuk so w protykowych datajach, Lotus-datajach a při synchronizaciji z online-kontami wobchowa. Za cyłodnjowe terminy w protykowych datajach přeměni Organizer techniski kónčny datum tak, zo so žadyn přidatny dźeń njepokazuje.</p><div class='merke'><b>Jenož jedyn dźeń?</b>Jeli wobě datumowej poli samsny datum wobsahujetej, zadźeržuje so zapisk kaž zwyčajny jednódnjowy termin.</div>","<p>Above the buttons the window shows a running clock and a short list. The clock starts at <b>00:00:00</b> and counts only from the moment the call is actually connected.</p><h3>The list</h3><ul><li><span class='knopfwort'>Direction</span> – <span class='knopfwort'>Incoming</span>, <span class='knopfwort'>Outgoing</span> or <span class='knopfwort'>Unknown</span>.</li><li><span class='knopfwort'>Phone number</span> – blank if the caller withheld it.</li><li><span class='knopfwort'>Spam check</span> – either <span class='knopfwort'>Possible spam</span> or <span class='knopfwort'>No spam check available</span>.</li><li><span class='knopfwort'>Phone battery</span> – the level of your telephone, or <span class='knopfwort'>Unavailable</span>.</li><li><span class='knopfwort'>Call started</span> – day and time.</li></ul><h3>The writing field</h3><p>Under <span class='knopfwort'>Call notes</span> you may write during the conversation. When the call ends, and only if you have written something, the Organizer lays a new note in your notebook. It bears the name and the date in its title, and above your own lines it repeats direction, contact, times, <span class='knopfwort'>Duration</span> and the other particulars.</p><div class='merke'><b>Empty stays empty</b>Write nothing and no note is made. Every call does not become paper.</div>":"<p>Nad tłóčatkami wokno čas a krótku lisćinu pokazuje. Čas započina při <b>00:00:00</b> hakle po zwjazanju zawołanja.</p><h3>Lisćina</h3><ul><li><span class='knopfwort'>Směr</span> – <span class='knopfwort'>Dochadźace</span>, <span class='knopfwort'>Wotchadźace</span> abo <span class='knopfwort'>Njeznate</span>.</li><li><span class='knopfwort'>Telefonowe čisło</span> – prózdne při zatajenym čisle.</li><li><span class='knopfwort'>Spamowa kontrola</span> – <span class='knopfwort'>Móžny spam</span> abo <span class='knopfwort'>Žana spamowa kontrola</span>.</li><li><span class='knopfwort'>Telefonowa baterija</span> – staw abo <span class='knopfwort'>Njek dispoziciji</span>.</li><li><span class='knopfwort'>Zawołanje započate</span> – dźeń a čas.</li></ul><h3>Pisanske polo</h3><p>Pod <span class='knopfwort'>Zawołanske notice</span> móžeće pisać. Po kóncu Organizer jenož při tekście nowu noticu z mjenom, datumom, směrom, kontaktom, časom, <span class='knopfwort'>Trajanjem</span> a podrobnosćemi wutwori.</p><div class='merke'><b>Prózdne wostanje prózdne</b>Bjez teksta so notica njewutwori.</div>","<p>After <span class='knopfwort'>Connect</span> a window appears. It shows a <b>six-digit code</b>, the name of the other branch and its fingerprint. Exactly the same code appears on the other computer.</p><ol class='schritte'><li>Read the code out to the other person, on the telephone or in the same room.</li><li>Only if both codes are exactly the same, click <span class='knopfwort'>Yes, the code matches</span>.</li><li>On the other computer the new branch waits in the list, with its code beside it. Click <span class='knopfwort'>Code matches</span> there.</li></ol><p>Both sides must confirm. Afterwards the line reads <b>confirmed</b>. From then on the two branches speak only in encrypted form.</p><div class='achtung'><b>If the codes differ, stop</b>Two different codes mean that somebody else answered instead of your partner. Do not confirm anything. Close the window and start again from the search.</div><p>A freshly confirmed branch is <b>not</b> yet trusted. Tasks and notes coming from it wait for your decision. Only when you tick <b>Trust and accept tasks and notes automatically</b> in that line are they accepted without asking.</p>":"<p>Po <span class='knopfwort'>Zwjazać</span> pokazuje wokno <b>šěsćměstnowy kod</b>, mjeno druheje hałuzy a palčikowy wotćišć. Samsny kod je na druhim ličaku.</p><ol class='schritte'><li>Přečitajće kod druhej wosobje.</li><li>Jenož při samsnym kodźe klikńće <span class='knopfwort'>Haj, kod so hodźi</span>.</li><li>Na druhim ličaku klikńće <span class='knopfwort'>Kod so hodźi</span>.</li></ol><p>Wobě stronje dyrbitej wobkrućić. Potom steji <b>wobkrućena</b> a komunikacija je zaklučowana.</p><div class='achtung'><b>Při rozdźělnych kodach zastajće</b>Ničo njewobkrućujće, wokno začińće a zaso pytajće.</div><p>Nowa hałuz hišće <b>njeje</b> dowěry hódna. Hakle <b>Dowěrić a nadawki a notice awtomatisce přiwzać</b> přiwzaće bjez prašenja dowoli.</p>","<p>After installation you will find the Organizer in the application menu under <b>Office</b> on Linux, or in its <b>Magnolie Organizer</b> folder in the Windows Start menu. If you are using the AppImage, double-click the file itself.</p><p>However you started it, the same thing now happens: a closed book appears, with a brown leather cover and a golden magnolia blossom on the front. <b>Click the cover once</b> and the book opens.</p><figure><svg viewBox='0 0 420 240' width='420' height='240'><rect x='8' y='8' width='404' height='224' rx='14' fill='#55291c'/><rect x='30' y='26' width='360' height='188' rx='8' fill='none' stroke='#d8b25c' stroke-width='2'/><g fill='none' stroke='#d8b25c' stroke-width='2.4'><path d='M210 128 C 204 120, 204 110, 210 103 C 216 110, 216 120, 210 128 Z'/><path d='M210 128 C 201 126, 193 120, 191 111 C 200 111, 208 118, 210 128 Z'/><path d='M210 128 C 219 126, 227 120, 229 111 C 220 111, 212 118, 210 128 Z'/><path d='M210 128 C 202 134, 199 141, 200 148 C 206 145, 210 138, 210 128 Z'/><path d='M210 128 C 218 134, 221 141, 220 148 C 214 145, 210 138, 210 128 Z'/></g><text x='210' y='176' text-anchor='middle' fill='#d8b25c' font-family='Georgia,serif' font-size='26' font-variant='small-caps'>Magnolie</text><text x='210' y='196' text-anchor='middle' fill='#d8b25c' font-family='sans-serif' font-size='9' letter-spacing='3'>ORGANIZER</text></svg><figcaption>This is how the Organizer greets you: one click on the cover is all it takes.</figcaption></figure><p>The first time you start the Organizer, the notepad contains a welcome note summarizing the most important points. You can read it and delete it later, or simply leave it there.</p><div class='merke'><b>No password required</b>The Organizer does not ask you to set anything up when you first start it. If you want to add password protection later, continue on page <b data-page='password-protection-and-encryption' class='knopfwort'></b>.</div><div class='merke'><b>The one-time handbook prompt</b>After you open the book, the Organizer offers <span class='knopfwort'>Open manual</span> if the manual is installed. Otherwise it retrieves the checked package details from the update information and offers <span class='knopfwort'>Download manual</span>. You can also choose <span class='knopfwort'>Not now</span>. The prompt also states in <strong>bold</strong> that the accessibility helper frame is off by default and can be switched on or off at any time with <kbd>Ctrl</kbd>+<kbd>Alt</kbd>+<kbd>H</kbd>. Choosing <i>Not now</i> does not remove the handbook; it remains available under <i>Settings ▸ About</i>, and on Windows also in the same Start-menu folder if you left the handbook component selected during installation.</div>":"<p>Po instalaciji namakaće Organizer pod Linuxom w nałoženskim meniju pod <b>Běrow</b> abo pod Windowsom w rjadowaku <b>Magnolie Organizer</b> startoweho menija. Při AppImage klikńće dwójce na dataju.</p><p>Wšojedne, kak sće jón startowali, so začinjena kniha z brunym kožanym wobalkom a zołćanym magnolijowym kwětkom zjewi. <b>Klikńće jónu na wobalk</b> a kniha so wočini.</p><figure><svg viewBox='0 0 420 240' width='420' height='240'><rect x='8' y='8' width='404' height='224' rx='14' fill='#55291c'/><rect x='30' y='26' width='360' height='188' rx='8' fill='none' stroke='#d8b25c' stroke-width='2'/><g fill='none' stroke='#d8b25c' stroke-width='2.4'><path d='M210 128 C 204 120, 204 110, 210 103 C 216 110, 216 120, 210 128 Z'/><path d='M210 128 C 201 126, 193 120, 191 111 C 200 111, 208 118, 210 128 Z'/><path d='M210 128 C 219 126, 227 120, 229 111 C 220 111, 212 118, 210 128 Z'/><path d='M210 128 C 202 134, 199 141, 200 148 C 206 145, 210 138, 210 128 Z'/><path d='M210 128 C 218 134, 221 141, 220 148 C 214 145, 210 138, 210 128 Z'/></g><text x='210' y='176' text-anchor='middle' fill='#d8b25c' font-family='Georgia,serif' font-size='26' font-variant='small-caps'>Magnolie</text><text x='210' y='196' text-anchor='middle' fill='#d8b25c' font-family='sans-serif' font-size='9' letter-spacing='3'>ORGANIZER</text></svg><figcaption>Tak was Organizer wita: jedyn klik na wobalk dosaha.</figcaption></figure><p>Při prěnim starće notnik witansku noticu z najwažnišimi dypkami wobsahuje. Móžeće ju čitać a pozdźišo zhašeć abo ju tam wostajić.</p><div class='merke'><b>Žane hesło trěbne</b>Organizer při prěnim starće wo žane zarjadowanje njepraša. Za pozdźiši hesłowy škit pokročujće na stronje <b data-page='password-protection-and-encryption' class='knopfwort'></b>.</div><div class='merke'><b>Jónkróćne prašenje wo přiručku</b>Po wočinjenju knihy Organizer <span class='knopfwort'>Přiručku wočinić</span> poskića, jeli je instalowana. Hewak z přepruwowanych aktualizaciskich informacijow podrobnosće pakćika wobstara a <span class='knopfwort'>Přiručku sćahnyć</span> poskića. Móžeće tež <span class='knopfwort'>Nic nětko</span> wubrać. Prašenje <strong>tučnje</strong> zdźěli, zo je pomocny wobłuk přistupnosće standardnje wupinjeny a so z <kbd>Ctrl</kbd>+<kbd>Alt</kbd>+<kbd>H</kbd> kóždy čas přepina. <i>Nic nětko</i> přiručku njewotstroni; wostanje pod <i>Nastajenja ▸ Wo programje</i> a pod Windowsom tež w samsnym rjadowaku startoweho menija, jeli sće komponentu při instalaciji wubranu wostajili.</div>","<p>An <b>APK</b> is an Android installation file. For release 1.0.5 its name is <i>Magnolie-Notes-1.0.5.apk</i>. Obtain it and the accompanying <i>Magnolie-Notes-PRUEFSUMMEN.sha256</i> only from the official Magnolie release location. Do not install a similarly named file from a search result, advertising page, file portal, or an unknown message.</p><h3>Check the file before transferring it</h3><ol class='schritte'><li>Check that the file name and advertised version agree.</li><li>Compare its <b>SHA-256</b> value with the value published with that release. SHA-256 is a 64-character fingerprint: every character must agree.</li><li>On Linux, open a terminal in the download folder and run <i>sha256sum Magnolie-Notes-1.0.5.apk</i>. On Windows, open PowerShell in that folder and run <i>Get-FileHash .\\Magnolie-Notes-1.0.5.apk -Algorithm SHA256</i>.</li><li>If the values differ, delete the APK and download it again from the official location. Renaming a file does not make it genuine.</li></ol><h3>Direct download on the phone</h3><p>This is the shortest route. Open the official release address in the phone's browser, download the APK, and compare the published SHA-256 value before opening it. The file is normally in <i>Downloads</i>. The permission required later belongs to this browser.</p><h3>From a Linux computer</h3><ul><li><b>USB/MTP:</b> unlock the phone, connect a data-capable USB cable, tap the USB notification on the phone, and select <i>File transfer</i>. Open the phone in the Linux file manager and copy the checked APK to <i>Download</i>. If the phone does not appear, try another cable or USB socket; charging-only cables cannot transfer files.</li><li><b>Bluetooth:</b> pair computer and phone in their system settings, choose <i>Send file</i> on Linux, select the checked APK, and accept the transfer on the phone. Bluetooth is slow but needs no cable.</li><li><b>Warpinator:</b> install Warpinator from the trusted package source on Linux and the trusted app store on Android, put both devices on the same private network, select the phone, send the checked APK, and accept it there.</li><li><b>Messenger:</b> send the checked APK to yourself with WhatsApp Web, Whatsie, or another messenger you already trust, then download that attachment on the phone. Do not send it to another person or a group by mistake. Some services block APK attachments or rename them; use another method rather than disguising the file.</li></ul><h3>From a Windows computer</h3><ul><li><b>USB/MTP:</b> unlock the phone, connect a data-capable USB cable, select <i>File transfer</i> in the phone's USB notification, open the phone under <i>This PC</i>, and copy the checked APK to <i>Internal shared storage\\Download</i>.</li><li><b>Bluetooth:</b> pair both devices under Windows Bluetooth settings, choose <i>Send or receive files via Bluetooth</i>, select the checked APK, and accept it on the phone.</li><li><b>Warpinator:</b> install a trusted Windows-compatible Warpinator client and the Android app from their official sources, connect both to the same private network, and accept the transfer on the phone.</li><li><b>Messenger:</b> use WhatsApp Web, Whatsie, or another trusted messenger as described above. Download only the attachment you sent yourself and check its name and hash again if the service changed anything.</li></ul><div class='merke'><b>The transfer method does not prove authenticity</b>USB, Bluetooth, Warpinator, and messengers merely move bytes. The official origin and matching SHA-256 value are what let you detect a wrong or damaged file.</div><figure data-image-manifest='android-apk-transfer-methods'><div class='achtung'><b>IMAGE MISSING - manifest requirement</b>Real, current photographs or screenshots are required for: Android USB “File transfer”, the Linux MTP destination, the Windows MTP destination, Bluetooth acceptance, and Warpinator acceptance. Record the Android version, phone model, desktop system, language, source release, capture date, and SHA-256 of each image. Do not substitute a recreated Android system dialog.</div><figcaption>No Android system-dialog image has been invented for this edition.</figcaption></figure>":"<p><b>APK</b> je Androidowa instalowanska dataja. Za wersiju 1.0.5 rěka <i>Magnolie-Notes-1.0.5.apk</i>. Wobstarajće ju a <i>Magnolie-Notes-PRUEFSUMMEN.sha256</i> jenož z oficialneho wozjewjenskeho městna Magnolie. Njeinstalujće podobnje pomjenowanu dataju z pytanskeho wuslědka, wabjenja, datajoweho portala abo njeznateje powěsće.</p><h3>Dataju před přenjesenjom přepruwować</h3><ol class='schritte'><li>Přepruwujće mjeno dataje a wersiju.</li><li>Přirunajće <b>SHA-256</b> z wozjewjenej hódnotu. Wšitke 64 znamješkow dyrbja so hodźić.</li><li>Pod Linuxom wuwjedźće <i>sha256sum Magnolie-Notes-1.0.5.apk</i>. Pod Windows w PowerShell wuwjedźće <i>Get-FileHash .\\Magnolie-Notes-1.0.5.apk -Algorithm SHA256</i>.</li><li>Při rozdźělu APK zhašejće a z oficialneho městna znowa sćehńće. Přemjenowanje dataju njewoprawdźa.</li></ol><h3>Direktne sćehnjenje na telefonje</h3><p>Wočińće oficialnu wozjewjensku adresu w browserje telefona, sćehńće APK a přepruwujće SHA-256. Dataja je zwjetša w <i>Sćehnjenja</i>. Pozdźiša dowolnosć k tutomu browserej słuša.</p><h3>Z ličaka Linux</h3><ul><li><b>USB/MTP:</b> wotamkńće telefon, zwjazajće datowy USB-kabl, podótkńće so USB-zdźělenki a wubjerće <i>Dataje přenjesć</i>. Kopěrujće přepruwowanu APK do <i>Download</i>. Jeli telefon faluje, wužijće druhi kabl abo port; čiste ładźenske kable daty njepřenjesuja.</li><li><b>Bluetooth:</b> sparujće graty, wubjerće pod Linuxom <i>Dataju pósłać</i>, APK a akceptujće přenjesenje na telefonje. Bluetooth je pomały, ale bjez kabla.</li><li><b>Warpinator:</b> instalujće z dowěry hódneho žórła na woběmaj gratajomaj, zwjazajće ze samsnej priwatnej syću, wubjerće telefon, sćelće APK a přiwzmiće ju.</li><li><b>Messenger:</b> sćelće přepruwowanu APK samemu sebi přez WhatsApp Web, Whatsie abo dowěry hódny messenger a sćehńće přiwěšk. Njesćelće ju druhej wosobje abo skupinje. Jeli słužba APK blokuje abo přemjenuje, wužijće druhi puć a dataju njemaskěrujće.</li></ul><h3>Z ličaka Windows</h3><ul><li><b>USB/MTP:</b> wotamkńće telefon, zwjazajće datowy kabl, wubjerće <i>Dataje přenjesć</i>, wočińće telefon pod <i>Tutón PC</i> a kopěrujće APK do <i>Internal shared storage\\Download</i>.</li><li><b>Bluetooth:</b> sparujće graty, wubjerće <i>Dataje přez Bluetooth pósłać abo přiwzać</i>, APK a akceptujće na telefonje.</li><li><b>Warpinator:</b> instalujće dowěry hódny klient Windows a Androidowe nałoženje z oficialneho žórła, zwjazajće ze samsnej syću a přenjesenje přiwzmiće.</li><li><b>Messenger:</b> wužiwajće WhatsApp Web, Whatsie abo druhi dowěry hódny messenger. Sćehńće jenož swójski přiwěšk a přepruwujće mjeno a wotćišć znowa, jeli słužba něšto změni.</li></ul><div class='merke'><b>Přenjesenski puć prawosć njedopokazuje</b>USB, Bluetooth, Warpinator a messengery jenož bajty přesuwaja. Oficialne žórło a hodźacy so SHA-256 zmylkowu abo wobškodźenu dataju wotkryjetej.</div><figure data-image-manifest='android-apk-transfer-methods'><div class='achtung'><b>WOBRAZ FALUJE – žadanje manifesta</b>Trěbne su woprawdźite aktualne fota abo wobrazowki za Androidowe USB „Dataje přenjesć“, cil MTP pod Linuxom, cil MTP pod Windows, přiwzaće Bluetooth a Warpinator. Zapisajće Androidowu wersiju, telefonowy model, desktopowy system, rěč, žórłowe wozjewjenje, datum a SHA-256 kóždeho wobraza. Njerunajće napodobnjeny Androidowy systemowy dialog.</div><figcaption>Za tute wudaće njeje so žadyn Androidowy systemowy dialog wumyslił.</figcaption></figure>","<p>An <span class='knopfwort'>SMS</span> button appears on a contact card only when that contact has at least one number whose type is set to <span class='knopfwort'>Mobile</span>. If no number carries that type, the button is simply not there.</p><h3>Marking a number as mobile</h3><ol class='schritte'><li>Open the contact card.</li><li>Put the card into editing.</li><li>Beside the number, choose the type <span class='knopfwort'>Mobile</span>.</li><li>Save the card.</li></ol><p>The button appears at once, as soon as the card is shown again.</p><div class='achtung'><b>The dialling code is never examined</b>The Organizer does not read the digits and does not guess. A mobile number that is stored as <span class='knopfwort'>Landline</span> receives no SMS button. A landline number that is stored as <span class='knopfwort'>Mobile</span> does receive one. Only the type you set counts.</div><div class='merke'><b>Calling follows another rule</b>The <span class='knopfwort'>Call</span> button appears for every number of the contact, whatever its type. Only Fax and Pager numbers are left out.</div>":"<p>Tłóčatko <span class='knopfwort'>SMS</span> je jenož při čisle typa <span class='knopfwort'>Mobilny telefon</span>.</p><h3>Čisło jako mobilne markěrować</h3><ol class='schritte'><li>Wočińće kontakt.</li><li>Wobdźěłujće jón.</li><li>Wubjerće typ <span class='knopfwort'>Mobilny telefon</span>.</li><li>Składujće.</li></ol><p>Tłóčatko so hnydom zjewi.</p><div class='achtung'><b>Předwólba so njepřepruwuje</b>Organizer čisła njetrochuje. Mobilne jako <span class='knopfwort'>Festna syć</span> nima SMS, festne jako <span class='knopfwort'>Mobilny telefon</span> jo ma. Jenož typ płaći.</div><div class='merke'><b>Zawołanje ma druhe prawidło</b><span class='knopfwort'>Zawołać</span> je za wšitke čisła nimo faksa a pagera.</div>","<p>An SMS can only carry a limited set of characters. Hearts, smileys, long dashes and typographic quotation marks do not belong to it. The Organizer therefore looks at your text while you type.</p><h3>The counter under the writing field</h3><p>It reads for example <b>1 SMS parts · 47 character units</b>. Up to 160 units the message is a single part; after that it is divided. More than <b>10</b> parts cannot be sent, and the counter then adds the sentence that a maximum of 10 SMS parts is allowed.</p><h3>The adjustment preview</h3><p>If something in your text cannot be carried, a box appears headed <b>SMS text was adjusted:</b>. Underneath stands exactly the text that would go out. A heart becomes <b>&lt;3</b>, a smiley becomes <b>:)</b>, an unknown sign becomes <b>[Symbol]</b>.</p><ol class='schritte'><li>Read the proposed text in the box.</li><li>If it suits you, click <span class='knopfwort'>Send adjusted text</span>.</li><li>If it does not, click <span class='knopfwort'>Cancel</span> and change your own wording. The box disappears.</li></ol><div class='merke'><b>Nothing is sent behind your back</b>As long as the box is open, no message has left. <span class='knopfwort'>Send SMS</span> alone never sends an adjusted text; it only opens this box.</div>":"<p>SMS jenož wobmjezowanu sadźbu znamješkow přenjesuje. Organizer tekst při pisanju přepruwuje.</p><h3>Ličnik pod polom</h3><p>Na př. <b>1 SMS-dźěl · 47 znamješkowych jednotkow</b>. Po 160 jednotkach so dźěli; wjace hač <b>10</b> dźělow njeda so pósłać.</p><h3>Přehlad přiměrjenja</h3><p>Při njepřenjesomnym znamješku so <b>SMS-tekst je so přiměrił:</b> zjewi. Wutroba budźe <b>&lt;3</b>, smiley <b>:)</b>, njeznate znamješko <b>[Symbol]</b>.</p><ol class='schritte'><li>Čitajće tekst.</li><li>Klikńće <span class='knopfwort'>Přiměrjeny tekst pósłać</span>.</li><li>Abo klikńće <span class='knopfwort'>Přetorhnyć</span> a tekst změńće.</li></ol><div class='merke'><b>Ničo so potajkim njesćele</b>Dokelž kašćik je wočinjeny, ničo njeje pósłane. <span class='knopfwort'>SMS pósłać</span> jenož kašćik wočini.</div>","<p>An anniversary is a date that recurs every year: a birthday, a wedding anniversary, the anniversary of a relative’s death, or the anniversary of a club.</p><ol class='schritte'><li>Click the <b>Anniversaries</b> tab.</li><li>Enter the <b>Name</b>, for example <i>Grandma Erna</i>.</li><li>Enter the <b>Date</b>, including the year of birth if you know it. If the year is unknown, enter only day and month; the Organizer stores the anniversary without a year and omits the person’s age.</li><li>The <b>Type</b> field initially has no selection and displays <i>e.g. birthday</i> in gray. Click it and choose Birthday, Death anniversary, Wedding anniversary, or Memorial day; you can also type your own description straight away.</li><li>Click <span class='knopfwort'>Enter</span>.</li></ol><p>The anniversaries in the list on the left are sorted by their <b>next occurrence</b>, with the next one due at the top. Beside each entry, you can see how many days remain and, for a birthday, the age the person will reach.</p><p>The recognized types appear as suggestions as you type. You can nevertheless enter any description at any time; there is no longer a separate setting to enable this.</p><h3>In the calendar</h3><p>Anniversaries appear automatically in the month and week views, marked with a star <b>✱</b>, and above the appointments in the day view. An anniversary is not shown before its entered starting year.</p><div class='beispiel'><b>February 29</b>In a year without a leap day, a birthday on February 29 is shown on February 28, so it is never missed.</div><div class='merke'><b>Set a reminder</b>The Organizer can also remind you up to seven days in advance, leaving time to buy a gift. See page <b data-page='getting-timely-anniversary-reminders' class='knopfwort'></b>.</div>":"<p>Róčnica je datum, kotryž so kóžde lěto wospjetuje: narodniny, kwasna róčnica, posmjertna róčnica přiwuzneho abo róčnica towarstwa.</p><ol class='schritte'><li>Klikńće na rajtark <b>Róčnicy</b>.</li><li>Zapodajće <b>Mjeno</b>, na přikład <i>Wowka Erna</i>.</li><li>Zapodajće <b>Datum</b> z narodnym lětom, jeli je znate. Hewak zapodajće jenož dźeń a měsac; Organizer róčnicu bjez lěta składuje a starobu njepokazuje.</li><li>Polo <b>Typ</b> spočatnje ničo wubrane nima a pokazuje šěry pokiw <i>na př. narodniny</i>. Wubjerće Narodniny, Posmjertnu róčnicu, Kwasnu róčnicu abo Spomnjenski dźeń, abo zapodajće swójske wopisanje.</li><li>Klikńće <span class='knopfwort'>Zapodać</span>.</li></ol><p>Lisćina nalěwo je po <b>najblišim wustupjenju</b> sortěrowana. Pódla zapiska widźiće zbytne dny a při narodninach docpětu starobu.</p><p>Spóznate typy so při pisanju namjetuja; kóžde swójske wopisanje je přiwšěm móžne bjez separatneho nastajenja.</p><h3>W protyce</h3><p>Róčnicy so awtomatisce w měsacnym a tydźenskim napohladźe z hwěžku <b>✱</b> a w dnjowym nad terminami pokazuja. Před zapodatym započatnym lětom so róčnica njepokazuje.</p><div class='beispiel'><b>29. februar</b>W lěće bjez přestupneho dnja so narodniny z 29. februara 28. februara pokazuja.</div><div class='merke'><b>Dopomnjeće nastajić</b>Organizer móže was hač do sydom dnjow do toho dopominać, zo by čas za dar był. Hlejće stronu <b data-page='getting-timely-anniversary-reminders' class='knopfwort'></b>.</div>","<p>An open book is now in front of you. First, familiarize yourself with its parts; after that, everything will fall naturally into place.</p><figure><svg viewBox='0 0 460 250' width='460' height='250'><rect x='6' y='6' width='448' height='238' rx='12' fill='#55291c'/><rect x='18' y='18' width='190' height='214' fill='#f6efdc'/><rect x='252' y='18' width='190' height='214' fill='#f6efdc'/><rect x='208' y='18' width='44' height='214' fill='#2a150e'/><g fill='none' stroke='#e8e2d4' stroke-width='2.4'><circle cx='230' cy='48' r='8'/><circle cx='230' cy='90' r='8'/><circle cx='230' cy='132' r='8'/><circle cx='230' cy='174' r='8'/></g><line x1='28' y1='44' x2='198' y2='44' stroke='#d8b25c' stroke-width='2'/><line x1='262' y1='44' x2='432' y2='44' stroke='#d8b25c' stroke-width='2'/><g fill='#c9b68c'><rect x='442' y='40' width='14' height='22' rx='3'/><rect x='442' y='68' width='14' height='22' rx='3'/><rect x='442' y='96' width='14' height='22' rx='3'/><rect x='442' y='124' width='14' height='22' rx='3'/></g><path d='M424 232 L442 232 L442 214 Z' fill='#ece1c4' stroke='#ab9468'/><g font-family='sans-serif' font-size='10' fill='#3a3128'><text x='30' y='38'>1 Header</text><text x='30' y='120'>2 Left page</text><text x='264' y='120'>3 Right page</text><text x='196' y='246' text-anchor='end'>4 Ring binding</text><text x='300' y='246'>5 Dog-ear</text></g></svg><figcaption>The layout: header, two pages, ring binding, tabs along the edge, and the dog-ear at the bottom right.</figcaption></figure><p><b>1 The header</b> tells you what is on the page, such as the month and year in the Calendar. Small buttons for turning the pages appear to its right.</p><p><b>2 and 3 The two pages.</b> The left usually contains an overview and the right contains the details. In the month view, the month is on the left and the appointment overview on the right; in the day view, two days appear side by side.</p><p><b>4 The ring binding</b> in the middle is purely decorative.</p><p><b>5 The dog-ear</b> at the bottom right moves forward; the one at the bottom left moves back.</p>":"<p>Nětko leži před wami wočinjena kniha. Najprjedy spóznajće jeje dźěle; potom budźe so wšitko přirodnje wot sebje rozumić.</p><figure><svg viewBox='0 0 460 250' width='460' height='250'><rect x='6' y='6' width='448' height='238' rx='12' fill='#55291c'/><rect x='18' y='18' width='190' height='214' fill='#f6efdc'/><rect x='252' y='18' width='190' height='214' fill='#f6efdc'/><rect x='208' y='18' width='44' height='214' fill='#2a150e'/><g fill='none' stroke='#e8e2d4' stroke-width='2.4'><circle cx='230' cy='48' r='8'/><circle cx='230' cy='90' r='8'/><circle cx='230' cy='132' r='8'/><circle cx='230' cy='174' r='8'/></g><line x1='28' y1='44' x2='198' y2='44' stroke='#d8b25c' stroke-width='2'/><line x1='262' y1='44' x2='432' y2='44' stroke='#d8b25c' stroke-width='2'/><g fill='#c9b68c'><rect x='442' y='40' width='14' height='22' rx='3'/><rect x='442' y='68' width='14' height='22' rx='3'/><rect x='442' y='96' width='14' height='22' rx='3'/><rect x='442' y='124' width='14' height='22' rx='3'/></g><path d='M424 232 L442 232 L442 214 Z' fill='#ece1c4' stroke='#ab9468'/><g font-family='sans-serif' font-size='10' fill='#3a3128'><text x='30' y='38'>1 Nadpismo</text><text x='30' y='120'>2 Lěwa strona</text><text x='264' y='120'>3 Prawa strona</text><text x='196' y='246' text-anchor='end'>4 Rynkowe wjazanje</text><text x='300' y='246'>5 Zahnuty róžk</text></g></svg><figcaption>Natwar: nadpismo, dwě stronje, rynkowe wjazanje, rajtarki na kromje a zahnuty róžk deleka naprawo.</figcaption></figure><p><b>1 Nadpismo</b> wam praji, što je na stronje, na přikład měsac a lěto w Protyce. Naprawo pódla njeho su małe tłóčatka za listowanje.</p><p><b>2 a 3 Dwě stronje.</b> Nalěwo je zwjetša přehlad, naprawo podrobnosće. W měsacnym napohladźe je měsac nalěwo a přehlad terminow naprawo; w dnjowym napohladźe stej dwa dnja pódla sebje.</p><p><b>4 Rynkowe wjazanje</b> w srjedźiznje je jenož dekoracija.</p><p><b>5 Zahnuty róžk</b> deleka naprawo listuje doprědka; tón deleka nalěwo wróćo.</p>","<p>Appointments are entered on a separate sheet that appears over the book. Suppose you have a dentist appointment on August 3 from 09:00 until 10:15:</p><p>Dates can be entered directly as eight digits in day, month and four-digit year order. For example, <i>11021982</i> becomes <i>11.02.1982</i>. The native calendar is disabled by default. You can enable it under <b>Settings ▸ General ▸ Accessibility</b>.</p><ol class='schritte'><li>Click August 3 in the month view. By default, the appointment sheet opens immediately. <b>Date</b> contains the start date, while <b>Through</b> initially contains the same date.</li><li>The <b>Title</b> field starts empty. Click it and select, for example, <i>Doctor's appointment</i>, <i>Meeting</i> or <i>Phone call</i>. You can also enter your own title, such as <i>Dentist, Dr Berg</i>.</li><li>Under <b>Time</b>, enter <i>09:00</i> on the left and <i>10:15</i> on the right.</li><li>Write a <b>Note</b> on the lined sheet on the right, such as <i>Bring health insurance card</i>.</li><li>Click <span class='knopfwort'>Add appointment</span> at the bottom right.</li></ol><h3>Custom notification</h3><p>For important appointments, you can also choose a lead time of one to seven days. The field starts empty and displays the gray example <i>e.g. 1 day before</i>. Click it to select 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6 or 7 days beforehand. The <b>Also use the default notification</b> checkbox appears only after you select a custom lead time. It lets you decide whether the default notification selected under Settings should also appear, no more than two hours beforehand, in addition to this early notification.</p><p>The sheet closes and the appointment appears in the Calendar. Under <b>Related tasks</b>, you can also link an existing task or create a new one directly, complete with a due date and reminder.</p><p>Existing tasks are not presented in one long selection list. Search by title, due date, a word in the note, or a person responsible. Each result shows the title, due date and an excerpt from the note. This makes it easy to distinguish even between two tasks both called <i>Errands</i>. If there are many results, no more than twelve are shown; a message below them then asks you to use a more specific search term. The date and note excerpt remain visible after you link the task.</p><h3>Editing an appointment</h3><p>Click the appointment in any view. The same sheet opens with all its fields completed. The button at the bottom right is now labeled <span class='knopfwort'>Edit appointment</span>, and <span class='knopfwort'>Delete</span> appears at the bottom left.</p><div class='achtung'><b>A title is required</b>If the field is empty, the Organizer politely points this out. All other fields may be left empty. Press <kbd>Esc</kbd> to close the sheet without making any changes.</div>":"<p>Terminy so na separatnym łopjenje zapodawaja, kotrež so nad knihu zjewi. Předstajće sej, zo maće 3. awgusta wot 09:00 hač do 10:15 termin pola zubneho lěkarja:</p><p>Datumy móžeće direktnje jako wosom ličbow w porjedźe dźeń, měsac a štyrilichotne lěto zapodać. Na přikład <i>11021982</i> so na <i>11.02.1982</i> přeměni. Systemowy protykař je po standardźe znjemóžnjeny. Móžeće jón pod <b>Nastajenja ▸ Powšitkowne ▸ Bjezbarjernosć</b> zmóžnić.</p><ol class='schritte'><li>Klikńće w měsacnym napohladźe na 3. awgust. Po standardźe so terminowe łopjeno hnydom wočini. <b>Datum</b> wobsahuje započatny datum, <b>Hač do</b> spočatnje samsny datum.</li><li>Polo <b>Titul</b> je spočatnje prózdne. Klikńće na nje a wubjerće na přikład <i>Termin pola lěkarja</i>, <i>Zetkanje</i> abo <i>Telefonować</i>. Móžeće tež swójski titul zapodać, na přikład <i>Zubny lěkar, dr. Berg</i>.</li><li>Pod <b>Čas</b> zapodajće nalěwo <i>09:00</i> a naprawo <i>10:15</i>.</li><li>Napišće <b>Noticu</b> na linijowanym łopjenje naprawo, na přikład <i>Kartu chorowarskeje kasy sobu wzać</i>.</li><li>Klikńće deleka naprawo <span class='knopfwort'>Termin přidać</span>.</li></ol><h3>Indiwiduelne zdźělenje</h3><p>Za wažne terminy móžeće tež předčas jedneho hač sydom dnjow wubrać. Polo je spočatnje prózdne a pokazuje šěry přikład <i>na př. 1 dźeń do toho</i>. Klikńće na nje, zo byšće 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6 abo 7 dnjow do toho wubrali. Kontrolny kašćik <b>Tež standardne zdźělenje wužiwać</b> so hakle zjewi, hdyž swójski předčas wubjerjeće. Z nim postajiće, hač so pódla tutoho zažneho zdźělenja tež pod Nastajenja wubrane standardne zdźělenje, maksimalnje dwě hodźinje do toho, zjewi.</p><p>Łopjeno so začini a termin so w Protyce zjewi. Pod <b>Zwisowace nadawki</b> móžeće tež eksistowacy nadawk zwjazać abo nowy direktnje wutworić, z terminom dospěća a dopomnjećom.</p><p>Eksistowace nadawki so njejewja w jednej dołhej wuběranskej lisćinje. Pytajće po titulu, datumje dospěća, słowje w noticy abo zamołwitej wosobje. Kóždy wuslědk pokazuje titul, datum dospěća a wurězk z notice. Tak móžeće samo dwa nadawki z titulom <i>Nákupy</i> lochko rozeznawać. Jeli je wuslědkow wjele, so maksimalnje dwanaće pokazuje; powěsć pod nimi potom prosy wo dokładniše pytanske zapodaće. Datum a wurězk notice wostanjetej po zwjazanju nadawka widźomnej.</p><h3>Termin wobdźěłać</h3><p>Klikńće na termin w někajkim napohladźe. Samsne łopjeno so ze wšěmi wupjelnjenymi polami wočini. Tłóčatko deleka naprawo ma nětko napis <span class='knopfwort'>Termin wobdźěłać</span> a deleka nalěwo so <span class='knopfwort'>Zhašeć</span> zjewi.</p><div class='achtung'><b>Titul je trěbny</b>Jeli je polo prózdne, Organizer was přećelnje na to skedźbni. Wšitke druhe pola smědźa prózdne wostać. Tłóčće <kbd>Esc</kbd>, zo byšće łopjeno bjez změnow začinili.</div>","<p>As soon as the account is saved and switched on, the Organizer asks the server which calendars and address books exist there. They then appear in the second section, <span class='knopfwort'>Calendars and contacts</span>, each with the word <i>Nextcloud</i> after its name.</p><ol class='schritte'><li>Under <span class='knopfwort'>Calendars (multiple selections allowed)</span>, tick every calendar you want to use. You may tick several.</li><li>Under <span class='knopfwort'>Address book</span>, choose one address book. <span class='knopfwort'>— do not link —</span> means that your addresses stay on this computer.</li><li>Click <span class='knopfwort'>Synchronize now</span>.</li></ol><p>The same lists also offer the <span class='knopfwort'>Windows Contacts folder</span> and, where it has been set up, <span class='knopfwort'>Outlook.com / Microsoft 365</span>. Only the entries marked <i>Nextcloud</i> come from your server.</p><p>If you tick <span class='knopfwort'>Synchronize automatically at startup</span>, the Organizer compares everything by itself each time it is started.</p><div class='merke'><b>The first run only adds</b>The first comparison of a calendar or an address book never deletes anything. The entries from both sides are gathered together. Only later runs pass deletions on.</div><div class='achtung'><b>If the list stays empty</b>Nothing appears as long as the tick is missing, no app password is stored, or the server did not answer within twelve seconds. In that case return to the section above and press <span class='knopfwort'>Test connection</span>.</div>":"<p>Po składowanju konta wobstara Organizer protyki a adresniki. Wone so pod <span class='knopfwort'>Protyki a kontakty</span> z <i>Nextcloud</i> pokazuja.</p><ol class='schritte'><li>Pod <span class='knopfwort'>Protyki (wjacory wuběr móžny)</span> wubjerće protyki.</li><li>Pod <span class='knopfwort'>Adresnik</span> wubjerće jedyn; <span class='knopfwort'>— njezwjazać —</span> adresy lokalnje wostaji.</li><li>Klikńće <span class='knopfwort'>Nětko synchronizować</span>.</li></ol><p>Tež <span class='knopfwort'>Zapis kontaktow Windows</span> a <span class='knopfwort'>Outlook.com / Microsoft 365</span> stej móžnej. Jenož <i>Nextcloud</i> přińdźe ze serwera.</p><p><span class='knopfwort'>Při starće awtomatisce synchronizować</span> kóždy start přirunuje.</p><div class='merke'><b>Prěni běh jenož přidawa</b>Ničo njezhaša, ale wobě stronje zjednoći.</div><div class='achtung'><b>Jeli lisćina wostanje prózdna</b>Přepruwujće zmóžnjenje, hesło nałoženja a serwer. Klikńće <span class='knopfwort'>Zwisk testować</span>.</div>","<p>As soon as the telephone has answered, the waiting window changes. It now carries the heading <span class='knopfwort'>Compare pairing code</span>.</p><h3>What you see</h3><ul><li>A six-digit code in large figures.</li><li>Beneath it the name of the telephone.</li><li>Beneath that a long row of letters and figures, the fingerprint.</li></ul><h3>What you do</h3><ol class='schritte'><li>Look at the screen of the telephone. It shows a code too.</li><li>Read both codes aloud, digit by digit.</li><li>Are they exactly the same? Then click <span class='knopfwort'>Codes match</span>.</li><li>Do they differ in even one digit? Then click <span class='knopfwort'>Codes differ</span>.</li></ol><p>After <span class='knopfwort'>Codes match</span> the buttons disappear and a line reports that the secure pairing is being completed. Wait until it is done.</p><div class='achtung'><b>Never confirm out of politeness</b>The comparison is the whole protection. If the codes do not match, someone else may be answering instead of your telephone. <span class='knopfwort'>Codes differ</span> is always the safe answer. You lose nothing but a minute; you can start again.</div>":"<p>Po wotmołwje telefona pokazuje wokno <span class='knopfwort'>Sparowanski kod přirunać</span>.</p><h3>Što widźiće</h3><ul><li>Wulki šěsćměstnowy kod.</li><li>Mjeno telefona.</li><li>Palčikowy wotćišć.</li></ul><h3>Što činiće</h3><ol class='schritte'><li>Hlejće na telefonowy wobrazowku.</li><li>Přečitajće wobaj kodaj.</li><li>Při samsnym kodźe klikńće <span class='knopfwort'>Kodaj so hodźitej</span>.</li><li>Při rozdźělu klikńće <span class='knopfwort'>Kodaj so rozeznawatej</span>.</li></ol><p>Po <span class='knopfwort'>Kodaj so hodźitej</span> so wěste sparowanje dokónči.</p><div class='achtung'><b>Ženje z česćownosće njewobkrućujće</b>Přirunanje je škit. <span class='knopfwort'>Kodaj so rozeznawatej</span> je přeco wěsta wotmołwa.</div>","<p>Automatic checks run at most once every <b>24 hours</b>. <span class='knopfwort'>Check now</span> deliberately bypasses that interval and retrieves current release information.</p><h3>Linux</h3><p>The Linux updater verifies the release manifest with <b>Ed25519</b> and applies strict URL rules before it offers a file. Organizer updates open the official download in the browser; the Organizer displays the expected SHA-256 value and the user compares it with the downloaded file. The browser download itself is not silently trusted or installed.</p><h3>Windows</h3><p>Windows validates the manifest's version, download URL and SHA-256 syntax at runtime. It does <b>not</b> currently verify an Ed25519 signature on that manifest, and it does <b>not</b> hash an Organizer setup file downloaded by the browser. Be explicit about that difference: compare the published SHA-256 value yourself before starting the setup.</p><div class='achtung'><b>Authenticode has a separate role</b>The Windows setup is Authenticode-signed as part of the release and approval pipeline. That signature helps Windows identify the published binary, but it does not turn the current runtime manifest handling into Ed25519 verification and does not replace a checksum comparison.</div>":"<p>Awtomatiske přepruwowanja běža maksimalnje jónu za <b>24 hodźin</b>. <span class='knopfwort'>Nětko přepruwować</span> tutón interwal wotpohladanje wobeńdźe a aktualne wersijowe informacije wobstara.</p><h3>Linux</h3><p>Linuxowy aktualizowak wozjewjenski manifest z <b>Ed25519</b> přepruwuje a krute URL-prawidła nałoži, prjedy hač dataju poskića. Aktualizacije Organizera hamtske sćehnjenje we wobhladowaku wočinja; Organizer wočakowanu hódnotu SHA-256 pokazuje a wužiwar ju ze sćehnjenej dataju přirunuje. Sćehnjenju wobhladowaka so njezdowěrja mjelčo a so awtomatisce njeinstaluje.</p><h3>Windows</h3><p>Windows za běžny čas wersiju manifesta, sćehnjenski URL a syntaksu SHA-256 waliduje. Tuchwilu <b>njepřepruwuje</b> signaturu Ed25519 manifesta a tež <b>njewuliči</b> haš instalaciskeje dataje Organizera, kotruž wobhladowak sćahny. Wobkedźbujće rozdźěl: přirunajće wozjewjenu hódnotu SHA-256 sami před startom instalacije.</p><div class='achtung'><b>Authenticode ma separatnu rólu</b>Windowsowa instalacija je jako dźěl wozjewjenskeho a schwalićenskeho procesa z Authenticode signowana. Signatura pomha Windowsej wozjewjenu binarnu dataju identifikować, ale aktualne wobchadźenje manifesta za běžny čas na přepruwowanje Ed25519 njepřetwori a přirunanje kontrolneje sumy njenaruna.</div>","<p>Before starting, pair the Magnolie phone connection and select <b>Magnolie Notes</b> as the standard call action. Exactly one suitable telephone must be online. In Magnolie Notes on Android, enable <span class='knopfwort'>Allow dial requests</span>.</p><h3>Call from a card</h3><ol class='schritte'><li>Open <span class='knopfwort'>Contacts</span> and select the required card.</li><li>Click <span class='knopfwort'>Call</span>.</li><li>If the card has several suitable numbers, choose one under <span class='knopfwort'>Choose a phone number to call</span>.</li></ol><p>Fax and pager entries are excluded. With only one suitable number, dialing starts without the number sheet. To select or change the standard action, right-click <span class='knopfwort'>Call</span> and open <span class='knopfwort'>Assign call action</span>.</p><div class='merke'><b>The phone places the call directly</b>The current Magnolie Notes implementation calls Android's <b>TelecomManager.placeCall</b>. It does not merely open the system dialer, so do not expect a general extra confirmation in the dialer. Android permissions, roles, the telephone app, or the manufacturer can still prevent the request.</div>":"<p>Před startom porujće telefonowy zwisk Magnolie a wubjerće <b>Magnolie Notes</b> jako standardnu zawołansku akciju. Eksaktnje jedyn přihódny telefon dyrbi online być. Zapńće w Magnolie Notes na Androidźe <span class='knopfwort'>Zawołanske naprašowanja dowolić</span>.</p><h3>Z karty zawołać</h3><ol class='schritte'><li>Wočińće <span class='knopfwort'>Kontakty</span> a wubjerće trěbnu kartu.</li><li>Klikńće <span class='knopfwort'>Zawołać</span>.</li><li>Jeli karta ma wjacore přihódne čisła, wubjerće jedne pod <span class='knopfwort'>Telefonowe čisło za zawołanje wubrać</span>.</li></ol><p>Faksowe a pagerowe zapiski so wuwostaja. Při jenož jednym přihódnym čisle zawołanje bjez čisłoweho łopjena startuje. Zo byšće standardnu akciju wubrali abo změnili, klikńće z prawej tastu na <span class='knopfwort'>Zawołać</span> a wočińće <span class='knopfwort'>Zawołansku akciju připokazać</span>.</p><div class='merke'><b>Telefon direktnje zawoła</b>Aktualna implementacija Magnolie Notes Androidowy <b>TelecomManager.placeCall</b> zawoła. Jenož systemowy wólak njewočini, tuž powšitkowne přidatne wobkrućenje we wólaku njewočakujće. Androidowe dowolnosće, róle, telefonowe nałoženje abo zhotowjer móža naprašowanju přiwšěm zadźěwać.</div>","<p>Below each contact card is a row of small icon buttons. They save you several steps:</p><h3>Letter</h3><p>Click <span class='knopfwort'>Letter</span> to create a prepared letter and open it in <b>LibreOffice Writer</b>. The default is the <b>Compact sender line (default)</b>. You can instead use a <b>DIN 5008 Form B</b> template: the recipient’s address is positioned for a window envelope, today’s date appears on the right, and two fold marks and a hole-punch mark help you fold and file the letter neatly. The salutation and complimentary close are prepared; you only need to write the body of the letter.</p><p>LibreOffice comes with Linux Mint and most other distributions, so the prepared letter usually opens straight away. On Windows it is not part of Magnolie Organizer: if LibreOffice Writer is installed and associated with the file, it opens the letter; otherwise the document is saved for you to open yourself.</p><p>In the compact template, your address appears as a single-line sender line. DIN 5008 uses a multiline sender block as well as the small line in the address window. Enter your address under <span class='knopfwort'>Settings ▸ Contacts</span>, or click <span class='knopfwort'>Import from LibreOffice</span> to retrieve it conveniently from LibreOffice’s user data. Under <b>Letter template</b>, you can choose between the compact default template and DIN 5008 Form B. The fold and hole-punch marks are within the standard printable area.</p><div class='merke'><b>Your address</b>Your address is also used as the starting point for a route. Make sure the street, postal code, and city are complete.</div>":"<p>Pod kóždej kontaktowej kartu je rjad małych symbolowych tłóčatkow, kotrež wam kroki zalutuja:</p><h3>List</h3><p>Klikńće <span class='knopfwort'>List</span>, zo byšće přihotowany list wutworili a w <b>LibreOffice Writer</b> wočinili. Standard je <b>Kompaktna wotpósłarska linka (standard)</b>. Móžeće město toho předłohu <b>DIN 5008 forma B</b> wužiwać: adresa přijimarja je za woknowu wobalku pozicionowana, dźensniši datum je naprawo a dwě falcowanske marce a dźěrkowanska marka pomhaja list porjadnje złožić a zarjadować. Narěčenje a postrow stej přihotowanej; dyrbiće jenož hłowny tekst napisać.</p><p>LibreOffice je při Linux Mint a najwjace druhich distribucijach sobu, tuž so list zwjetša hnydom wočini. Pod Windowsom njeje dźěl Magnolie Organizera: jeli je LibreOffice Writer instalowany a z dataju zwjazany, list wočini; hewak so dokument składuje, zo byšće jón sami wočinili.</p><p>W kompaktnej předłoze so waša adresa jako jednolinkowy wotpósłar pokazuje. DIN 5008 wužiwa wjacelinkowy wotpósłarski blok a mału linku w adresowym woknje. Zapodajće adresu pod <span class='knopfwort'>Nastajenja ▸ Kontakty</span> abo klikńće <span class='knopfwort'>Z LibreOffice importować</span>. Pod <b>Listowa předłoha</b> móžeće mjez kompaktnej standardnej předłohu a DIN 5008 forma B wubrać. Falcowanske a dźěrkowanska marka su znutřka standardneho ćišćomneho wobłuka.</p><div class='merke'><b>Waša adresa</b>Adresa so tež jako spočatny dypk puća wužiwa. Zawěsćće, zo dróha, póstowe wodźenske čisło a město dospołne su.</div>","<p>Both computers must be switched on, stand in the same network, and both must have the tick set. Then the Organizer can look for the other branch by itself.</p><ol class='schritte'><li>Open <span class='knopfwort'>Settings ▸ Magnolia tree</span>.</li><li>Click <span class='knopfwort'>Search local network</span>. The button then reads <i>Searching…</i>.</li><li>Wait a moment. Every branch that answers appears in a list with its name, its fingerprint and its address.</li><li>Compare the fingerprint in the list with the fingerprint shown on the other computer.</li><li>Click <span class='knopfwort'>Connect</span> in that line.</li></ol><p>If the message <b>No other branch was found</b> appears, nothing is broken. The search only calls into your own network. It cannot reach a branch in another house.</p><h3>Typing an address instead</h3><p>Beside the search button there is an empty field. Type the computer name or the IP address of the other branch into it and click <span class='knopfwort'>Connect</span>.</p><div class='merke'><b>Nothing is connected yet</b>Both sides must compare a six-digit code first. The next page explains how.</div>":"<p>Wobaj ličakaj dyrbitej być zapnjenaj, w samsnej syći a zmóžnjenaj.</p><ol class='schritte'><li>Wočińće <span class='knopfwort'>Nastajenja ▸ Magnolienbaum</span>.</li><li>Klikńće <span class='knopfwort'>Lokalnu syć přepytać</span>; steji <i>Pyta so…</i>.</li><li>Čakajće na hałuzy z mjenom, wotćišćom a adresu.</li><li>Přirunajće palčikowy wotćišć.</li><li>Klikńće <span class='knopfwort'>Zwjazać</span>.</li></ol><p><b>Žana druha hałuz namakana</b> njeje zmylk; pytanje jenož swójsku syć docpěwa.</p><h3>Adresu zapodać</h3><p>Zapodajće mjeno ličaka abo IP-adresu a klikńće <span class='knopfwort'>Zwjazać</span>.</p><div class='merke'><b>Hišće ničo zwjazane njeje</b>Najprjedy dyrbitej wobě stronje šěsćměstnowy kod přirunać.</div>","<p>Both deleting buttons stand on the same sheet as the notification setting: open a conversation, then click the small <span class='knopfwort'>SMS</span> button beside the name.</p><h3>The history of this one person</h3><ol class='schritte'><li>Click <span class='knopfwort'>Delete this contact's history</span>.</li><li>A question appears. Confirm it.</li><li>The sheet closes and the conversation is empty.</li></ol><p>This removes the messages of the number that is currently chosen under <span class='knopfwort'>Phone number</span>. Another number of the same person keeps its own history.</p><h3>All histories at once</h3><ol class='schritte'><li>Click <span class='knopfwort'>Delete all SMS histories</span>.</li><li>Confirm the question.</li></ol><p>Now every stored conversation with every contact is gone.</p><div class='achtung'><b>There is no way back</b>Deleting here is final. There is no undo, no wastebasket and no restoring from a backup of the day. If you are unsure, close the sheet and think it over first.</div><div class='merke'><b>The phone keeps its own copy</b>Only the record inside the Organizer is removed. The messages on your mobile telephone are untouched.</div>":"<p>Wobě zhašenskej tłóčatce stej na SMS-nastajenskim łopjenje. Klikńće małe <span class='knopfwort'>SMS</span>.</p><h3>Historija tuteho kontakta</h3><ol class='schritte'><li>Klikńće <span class='knopfwort'>Historiju tutoho kontakta zhašeć</span>.</li><li>Wobkrućće.</li><li>Rozmołwa je prózdna.</li></ol><p>To płaći za wubrane <span class='knopfwort'>Telefonowe čisło</span>; druhe čisło ma swójsku historiju.</p><h3>Wšitke historije</h3><ol class='schritte'><li>Klikńće <span class='knopfwort'>Wšitke SMS-historije zhašeć</span>.</li><li>Wobkrućće.</li></ol><p>Wšitke rozmołwy su zhašane.</p><div class='achtung'><b>Žadyn wróćopuć</b>Zhašenje je trajne, bjez papjernika abo wobnowjenja.</div><div class='merke'><b>Telefon swójsku kopiju wobchowa</b>Jenož zapisk w Organizerje so wotstroni.</div>","<p>By default, deleted appointments, contacts, tasks, notes, notebooks, attachments, anniversaries and duplicate contact cards first go to the <b>Recycle bin</b>. Clear <b>Use the recycle bin</b> to remove future deletions permanently at once. Personal Sync has a separate proposal and tombstone process described on <b data-page='personal-deletions-trash' class='knopfwort'></b>.</p><h3>Restoring an item</h3><ol class='schritte'><li>Open <span class='knopfwort'>Settings ▸ Security</span> and unfold <b>Recycle bin</b>.</li><li><i>In the recycle bin</i> groups the saved items by type and shows when each was deleted.</li><li>Click <span class='knopfwort'>Restore</span> beside the item you need.</li></ol><p>If the old identifier is already in use, the restored item receives a new one. An attachment can return only while its parent note still exists. Merged contact cards appear under <i>Duplicates</i> when the recycle bin was enabled.</p><h3>Automatic and permanent deletion</h3><p>The default retention is <b>30 days</b>; choose 7, 90 or 365 days, or <i>never</i>. Expired entries are removed when the Organizer next opens the data and after a restore, not by a continuously running countdown. <span class='knopfwort'>Empty recycle bin</span> removes everything after confirmation.</p><p>The Organizer retains at most 3,000 entries. The page displays the 60 newest entries of each type; older retained entries remain protected until their retention expires or you empty the whole recycle bin.</p><div class='achtung'><b>Not every deletion uses this bin</b>Health records, SMS histories, planner definitions and several technical records have their own confirmed deletion paths. Read the confirmation before agreeing; a backup or recovery snapshot is the safer protection before a large cleanup.</div>":"<p>Standardnje dóńdu zhašane terminy, kontakty, nadawki, notice, notatniki, přiwěški, róčnicy a dwójne kontaktowe karty najprjedy do <b>Papjernika</b>. Wupńće <b>Papjernik wužiwać</b>, zo byšće přichodne zhašenja hnydom trajnje wotstronili. Personal Sync ma separatny namjetowy a zhašenski proces na <b data-page='personal-deletions-trash' class='knopfwort'></b>.</p><h3>Zapisk wobnowić</h3><ol class='schritte'><li>Wočińće <span class='knopfwort'>Nastajenja ▸ Wěstota</span> a rozwińće <b>Papjernik</b>.</li><li><i>W papjerniku</i> wobchowane zapiski po typje skupinuje a čas zhašenja pokazuje.</li><li>Klikńće <span class='knopfwort'>Wobnowić</span> pódla trěbneho zapiska.</li></ol><p>Jeli so stary identifikator hižo wužiwa, dóstanje wobnowjeny zapisk nowy. Přiwěšk móže so jenož wróćić, mjeztym zo jeho nadrjadowana notica hišće eksistuje. Zjednoćene kontaktowe karty so při zapinjenym papjerniku pod <i>Dwójne</i> pokazuja.</p><h3>Awtomatiske a trajne zhašenje</h3><p>Standardne wobchowanje je <b>30 dnjow</b>; wubjerće 7, 90 abo 365 dnjow abo <i>ženje</i>. Spadnjene zapiski so při přichodnym wočinjenju datow a po wobnowjenju wotstronja, nic přez stajnje běžacy wotličowak. <span class='knopfwort'>Papjernik wuprózdnić</span> po wobkrućenju wšitko wotstroni.</p><p>Organizer maksimalnje 3.000 zapiskow wobchowa. Strona 60 najnowšich zapiskow kóždeho typa pokazuje; starše wobchowane zapiski su škitane, doniž jich čas njespadnje abo cyły papjernik njewuprózdniće.</p><div class='achtung'><b>Nic kóžde zhašenje tutón papjernik wužiwa</b>Strowotne zapiski, SMS-historije, definicije planowakow a wjacore techniske zapiski maja swójske wobkrućene zhašenske puće. Čitajće wobkrućenje před přizwolenjom; zawěsćenska abo wobnowjenska kopija je před wulkim rjedźenjom wěsćiši škit.</div>","<p>Choose <span class='knopfwort'>Day</span> in the calendar header. In a narrow window the words Month, Week and Day disappear, but their three symbols remain. The Organizer remembers the chosen view for the next start and opens it at today's date.</p><h3>Two days side by side</h3><p>The day view is a two-day spread: the selected date is on the left and the following date on the right. The dog-ears and header arrows therefore move two days at a time. All-day appointments have a separate strip above the hours. Timed appointments appear in the schedule from 06:00 through 22:00 with their time, title and the first line of their note.</p><h3>Creating and opening appointments</h3><ul><li>Click a free hour line to start a new appointment at that hour. Its suggested end is one hour later.</li><li>Click <span class='knopfwort'>＋ Add appointment</span> to use the next suggested quarter-hour and a half-hour duration.</li><li>Click an existing appointment to open and edit it.</li></ul><p>The setting <span class='knopfwort'>Clicking a day</span> applies to free areas in the Month and Week grids, not to the hour lines here. A date line in the right-hand monthly overview and a <span class='knopfwort'>+ more</span> button in Week always lead to this view.</p><div class='merke'><b>What remains visible</b>Today's appointments stay visible even after their time has passed. Only calendar dates before today are affected by <span class='knopfwort'>Hide past appointments</span>. Public holidays are never hidden by it. Details are on page <b data-page='calendar-hiding-entries' class='knopfwort'></b>.</div><p><b>With the keyboard:</b> Up and Down select the previous or next hour, Left and Right the neighboring day, <kbd>Home</kbd> and <kbd>End</kbd> 06:00 or 22:00, and <kbd>Page Up</kbd> or <kbd>Page Down</kbd> the previous or next two-day spread. <kbd>Enter</kbd> or <kbd>Space</kbd> creates an appointment at the selected time.</p>":"<p>Wubjerće <span class='knopfwort'>Dźeń</span> w nadpismje. We wuskim woknje słowa Měsac, Tydźeń a Dźeń zmiznu, symbole wostanu. Organizer wuběr za přichodny start spomjatkuje a jón při dźensnišim datumje wočini.</p><h3>Dwaj dnjej pódla sebje</h3><p>Dnjowy napohlad je dwudnjowa dwójstrona: wubrany datum nalěwo a přichodny naprawo. Róžkaj a šipki pohibujetej wo dwa dnja. Cyłodnjowe terminy maja separatny pask nad hodźinami. Časowe terminy su w planje wot 06:00 hač do 22:00 z časom, titulom a prěnjej linku notice.</p><h3>Terminy wutworić a wočinić</h3><ul><li>Klikńće na swobodnu hodźinowu linku za nowy termin; namjetowany kónc je hodźinu pozdźišo.</li><li>Klikńće na <span class='knopfwort'>＋ Termin přidać</span> za přichodnu štwórćhodźinu a połhodźinske trajanje.</li><li>Klikńće na eksistowacy termin za wočinjenje a wobdźěłanje.</li></ul><p><span class='knopfwort'>Kliknjenje na dźeń</span> płaći za swobodne městna měsacneje a tydźenskeje syće, nic za hodźinowe linki. Datumowa linka w prawym měsacnym přehladźe a <span class='knopfwort'>+ dalše</span> w tydźenju přeco sem wodźitej.</p><div class='merke'><b>Što widźomne wostanje</b>Dźensniše terminy wostanu tež po času widźomne. <span class='knopfwort'>Minjene terminy schować</span> płaći jenož za datumy před dźensa a ženje za swjate dny. Podrobnosće su na stronje <b data-page='calendar-hiding-entries' class='knopfwort'></b>.</div><p><b>Z tastaturu:</b> Horje a Dele wubjeratej hodźinu, Nalěwo a Naprawo susodny dźeń, <kbd>Home</kbd> a <kbd>End</kbd> 06:00 abo 22:00, <kbd>Page Up</kbd> a <kbd>Page Down</kbd> dwójstronu. <kbd>Enter</kbd> abo <kbd>Space</kbd> wutwori termin.</p>","<p>Choose <span class='knopfwort'>Month</span>, <span class='knopfwort'>Week</span> or <span class='knopfwort'>Day</span> in the calendar header. A new Organizer begins in Week; afterwards it remembers the last view you selected. At the next start that view opens at today's date, not at the date you last inspected.</p><h3>The month on the left</h3><p>The month view always contains six complete calendar rows, or 42 day boxes. Pale boxes at the beginning and end belong to the neighboring months. Today has a red outline and the selected day a pale gold background. Each box shows at most two appointments; <span class='knopfwort'>+ more</span> reports the remainder.</p><p>Open <span class='knopfwort'>Settings ▸ Calendar ▸ Week numbers</span> to enable <span class='knopfwort'>Show week numbers in the monthly view</span>. The setting is initially off. A narrow <span class='knopfwort'>CW</span> column then appears beside the six rows. These are ISO week numbers even if the displayed week starts on another day.</p><h3>The overview on the right</h3><p>The right-hand page groups the visible contents of the month by date. A date line comes first, followed where applicable by public holidays, school holidays and anniversaries, then appointments. All-day appointments are listed before appointments with times. Days with no visible content are omitted.</p><p>Click a date line to open that date in the two-day view. Click an appointment to edit it. A click on a free place in a day box follows <span class='knopfwort'>Settings ▸ Calendar ▸ Clicking a day</span>: the initial choice is <span class='knopfwort'>Create a new appointment immediately</span>; the alternative is <span class='knopfwort'>Open the day in the daily view</span>. Existing appointments open for editing in either case.</p><div class='merke'><b>Hidden is not deleted</b>Past appointments and the weather can change what these two pages display. The switches and their precise reach are explained on page <b data-page='calendar-hiding-entries' class='knopfwort'></b>.</div><p><b>With the keyboard:</b> Arrow keys move between dates, <kbd>Home</kbd> and <kbd>End</kbd> select the first or last date in a row, <kbd>Page Up</kbd> and <kbd>Page Down</kbd> change the month, and holding <kbd>Shift</kbd> changes the year. <kbd>Enter</kbd> or <kbd>Space</kbd> performs the configured day click.</p>":"<p>Wubjerće <span class='knopfwort'>Měsac</span>, <span class='knopfwort'>Tydźeń</span> abo <span class='knopfwort'>Dźeń</span>. Nowy Organizer započina w tydźenju, potom posledni wuběr spomjatkuje. Při přichodnym starće so napohlad při dźensnišim datumje wočini.</p><h3>Měsac nalěwo</h3><p>Měsacny napohlad ma přeco šěsć rjadow, 42 dnjowych polow. Swětłe pola słušeja k susodnym měsacam. Dźensa ma čerwjeny wobrys, wubrany dźeń swětłozłoty pozadk. Polo pokazuje maksimalnje dwaj terminaj; <span class='knopfwort'>+ dalše</span> zbytk mjenuje.</p><p>Pod <span class='knopfwort'>Nastajenja ▸ Protyka ▸ Čisła tydźenjow</span> zmóžńće <span class='knopfwort'>Čisła tydźenjow w měsacnym napohladźe pokazać</span>. Spočatnje je wupinjene. Wuski słup <span class='knopfwort'>CW</span> so pódla rjadow zjewi. To su ISO-čisła, tež při druhim započatku tydźenja.</p><h3>Přehlad naprawo</h3><p>Prawa strona widźomny wobsah po datumach skupinuje: datumowa linka, swjate dny, šulske prózdniny, róčnicy a terminy. Cyłodnjowe su před časowymi; prózdne dny so wuwostaja.</p><p>Klikńće datum za dwudnjowy napohlad, termin za wobdźěłanje. Klik do swobodneho pola slěduje <span class='knopfwort'>Nastajenja ▸ Protyka ▸ Kliknjenje na dźeń</span>: standard je <span class='knopfwort'>Hnydom nowy termin wutworić</span>, alternatiwa <span class='knopfwort'>Dźeń w dnjowym napohladźe wočinić</span>. Eksistowace terminy so přeco wobdźěłuja.</p><div class='merke'><b>Schowane njeje zhašane</b>Minjene terminy a wjedro pokazanje měnjatej. Přepinaki wopisuje strona <b data-page='calendar-hiding-entries' class='knopfwort'></b>.</div><p><b>Z tastaturu:</b> Šipki pohibuja datum, <kbd>Home</kbd>/<kbd>End</kbd> wubjeratej prěni/posledni datum rjada, <kbd>Page Up</kbd>/<kbd>Page Down</kbd> měsac a <kbd>Shift</kbd> lěto. <kbd>Enter</kbd> abo <kbd>Space</kbd> přewjedźe nastajene kliknjenje.</p>","<p>Choose <span class='knopfwort'>Week</span> in the three-part calendar switch. The title always names the ISO calendar week and the date range, independently of the optional week-number columns in Month and Planner.</p><h3>Seven days on two pages</h3><p>The first three days of the displayed week are arranged one below another on the left. The next two are on the right, with the final two in narrower boxes beneath them. A new installation starts the week on Monday; imported or future regional settings can start it on another day. The ISO week number itself is still calculated by the ISO rule.</p><p>A normal day box shows at most four appointments and each of the two narrow boxes at most two. All-day appointments come first. <span class='knopfwort'>+ more</span> opens that date in the day view so that nothing remains hidden. Public holidays, school holidays, anniversaries, day markers and weather appear above the appointments where applicable.</p><h3>Clicking and turning</h3><p>Click an appointment to edit it. Clicking a free part of a day box either creates an appointment immediately or opens the day view, according to <span class='knopfwort'>Settings ▸ Calendar ▸ Clicking a day</span>. The dog-ears and the header arrows move exactly one week backward or forward.</p><p>The separate setting <span class='knopfwort'>Show week numbers in the planner</span> adds a <span class='knopfwort'>CW</span> column to the twelve small months only while Planner is enabled. Printed monthly Planner calendars and their ODS sheets always contain calendar weeks; the switch controls the normal on-screen Planner.</p><div class='merke'><b>Past days</b>The calendar can omit appointments, and optionally anniversaries and school holidays, on dates before today. It never removes them from storage. See page <b data-page='calendar-hiding-entries' class='knopfwort'></b>.</div><p><b>With the keyboard:</b> Arrow keys move to neighboring dates. If the target lies outside this week, the Organizer turns the page and keeps that date focused. <kbd>Page Up</kbd> and <kbd>Page Down</kbd> move one week.</p>":"<p>Wubjerće <span class='knopfwort'>Tydźeń</span>. Titul přeco ISO-tydźeń a datumowy wobłuk mjenuje, njewotwisnje wot opcionalnych słupow.</p><h3>Sydom dnjow na dwěmaj stronomaj</h3><p>Prěnje tři dny su nalěwo pod sobu, přichodnej dwaj naprawo a poslednej dwaj we wušimaj polomaj pod nima. Nowa instalacija započina póndźelu; regionalne nastajenja móža druhi dźeń wubrać. ISO-čisło so dale po ISO-prawidle wobliči.</p><p>Normalne polo pokazuje maksimalnje štyri terminy, wuskej po dwaj. Cyłodnjowe su prěnje. <span class='knopfwort'>+ dalše</span> wočini dnjowy napohlad. Swjate dny, prózdniny, róčnicy, dnjowe marki a wjedro su nad terminami.</p><h3>Kliknjenje a listowanje</h3><p>Termin klikńće za wobdźěłanje. Swobodne městno po <span class='knopfwort'>Nastajenja ▸ Protyka ▸ Kliknjenje na dźeń</span> termin wutwori abo dźeń wočini. Róžkaj a šipki pohibujetej eksaktnje wo tydźeń.</p><p><span class='knopfwort'>Čisła tydźenjow w planowaku pokazać</span> přidawa słup <span class='knopfwort'>CW</span> jenož na wobrazowkowy Planowak. Ćišćane měsacne protyki a ODS přeco protykowe tydźenje wobsahuja.</p><div class='merke'><b>Minjene dny</b>Protyka móže terminy a opcionalnje róčnicy a prózdniny před dźensa wuwostajić, ale je ze składa njezhaša. Hlejće <b data-page='calendar-hiding-entries' class='knopfwort'></b>.</div><p><b>Z tastaturu:</b> Šipki dźědu k susodnym datumam. Zwonka tydźenja Organizer listuje a datum fokusowany wostanje. <kbd>Page Up</kbd> a <kbd>Page Down</kbd> pohibujetej wo tydźeń.</p>","<p>Choose the way that suits your system. Every way leads to the same program with the same data format, so you can move a data set from one system to another later.</p><h3>Debian, Ubuntu and Linux Mint</h3><p>Right-click the downloaded <b>.deb</b> file in the file manager, choose <span class='knopfwort'>Open with GDebi Package Installer</span>, and click <span class='knopfwort'>Install Package</span>. Alternatively, open a terminal in the download folder and enter <i>sudo apt install ./magnolie-organizer_2.0.4_all.deb</i>. The <i>./</i> before the file name is important — without it the package manager looks for a package of that name on the internet instead of using your file.</p><h3>Fedora and other RPM systems</h3><p>Double-click the downloaded RPM to open Software, or install it from the download folder with <i>sudo dnf install ./magnolie-organizer-2.0.4-1.noarch.rpm</i>. An <i>.src.rpm</i> is source material rather than the application itself: install the build tool with <i>sudo dnf install rpm-build</i>, rebuild the source package with <i>rpmbuild --rebuild magnolie-organizer-2.0.4-1.src.rpm</i>, and install the resulting package from <i>~/rpmbuild/RPMS/noarch/</i>.</p><h3>Any other distribution</h3><p>If neither a DEB nor an RPM fits your system, use the AppImage. It needs no package manager and no administrator rights; page <b data-page='the-appimage' class='knopfwort'></b> describes it.</p><h3>Windows</h3><p>Download <i>Magnolie-Organizer-Windows-2.0.4-Setup-x64.exe</i> and double-click it.</p><ol class='schritte'><li>Confirm the welcome page with <span class='knopfwort'>Next</span>.</li><li>Accept the proposed program folder under your local application-data folder, or select another program folder.</li><li>Leave <b>User handbook</b> selected if this book should be installed as well.</li><li>Select the desktop shortcut if required.</li><li>Click <span class='knopfwort'>Install</span>.</li></ol><p>The installation applies only to your Windows account and needs no administrator rights. A <b>Magnolie Organizer</b> folder is created in the Start menu. There is also a plain ZIP archive for people who would rather not install anything: unpack it anywhere and start <i>Magnolie Organizer.exe</i>.</p><h3>Android</h3><p>Magnolie Notes is installed from an APK file. Page <b data-page='android-apk-transfer' class='knopfwort'></b> explains how to get the file onto the phone, and page <b data-page='android-apk-install-update' class='knopfwort'></b> how to install and update it safely.</p><div class='achtung'><b>Use the package manager, and keep the folders apart</b>On Linux, <i>apt</i> and <i>dnf</i> install the required and recommended additional components as well. On Windows, do not install the program into <i>%LOCALAPPDATA%\\Magnolie Organizer</i> — that folder is reserved for your personal data and settings.</div>":"<p>Wubjerće puć za swój system. Wšě puće wodźa k samemu programej a datowemu formatej, tuž móžeće daty pozdźišo přesunyć.</p><h3>Debian, Ubuntu a Linux Mint</h3><p>Klikńće z prawej tastu na <b>.deb</b>, wubjerće <span class='knopfwort'>Z GDebi wočinić</span> a <span class='knopfwort'>Pakćik instalować</span>. Abo zapodajće w sćehnjenskim rjadowaku <i>sudo apt install ./magnolie-organizer_2.0.4_all.deb</i>. <i>./</i> je wažne, hewak pyta zrjadowak online-pakćik.</p><h3>Fedora a RPM-systemy</h3><p>Klikńće dwójce na RPM abo wužijće <i>sudo dnf install ./magnolie-organizer-2.0.4-1.noarch.rpm</i>. <i>.src.rpm</i> je žórło: instalujće <i>sudo dnf install rpm-build</i>, twarće z <i>rpmbuild --rebuild magnolie-organizer-2.0.4-1.src.rpm</i> a instalujće pakćik z <i>~/rpmbuild/RPMS/noarch/</i>.</p><h3>Druha distribucija</h3><p>Bjez přihódneho DEB/RPM wužijće AppImage. Njetrjeba zrjadowak ani administratorske prawa; hlejće <b data-page='the-appimage' class='knopfwort'></b>.</p><h3>Windows</h3><p>Sćehńće <i>Magnolie-Organizer-Windows-2.0.4-Setup-x64.exe</i> a klikńće dwójce.</p><ol class='schritte'><li>Wobkrućće z <span class='knopfwort'>Dale</span>.</li><li>Akceptujće programowy rjadowak abo druhi wubjerće.</li><li>Wostajće <b>Wužiwarska přiručka</b> wubranu, jeli ma so instalować.</li><li>Wubjerće desktopowy wotkaz po potrjebje.</li><li>Klikńće na <span class='knopfwort'>Instalować</span>.</li></ol><p>Instalacija płaći jenož za waše konto a njetrjeba administratora. Rjadowak <b>Magnolie Organizer</b> nastanje w startowym meniju. ZIP-warianta da so něhdźe rozpakować a z <i>Magnolie Organizer.exe</i> startować.</p><h3>Android</h3><p>Magnolie Notes so z APK instaluje. Strona <b data-page='android-apk-transfer' class='knopfwort'></b> přenjesenje a <b data-page='android-apk-install-update' class='knopfwort'></b> instalaciju a aktualizaciju wopisuje.</p><div class='achtung'><b>Pakćikowy zrjadowak wužiwać a rjadowaki dźělić</b>Pod Linux instalujetej <i>apt</i> a <i>dnf</i> tež komponenty. Pod Windows njeinstalujće do <i>%LOCALAPPDATA%\\Magnolie Organizer</i>; tutón rjadowak je za wosobinske daty a nastajenja.</div>","<p>Click <span class='knopfwort'>SMS</span> on the contact card. A sheet opens that holds the whole conversation with this person.</p><h3>What the sheet contains</h3><ul><li>At the top the name, a small <span class='knopfwort'>SMS</span> button and <span class='knopfwort'>Close</span>.</li><li>Underneath two rows. <span class='knopfwort'>Phone number</span> chooses among the mobile numbers of this contact. <span class='knopfwort'>Phone</span> names the connection used; it is always KDE Connect.</li><li>In the middle the history. The oldest message is at the top, the newest at the bottom, and a date line separates the days.</li><li>At the bottom the writing field <span class='knopfwort'>Message text</span> and the button <span class='knopfwort'>Send SMS</span>.</li></ul><h3>The little marks</h3><p>Only messages you sent yourself carry a mark beside the time. It reports how far the message has travelled: <b>◷</b> <span class='knopfwort'>Queued</span>, <b>✓</b> <span class='knopfwort'>Submitted</span> or <span class='knopfwort'>Sent</span>, <b>✓✓</b> <span class='knopfwort'>Delivered</span>, <b>⚠</b> <span class='knopfwort'>Failed</span>. Resting the mouse on a mark shows the word.</p><div class='merke'><b>Each number has its own history</b>If you change the entry in <span class='knopfwort'>Phone number</span>, a different conversation appears. Nothing is lost; the other history simply belongs to the other number.</div>":"<p>Klikńće <span class='knopfwort'>SMS</span> na kontakće, zo byšće rozmołwu wočinili.</p><h3>Wobsah łopjena</h3><ul><li>Mjeno, małe <span class='knopfwort'>SMS</span> a <span class='knopfwort'>Začinić</span>.</li><li><span class='knopfwort'>Telefonowe čisło</span> a <span class='knopfwort'>Telefon</span>, přeco KDE Connect.</li><li>Historija wot najstaršeje k najnowšej.</li><li><span class='knopfwort'>Powěsćowy tekst</span> a <span class='knopfwort'>SMS pósłać</span>.</li></ul><h3>Małe marki</h3><p><b>◷</b> <span class='knopfwort'>W čakanskim rjedźe</span>, <b>✓</b> <span class='knopfwort'>Wotpósłane</span> abo <span class='knopfwort'>Pósłane</span>, <b>✓✓</b> <span class='knopfwort'>Doručene</span>, <b>⚠</b> <span class='knopfwort'>Njeporadźiło</span>. Myška wopis pokazuje.</p><div class='merke'><b>Kóžde čisło ma swójsku historiju</b>Změna <span class='knopfwort'>Telefonowe čisło</span> druhu rozmołwu pokazuje.</div>","<p>Colored tabs run down the right-hand edge of the book. Calendar is always available. Under <span class='knopfwort'>Settings ▸ General ▸ Tabs</span>, you can show or hide Tasks, Contacts, Notes, Anniversaries, Planner and Health individually. All six are visible at first.</p><p>A change takes effect immediately. If you hide the section that is open, the Organizer returns to Calendar. Nothing is deleted: showing the section again restores its tab and all its entries. Controls that belong only to a hidden section may disappear as well; for example, hiding Contacts removes the Contacts settings tab.</p><h3>Finding a visible section</h3><p>If Calendar is the only section, no tab is needed and the tab strip disappears. With two, three or four visible sections, the labels run from top to bottom so that they still fit. Click a tab, or hold <kbd>Ctrl</kbd> and press the number of a visible section. Hidden sections are skipped, so the numbers always follow the current visible order.</p><h3>Make keyboard focus visible</h3><p>Open <span class='knopfwort'>Settings ▸ General ▸ Accessibility</span> and enable <span class='knopfwort'>Accessibility helper frame</span> if you use the keyboard. It is off initially. When enabled, a solid frame shows the control reached with <kbd>Tab</kbd> or the arrow keys. The keyboard continues to work while the frame is off, but the current control may then have no visible outline. <kbd>Ctrl</kbd>+<kbd>Alt</kbd>+<kbd>H</kbd> switches the frame at any time and saves the choice.</p><h3>Calendar buttons in date fields</h3><p><span class='knopfwort'>Show calendar button in date fields</span> changes ordinary date fields to the calendar control supplied by the display component. Leave it off if you prefer segmented text entry: eight digits enter day, month and year, <kbd>Tab</kbd> moves between the parts, and the mouse wheel changes the selected part. Appointment start and end dates, dates that may omit the year, and Health dates deliberately remain text fields.</p><div class='merke'><b>Complete keyboard table</b>Page <b data-page='keyboard-shortcuts-at-a-glance' class='knopfwort'></b> lists the keys for calendars, dialogs, writing and search.</div>":"<p>Barbne rajtarki běža po prawym kromje. Protyka je přeco k dispoziciji. Pod <span class='knopfwort'>Nastajenja ▸ Powšitkowne ▸ Rajtarki</span> móžeće Nadawki, Kontakty, Notice, Róčnicy, Planowak a Strowotu pokazać abo schować. Spočatnje su wšitke widźomne.</p><p>Změna płaći hnydom. Schowaće-li wočinjenu sekciju, wróći so Organizer k Protyce. Ničo so njezhaša; zaso pokazana sekcija ma wšitke zapiski. Tež přisłušne elementy móža zmiznyć, na přikład kontaktowy nastajenski rajtark.</p><h3>Widźomny wotrězk namakać</h3><p>Při samej Protyce rajtarki zmiznu. Při dwěmaj, třoch abo štyrjoch běža popisy zwjercha dele. Klikńće rajtark abo dźeržće <kbd>Ctrl</kbd> a tłóčće čisło widźomneho wotrězka. Schowane so přeskoča.</p><h3>Fokus tastatury pokazać</h3><p>Pod <span class='knopfwort'>Nastajenja ▸ Powšitkowne ▸ Přistupnosć</span> zmóžńće <span class='knopfwort'>Pomocna ramika přistupnosće</span>. Spočatnje je wupinjena. Solidna ramika pokazuje element docpěty z <kbd>Tab</kbd> abo šipkami. Tastatura funguje tež bjez ramiki. <kbd>Ctrl</kbd>+<kbd>Alt</kbd>+<kbd>H</kbd> ju přepina a wuběr składuje.</p><h3>Protykowe tłóčatka w datumowych polach</h3><p><span class='knopfwort'>Protykowe tłóčatko w datumowych polach pokazać</span> zwyčajne pola na protykowy element pokazowanskeje komponenty změni. Wostajće wupinjene za dźěleny tekst: wosom ličbow zapoda dźeń, měsac a lěto, <kbd>Tab</kbd> dźe mjez dźělemi a kolesko dźěl změni. Započatne a kónčne datumy terminow, datumy bjez lěta a strowotne datumy wostanu tekstowe.</p><div class='merke'><b>Dospołna tabela tastow</b>Strona <b data-page='keyboard-shortcuts-at-a-glance' class='knopfwort'></b> nalistuje tasće za protyki, dialogi, pisanje a pytanje.</div>","<p>Contact synchronization is an optional permission for one confirmed trusted <b>Magnolienbaum</b> branch. Enable it for that partner and start <span class='knopfwort'>Synchronize contacts</span> manually. It is not part of <b>Synchronize everything</b>, Personal Sync, or automatic Wi-Fi runs.</p><p>Names, company, numbers, addresses, note, birthday, and supported photos can travel directly. Stable bindings identify linked contacts; empty remote fields do not erase local values, and uncertain duplicates require review.</p><div class='achtung'><b>Android contacts are separate</b>Android requests contact read/write access only when enabled or run. Shared contacts are not phone-pairing data.</div>":"<p>Kontaktsynchronisierung ist eine optionale Berechtigung für einen bestätigten vertrauenswürdigen <b>Magnolienbaum</b>-Zweig. Aktivieren Sie es für diesen Partner und starten Sie <span class='knopfwort'>Kontakte synchronisieren</span> manuell. Es ist nicht Teil von <b>Alles synchronisieren</b>, Personal Sync oder automatischen WLAN-Ausführungen.</p><p>Namen, Unternehmen, Nummern, Adressen, Notizen, Geburtstage und unterstützte Fotos können direkt übertragen werden. Stabile Bindungen identifizieren verknüpfte Kontakte; Leere Remote-Felder löschen lokale Werte nicht und unsichere Duplikate müssen überprüft werden.</p><div class='achtung'><b>Android-Kontakte sind separat</b>Android fordert den Kontakt-Lese-/Schreibzugriff nur an, wenn er aktiviert oder ausgeführt wird. Bei freigegebenen Kontakten handelt es sich nicht um Daten zur Telefonkopplung.</div>","<p>Delegation belongs to <b>Magnolienbaum sharing</b>, not Personal Sync. Choose a confirmed branch under <b>Delegate to</b> and confirm the offer. The recipient accepts or rejects a new task according to that branch's trust setting.</p><p>The recipient may report completion to the creator. A delegated task is not an own task and is excluded from <b>personal_tasks_sync</b>. Removing an own-phone pairing does not remove a branch, delegation, or completion history.</p><div class='merke'><b>Separate relationships</b>A Magnolienbaum branch represents another person or workgroup. <b>own_device</b> represents your one personal phone.</div>":"<p>Delegation gehört zur <b>Magnolienbaum-Freigabe</b>, nicht zur persönlichen Synchronisierung. Wählen Sie unter <b>Delegieren an</b> eine bestätigte Filiale aus und bestätigen Sie das Angebot. Der Empfänger akzeptiert oder lehnt eine neue Aufgabe entsprechend der Vertrauenseinstellung dieses Zweigs ab.</p><p>Der Empfänger kann den Abschluss dem Ersteller melden. Eine delegierte Aufgabe ist keine eigene Aufgabe und wird von <b>personal_tasks_sync</b> ausgeschlossen. Durch das Entfernen einer Kopplung mit dem eigenen Telefon wird kein Zweig, keine Delegation oder kein Abschlussverlauf entfernt.</p><div class='merke'><b>Getrennte Beziehungen</b>Ein Magnolienbaum-Zweig repräsentiert eine andere Person oder Arbeitsgruppe. <b>own_device</b> stellt Ihr einziges persönliches Telefon dar.</div>","<p>Hiding a window and ending the Organizer are different actions. The tray applet offers a separate choice for each.</p><ul><li><b>Hide in the tray when minimized</b> – the minimize button removes the window from the taskbar while the process keeps running.</li><li><b>Minimize to the tray when closed</b> – the window's close button hides it instead of ending the process.</li><li><b>Quit</b> – the tray menu saves pending changes and ends the process completely.</li></ul><p>While the Organizer is hidden, tray functions, telephone connections and services belonging to the running process remain available. If you disable the tray applet while the window is hidden, the native application brings the window back so that it cannot become unreachable.</p><h3>Safe shutdown</h3><p>When the program is really ended, it asks the open editor to finish or discard its change and waits for pending data to be saved. If saving fails, the Organizer remains open and reports <span class='knopfwort'>Saving failed!</span>; correct the cause and close it again. Do not terminate it forcibly while that warning is present.</p><div class='achtung'><b>Reminders after quitting</b>Under Windows, reminders require the Organizer process and stop after <span class='knopfwort'>Quit</span> until the next start or sign-in. Linux can use its separate reminder monitor, so ending the main window does not necessarily stop scheduled reminders.</div>":"<p>Wokno schować a Organizer skónčić stej rozdźělnej akciji. Systemowy applet poskića:</p><ul><li><b>Při minimizowanju do systemoweho pola schować</b> – proces běži dale, wokno z lajsty zmiznje.</li><li><b>Při začinjenju do systemoweho pola minimizować</b> – začinjenske tłóčatko wokno schowa město skónčenja.</li><li><b>Skónčić</b> – meni změny składuje a proces dospołnje skónči.</li></ul><p>Při schowanym Organizerje wostanu applet, telefonowe zwiski a procesowe słužby k dispoziciji. Wupinjenje appleta při schowanym woknje wokno zaso přinjese.</p><h3>Wěsće skónčić</h3><p>Program prosy wo dokónčenje abo zaćisnjenje wočinjeneje změny a čaka na składowanje. Při zmylku wostanje wočinjene a zdźěli <span class='knopfwort'>Składowanje je so njeporadźiło!</span>; porjedźće přičinu a začińće znowa. Při warnowanju proces njewusylujće.</p><div class='achtung'><b>Dopominanja po skónčenju</b>Pod Windows trjebaja proces a po <span class='knopfwort'>Skónčić</span> hač do starta abo přizjewjenja zastanu. Linux móže separatny monitor wužiwać, tuž skónčenje wokna planowane dopominanja nutnje njezastaji.</div>","<p>If a contact has several numbers that can be called, the Organizer does not decide for you.</p><ol class='schritte'><li>Click <span class='knopfwort'>Call</span> on the card.</li><li>A sheet headed <span class='knopfwort'>Choose a phone number to call</span> opens.</li><li>Every number stands on its own button, with its kind in front of it: <span class='knopfwort'>Mobile</span>, <span class='knopfwort'>Work phone</span>, <span class='knopfwort'>Home phone</span> or <span class='knopfwort'>Private</span>.</li><li>Click the number you want. If you have thought better of it, use <span class='knopfwort'>Close</span>.</li></ol><p>With only one callable number the sheet is skipped and dialling begins at once.</p><h3>The same for SMS</h3><p>If several mobile numbers are stored and SMS does not run over KDE Connect, a like sheet appears headed <span class='knopfwort'>Choose a mobile number</span>.</p><div class='merke'><b>The dialling happens on the telephone</b>The Organizer sends the request to Magnolie Notes. The current Android implementation uses <b>TelecomManager.placeCall</b> directly instead of merely opening the system dialer, so there is no general promise of another dialer confirmation. Should no suitable telephone be online, a sheet <span class='knopfwort'>Phone call</span> appears and says so plainly.</div>":"<p>Jeli kontakt ma wjacore zawołujomne čisła, Organizer za was njerozsudźi.</p><ol class='schritte'><li>Klikńće <span class='knopfwort'>Zawołać</span> na karće.</li><li>Łopjeno z nadpismom <span class='knopfwort'>Telefonowe čisło za zawołanje wubrać</span> so wočini.</li><li>Kóžde čisło ma swójske tłóčatko z druhom před nim: <span class='knopfwort'>Mobilny</span>, <span class='knopfwort'>Słužbny telefon</span>, <span class='knopfwort'>Domjacy telefon</span> abo <span class='knopfwort'>Priwatny</span>.</li><li>Klikńće požadane čisło. Jeli sće so přemyslili, wužijće <span class='knopfwort'>Začinić</span>.</li></ol><p>Při jenož jednym zawołujomnym čisle so łopjeno přeskoči a zawołanje hnydom započina.</p><h3>Samsne za SMS</h3><p>Jeli je wjacore mobilne čisła składowane a SMS njeběži přez KDE Connect, so podobne łopjeno z nadpismom <span class='knopfwort'>Mobilne čisło wubrać</span> zjewi.</p><div class='merke'><b>Zawołanje so na telefonje stawa</b>Organizer naprašowanje do Magnolie Notes pósćele. Aktualna Androidowa implementacija <b>TelecomManager.placeCall</b> direktnje wužiwa, město zo by jenož systemowy wólak wočiniła; dalše wólakowe wobkrućenje tuž njeje powšitkownje zaručene. Jeli žadyn přihódny telefon online njeje, so łopjeno <span class='knopfwort'>Telefonowe zawołanje</span> zjewi a to jasnje zdźěli.</div>","<p>If the other branch stands in a different house, the network search cannot reach it. Then both sides need each other's public address.</p><ol class='schritte'><li>Open <span class='knopfwort'>Settings ▸ Magnolia tree</span>.</li><li>Click <span class='knopfwort'>Via internet</span>. A box opens.</li><li>Wait until <b>Own internet IP</b> shows your address. Read it out to the other person, together with your <b>Fingerprint</b>.</li><li>Enter the other side's address into <b>Internet IP</b> and their fingerprint into <b>Fingerprint</b>.</li><li>Click <span class='knopfwort'>Send secure request</span>.</li></ol><p>Then the six-digit code appears, exactly as for a connection inside your own network. Confirm it on both computers.</p><p>The button <span class='knopfwort'>Hide internet access</span> closes the box again.</p><div class='achtung'><b>The router has to allow it</b>For IPv4 the port 8737 may have to be forwarded in the router. With some contracts (CGNAT) that is impossible. For IPv6 the port must be allowed in the router firewall and in the computer firewall. Ask whoever looks after your router.</div>":"<p>Hałuz w druhim domje trjeba zjawnu adresu.</p><ol class='schritte'><li>Wočińće <span class='knopfwort'>Nastajenja ▸ Magnolienbaum</span>.</li><li>Klikńće <span class='knopfwort'>Přez internet</span>.</li><li>Wobstarajće <b>Swójsku internetowu IP</b> a <b>Palčikowy wotćišć</b>.</li><li>Zapodajće druhu <b>Internetowu IP</b> a <b>Palčikowy wotćišć</b>.</li><li>Klikńće <span class='knopfwort'>Wěste naprašowanje pósłać</span>.</li></ol><p>Přirunajće šěsćměstnowy kod na woběmaj ličakomaj.</p><p><span class='knopfwort'>Internetowy přistup schować</span> kašćik začini.</p><div class='achtung'><b>Router dyrbi dowolić</b>IPv4 móže port 8737 trjebać; CGNAT to znjemóžnja. Při IPv6 dowolće port we firewallomaj routera a ličaka.</div>","<p>If you do not want everyone who uses the computer to see your Calendar, protect the Organizer with a password or numeric code.</p><ol class='schritte'><li>Open <span class='knopfwort'>Settings ▸ Security</span>.</li><li>Under <b>Password or numeric code</b>, enter your choice. Four characters are accepted, but that minimum is weak; use a long, unique passphrase.</li><li>Enter the same password or code again in the field below.</li><li>Click <span class='knopfwort'>Enable password protection</span> and confirm the prompt.</li></ol><p>From now on, the Organizer asks for it when you open the book. A sheet appears with a magnolia blossom and a <b>numeric keypad</b>. Enter the digits with the mouse or keyboard; Backspace deletes a digit and Enter unlocks the Organizer. For a password containing letters, switch to the other option below.</p><p>Your data is encrypted with AES-256-GCM. The password key uses PBKDF2-HMAC-SHA-256 with a random salt and 240,000 rounds. New local backups use the protection in effect when they are created; older files may retain their previous protection and password. External backups have a separate password (page <b data-page='backing-up-and-restoring' class='knopfwort'></b>).</p><h3>Changing or removing the password</h3><p>When the Organizer is unlocked, <span class='knopfwort'>Change password</span> and <span class='knopfwort'>Remove password protection</span> are available. To change the password, enter the new one twice; removing protection requires confirmation. Neither action changes the passwords of external backups.</p><div class='achtung'><b>Keep a recoverable copy</b>No password offers an absolute guarantee. Anyone who copies an encrypted file can try guesses offline, and short codes are especially vulnerable; the on-screen failed-attempt delay does not protect a copied file. If a strong passphrase is forgotten and no usable backup exists, neither the author nor a service can recover the data. Store the passphrase separately and keep tested backups.</div><div class='merke'><b>After three failed attempts</b>the Organizer waits five minutes before allowing another attempt in the app. This delay remains after a restart, but it is not an encryption property or an offline-guessing defense.</div>":"<p>Jeli nima kóždy wužiwar ličaka wašu protyku widźeć, škitajće Organizer z hesłom abo ličbowym kodom.</p><ol class='schritte'><li>Wočińće <span class='knopfwort'>Nastajenja ▸ Wěstota</span>.</li><li>Pod <b>Hesło abo ličbowy kod</b> zapodajće swój wuběr. Štyri znamješka so akceptuja, ale tutón minimum je słaby; wužijće dołhu, jónkróćnu hesłowu sadu.</li><li>Zapodajće samsne hesło abo kod do pola deleka.</li><li>Klikńće <span class='knopfwort'>Hesłowy škit zmóžnić</span> a wobkrućće prašenje.</li></ol><p>Wotnětka Organizer při wočinjenju knihy wo nim prosy. Łopjeno z magnolijowym kwětkom a <b>ličbowej tastaturu</b> so zjewi. Zapodajće ličby z myšu abo tastaturu; Backspace jednu ličbu zhaša a Enter Organizer wotblokuje. Za hesło z pismikami přepińće k druhej móžnosći deleka.</p><p>Waše daty su z AES-256-GCM zaklučowane. Hesłowy kluč wužiwa PBKDF2-HMAC-SHA-256 z připadnej solu a 240.000 kołami. Nowe lokalne zawěsćenja wužiwa škit, kotryž při wutworjenju płaći; starše dataje móža swój předchadny škit a hesło wobchować. Eksterne zawěsćenja maja separatne hesło (strona <b data-page='backing-up-and-restoring' class='knopfwort'></b>).</p><h3>Hesło změnić abo wotstronić</h3><p>Při wotblokowanym Organizeru stej <span class='knopfwort'>Hesło změnić</span> a <span class='knopfwort'>Hesłowy škit wotstronić</span> k dispoziciji. Za změnu zapodajće nowe hesło dwójce; wotstronjenje škita trjeba wobkrućenje. Žana akcija hesła eksternych zawěsćenjow njezměni.</p><div class='achtung'><b>Wobnowjomnu kopiju wobchować</b>Žane hesło absolutnu zawěsćenje njedawa. Kóždy, kiž zaklučowanu dataju kopěruje, móže offline hesła wuspytać; krótke kody su wosebje słabe a komdźenje njewuspěšnych pospytow na wobrazowce kopěrowanu dataju nješkita. Při zabytej sylnej hesłowej sadźe bjez wužiwomneho zawěsćenja njemóže awtor ani słužba daty wobnowić. Wobchowajće hesłowu sadu separatnje a dźeržće přepruwowane zawěsćenja.</div><div class='merke'><b>Po třoch njewuspěšnych pospytach</b>Organizer pjeć mjeńšin čaka, prjedy hač dalši pospyt w nałoženju dowoli. Komdźenje po nowym starće wostanje, ale njeje kajkosć zaklučowanja ani škit přećiwo wuspyćej offline.</div>","<p>If you have kept your calendar in <b>Lotus Organizer</b> on Windows for decades, you can bring everything with you. The transfer uses files in CSV format.</p><h3>In Lotus Organizer</h3><ol class='schritte'><li>Open Lotus Organizer and go to the section you want to export, such as the calendar.</li><li>Select <i>File ▸ Export</i>.</li><li>Select <i>Delimited ASCII file</i> or <i>CSV</i> as the format.</li><li>Name the file, for example <i>appointments.csv</i>, and save it where the Organizer can reach it — a USB drive if you are moving to another computer.</li><li>Repeat these steps for <i>Contacts</i>, <i>Tasks</i>, <i>Anniversaries</i>, and <i>Notes</i>.</li></ol><h3>In Magnolie Organizer</h3><ol class='schritte'><li>Make the files reachable; insert the USB drive if you used one.</li><li>Open <span class='knopfwort'>Settings ▸ Import</span> and click <span class='knopfwort'>Lotus Organizer CSV …</span>.</li><li>Select the first file.</li><li>Repeat this for each remaining file.</li></ol><p>The Organizer identifies the section represented by each file from its header, so you do not have to specify it. Different column names, commas, semicolons, tabs, vertical bars, and the Windows character set with its accented characters pose no problem. The Organizer understands separate date and time columns, German, ISO, and US date formats, AM/PM times, German month names, and date serial numbers from spreadsheet programs.</p><div class='beispiel'><b>How much can it handle?</b>Imports of up to 30,000 appointments, 30,000 contacts, 30,000 tasks, 30,000 notes, and 30,000 anniversaries have been tested. Even collections of this size are imported quickly.</div>":"<p>Jeli sće protyku w <b>Lotus Organizer</b> pod Windows lětdźesatki wjedli, móžeće wšitko přenjesć. Wuměna wužiwa CSV.</p><h3>W Lotus Organizer</h3><ol class='schritte'><li>Wočińće Lotus Organizer a eksportowany wotrězk.</li><li>Wubjerće <i>Dataja ▸ Eksport</i>.</li><li>Wubjerće <i>Delimited ASCII file</i> abo <i>CSV</i>.</li><li>Pomjenujće dataju, na př. <i>appointments.csv</i>, a składujće ju docpějomnje, při druhim ličaku na USB.</li><li>Zopakujće za <i>Kontakty</i>, <i>Nadawki</i>, <i>Róčnicy</i> a <i>Notice</i>.</li></ol><h3>W Magnolie Organizer</h3><ol class='schritte'><li>Přistupńće dataje a zasadźće USB.</li><li>Wočińće <span class='knopfwort'>Nastajenja ▸ Import</span> a <span class='knopfwort'>Lotus Organizer CSV …</span>.</li><li>Wubjerće prěnju dataju.</li><li>Zopakujće za zbytek.</li></ol><p>Organizer wotrězk po hłowje spóznaje. Rozdźělne słupowe mjena, komy, semikolony, tabulatory, smužki a Windowsowe znamješka njejsu problem. Rozumi separatne datumowe a časowe słupy, němske, ISO- a US-formaty, AM/PM, němske měsacy a serielne datumowe ličby tabelow.</p><div class='beispiel'><b>Kelko?</b>Hač do 30.000 terminow, kontaktow, nadawkow, noticow a róčnicow je testowane; tež tajke zběrki so spěšnje importuja.</div>","<p>In Magnolie Notes, open the Magnolie phone connection and enable only the required switches: <span class='knopfwort'>Share incoming call status</span>, <span class='knopfwort'>Share caller number when available</span>, and <span class='knopfwort'>Allow answering calls from the computer</span>. Status is required before the other two can be useful; every grant remains separate.</p><h3>When somebody calls</h3><p>The Organizer shows an incoming-call message. The caller number may be blank because it was withheld, Android did not provide it, or the number permission was not granted. Use <span class='knopfwort'>Answer</span>, <span class='knopfwort'>Hang up</span>, or <span class='knopfwort'>Minimize</span>. After minimizing, <span class='knopfwort'>Active call</span> brings the call sheet back.</p><p>Android API level, telephone role, permissions, telephony support, and manufacturer changes can make individual controls unavailable or unsuccessful. A displayed submitted action means the request was handed over, not that every device completed it.</p><div class='achtung'><b>Control is not conversation audio</b>The Magnolie connection carries status and commands only. Without a separately configured Bluetooth HFP hands-free audio connection, conversation sound remains on the telephone.</div>":"<p>Wočińće w Magnolie Notes telefonowy zwisk a zmóžńće jenož trěbne přepinaki: <span class='knopfwort'>Staw dochadźaceho zawołanja dźělić</span>, <span class='knopfwort'>Čisło zawołarja dźělić, jeli je k dispoziciji</span> a <span class='knopfwort'>Přiwzaće zawołanjow z ličaka dowolić</span>. Staw je zakład za druhej; kóžda dowolnosć wostanje separatna.</p><h3>Hdyž něchtó zawoła</h3><p>Organizer pokazuje powěsć. Čisło móže prózdne być, dokelž je zatajene, Android jo njepoda abo dowolnosć faluje. Wužijće <span class='knopfwort'>Přiwzać</span>, <span class='knopfwort'>Połožić</span> abo <span class='knopfwort'>Minimizować</span>. Potom <span class='knopfwort'>Aktualne zawołanje</span> łopjeno wróći.</p><p>Androidowy API, telefonowa róla, dowolnosće, podpěra a změny zhotowjerja móža elementy znjemóžnić. Zdźělena akcija jenož přepodanje požadanja wobkruća, nic wuspěch na kóždym graće.</p><div class='achtung'><b>Wodźenje njeje zynk rozmołwy</b>Zwisk Magnolie přenošuje jenož staw a přikazy. Bjez separatneho Bluetooth HFP-zwiska wostanje zynk na telefonje.</div>","<p>In the history each message sits in its own bubble. The bubble shows only the text and the time. Everything else is kept out of the way, so that the conversation stays readable.</p><div class='merke'><b>Right-click opens the details</b>Click the bubble with the <b>right</b> mouse button. A sheet headed <span class='knopfwort'>SMS details</span> opens. A normal left click does nothing here.</div><h3>What the sheet reports</h3><ul><li><span class='knopfwort'>Date</span> – the full day and the time to the second.</li><li><span class='knopfwort'>Direction</span> – <span class='knopfwort'>Incoming</span> or <span class='knopfwort'>Outgoing</span>.</li><li><span class='knopfwort'>Phone number</span> – the number this message belongs to.</li><li><span class='knopfwort'>Phone</span> – the way it took, that is KDE Connect.</li><li><span class='knopfwort'>Status</span> – the same word that the little mark stands for.</li><li><span class='knopfwort'>Error</span> – only present when something went wrong. Here stands the plain reason.</li></ul><p>Click <span class='knopfwort'>Close</span> to put the sheet away. Nothing is changed by looking.</p><div class='beispiel'>A message carries the mark <b>⚠</b>. You right-click it, read under <span class='knopfwort'>Error</span> what the phone reported, and can now write the message anew.</div>":"<p>Kóžda powěsć je we swojej bunce z tekstom a časom.</p><div class='merke'><b>Prawe kliknjenje podrobnosće wočini</b>Klikńće bunku z <b>prawej</b> tastu. Wočini so <span class='knopfwort'>SMS-podrobnosće</span>.</div><h3>Što łopjeno zdźěluje</h3><ul><li><span class='knopfwort'>Datum</span> – dźeń a čas.</li><li><span class='knopfwort'>Směr</span> – <span class='knopfwort'>Dochadźace</span> abo <span class='knopfwort'>Wotchadźace</span>.</li><li><span class='knopfwort'>Telefonowe čisło</span>.</li><li><span class='knopfwort'>Telefon</span> – KDE Connect.</li><li><span class='knopfwort'>Staw</span>.</li><li><span class='knopfwort'>Zmylk</span> – přičina při problemje.</li></ul><p>Z <span class='knopfwort'>Začinić</span> łopjeno začiniće.</p><div class='beispiel'>Při <b>⚠</b> klikńće prawje a čitajće <span class='knopfwort'>Zmylk</span>.</div>","<p>In the month view, the dog-ears move one month at a time; in the week view, one week at a time; and in the day view, two days at a time. Lists such as Tasks, Contacts and Notes scroll instead of turning pages.</p><h3>The header</h3><p>The <span class='knopfwort'>&lsaquo;</span> and <span class='knopfwort'>&rsaquo;</span> arrows move backward and forward. Hold one down to continue automatically. A normal click on <span class='knopfwort'>Today</span> returns Calendar to the current date. Right-click <span class='knopfwort'>Today</span> to open the appointment search without first changing the displayed date.</p><h3>The footer</h3><p>Below the book is a save status message and three buttons:</p><ul><li><span class='knopfwort'>Selection options</span> – opens the entries for the current section. Checked entries can be printed; Contacts can also be exported to ODS, and contacts, tasks and appointments can be deleted after confirmation (page <b data-page='printing-and-saving-as-pdf' class='knopfwort'></b>). You can hide this button under <i>General</i>. In Planner, this button is called <span class='knopfwort'>Print</span> and opens the year preview described on page <b data-page='the-year-at-a-glance' class='knopfwort'></b>.</li><li><span class='knopfwort'>Settings</span> – opens the thirteen settings tabs</li><li><span class='knopfwort'>Create backup</span> – creates a dated copy of all your data</li></ul><div class='beispiel'><b>Try it</b>Open Calendar, turn forward several times, then use <span class='knopfwort'>Today</span> to return. The Organizer remembers the window size, full-screen setting and calendar view.</div>":"<p>W měsacnym napohledźe pohibujetej wołacej róžkaj wo jedyn měsac, w tydźenskim wo jedyn tydźeń a w dnjowym wo dwaj dnjej. Lisćiny kaž Nadawki, Kontakty a Notice skroluja město přewobroćenja stronow.</p><h3>Hłowa</h3><p>Šipce <span class='knopfwort'>&lsaquo;</span> a <span class='knopfwort'>&rsaquo;</span> pohibujetej wróćo a doprědka. Dźeržće jednu stłóčenu za awtomatiske pokročowanje. Normalny klik na <span class='knopfwort'>Dźensa</span> protyku k aktualnemu datumej wróći. Klikńće z prawej tastu na <span class='knopfwort'>Dźensa</span>, zo byšće pytanje terminow bjez předchadneje změny pokazowaneho datuma wočinili.</p><h3>Noha</h3><p>Pod knihu je status składowanja a tři tłóčatka:</p><ul><li><span class='knopfwort'>Wuběrowe opcije</span> wočinja zapiski aktualneho wotrězka. Wubrane dadźa so ćišćeć; Kontakty tež do ODS eksportować a kontakty, nadawki a terminy po wobkrućenju zhašeć (strona <b data-page='printing-and-saving-as-pdf' class='knopfwort'></b>). Pod <i>Powšitkowne</i> móžeće tłóčatko schować. W Planowaku rěka <span class='knopfwort'>Ćišćeć</span> a wočini lětny přehlad ze strony <b data-page='the-year-at-a-glance' class='knopfwort'></b>.</li><li><span class='knopfwort'>Nastajenja</span> wočinja třinaće rajtarkow nastajenjow</li><li><span class='knopfwort'>Zawěsćensku kopiju wutworić</span> wutwori datowanu kopiju wšitkich datow</li></ul><div class='beispiel'><b>Wuspytać</b>Wočińće Protyku, wobroćće wjacore razy doprědka a wužijće <span class='knopfwort'>Dźensa</span> za wróćenje. Organizer sej wulkosć wokna, połnowobrazowe nastajenje a protykowy napohlad spomjatkuje.</div>","<p>Install the separate <b>KDE Connect</b> app on the Android telephone and pair it with the Organizer. This pairing is independent of Magnolie Notes and the Magnolie phone connection. Keep exactly one SMS-capable telephone paired and reachable.</p><h3>Write and send</h3><p>The SMS sheet contains <span class='knopfwort'>Phone number</span>, <span class='knopfwort'>Phone</span>, the conversation history, <span class='knopfwort'>Message text</span>, and <span class='knopfwort'>Send SMS</span>. If Magnolie must replace unsupported characters, review the preview and use <span class='knopfwort'>Send adjusted text</span>. A message is limited to <b>10 segments</b> and <b>5,000 characters</b>.</p><p><span class='knopfwort'>Submitted</span> means that KDE Connect accepted the request; it is not proof of delivery to the recipient. The shown history is kept locally by the Organizer. Deleting that history removes the local copy, not messages on the telephone.</p><div class='merke'><b>Two separate applications</b>KDE Connect supplies the SMS function under its own Android permissions. Magnolie Notes neither reads nor sends SMS, and Personal Sync does not transfer SMS.</div>":"<p>Instalujće separatne nałoženje <b>KDE Connect</b> na Androidowym telefonje a sparujće jo z Organizerom. To je njewotwisne wot Magnolie Notes a telefonoweho zwiska. Wostajće dokładnje jedyn SMS-kmany telefon sparowany a docpějomny.</p><h3>Pisać a pósłać</h3><p>SMS-łopjeno wobsahuje <span class='knopfwort'>Telefonowe čisło</span>, <span class='knopfwort'>Telefon</span>, historiju, <span class='knopfwort'>Tekst powěsće</span> a <span class='knopfwort'>SMS pósłać</span>. Jeli Magnolie njepodpěrane znamješka naruna, přepruwujće přehlad a wužijće <span class='knopfwort'>Přiměrjeny tekst pósłać</span>. Mjeza je <b>10 segmentow</b> a <b>5.000 znamješkow</b>.</p><p><span class='knopfwort'>Přepodate</span> rěka, zo KDE Connect požadanje přiwza, nic zo je přijimar dóstał. Historija je lokalna; jeje zhašenje powěsće na telefonje njezhaša.</p><div class='merke'><b>Dwě separatnej nałoženi</b>KDE Connect SMS pod swójskimi Androidowymi dowolnosćemi dodawa. Magnolie Notes SMS nječita ani njesćele a Personal Sync je njepřenjesuje.</div>","<p>Less frequently used appointment details are collapsed to keep the sheet uncluttered. Below the recurrence and notification options, click <span class='knopfwort'>▸ MORE FIELDS</span> to reveal them.</p><h3>Categories and organizational details</h3><ul><li><b>Categories</b> remains freely editable. When you click the field, the Organizer suggests categories already used in other appointments. You can select one or type a new category.</li><li><b>Cost center</b> assigns the appointment within an organization.</li><li><b>Customer no.</b> records the customer's number.</li><li><b>Confidential</b> adds a red stamp to the appointment.</li><li><b>Tentative</b> marks an appointment that has not yet been confirmed.</li></ul><h3>Organizer and email address</h3><p>Under <b>Organizer</b>, the Name field suggests names saved in Contacts but still accepts any text. After you select or fully enter one of those contact names, click the Email field to choose one of that contact's saved email addresses. The email address also remains freely editable. URI, attendees and attachment addresses can be entered in the same section.</p><p>If any additional field contains information, the section expands automatically when you open the appointment, so nothing is overlooked.</p><div class='beispiel'><b>How to identify the stamps</b>In the appointment overview, a word in capital letters follows the title: <i>CONFIDENTIAL</i> in red or <i>TENTATIVE</i> in brown.</div><div class='merke'><b>When moving from Lotus Organizer</b>Categories, cost center, customer number and the two designations are read when you import a Lotus file and written back to the same columns when you export a Lotus file.</div>":"<p>Rědšo wužiwane podrobnosće termina su skłopjene, zo by łopjeno přehladne wostało. Klikńće pod opcijemi wospjetowanja a zdźělenkow na <span class='knopfwort'>▸ WJACE POLOW</span>, zo byšće je pokazali.</p><h3>Kategorije a organizatoriske podrobnosće</h3><ul><li><b>Kategorije</b> dadźa so dale swobodnje wobdźěłać. Hdyž na polo kliknjeće, namjetuje Organizer kategorije, kotrež su so hižo w druhich terminach wužili. Móžeće jednu wubrać abo nowu kategoriju zapodać.</li><li><b>Kostowe městno</b> připokazuje termin znutřka organizacije.</li><li><b>Čisło kupca</b> zapisuje čisło kupca.</li><li><b>Dowěrliwe</b> přidawa terminej čerwjeny kołk.</li><li><b>Nachwilne</b> markěruje termin, kotryž hišće njeje wobkrućeny.</li></ul><h3>Organizator a e-mejlowa adresa</h3><p>Pod <b>Organizator</b> namjetuje polo Mjeno mjena, kotrež su w Kontaktach składowane, ale přijima dale swobodny tekst. Hdyž sće jedne z tutych kontaktnych mjenow wubrali abo dospołnje zapodali, klikńće na polo E-mejl, zo byšće jednu ze składowanych e-mejlowych adresow tutoho kontakta wubrali. E-mejlowa adresa da so tež dale swobodnje wobdźěłać. URI, wobdźělnicy a adresy přiwěškow dadźa so w samsnym wotrězku zapodać.</p><p>Jeli někajke přidatne polo informacije wobsahuje, so wotrězk při wočinjenju termina awtomatisce rozłoži, zo so ničo njepřehlada.</p><div class='beispiel'><b>Kak kołki spóznaće</b>W přehladźe terminow steji po titulu słowo we wulkich pismikach: <i>DOWĚRLIWE</i> čerwjenje abo <i>NACHWILNE</i> brunjowje.</div><div class='merke'><b>Při přeńdźenju z Lotus Organizer</b>Kategorije, kostowe městno, čisło kupca a wobě markěrowani so při imporće Lotus-dataje čitaja a při eksporće Lotus-dataje zaso do samsnych słupow zapisuja.</div>","<p>Limits make malformed or unexpectedly large input fail in a controlled way. A normal desktop import file may be at most <b>32 MiB</b>. A ZIP may contain at most <b>128 files</b>; one uncompressed entry may be at most <b>16 MiB</b>, all entries together at most <b>32 MiB</b>, and the uncompressed-to-compressed ratio at most <b>200:1</b>. Encrypted ZIP files are rejected.</p><h3>Backups, notes and appointments</h3><ul><li>A selected backup file may be at most <b>256 MiB</b>; a complete archive may be at most <b>384 MiB</b>.</li><li>A selected note attachment may be at most <b>8 MiB</b>. One attachment encoded as a data URL may contain at most <b>12 million characters</b>, and all such data URLs in one note together at most <b>24 million characters</b>.</li><li>One appointment may contain at most <b>32 alarms</b>, <b>100 attendees</b> and <b>50 attachments</b>. At most <b>1,000</b> own recurrence dates are accepted.</li></ul><h3>Stored quantities</h3><p>The recycle bin retains at most <b>3,000</b> entries and shows the <b>60</b> newest entries of each type. Imports containing <b>30,000</b> appointments, contacts, tasks, notes or anniversaries have been tested; 30,000 is a tested scale, <b>not a storage limit</b>.</p><div class='achtung'><b>Rejecting is safer than guessing</b>If a limit is exceeded, reduce or split the source with the program that created it. Do not rename or manipulate an archive merely to bypass validation.</div>":"<p>Mjezy wopak abo njewočakowanje wulki wobsah kontrolowanje wotpokazuja. Normalna desktopowa importowa dataja smě <b>32 MiB</b> měć. ZIP smě <b>128 datajow</b> wobsahować; jedyn njekomprimowany zapisk <b>16 MiB</b>, wšitke <b>32 MiB</b> a poměr <b>200:1</b>. Zaklučowane ZIP so wotpokazuja.</p><h3>Zawěsćenja, notice a terminy</h3><ul><li>Zawěsćenska dataja smě <b>256 MiB</b>, dospołny archiw <b>384 MiB</b> měć.</li><li>Přiwěšk noticy smě <b>8 MiB</b> měć. Data-URL jedneho přiwěška maksimalnje <b>12 milionow znamješkow</b>, wšitke w noticy <b>24 milionow</b>.</li><li>Termin smě <b>32 alarmow</b>, <b>100 wobdźělnikow</b> a <b>50 přiwěškow</b> měć. Maksimalnje <b>1.000</b> swójskich datumow wospjetowanja.</li></ul><h3>Składowane mnóstwa</h3><p>Papjernik wobchowa <b>3.000</b> zapiskow a pokazuje <b>60</b> najnowšich na typ. Importy z <b>30.000</b> objektami su testowane; to je testowana škala, <b>nic składowanska mjeza</b>.</p><div class='achtung'><b>Wotpokazanje je wěsćiše hač wuhodanje</b>Při překročenju zmjeńšće abo dźělće žórło z programom, kotryž jo wutwori. Njepřemjenujće ani nemanipulujće archiw jenož za wobeńdźenje přepruwowanja.</div>","<p>Magnolie Notes opens with its name at the top and five tabs along the bottom. This chapter concerns the two everyday tabs <span class='knopfwort'>Notes</span> and <span class='knopfwort'>Tasks</span>. The other three tabs belong to transferring and recovering data and are explained separately later.</p><h3>Portrait or landscape</h3><p>Android may display the app upright or sideways; Magnolie Notes does not lock the screen orientation. The tabs remain in one row at the bottom, and landscape does not turn the app into a two-pane desktop view. On a short screen, with a larger system font, while the keyboard is open, or when several attachments are present, the note editor scrolls vertically.</p><h3>Moving between the two everyday tabs</h3><p>Tap <span class='knopfwort'>Notes</span> for the note list or <span class='knopfwort'>Tasks</span> for the task list. From Tasks, Android's system Back action first returns to Notes. Inside an editor, however, the visible Back arrow and Android's system Back action do not have the same saving behaviour; page <b data-page='android-notes-edit-save-delete' class='knopfwort'></b> explains the important difference.</p><div class='achtung'><b>Save before rotating the device</b>The open editor and unsaved text are not promised to survive an orientation change. Save the entry before turning the phone or tablet.</div>":"<p>Magnolie Notes ma horjeka mjeno a deleka pjeć rajtarkow. Tuta kapitla jedna wo wšědnymaj rajtarkomaj <span class='knopfwort'>Notice</span> a <span class='knopfwort'>Nadawki</span>. Druhe tři su za přenjesenje a wobnowjenje datow a so pozdźišo wopisują.</p><h3>Wysoki abo prěčny format</h3><p>Android smě nałoženje horje abo nabók pokazać; orientacija njeje zamknjena. Rajtarki wostanu w jednym rjedźe deleka a prěčny format njewutwori desktopowy dwupolowy napohlad. Na krótkim wobrazowce, při wjetšim systemowym pismje, wočinjenjej tastaturje abo wjacorych přiwěškach so editor wertikalnje skroluje.</p><h3>Mjez wšědnymaj rajtarkomaj</h3><p>Podótkńće so <span class='knopfwort'>Notice</span> abo <span class='knopfwort'>Nadawki</span>. Z Nadawkow wróći systemowe Wróćo najprjedy k Noticam. W editorje pak widźomna šipka a systemowe Wróćo rozdźělnje składuja; strona <b data-page='android-notes-edit-save-delete' class='knopfwort'></b> rozdźěl wopisuje.</p><div class='achtung'><b>Před wobroćenjom składować</b>Wočinjeno editorowe wokno a njeskładowany tekst při změnje orientacije garantowane njejstej. Składujće zapisk před wobroćenjom telefona abo tableta.</div>","<p>Magnolie Organizer and Magnolie Notes are developed openly. The public project overview lists Maik Walter's repositories, source code, and available project information:</p><p><a href='https://gitlab.com/users/maik3531/projects'>https://gitlab.com/users/maik3531/projects</a></p><div class='merke'><b>Check the address</b>The visible address and the link destination are identical. Your web browser opens the page outside the Organizer. Releases and checksums should still be obtained only from the official location named for the respective project.</div>":"<p>Magnolie Organizer a Magnolie Notes so zjawnje wuwiwatej. Přehlad nalistuje repozitorije Maika Waltera, žórłowy kod a informacije:</p><p><a href='https://gitlab.com/users/maik3531/projects'>https://gitlab.com/users/maik3531/projects</a></p><div class='merke'><b>Adresu přepruwować</b>Widźomna adresa a cil stej samsnej. Browser stronu zwonka Organizera wočini. Wersije a kontrolne sumy wobstarajće jenož z oficialneho městna projekta.</div>","<p>Magnolie Organizer stores everything you might once have written in a ring binder. It has seven sections, which you open using the colored tabs along the right-hand edge:</p><h3>The seven sections</h3><ul><li><b>Calendar</b> – Your appointments in a month, week or day view. You can enter any number of appointments for each day, with a time, note and other details.</li><li><b>Tasks</b> – Everything you need to do, with a due date, priority, people responsible and a reminder. Completed items are checked off and move to the bottom.</li><li><b>Contacts</b> – Your address book, containing postal addresses, telephone numbers and email addresses, arranged using an alphabetical index.</li><li><b>Notes</b> – Groups, notebooks and pages for anything that does not belong elsewhere, including links, images and PDF files.</li><li><b>Anniversaries</b> – Birthdays, wedding anniversaries and other fixed dates that recur every year.</li><li><b>Planner</b> – An overview of the entire year on a single sheet.</li><li><b>Health</b> – Blood pressure, blood glucose, weight and a medication plan, kept in the same encrypted data as everything else.</li></ul><p>Calendar is always available. Each of the other six can be shown or hidden under <i>Settings ▸ General ▸ Tabs</i> without losing what you have already entered.</p><div class='beispiel'><b>An everyday example</b>Mr Muller enters his dentist appointment in the <i>Calendar</i>, his granddaughter's birthday under <i>Anniversaries</i>, the garage's telephone number under <i>Contacts</i>, and “Have the tires changed” under <i>Tasks</i>.</div><p>Note pages are saved while you write. For appointments, tasks and addresses, save the completed sheet using the appropriate button, such as <i>Add appointment</i>, <i>Add</i> or <i>Save</i>. Page <b data-page='backing-up-and-restoring' class='knopfwort'></b> explains where the data is stored.</p>":"<p>Magnolie Organizer składuje, štož byšće do kólnoweho zarjadowaka pisali. Ma sydom wotrězkow z barbnymi rajtarkami naprawo:</p><h3>Sydom wotrězkow</h3><ul><li><b>Protyka</b> – terminy w měsacnym, tydźenskim abo dnjowym napohladźe, z časom, noticu a podrobnosćemi.</li><li><b>Nadawki</b> – dźěło z datumom dospěća, prioritu, zamołwitymi a dopomnjećom; dokónčene dóńdu dele.</li><li><b>Kontakty</b> – adresnik z póštowymi, telefonowymi a e-mejlowymi adresami po alfabeće.</li><li><b>Notice</b> – skupiny, notatniki a strony z wotkazami, wobrazami a PDF.</li><li><b>Róčnicy</b> – narodniny, kwasne róčnicy a druhe lětnje wospjetowane datumy.</li><li><b>Planowak</b> – cyłe lěto na jednym łopjenje.</li><li><b>Strowota</b> – krejny ćišć, cokor, waha a medikaciski plan w samsnych zaklučowanych datach.</li></ul><p>Protyka je přeco k dispoziciji. Druhe dadźa so pod <i>Nastajenja ▸ Powšitkowne ▸ Rajtarki</i> bjez zhubjenja schować.</p><div class='beispiel'><b>Wšědny přikład</b>Knjez Müller pisa termin zubneho lěkarja do <i>Protyki</i>, narodniny wnuki pod <i>Róčnicy</i>, čisło awtodomownje pod <i>Kontakty</i> a „Gumy změnić dać“ pod <i>Nadawki</i>.</div><p>Noticowe strony so při pisanju składuja. Terminy, nadawki a adresy składujće z přihódnym tłóčatkom kaž <i>Termin přidać</i>, <i>Přidać</i> abo <i>Składować</i>. Strona <b data-page='backing-up-and-restoring' class='knopfwort'></b> datowe městno wopisuje.</p>","<p>Magnolie Organizer, Magnolie Notes und dieses Handbuch sind ein freies, unabhängiges Hobbyprojekt. Sie können sie verwenden, ohne etwas kaufen zu müssen. Wenn Magnolie Ihnen hilft und Sie die Zeit unterstützen möchten, die in Entwicklung, Tests, Übersetzungen und Dokumentation fließt, würde sich Maik Walter sehr darüber freuen, wenn Sie ihm einen Kaffee spendieren.</p><figure><img class='kaffee-qr' src='kaffee-qr.png' alt='QR-Code für die freiwillige Unterstützung mit einem Kaffee'><figcaption>Scannen Sie den QR-Code, um die Seite für die freiwillige Kaffee-Unterstützung zu öffnen.</figcaption></figure><div class='merke'><b>QR-Code oder E-Mail als Alternative</b>Der QR-Code ist der direkte Weg. Falls Sie lieber PayPal verwenden oder auf anderem Weg eine freiwillige Zuwendung beziehungsweise Aufmerksamkeit zukommen lassen möchten, können Sie <i>maik3531@gmail.com</i> als Alternative zum QR-Code verwenden. Die Adresse ist keine Aufforderung für allgemeine Nachrichten.</div><div class='achtung'><b>Eine E-Mail-Adresse bleibt freiwillig</b>Wer einen Contributor-Key erhalten und zugeordnet haben möchte, sollte eine E-Mail-Adresse angeben. Ohne Adresse kann der Key nicht zugestellt werden, aber niemand ist verpflichtet, eine anzugeben. Magnolie bleibt ohne Key in sämtlichen Funktionen vollständig und uneingeschränkt nutzbar. Die Eingabe eines Contributor-Keys entfernt lediglich das Branding <b>No valid coffee allowance</b>; sie schaltet keine Funktion frei. Magnolie bleibt freie Software unter der GNU General Public License; ein Kaffee erwirbt weder die Software noch eine Gewährleistung oder einen regulären Supportvertrag.</div><p>Vielen Dank an alle, die ein Problem sorgfältig melden, eine Verbesserung vorschlagen, eine neue Version testen, eine Übersetzung verbessern oder Magnolie jemandem empfehlen, dem es nützen kann.</p>":"<p>Magnolie Organizer, Magnolie Notes a tuta přiručka su swobodny, njewotwisny hobbyjowy projekt. Móžeće je wužiwać, bjeztoho zo byšće něšto kupili. Jeli wam Magnolie pomha a chceće čas podpěrać, kotryž so do wuwiwanja, testowanja, přełožowanja a dokumentacije inwestuje, by so Maik Walter jara wjeselił, hdy byšće jeho na kofej přeprosyli.</p><figure><img class='kaffee-qr' src='kaffee-qr.png' alt='QR-kod za dobrowólnu kofejowu podpěru'><figcaption>Skenujće QR-kod, zo byšće stronu za dobrowólnu kofejowu podpěru wočinili.</figcaption></figure><div class='merke'><b>QR-kod abo e-mejlka jako alternatiwa</b>QR-kod je direktny puć. Jeli PayPal preferujeće abo chceće na druhe wašnje dobrowólny pokiw dźakownosće pósłać, móžeće <i>maik3531@gmail.com</i> jako alternatiwu k QR-kodej wužiwać. Adresa njeje přeprošenje za powšitkowne powěsće.</div><div class='achtung'><b>E-mejlowa adresa wostanje dobrowólna</b>Jeli chceće Contributor-Key dóstać a sej jón připokazać dać, dyrbiće e-mejlowu adresu podać. Bjez adresy njeda so kluč pósłać, ale nichtó njeje winowaty, ju podać. Magnolie wostanje bjez kluča we wšěch funkcijach dospołnje a bjez wobmjezowanjow wužiwajomna. Zapodaće Contributor-Key jenož marku <b>No valid coffee allowance</b> wotstroni; žanu funkciju njewotamknje. Magnolie wostanje swobodna software pod GNU General Public License; kofej software, rukowanje abo prawidłowny podpěrowanski zrěčenje njekupuje.</div><p>Dźakujemy so wšěm, kotřiž problem starosćiwje zdźěla, polěpšenje namjetuja, nowu wersiju testuja, přełožk polěpšuja abo Magnolie někomu doporučeja, kotremuž móže wužitna być.</p>","<p>Magnolie natively represents daily and weekly series, monthly series on a date or selected weekday, and annual series. A recurrence end date is <b>inclusive</b>. A monthly series on the 29th, 30th or 31st moves to the last day of a shorter month; an annual February 29 occurrence moves to February 28 in a non-leap year.</p><h3>Durations remain exact</h3><p>A recurring multi-day appointment keeps its complete start-to-end duration for every occurrence, including timed and all-day series. Import, display, reminders and export use that duration rather than reducing the occurrence to one day.</p><h3>Complex ICS rules</h3><p>Rules with <i>EXDATE</i>, <i>RDATE</i>, <i>RECURRENCE-ID</i>, multiple RRULEs, unsupported rule parts or differing time zones are not forced into a similar-looking native rule. Their components are imported as individual appointments. Opaque source data is retained where the calendar connection supports a lossless round trip, so a later synchronization does not rewrite a rule Magnolie cannot faithfully edit.</p><div class='achtung'><b>No native recurring tasks</b>ICS tasks can be imported, but Magnolie has no true recurring-task model. Recurring task components are therefore handled as individual tasks rather than pretending that an appointment series is a task series.</div>":"<p>Magnolie natiwnje podpěruje dnjowe a tydźenske serije, měsacne na datumje abo wubranym dnju tydźenja a lětne serije. Kónčny datum je <b>inkluziwny</b>. Měsačna serija 29., 30. abo 31. dnja so na posledni dźeń króćeho měsaca přesunje; 29. februar lětneje serije na 28. februar njepřestupneho lěta.</p><h3>Trajanje wostanje eksaktne</h3><p>Wospjetowacy so wjacednjowy termin wobchowa za kóžde wustupjenje dospołne trajanje wot započatka do kónca, tež časowe a cyłodnjowe serije. Import, pokazanje, dopominanja a eksport tute trajanje wužiwaja a wustupjenje na jedyn dźeń njeredukuja.</p><h3>Kompleksne ICS-prawidła</h3><p>Prawidła z <i>EXDATE</i>, <i>RDATE</i>, <i>RECURRENCE-ID</i>, wjacorymi RRULE, njepodpěranymi dźělemi abo rozdźělnymi pasmami so do podobneho natiwneho prawidła njecpěja. Jich komponenty budu jednotliwe terminy. Njepřehladne žórłowe daty so při podpěrowanej bezzhubnej wuměnje wobchowaja, zo njeby synchronizacija prawidło wopak přepisała.</p><div class='achtung'><b>Žane natiwne wospjetowace so nadawki</b>ICS-nadawki dadźa so importować, ale Magnolie nima model wospjetowacych so nadawkow. Komponenty budu jednotliwe nadawki a njepředawaja terminowu seriju za nadawkowu.</div>","<p>Magnolie uses several separate connections. Pairing one does not silently enable another.</p><ul><li><b>Magnolienbaum</b> joins branches belonging to people or workgroups and carries deliberately shared entries.</li><li><b>Magnolie phone connection</b> binds one Organizer to one phone for granted controls and Personal Sync.</li><li><b>Personal Sync</b> travels inside that phone connection and covers own notes, notebooks, tasks and permitted deletion proposals.</li><li><b>KDE Connect</b> is a separate local-network relationship used by Magnolie for SMS.</li><li><b>Nextcloud</b> uses outgoing HTTPS for DAV synchronization and, when configured, as a Magnolienbaum mailbox.</li></ul><h3>Transport does not define trust</h3><p>Wi-Fi, Internet, VPN, tunnel and Bluetooth are ways to carry data. Magnolie still requires the matching paired identity and grants. A Bluetooth system pairing alone is not a Magnolie pairing, and opening a firewall port does not authorize a branch.</p><div class='merke'><b>Enable only what you use</b>Listener lifetimes follow their functions. Turning off Magnolienbaum or the phone connection closes its listener; KDE Connect remains a separate service while the Organizer runs.</div>":"<p>Magnolie wužiwa wjacore separatne zwiski. Sparowanje jednoho druhi mjelčo njezmóžni.</p><ul><li><b>Magnolienbaum</b> zwjazuje hałuzy ludźi abo skupin a přenošuje wědomje dźělene zapiski.</li><li><b>Telefonowy zwisk Magnolie</b> zwjaza jedyn Organizer z jednym telefonom za dowolene wodźenje a Personal Sync.</li><li><b>Personal Sync</b> běži w tutym zwisku a zapřija swójske notice, notatniki, nadawki a dowolene namjety zhašenja.</li><li><b>KDE Connect</b> je separatny lokalny zwisk za SMS.</li><li><b>Nextcloud</b> wužiwa won dźacy HTTPS za DAV-synchronizaciju a opcionalnje jako póštowy kašćik Magnolienbauma.</li></ul><h3>Transport dowěru njedefinuje</h3><p>Wi-Fi, internet, VPN, tunel a Bluetooth daty přenošuja. Magnolie dale hodźacu identitu a dowolnosće trjeba. Systemowe Bluetoothowe sparowanje njeje sparowanje Magnolie a wočinjeny port hałuzu njedowoli.</p><div class='merke'><b>Jenož trěbne zmóžnić</b>Žiwjenske doby słuchakow funkcijam slěduja. Wupinjenje Magnolienbauma abo telefonoweho zwiska słuchak začini; KDE Connect při běžacym Organizerje separatny wostanje.</div>","<p>Not every appointment has a specific time. For a day of leave, a company holiday, or a day when a tradesperson will arrive “at some point,” select <span class='knopfwort'>All day</span> beside the two time fields.</p><ol class='schritte'><li>Create the appointment as usual and enter its title.</li><li>Select <b>All day</b>.</li><li>If the appointment spans several days, enter the final date under <b>Through</b>.</li><li>The two time fields become pale and hatched because they are no longer needed.</li><li>Click <span class='knopfwort'>Add appointment</span>.</li></ol><p>In the appointment overview, <i>All day</i> now appears in italics instead of a time. All-day appointments are always listed <b>first</b>, above every appointment with a specific time.</p><h3>When exporting</h3><p>When you export your appointments to another program (page <b data-page='exporting-data-to-other-programs' class='knopfwort'></b>), all-day appointments are recognized there as well. Thunderbird, Outlook and the Linux Mint calendar display them as bars spanning the entire day.</p><div class='merke'><b>Changing this later</b>When you open an all-day appointment, the option is selected. Clear it and the Organizer fills the time fields with suggested times again.</div>":"<p>Nic kóždy termin ma čas. Za dowol, swjaty dźeń předewzaća abo njewěsty přichad rjemjeslnika wubjerće <span class='knopfwort'>Cyły dźeń</span> pódla časowych polow.</p><ol class='schritte'><li>Wutworće termin a titul.</li><li>Wubjerće <b>Cyły dźeń</b>.</li><li>Při wjacorych dnjach zapodajće kónc pod <b>Hač do</b>.</li><li>Časowej poli zblednjetej a budźetej šrafowanej.</li><li>Klikńće na <span class='knopfwort'>Termin přidać</span>.</li></ol><p>W přehladźe steji <i>Cyły dźeń</i> kursiwnje město časa. Cyłodnjowe terminy su přeco <b>prěnje</b>.</p><h3>Při eksporće</h3><p>Druhe programy (strona <b data-page='exporting-data-to-other-programs' class='knopfwort'></b>) je tež spóznaja. Thunderbird, Outlook a protyka Linux Mint je jako cyłodnjowe paski pokazuja.</p><div class='merke'><b>Pozdźišo změnić</b>Při wočinjenju je opcija wubrana. Wupńće ju a Organizer časowej poli z namjetami zaso pjelnje.</div>","<p>On Linux, a normal <i>magnolie-organizer</i> command opens the graphical application. Only one graphical instance runs per user session: another normal start brings its window forward. <i>magnolie-organizer --tray-start</i> is the autostart form; if an instance already exists, this invocation deliberately does not bring it forward.</p><h3>Help and language</h3><p><i>--hilfe</i> and <i>--help</i> are aliases. <i>--sprache CODE</i> and <i>--language CODE</i> are aliases as well and affect only that invocation, not the saved setting. CODE may be <b>ar, be, cs, da, de, en, es, fr, hi, hsb, it, ja, nb, nl, pl, pt, ru, tr, uk, zh_CN</b>, or <b>system</b>. The selection is applied before help, diagnostics, background modes, and a newly opened interface.</p><h3>Gettext template</h3><p><i>--pot [FILE]</i> and <i>--pot-template [FILE]</i> generate a reproducible gettext template and then exit. Without FILE, the result is <i>magnolie-organizer.pot</i> in the current directory. This maintenance function takes precedence over reminder, help, and graphical modes.</p><p>The installed manual page contains the same reference: enter <i>man magnolie-organizer</i>. A missing option value or unsupported language is a command-line error and exits with status 2; template-generation failure exits with status 1.</p>":"<p>Pod Linuxom normalny <i>magnolie-organizer</i> grafiske nałoženje wočini. Jenož jedna grafiska instanca na posedźenje běži; druhi start wokno doprědka přinjese. <i>magnolie-organizer --tray-start</i> je awtostart a běžacu instancu njewuzběhnje.</p><h3>Pomoc a rěč</h3><p><i>--hilfe</i> a <i>--help</i> stej samsnej, runje <i>--sprache CODE</i> a <i>--language CODE</i>. Rěč płaći jenož za zawołanje. CODE smě być <b>ar, be, cs, da, de, en, es, fr, hi, hsb, it, ja, nb, nl, pl, pt, ru, tr, uk, zh_CN</b> abo <b>system</b>. Wuběr płaći před pomocu, diagnostiku, pozadkowymi modusami a nowym powjerchom.</p><h3>Gettext-předłoha</h3><p><i>--pot [FILE]</i> a <i>--pot-template [FILE]</i> reprodukowatnu předłohu wutworitej a skónčitej. Bjez FILE je to <i>magnolie-organizer.pot</i> w aktualnym rjadowaku. Tuta hladanska funkcija ma prioritu před dopominanjom, pomocu a grafiku.</p><p>Instalowana manualowa strona ma samsnu referencu: <i>man magnolie-organizer</i>. Falowaca hódnota abo njepodpěrana rěč skónči ze statusom 2; zmylk předłohi ze statusom 1.</p>","<p>Open <span class='knopfwort'>Notes</span>. The list is ordered by the most recently changed note and grouped by day, with headings such as <b>Today</b> and <b>Yesterday</b>. A row can show its symbol, title, a text preview, the time of the last change and the notebook name.</p><h3>Find a note</h3><p>Type in <span class='knopfwort'>Search</span>. Magnolie Notes looks through titles and note text without distinguishing upper- and lower-case letters. Clear the field to show the complete list again.</p><h3>Create a local note</h3><ol class='schritte'><li>Tap <span class='knopfwort'>New note</span>.</li><li>Enter a <span class='knopfwort'>Title</span> and write in <span class='knopfwort'>Write here …</span>.</li><li>Select a symbol if the ordinary Note symbol does not fit.</li><li>Use <span class='knopfwort'>Save</span> or the visible Back arrow.</li></ol><p>A new local note belongs to <b>Loose Notes</b>. Notebook names received with notes can appear in the list, but this local Android screen has no control for creating, renaming, selecting, moving or deleting notebooks.</p><div class='merke'><b>The desktop has more notebook tools</b>Groups, notebook management, links and embedded files in the Organizer are separate desktop functions. Do not look for those controls in the local Android note editor.</div>":"<p>Wočińće <span class='knopfwort'>Notice</span>. Lisćina je po najnowšej změnje a po dnjach z nadpismami kaž <b>Dźensa</b> a <b>Wčera</b> zrjadowana. Rjad móže symbol, titul, přehlad teksta, čas poslednjeje změny a mjeno notatnika pokazać.</p><h3>Noticu namakać</h3><p>Pišće do <span class='knopfwort'>Pytać</span>. Magnolie Notes přepytuje titule a tekst bjez rozeznawanja wulkich a małych pismikow. Wuprózdńće polo, zo byšće cyłu lisćinu zaso widźeli.</p><h3>Lokalnu noticu wutworić</h3><ol class='schritte'><li>Podótkńće so <span class='knopfwort'>Nowa notica</span>.</li><li>Zapodajće <span class='knopfwort'>Titul</span> a pišće do <span class='knopfwort'>Tu pisać …</span>.</li><li>Wubjerće symbol, jeli normalny symbol Notice njepasuje.</li><li>Wužijće <span class='knopfwort'>Składować</span> abo widźomnu šipku Wróćo.</li></ol><p>Nowa lokalna notica słuša k <b>Swobodnym noticam</b>. Přijate mjena notatnikow móža so pokazać, ale lokalny Androidowy powjerch nima elementy za wutworjenje, přemjenowanje, wuběr, přesunjenje abo zhašenje notatnikow.</p><div class='merke'><b>Desktop ma wjace notatnikowych nastrojow</b>Skupiny, zarjadowanje notatnikow, wotkazy a zasadźene dataje su separatne desktopowe funkcije Organizera. W lokalnym Androidowym editorje je njepytajće.</div>","<p>Open <span class='knopfwort'>Settings ▸ General ▸ Tabs</span> and switch on <span class='knopfwort'>Health</span>. The tab appears after the planners. Nothing is deleted when you hide it, but the hidden section may disappear from search and print choices until you switch it on again.</p><h3>Views and units</h3><p>Health has four subviews: <span class='knopfwort'>Vital readings</span>, <span class='knopfwort'>Medication plan</span>, the optional blood-sugar table, and <span class='knopfwort'>History</span>. Under <span class='knopfwort'>Settings ▸ Calendar ▸ Health</span>, you can show or hide each view. If imported settings hide all four, Vital readings is restored so the section can still open.</p><p>The same settings choose kg or lb, cm or in, °C or °F, and mmol/L or mg/dL. <span class='knopfwort'>According to language</span> follows the region of the selected language. Changing a selector converts the entered and saved values for display; it does not reinterpret them. Finish or discard an edited row before changing a unit.</p><h3>Calendar planning</h3><p>The switches for vital readings, medication and blood sugar add general planning marks to the calendar. Choose a first date and an interval from 1 to 365 days. The Today marker and other calendar entries remain separate. Clicking a vital-reading or blood-sugar mark opens a row with its date; a medication mark opens the plan. These marks are not reminders and have no completion state.</p><div class='achtung'><b>Protect sensitive data</b>Health records are stored locally with the rest of the Organizer data. They are encrypted at rest only when password protection is enabled. Printed pages and ODS exports are separate files; protect or remove them yourself.</div>":"<p>Wočińće <span class='knopfwort'>Nastajenja ▸ Powšitkowne ▸ Rajtarki</span> a zapńće <span class='knopfwort'>Strowotu</span>. Rajtark so za planowakami zjewi. Schowanje ničo njezhaša, ale schowany wotrězk móže z pytanja a ćišćenskich wuběrow hač do znowazapinjenja zmiznyć.</p><h3>Napohlady a jednotki</h3><p>Strowota ma štyri podnapohlady: <span class='knopfwort'>Vitalne hódnoty</span>, <span class='knopfwort'>Medikaciski plan</span>, opcionalnu tabelu krejneho cokora a <span class='knopfwort'>Historiju</span>. Pod <span class='knopfwort'>Nastajenja ▸ Protyka ▸ Strowota</span> móžeće kóždy pokazać abo schować. Jeli importowane nastajenja wšitke štyri schowaja, so Vitalne hódnoty wobnowja.</p><p>Tam wubjerće tež kg abo lb, cm abo in, °C abo °F a mmol/L abo mg/dL. <span class='knopfwort'>Po rěči</span> region wubraneje rěče slěduje. Změna wuběra zapodate a składowane hódnoty za pokazanje konwertuje; njeinterpretuje je znowa. Dokónčće abo zaćisńće wobdźěłowany rjad před změnu jednotki.</p><h3>Planowanje w protyce</h3><p>Přepinaki vitalnych hódnotow, medikacije a krejneho cokora přidaja powšitkowne planowanske marki do protyki. Wubjerće prěni datum a interwal wot 1 do 365 dnjow. Marka Dźensa a druhe zapiski wostanu separatne. Klik na marku vitalneje hódnoty abo cokora wočini rjad z datumom; medikaciska marka plan. Tute marki njejsu dopominanja a nimaja dokónčenski staw.</p><div class='achtung'><b>Wuznamne daty škitać</b>Strowotne daty so lokalnje z druhimi datami Organizera składuja. Wone su při składowanju jenož zaklučowane, hdyž je hesłowy škit zapinjeny. Ćišćane strony a ODS-eksporty su separatne dataje; škitajće abo wotstrońće je sami.</div>","<p>Open <span class='knopfwort'>Settings ▸ Language &amp; region</span>. Language and regional display are separate: the first chooses the words used by the Organizer, while the second chooses conventions for dates, numbers and sorting.</p><h3>Language</h3><p><span class='knopfwort'>System setting</span> follows the language selected for your computer. You can instead choose one of the twenty Organizer languages explicitly. The language names are written in their own language so that you can still recognize and change them after an accidental choice.</p><h3>Format region</h3><p>Enter <i>system</i> to follow the computer, or a language-and-country tag such as <i>de-DE</i>, <i>en-GB</i>, <i>en-US</i> or <i>fr-CH</i>. The country part controls conventions such as date order and number punctuation; names such as weekdays continue to follow the interface language where the display component permits it.</p><ol class='schritte'><li>Choose the <span class='knopfwort'>Language</span>.</li><li>Enter the required <span class='knopfwort'>Format region</span>.</li><li>Review the remaining regional choices described on the next page.</li><li>Click <span class='knopfwort'>Save</span> and restart the Organizer.</li></ol><div class='achtung'><b>Do not translate your entries</b>A language change never translates, renames or moves your appointments, contacts, tasks or notes. Text you entered remains exactly as you wrote it.</div>":"<p>Wočińće <span class='knopfwort'>Nastajenja ▸ Rěč &amp; region</span>. Rěč a regionalne pokazanje stej separatnej: prěnja słowa Organizera wuběra, druhe konwencije za daty, ličby a sortěrowanje.</p><h3>Rěč</h3><p><span class='knopfwort'>Systemowe nastajenje</span> rěči ličaka slěduje. Móžeće město toho jednu z dwaceći rěčow Organizera wubrać. Rěčne mjena su we swójskej rěči napisane, zo byšće je po mylnym wuběrje hišće spóznali a změnili.</p><h3>Formatowy region</h3><p>Zapodajće <i>system</i>, zo byšće ličakej slědowali, abo rěčnu a krajnu tafličku kaž <i>de-DE</i>, <i>en-GB</i>, <i>en-US</i> abo <i>fr-CH</i>. Krajowy dźěl konwencije kaž datumowy porjad a ličbowu interpunkciju wodźi; mjena kaž tydźenske dny dale rěči powjercha slěduja, hdźež komponenta pokazanja to dowoli.</p><ol class='schritte'><li>Wubjerće <span class='knopfwort'>Rěč</span>.</li><li>Zapodajće trěbny <span class='knopfwort'>Formatowy region</span>.</li><li>Přepruwujće dalše regionalne wuběry, kotrež přichodna strona wopisuje.</li><li>Klikńće <span class='knopfwort'>Składować</span> a startujće Organizer znowa.</li></ol><div class='achtung'><b>Waše zapiski njepřełožować</b>Změna rěče terminy, kontakty, nadawki ani notice ženje njepřełoži, njepřemjenuje a njepřesunje. Waš zapodaty tekst wostanje eksaktnje kaž napisany.</div>","<p>Open <span class='knopfwort'>Tasks</span> and tap <span class='knopfwort'>New task</span>. Enter <span class='knopfwort'>What needs doing</span> and, if required, an explanation under <span class='knopfwort'>Why, and anything else</span>.</p><h3>Due date and urgency</h3><p>Under <span class='knopfwort'>Due date</span>, choose <span class='knopfwort'>Today</span>, <span class='knopfwort'>Tomorrow</span>, <span class='knopfwort'>In seven days</span> or <span class='knopfwort'>without</span>. Urgency can be <span class='knopfwort'>urgent</span>, <span class='knopfwort'>normal</span> or <span class='knopfwort'>can wait</span>. The list groups entries under <b>Overdue</b>, <b>Today</b>, <b>Tomorrow</b>, <b>This week</b>, <b>Later</b>, <b>without</b> and <b>Done</b>. Overdue entries are red; completed entries are struck through and placed last.</p><p>The checkbox in a row immediately switches between <span class='knopfwort'>Mark task as done</span> and <span class='knopfwort'>Mark task as not done</span> and saves that state.</p><h3>Remind me</h3><p>A reminder requires a due date. Select <span class='knopfwort'>Remind me</span>, choose zero through fourteen <span class='knopfwort'>Days beforehand</span>, and select a full hour from 00 through 23. Completed tasks do not produce reminders. If Android does not permit exact alarms, delivery may be late; <span class='knopfwort'>Allow exact reminders</span> leads to the relevant Android permission.</p><div class='achtung'><b>Save and deletion follow the note rules</b><span class='knopfwort'>Save</span> and the visible Back arrow save; Android's system Back action closes without saving. <span class='knopfwort'>Delete task</span> uses the generic question <i>Delete this note for good?</i> and normally routes the task to trash.</div>":"<p>Wočińće <span class='knopfwort'>Nadawki</span> a podótkńće so <span class='knopfwort'>Nowy nadawk</span>. Zapodajće <span class='knopfwort'>Što je činić</span> a po potrjebje wujasnjenje pod <span class='knopfwort'>Čehodla a što hišće</span>.</p><h3>Datum dospěća a nuznosć</h3><p>Pod <span class='knopfwort'>Datum dospěća</span> wubjerće <span class='knopfwort'>Dźensa</span>, <span class='knopfwort'>Jutře</span>, <span class='knopfwort'>Za sydom dnjow</span> abo <span class='knopfwort'>bjez</span>. Nuznosć móže <span class='knopfwort'>spěšna</span>, <span class='knopfwort'>normalna</span> abo <span class='knopfwort'>móže čakać</span> być. Lisćina zapiski pod <b>Překročene</b>, <b>Dźensa</b>, <b>Jutře</b>, <b>Tutón tydźeń</b>, <b>Pozdźišo</b>, <b>bjez</b> a <b>Dokónčene</b> skupinuje. Překročene su čerwjene; dokónčene su přešmórnjene a steja na kóncu.</p><p>Kašćik w rjedźe hnydom mjez <span class='knopfwort'>Nadawk jako dokónčeny markěrować</span> a <span class='knopfwort'>jako njedokónčeny markěrować</span> přepina a staw składuje.</p><h3>Na mnje dopominać</h3><p>Dopomnjeće datum dospěća trjeba. Wubjerće <span class='knopfwort'>Na mnje dopominać</span>, nula hač štyrnaće <span class='knopfwort'>Dnjow do toho</span> a cyłu hodźinu wot 00 do 23. Dokónčene nadawki dopominanja njewutworja. Jeli Android eksaktne alarmy njedowoli, móže doručenje so komdźić; <span class='knopfwort'>Eksaktne dopominanja dowolić</span> k wotpowědnej Androidowej dowolnosći wodźi.</p><div class='achtung'><b>Składowanje a zhašenje noticowym prawidłam slědujetej</b><span class='knopfwort'>Składować</span> a widźomna šipka Wróćo składuje; systemowa akcija Wróćo Androida bjez składowanja začinja. <span class='knopfwort'>Nadawk zhašeć</span> wužiwa powšitkowne prašenje <i>Tutu noticu na přeco zhašeć?</i> a normalnje nadawk do papjernika přesunje.</div>","<p>Open the <span class='knopfwort'>Import</span> tab. Android keeps every app's private database closed to other apps, so Magnolie Notes cannot simply look inside Samsung Notes, Google Keep or another notepad. Use an export file, an export folder, or Android's Share command instead.</p><h3>Choose one file</h3><ol class='schritte'><li>Tap <span class='knopfwort'>Choose file …</span>.</li><li>Select the export in Android's document picker.</li><li>Wait while <span class='knopfwort'>Reading …</span> is displayed.</li><li>Read the result before opening Notes.</li></ol><p>The picker initially allows every file type because Magnolie Notes examines the name and contents itself. A selected file may contain at most <b>64 MiB</b>. An unknown file can fall back to a plain-text note, so do not select a binary file merely because Android offers it.</p><h3>Choose a folder</h3><p><span class='knopfwort'>Choose folder …</span> reads suitable files in that folder and its subfolders. Text, Markdown, JSON, HTML, ENEX and supported ZIP-based exports are considered; unrelated suffixes and files over 64 MiB are skipped. Magnolie reads the selection immediately and does not remember access to the folder for later.</p><div class='achtung'><b>A complete desktop archive does not fit here</b>A <b>.magnolie</b> complete archive from Magnolie Organizer is deliberately rejected with <i>Complete archive import is not yet supported on this device.</i> Keep that archive for the desktop Organizer.</div>":"<p>Wočińće rajtark <span class='knopfwort'>Import</span>. Android priwatnu datowu banku kóždeho nałoženja před druhimi začinja, tuž Magnolie Notes njemóže prosće do Samsung Notes, Google Keep abo druheho notnika pohladać. Wužijće eksportowu dataju, eksportowy rjadowak abo Androidowy přikaz Dźělić.</p><h3>Jednu dataju wubrać</h3><ol class='schritte'><li>Podótkńće so <span class='knopfwort'>Dataju wubrać …</span>.</li><li>Wubjerće eksport w Androidowym dokumentowym wuběraku.</li><li>Čakajće, doniž so <span class='knopfwort'>Čita so …</span> pokazuje.</li><li>Čitajće wuslědk před wočinjenjom Noticow.</li></ol><p>Wuběrak spočatnje wšitke datajowe typy dowoli, dokelž Magnolie Notes mjeno a wobsah sama přepruwuje. Wubrana dataja smě maksimalnje <b>64 MiB</b> měć. Njeznata dataja móže jako lutna tekstowa notica skónčić, tuž binarnu dataju njewubjerće jenož dokelž ju Android poskića.</p><h3>Rjadowak wubrać</h3><p><span class='knopfwort'>Rjadowak wubrać …</span> přihódne dataje w tutym rjadowaku a jeho podrjadowakach čita. Tekst, Markdown, JSON, HTML, ENEX a podpěrane ZIP-eksporty so wobkedźbuja; cuze kóncowki a dataje nad 64 MiB so přeskoča. Magnolie wuběr hnydom čita a přistup k rjadowakej na pozdźišo njewobchowa.</p><div class='achtung'><b>Dospołny desktopowy archiw sem njepasuje</b>Dospołny archiw <b>.magnolie</b> z Magnolie Organizera so z <i>Import dospołneho archiwa na tutym graće hišće podpěrany njeje.</i> wotpokaza. Wobchowajće tutón archiw za desktopowy Organizer.</div>","<p>Open the <span class='knopfwort'>Recovery</span> tab and scroll below the trash to <b>Recovery journal</b>. It stores encrypted local snapshots inside Magnolie Notes. The default interval is weekly; choose <span class='knopfwort'>Off</span>, <span class='knopfwort'>6 hours</span>, <span class='knopfwort'>12 hours</span>, <span class='knopfwort'>Daily</span> or <span class='knopfwort'>Weekly</span>.</p><h3>Create and inspect a snapshot</h3><p><span class='knopfwort'>Snapshot now</span> creates a pinned manual snapshot. An unchanged snapshot with the same reason may be deduplicated within 15 minutes. Each row shows time, reason, area, size and summary. <span class='knopfwort'>Preview</span> shows the summary and technical hash and synchronization epoch; it is not a note-by-note content browser.</p><h3>Restore or remove</h3><p><span class='knopfwort'>Restore</span> asks for confirmation and creates a pre-restore snapshot before replacing app data. Restoring a bound Android contact may require a second confirmation if it has changed. <span class='knopfwort'>Delete</span> permanently removes the selected snapshot after confirmation.</p><p>Automatic retention keeps limited daily, monthly, pre-restore and pre-synchronization generations. The journal uses at most five percent of the file system or 512 MiB while trying to retain 256 MiB free. Pinned manual snapshots remain until you delete them.</p><div class='achtung'><b>This is not an external backup</b>Snapshots never enter Android cloud backup or device transfer. Clearing app data, uninstalling Magnolie Notes or losing the phone also loses this journal.</div>":"<p>Wočińće rajtark <span class='knopfwort'>Wobnowjenje</span> a skrolujće pod papjernik k <b>Wobnowjenskemu žurnalej</b>. Wón zaklučowane lokalne kopije znutřka Magnolie Notes składuje. Standardny interwal je tydźenski; wubjerće <span class='knopfwort'>Wupinjene</span>, <span class='knopfwort'>6 hodźin</span>, <span class='knopfwort'>12 hodźin</span>, <span class='knopfwort'>Dnjowje</span> abo <span class='knopfwort'>Tydźensce</span>.</p><h3>Kopiju wutworić a přehladać</h3><p><span class='knopfwort'>Nětko kopiju</span> připinjenu manuelnu kopiju wutwori. Njezměnjena kopija ze samsnej přičinu móže so w běhu 15 mjeńšin zjednoćić. Kóždy rjad čas, přičinu, wobłuk, wulkosć a zjeće pokazuje. <span class='knopfwort'>Přehlad</span> zjeće, techniski haš a synchronizacisku epochu pokazuje; njeje přehladowak wobsaha jednotliwych noticow.</p><h3>Wobnowić abo wotstronić</h3><p><span class='knopfwort'>Wobnowić</span> wo wobkrućenje prosy a před narunanjom datow nałoženja kopiju wutwori. Wobnowjenje zwjazaneho Androidoweho kontakta móže druhe wobkrućenje trjebać, jeli je so změnił. <span class='knopfwort'>Zhašeć</span> wubranu kopiju po wobkrućenju trajnje wotstroni.</p><p>Awtomatiske wobchowanje wobmjezowane dnjowe, měsacne, předwobnowjenske a předsynchronizaciske generacije dźerži. Žurnal wužiwa maksimalnje pjeć procentow datajoweho systema abo 512 MiB a pospytuje 256 MiB swobodne wostajić. Připinjene manuelne kopije wostanu, doniž je njezhašeće.</p><div class='achtung'><b>To njeje eksterna zawěsćenska kopija</b>Kopije ženje do Androidoweho cloudoweho zawěsćenja ani gratoweho přenjesenja njedóńdu. Zhašenje datow nałoženja, wotinstalowanje Magnolie Notes abo zhubjenje telefona tutón žurnal tež zhubi.</div>","<p>Open the <span class='knopfwort'>Tree</span> tab and scroll to <b>Magnolienbaum</b>. Give the phone a recognizable <span class='knopfwort'>Name of this branch</span>. Its identifier and fingerprint belong to this installation and are shown for comparison.</p><h3>Use a pairing file</h3><ol class='schritte'><li>In the desktop Organizer, open <span class='knopfwort'>Settings ▸ Magnolienbaum</span> and create a pairing file.</li><li>Bring it to the phone and tap <span class='knopfwort'>Open pairing file …</span>. The invitation is valid for <b>15 minutes</b>.</li><li>Alternatively paste its complete JSON under <span class='knopfwort'>Paste pairing text</span> and tap <span class='knopfwort'>OK</span>.</li><li>Read the result <i>Paired with …</i> before continuing.</li></ol><p><span class='knopfwort'>Create own pairing file …</span> starts Android's Share sheet with an invitation from the phone. It does not leave an ordinary file in Downloads.</p><h3>Search the local network</h3><p><span class='knopfwort'>Search the local network</span> lists answering branches with address and fingerprint. Tap <span class='knopfwort'>Connect</span>, compare the six-digit code on both devices and confirm <span class='knopfwort'>Code matches</span> only when every digit agrees.</p><div class='achtung'><b>There is no QR pairing in this version</b>Use the file, pasted pairing text or local-network search. If a key has changed, remove the old connection first and compare the new fingerprint carefully.</div>":"<p>Wočińće rajtark <span class='knopfwort'>Štom</span> a skrolujće k <b>Magnolienbaum</b>. Dajće telefonej spóznajomne <span class='knopfwort'>Mjeno tutoho hałuža</span>. Jeho identifikator a porstowy wotćišć słušatej k tutej instalaciji a pokazujetej so za přirunanje.</p><h3>Porowansku dataju wužiwać</h3><ol class='schritte'><li>Wočińće w desktopowym Organizeru <span class='knopfwort'>Nastajenja ▸ Magnolienbaum</span> a wutworće porowansku dataju.</li><li>Přenjesće ju na telefon a podótkńće so <span class='knopfwort'>Porowansku dataju wočinić …</span>. Přeprošenje płaći <b>15 mjeńšin</b>.</li><li>Abo zasadźće dospołny JSON pod <span class='knopfwort'>Porowanski tekst zasadźić</span> a podótkńće so <span class='knopfwort'>W porjadku</span>.</li><li>Čitajće wuslědk <i>Porowany z …</i>, prjedy hač pokročujeće.</li></ol><p><span class='knopfwort'>Swójsku porowansku dataju wutworić …</span> Androidowy dźělenski dialog z přeprošenjom telefona startuje. Zwučenu dataju w Sćehnjenjach njewostaji.</p><h3>Lokalnu syć přepytać</h3><p><span class='knopfwort'>Lokalnu syć přepytać</span> wotmołwjace hałuzy z adresu a porstowym wotćišćom nalistuje. Podótkńće so <span class='knopfwort'>Zwjazać</span>, přirunajće šěsćměstnowy kod na woběmaj gratomaj a wobkrućće <span class='knopfwort'>Kod so kryje</span> jenož, hdyž so kóžda ličba kryje.</p><div class='achtung'><b>W tutej wersiji QR-porowanje njeje</b>Wužijće dataju, zasadźeny porowanski tekst abo pytanje w lokalnej syći. Jeli je so kluč změnił, wotstrońće najprjedy stary zwisk a přirunajće nowy porstowy wotćišć kedźbliwje.</div>","<p>Per-item change vectors distinguish later and concurrent changes. Concurrent changes preserve both versions; the loser receives a deterministic conflict-copy identity, so retrying does not create another copy.</p><h3>Attachment format 2</h3><p><b>format 2</b> supports JPEG, PNG, WebP, GIF, and PDF. Each file is at most <b>8 MiB</b>, with at most <b>64</b> per note. SHA-256, declared MIME, and file signature must agree.</p><p>Authenticated encrypted chunks support reuse and resume of missing ranges. Automatic transfer is Wi-Fi only; manual transfer may use the permitted RFCOMM fallback.</p><div class='achtung'><b>No silent loss</b>Invalid or unavailable files are reported; existing local attachments remain untouched.</div>":"<p>Změnowe wektory za kóždy zapisk rozeznawaja pozdźiše a runočasne změny. Při runočasnych změnach wobchowatej so wobě wersiji; přemožena wersija dóstanje deterministisku identitu konfliktoweje kopije, tak zo wospjetowanje dalšu kopiju njewutwori.</p><h3>Přiwěškowy format 2</h3><p><b>format 2</b> podpěruje JPEG, PNG, WebP, GIF a PDF. Kóždy dataj smě najwjace <b>8 MiB</b> wulki być a kóžda notica najwjace <b>64</b> datajow měć. SHA-256, deklarowany MIME a datajowa signatura dyrbja so kryć.</p><p>Awtentizowane zaklučowane kuski podpěruja znowa-wužiwanje a pokročowanje falowacych wobłukow. Awtomatiski přenos běži jenož přez Wi-Fi; manuelny přenos smě dowoleny narunanski puć RFCOMM wužiwać.</p><div class='achtung'><b>Žane ćiche zhubjenje</b>Njepłaćiwe abo njek dispoziciji stejace dataje so zdźěla; eksistowace lokalne přiwěški wostanu njedotknjene.</div>","<p>Personal Sync is for the same person's desktop and one phone. Both sides must mark the pairing <b>own_device</b>. Grant <b>personal_notes_sync</b>, <b>personal_tasks_sync</b>, and <b>personal_deletions_sync</b> independently on both devices.</p><h3>Scope</h3><p>Notes, notebooks, and own tasks synchronize. Shared Magnolienbaum notes and delegated tasks are excluded. Deletion permission still produces proposals, never automatic deletion.</p><h3>Connections</h3><p><b>Synchronize now</b> may use a secure Wi-Fi connection or a permitted RFCOMM fallback. Automatic runs are <b>Wi-Fi only</b>. The <b>15 minute</b> guard prevents duplicate or looping runs; it is not a schedule.</p><div class='merke'><b>One phone</b>A replacement starts an additive baseline. Old device history cannot silently delete its data.</div>":"<p>Personal Sync je za desktop samsneje wosoby a jedyn telefon. Wobě stronje dyrbitej sparowanje jako <b>own_device</b> markěrować. Dowolće <b>personal_notes_sync</b>, <b>personal_tasks_sync</b> a <b>personal_deletions_sync</b> njewotwisnje na woběmaj gratajomaj.</p><h3>Wobłuk</h3><p>Noticy, noticniki a swójske nadawki so synchronizuja. Dźělene noticy Magnolienbaum a delegowane nadawki su wuzamknjene. Zhašenska dowolnosć dale jenož namjety wutworja, ženje awtomatiske zhašenje.</p><h3>Zwiski</h3><p><b>Nětko synchronizować</b> móže wěsty Wi-Fi-zwisk abo dowoleny narunanski puć RFCOMM wužiwać. Awtomatiske běhi su <b>jenož přez Wi-Fi</b>. <b>15-mjeńšinowy škit</b> zadźěwa dwójnym abo so wospjetowacym běham; njeje časowy plan.</p><div class='merke'><b>Jedyn telefon</b>Narunanski telefon započina aditiwnu zakładnu runinu. Historija stareho grata njemóže jeho daty ćicho zhašeć.</div>","<p>Public holidays and school holidays depend on where you live. Open <span class='knopfwort'>Settings ▸ Country &amp; Holidays</span>. The first section is called <span class='knopfwort'>Country and region</span>.</p><ol class='schritte'><li>Under <span class='knopfwort'>Country</span>, choose your country.</li><li>If another field appears, choose the applicable <span class='knopfwort'>State</span> or <span class='knopfwort'>Canton</span>. The Organizer never guesses one.</li><li>Use <span class='knopfwort'>All states</span> or <span class='knopfwort'>All cantons</span> only when you deliberately want to compare every listed region. The individual selector is then disabled.</li></ol><p>A country with regional subdivisions is not enough by itself: before retrieval, the Organizer asks for one region or an explicit <i>All</i> choice. Changing this setting does not retrieve anything and does not delete entries already stored.</p><h3>What appears in the calendar</h3><p>Retrieved public holidays have a reddish mark; school-holiday periods appear in green. They are visible in Month, Week, Day, and the compact Planner. Point at a mark for its name and regional details. When all regions are selected, equal periods are combined and their state or canton abbreviations are shown together instead of producing indistinguishable copies.</p><div class='merke'><b>Your own vacation is separate</b>The vacation planner records personal days off. It neither changes the selected region nor replaces public or school holidays.</div>":"<p>Zjawne a šulske prózdniny wot wašeho bydlišća wotwisują. Wočińće <span class='knopfwort'>Nastajenja ▸ Kraj &amp; swjate dny</span>. Prěni wotrězk rěka <span class='knopfwort'>Kraj a region</span>.</p><ol class='schritte'><li>Pod <span class='knopfwort'>Kraj</span> wubjerće swój kraj.</li><li>Jeli so dalše polo zjewi, wubjerće płaćiwy <span class='knopfwort'>Zwjazkowy kraj</span> abo <span class='knopfwort'>Kanton</span>. Organizer ženje sam njehóda.</li><li>Wužijće <span class='knopfwort'>Wšitke zwjazkowe kraje</span> abo <span class='knopfwort'>Wšitke kantony</span> jenož, hdyž chceće wšitke regiony přirunać. Jednotliwy wuběrak je potom znjemóžnjeny.</li></ol><p>Kraj z regionalnymi dźělemi sam njedosaha: před wobstarowanjom Organizer wo jedyn region abo wurazny wuběr <i>Wšitke</i> prosy. Změna nastajenja ničo njewobstara a hižo składowane zapiski njezhaša.</p><h3>Što so w protyce zjewi</h3><p>Wobstarane zjawne swjate dny maja čerwjenkastu marku; šulske prózdniny su zelene. Widźomne su w měsacnym, tydźenskim a dnjowym napohledźe a kompaktnym Planowaku. Pokazujće na marku za mjeno a regionalne podrobnosće. Při wuběrje wšitkich regionow so samsne doby zjednoća a skrótšenki jich regionow hromadźe pokazuja.</p><div class='merke'><b>Waš swójski dowol je separatny</b>Dowolowy planowak wosobinske swobodne dny zapisuje. Wubrany region njezměni ani zjawne a šulske prózdniny njenaruna.</div>","<p>SMS take an entirely separate path. It is set up under <span class='knopfwort'>Settings ▸ Synchronization</span> in the part headed <span class='knopfwort'>KDE Connect for SMS</span>.</p><p>On the computer you need nothing further; the support is built into the Organizer. Only the KDE Connect app on the Android telephone is required.</p><ol class='schritte'><li>Click <span class='knopfwort'>Pair KDE Connect phone</span>.</li><li>Open KDE Connect on the telephone and start the pairing there.</li><li>Compare the eight-character verification key on both devices.</li><li>Confirm on both devices.</li></ol><h3>When the phone is already waiting</h3><p>If the Organizer has already found the telephone, it does not offer the pairing button but a notice with the name and a button <span class='knopfwort'>Complete pairing</span>. One click finishes the acquaintance.</p><p>When all is well, a green line reads <span class='knopfwort'>KDE Connect phone paired.</span></p><div class='merke'><b>Two different telephones on one screen</b>The Magnolie Notes connection and KDE Connect are separate. The names may differ even when it is the same device in your hand. That is not a fault.</div>":"<p>SMS maja separatny puć pod <span class='knopfwort'>Nastajenja ▸ Synchronizacija</span> w <span class='knopfwort'>KDE Connect za SMS</span>.</p><p>Na ličaku je podpěra zatwarjena; na Androidźe trjebaće KDE Connect.</p><ol class='schritte'><li>Klikńće <span class='knopfwort'>Telefon KDE Connect sparować</span>.</li><li>Startujće sparowanje na telefonje.</li><li>Přirunajće wosomznamješkowy kluč.</li><li>Wobaj grataj wobkrućće.</li></ol><h3>Hdyž telefon hižo čaka</h3><p>Klikńće <span class='knopfwort'>Sparowanje dokónčić</span>.</p><p>Zelena linka rěka <span class='knopfwort'>Telefon KDE Connect sparowany.</span></p><div class='merke'><b>Dwaj telefonaj na jednej wobrazowce</b>Magnolie Notes a KDE Connect stej separatnej; mjeni móžetej so rozeznawać.</div>","<p>Select <span class='knopfwort'>Start automatically when signing in</span> under <span class='knopfwort'>Settings ▸ General ▸ Tray applet</span> when the Organizer should be ready after you sign in. The tray applet must also be enabled.</p><h3>Linux</h3><p>The Organizer creates the private entry <i>~/.config/autostart/magnolie-organizer-tray.desktop</i>. It starts the current installation with <i>--tray-start</i> after sign-in. Appointment reminders use a separate autostart entry or user service; switching off tray autostart does not switch off the reminder monitor.</p><h3>Windows</h3><p>The application creates a value for the current user under <i>HKCU\\Software\\Microsoft\\Windows\\CurrentVersion\\Run</i>. The installer does not create this value. Enabled reminders may require the same sign-in start independently of the tray-autostart checkbox, because reminders on Windows need a hidden running Organizer.</p><h3>If automatic startup fails</h3><p>First start the Organizer normally and check that the tray icon works. Under Linux run <i>magnolie-organizer --tray-start --debug</i>; the private rotating log is under <i>~/.local/state/magnolie-organizer/debug.log</i>. Under Windows read the reported autostart error and check the logs under <i>%LOCALAPPDATA%\\Magnolie Organizer\\Logs</i>. A damaged tray settings file falls back to a visible window instead of intentionally hiding the program.</p><div class='technik'><b>Local desktop state</b>Tray choices are stored separately in <i>tray.json</i>, and size or full-screen state in <i>fenster.json</i>. A complete archive deliberately keeps the receiving computer's local tray and autostart choices instead of importing those of another machine.</div>":"<p>Wubjerće <span class='knopfwort'>Při přizjewjenju awtomatisce startować</span> pod <span class='knopfwort'>Nastajenja ▸ Powšitkowne ▸ Systemowy applet</span>, jeli ma Organizer po přizjewjenju hotowy być. Applet dyrbi tež zmóžnjeny być.</p><h3>Linux</h3><p>Organizer wutwori <i>~/.config/autostart/magnolie-organizer-tray.desktop</i>, kotryž instalaciju po přizjewjenju z <i>--tray-start</i> startuje. Terminowe dopominanja wužiwanja separatny awtostart abo wužiwarsku słužbu; wupinjenje appletoweho awtostarta wobkedźbowak dopominanjow njewupina.</p><h3>Windows</h3><p>Nałoženje wutwori hódnotu pod <i>HKCU\\Software\\Microsoft\\Windows\\CurrentVersion\\Run</i>. Instalowak ju njewutwori. Zapinjene dopominanja móža samsny start trjebać, dokelž pod Windowsom schowany běžacy Organizer žadaja.</p><h3>Jeli awtomatiski start njefunguje</h3><p>Startujće Organizer normalnje a přepruwujće appletowy symbol. Pod Linuxom wuwjedźće <i>magnolie-organizer --tray-start --debug</i>; protokol je pod <i>~/.local/state/magnolie-organizer/debug.log</i>. Pod Windowsom čitajće zmylk a protokole pod <i>%LOCALAPPDATA%\\Magnolie Organizer\\Logs</i>. Wobškodźena dataja appletowych nastajenjow widźomne wokno pokaza.</p><div class='technik'><b>Lokalny desktopowy staw</b>Appletowe wuběry su w <i>tray.json</i>, wulkosć a połnowobrazowy staw w <i>fenster.json</i>. Dospołny archiw lokalne appletowe a awtostartowe wuběry přijimaceho ličaka wobchowa.</div>","<p>Settings under <span class='knopfwort'>Settings ▸ Calendar</span> change what you see without deleting stored entries.</p><h3>Past entries</h3><p><span class='knopfwort'>Hide past appointments</span> leaves out appointments before today. Only while it is selected do the dependent switches <span class='knopfwort'>Also hide past anniversaries</span> and <span class='knopfwort'>Also hide past school holidays</span> appear. Clear the switches and everything is visible again, unchanged. An anniversary hidden after its date appears by itself when its next occurrence lies in the future.</p><h3>Weather for the next three days</h3><p>Unfold <span class='knopfwort'>Weather</span> and enable <span class='knopfwort'>Show weather for the next three days</span>. Weather is initially off. The forecast appears above the appointment overview in the month view, on the right-hand page in the day view and in the relevant day headings in the week view.</p><p>Under <span class='knopfwort'>Weather display</span>, choose <i>Magnolia weather symbols only</i>, <i>Symbols and temperatures</i>, or <i>Symbols, temperatures and description</i>. Symbols and temperatures is the initial choice. <span class='knopfwort'>Update weather</span> offers every 30 minutes, every hour, every 3 hours, every 6 hours or every 12 hours; the initial interval is three hours. Failed or empty requests are tried again after 15 minutes.</p><h3>Location and privacy</h3><p>The installed application retrieves the forecast from <i>wttr.in</i>. It first looks for a postal-code-and-town line in your own address under Contacts, then for a postal code or town in the local LibreOffice user data. If neither supplies a location, wttr.in can estimate one from the public IP address of the connection.</p><p>Enable <span class='knopfwort'>Do not retrieve weather without a location</span> if that estimate is not wanted. When no usable location exists, this setting prevents the request entirely. Every actual internet request still comes from your public IP address, and a request with a known location also sends the postal code or town to wttr.in.</p><div class='merke'><b>No permanent weather history</b>The forecast is held only while the Organizer runs. It is retrieved again after a new start when the weather display needs it.</div>":"<p>Nastajenja pod <span class='knopfwort'>Nastajenja ▸ Protyka</span> pokazanje změnja, bjez zo by zapiski zhašeli.</p><h3>Zańdźene zapiski</h3><p><span class='knopfwort'>Zańdźene terminy schować</span> terminy před dźensnišim dnjom wuwostaji. Jenož potom so <span class='knopfwort'>Tež zańdźene róčnicy schować</span> a <span class='knopfwort'>Tež zańdźene šulske prózdniny schować</span> zjewitej. Wupńće je a wšitko je zaso widźomne. Róčnica so zjewi, hdyž jeje přichodne wustupowanje w přichodźe leži.</p><h3>Wjedro za přichodne tři dny</h3><p>Rozwińće <span class='knopfwort'>Wjedro</span> a zapńće <span class='knopfwort'>Wjedro za přichodne tři dny pokazać</span>. Předpowědź je w měsacnym, dnjowym a tydźenskim napohledźe.</p><p>Pod <span class='knopfwort'>Wjedrowe pokazanje</span> wubjerće <i>Jenož magnolijowe wjedrowe symbole</i>, <i>Symbole a temperatury</i> abo <i>Symbole, temperatury a wopisanje</i>. Standard su symbole a temperatury. <span class='knopfwort'>Wjedro aktualizować</span> poskića 30 mjeńšin, 1, 3, 6 abo 12 hodźin; standard su tři hodźiny. Njewuspěšne naprašowanja so po 15 mjeńšinach wospjetuja.</p><h3>Městno a priwatnosć</h3><p>Nałoženje wobstara předpowědź z <i>wttr.in</i>. Pyta najprjedy póstowe wodźenske čisło a město we wašej adresy, potom w datach LibreOffice. Hewak móže wttr.in městno ze zjawneje IP-adresy wuslědźić.</p><p>Zapńće <span class='knopfwort'>Wjedro bjez městna njewobstarać</span>, jeli toho nochceće. Bjez městna naprašowanje dospołnje zadźěwa. Kóžde naprašowanje přiwšěm wašu zjawnu IP-adresu wužiwa a při znatym městnje tež póstowe wodźenske čisło abo město do wttr.in sćele.</p><div class='merke'><b>Žana trajna wjedrowa historija</b>Předpowědź so jenož za běžny čas Organizera dźerži a po nowym starće znowa wobstara.</div>","<p>Sharing is usually the quickest route for one note. Open the note or selected text in its original Android app, tap its Share command and choose <span class='knopfwort'>Save to Magnolie Notes</span>. This works with plain text, HTML, Markdown and suitable JSON, and with one supported image or PDF. Several plain texts or images may also arrive together.</p><h3>How the new note is named</h3><p>The Android subject becomes the title. Without one, the first nonblank text line, limited to 120 characters, becomes the title. Magnolie Notes tries to recognize Samsung Notes, Keep, ColorNote, Evernote and Standard Notes from the sending app; otherwise the source is named <b>Shared</b>.</p><h3>Images and PDF files</h3><p>JPEG, PNG, WebP, GIF and PDF are checked against their actual file signature before they become attachments. Each file may contain at most <b>8 MiB</b>. If only attachments are shared, Magnolie creates one holder note. With several texts and images in one request, all notes use the notebook of the first note and all attachments belong to that first note.</p><div class='achtung'><b>Check the result</b>Invalid or oversized attachments can be omitted. If safe storage space is insufficient, the text may still be saved without the new attachments. Open the resulting note and verify title, text and attachment before deleting the original.</div><div class='merke'><b>One PDF, not a PDF collection</b>The Android share target accepts a single PDF. Sharing several PDFs together is not an advertised Magnolie Notes route.</div>":"<p>Dźělenje je zwjetša najspěšniši puć za jednu noticu. Wočińće noticu abo tekst w Androidowym nałoženju, wužijće Dźělić a wubjerće <span class='knopfwort'>Do Magnolie Notes składować</span>. Funguje to z tekstom, HTML, Markdown, přihódnym JSON a jednym podpěranym wobrazom abo PDF; wjacore teksty abo wobrazy móža tež hromadźe přińć.</p><h3>Mjeno noweje notice</h3><p>Androidowy předmjet budźe titul. Bjez njeho prěnja njeprózdna linka do 120 znamješkow titul wutwori. Magnolie Notes pospytuje Samsung Notes, Keep, ColorNote, Evernote a Standard Notes spóznać; hewak rěka žórło <b>Dźělene</b>.</p><h3>Wobrazy a PDF-dataje</h3><p>JPEG, PNG, WebP, GIF a PDF so po datajowej signaturje přepruwuja. Kóžda dataja smě maksimalnje <b>8 MiB</b> měć. Při samych přiwěškach Magnolie jednu noticu-dźeržak wutwori. Při wjacorych tekstach a wobrazach wšitke notice notatnik prěnjeje wužiwanja a wšitke přiwěški k prěnjej noticy słušeja.</p><div class='achtung'><b>Wuslědk přepruwować</b>Njepłaćiwe abo přewulke přiwěški móža falować. Při njedosahacym rumje móže so tekst bjez nich składować. Přepruwujće titul, tekst a přiwěšk před zhašenjom originala.</div><div class='merke'><b>Jedyn PDF, nic zběrka</b>Androidowy dźělenski cil akceptuje jedyn PDF. Wjacore PDF hromadźe njejsu podpěrany puć.</div>","<p>Shift planner and Cycle calendar are initially switched off under <i>Settings ▸ Calendar</i>. Switching either feature off hides its marks but keeps its definitions and assigned days.</p><h3>Define the marks</h3><p><b>Shift planner</b> offers Early shift (06:00-14:00), Late shift (14:00-22:00), Night shift (22:00-06:00), and custom rows with a name, from/to times, and color. At most one shift can be assigned to a day.</p><p><b>Cycle calendar</b> offers three bleeding intensities, Ovulation, Follicular phase, Fertile days, and custom rows with a name, symbol of up to six characters, and color. Several cycle markers can share a day.</p><h3>Assign a date range</h3><ol class='schritte'><li>Enable the required planner and create its definitions.</li><li>Open a <b>new</b> appointment sheet and set <b>Date</b> and <b>Through</b>.</li><li>Under <span class='knopfwort'>Day markers</span>, choose a shift or click one or more cycle symbols.</li><li>Choose <span class='knopfwort'>No shift</span> or click an active cycle symbol again to remove that mark from the complete range.</li></ol><p>The marks are saved as soon as you select them, even if you cancel the appointment sheet without adding an appointment. Existing appointment sheets do not offer this assignment area.</p><h3>Display and removal</h3><p>Month, Week, and Day show the marks; the year grid reduces them to an underline for a shift and a dot for cycle data. <span class='knopfwort'>Include shifts</span> and <span class='knopfwort'>Include cycle markers</span> are Month-calendar output choices, not Year-calendar choices. Day markers stay in the local Organizer data and send no notifications.</p><div class='achtung'><b>Deleting a definition acts everywhere</b>Deleting a shift or cycle definition immediately removes all its assigned marks. There is no confirmation and no recycle-bin copy.</div>":"<p>Změnowy planowak a cyklusowa protyka stej spočatnje pod <i>Nastajenja ▸ Protyka</i> wupinjenej. Wupinjenje marki schowa, ale definicije a dny wobchowa.</p><h3>Marki definować</h3><p><b>Změnowy planowak</b> poskića zažnu změnu (06:00-14:00), pózdnju (14:00-22:00), nócnu (22:00-06:00) a swójske rjady z mjenom, časami a barbu. Jenož jedna změna smě na dźeń być.</p><p><b>Cyklusowa protyka</b> poskića tři intensiwity krwawjenja, owulaciju, folikularnu fazu, płódne dny a swójske rjady z mjenom, maksimalnje šěsćznamješkowym symbolom a barbu. Wjacore marki smědźa samsny dźeń dźělić.</p><h3>Dobu připokazać</h3><ol class='schritte'><li>Zapńće planowak a wutworće definicije.</li><li>Wočińće <b>nowe</b> terminowe łopjeno a nastajće <b>Datum</b> a <b>Hač do</b>.</li><li>Pod <span class='knopfwort'>Dnjowe marki</span> wubjerće změnu abo cyklusowe symbole.</li><li>Wubjerće <span class='knopfwort'>Žana změna</span> abo klikńće aktiwny symbol znowa za wotstronjenje z cyłeje doby.</li></ol><p>Marki so hnydom składuja, samo hdyž terminowe łopjeno přetorhnjeće. Eksistowace terminowe łopjena wobłuk njeposkićuja.</p><h3>Pokazanje a wotstronjenje</h3><p>Měsac, tydźeń a dźeń marki pokazuja; lětna šěrokosć změnu jako podšmórnjenje a cyklus jako dypk. <span class='knopfwort'>Změny zapřijeć</span> a <span class='knopfwort'>Cyklusowe marki zapřijeć</span> stej wuběraj měsacneho, nic lětneho wudaća. Marki lokalne wostanu a zdźělenki njepósćelu.</p><div class='achtung'><b>Zhašenje definicije skutkuje wšudźe</b>Zhašenje definicije hnydom wšitke připokazane marki bjez wobkrućenja abo papjernikoweje kopije wotstroni.</div>","<p>Some appointments fall on a weekday of the month rather than on a date: the works meeting on the second Thursday, the reading circle on the last Tuesday. <span class='knopfwort'>Frequency</span> offers this as its own choice.</p><ol class='schritte'><li>Create the first appointment of the series as usual.</li><li>Select <span class='knopfwort'>recurring appointment</span>.</li><li>Under <span class='knopfwort'>Frequency</span>, choose the entry that reads <i>every month on the …</i>. It is the fourth of the five choices and already names the weekday of the date you started from.</li><li>The row <span class='knopfwort'>Monthly weekday</span> now appears below. In the left field choose <span class='knopfwort'>first</span>, <span class='knopfwort'>second</span>, <span class='knopfwort'>third</span>, <span class='knopfwort'>fourth</span> or <span class='knopfwort'>last</span>; in the right field the weekday.</li><li>If the series has an end, enter it under <span class='knopfwort'>Until (leave blank for no end)</span>. Left blank, the series continues indefinitely.</li><li>Click <span class='knopfwort'>Add appointment</span>.</li></ol><p>The line below the fields states in words what you have set, and the choice in the list changes with it. <span class='knopfwort'>last</span> means the final matching weekday of the month, whether the month holds four or five of them.</p><div class='achtung'><b>The series is one appointment</b>As with every recurrence, opening one occurrence edits the whole series, and deleting one removes all of them.</div>":"<p>Někotre terminy su na tydźenskim dnju měsaca. <span class='knopfwort'>Hustosć</span> ma za to opciju.</p><ol class='schritte'><li>Wutworće prěni termin.</li><li>Wubjerće <span class='knopfwort'>wospjetowacy so termin</span>.</li><li>Pod <span class='knopfwort'>Hustosć</span> wubjerće <i>kóždy měsac na…</i>.</li><li>Pod <span class='knopfwort'>Měsačny tydźenski dźeń</span> wubjerće <span class='knopfwort'>prěni</span>, <span class='knopfwort'>druhi</span>, <span class='knopfwort'>třeći</span>, <span class='knopfwort'>štwórty</span> abo <span class='knopfwort'>posledni</span> a dźeń.</li><li>Kónc zapodajće pod <span class='knopfwort'>Hač do (prózdne bjez kónca)</span>.</li><li>Klikńće <span class='knopfwort'>Termin přidać</span>.</li></ol><p><span class='knopfwort'>posledni</span> je posledni hodźacy so dźeń měsaca.</p><div class='achtung'><b>Serija je jedyn termin</b>Wobdźěłanje abo zhašenje płaći za cyłu seriju.</div>","<p>Some appointments recur regularly: taking medicine every day, putting out the bins every Tuesday, paying the rent on the third of every month, holding a meeting on the second Thursday of every month, or receiving the garden maintenance bill once a year. You do not need to enter each occurrence separately.</p><ol class='schritte'><li>Create the first appointment in the series.</li><li>Select <b>recurring appointment</b>.</li><li>Under <b>Frequency</b>, choose one of the five recurrence types: <b>every day</b>, <b>every week on the same weekday</b>, <b>every month on the same day</b>, <b>every month on a selected weekday</b>, or <b>every year on the same date</b>.</li><li>If you wish, enter the final date under <b>Until (leave blank for no end)</b>. If you leave the field blank, the series continues indefinitely.</li><li>Click <span class='knopfwort'>Add appointment</span>.</li></ol><h3>Short months and leap years</h3><p>A monthly appointment set for the 31st appears on the last day of shorter months. An annual appointment set for February 29 appears on February 28 in non-leap years. The reminder service takes every calculated occurrence into account. The monthly weekday choice is explained on the next page.</p><div class='achtung'><b>The entire series</b>Opening and editing one occurrence changes the entire series. Deleting an occurrence also removes every occurrence in the series. Limitations are described under Export on page <b data-page='exporting-data-to-other-programs' class='knopfwort'></b>, and under Planner and printing on page <b data-page='printing-and-saving-as-pdf' class='knopfwort'></b>.</div>":"<p>Prawidłowne terminy njetrjebaće jednotliwje zapodać.</p><ol class='schritte'><li>Wutworće prěni termin.</li><li>Wubjerće <b>wospjetowacy so termin</b>.</li><li>Pod <b>Hustosć</b> wubjerće <b>kóždy dźeń</b>, <b>kóždy tydźeń na samsnym dnju</b>, <b>kóždy měsac na samsnym dnju</b>, <b>kóždy měsac na wubranym tydźenskim dnju</b> abo <b>kóžde lěto na samsnym datumje</b>.</li><li>Kónc pod <b>Hač do (prózdne bjez kónca)</b>.</li><li>Klikńće <span class='knopfwort'>Termin přidać</span>.</li></ol><h3>Krótke měsacy a přestupne lěta</h3><p>31. budźe posledni dźeń krótkeho měsaca, 29. februara budźe 28. februara.</p><div class='achtung'><b>Cyła serija</b>Změna a zhašenje płaćitej za wšitko. Eksport hlejće <b data-page='exporting-data-to-other-programs' class='knopfwort'></b>, ćišć <b data-page='printing-and-saving-as-pdf' class='knopfwort'></b>.</div>","<p>Tap a row to open its editor. It contains <span class='knopfwort'>Title</span>, <span class='knopfwort'>Write here …</span>, <span class='knopfwort'>Symbol</span>, the creation time, <span class='knopfwort'>Save</span>, <span class='knopfwort'>Delete</span> and a visible Back arrow.</p><h3>Two safe ways to keep a change</h3><ul><li><span class='knopfwort'>Save</span> writes the current values and closes the editor.</li><li>The <b>visible Back arrow inside Magnolie Notes</b> saves and then closes the editor.</li></ul><p>Saving changes the modification time but retains the original creation time.</p><div class='achtung'><b>Android's system Back action does not save</b>The system Back button or gesture merely closes the editor. It can discard changes, and a newly opened <span class='knopfwort'>New note</span> exists only in the editor until you use Save or the visible Back arrow. There is no autosave.</div><h3>Delete a note</h3><p>Tap <span class='knopfwort'>Delete</span>. The question <b>Delete this note for good?</b> offers <span class='knopfwort'>Delete</span> and <span class='knopfwort'>Cancel</span>. Despite that severe wording, the normal initial setting removes the note from the active list and places it in the app's trash rather than destroying it immediately.</p><div class='merke'><b>Read every deletion prompt</b>The result can differ if trash use has been switched off. Recovery and permanent removal belong to the later recovery chapter.</div>":"<p>Podótkńće so rjada, zo byšće jeho editor wočinili. Wobsahuje <span class='knopfwort'>Titul</span>, <span class='knopfwort'>Tu pisać …</span>, <span class='knopfwort'>Symbol</span>, wutworjenski čas, <span class='knopfwort'>Składować</span>, <span class='knopfwort'>Zhašeć</span> a widźomnu šipku Wróćo.</p><h3>Dwě wěstej móžnosći změnu wobchować</h3><ul><li><span class='knopfwort'>Składować</span> aktualne hódnoty zapisuje a editor začinja.</li><li><b>Widźomna šipka Wróćo w Magnolie Notes</b> składuje a potom editor začinja.</li></ul><p>Składowanje změni čas změny, ale wobchowa spočatny wutworjenski čas.</p><div class='achtung'><b>Systemowa akcija Wróćo Androida njeskładuje</b>Systemowy tłóčatko abo posunjenje Wróćo editor jenož začinja. Móže změny zaćisnyć; nowa <span class='knopfwort'>Nowa notica</span> eksistuje jenož w editorje, doniž Składować abo widźomnu šipku Wróćo njewužijeće. Awtomatiske składowanje njeje.</div><h3>Noticu zhašeć</h3><p>Podótkńće so <span class='knopfwort'>Zhašeć</span>. Prašenje <b>Tutu noticu na přeco zhašeć?</b> poskića <span class='knopfwort'>Zhašeć</span> a <span class='knopfwort'>Přetorhnyć</span>. Najebać wótřeho słowjenja spočatne normalne nastajenje noticu z aktiwneje lisćiny do papjernika přesunje, město zo by ju hnydom zničiło.</p><div class='merke'><b>Kóžde zhašenske prašenje čitać</b>Wuslědk móže hinaši być, jeli je papjernik wupinjeny. Wobnowjenje a trajne wotstronjenje słušatej do pozdźišeho wobnowjenskeho kapitla.</div>","<p>The <b>AppImage</b> is a single file that contains the whole program. It needs no package manager, no administrator rights and no additional libraries, so it runs on distributions for which there is no DEB or RPM.</p><h3>Starting it for the first time</h3><ol class='schritte'><li>Download <i>Magnolie-Organizer-2.0.4-x86_64.AppImage</i> and put it wherever you like — your home folder is fine.</li><li>Right-click the file, choose <span class='knopfwort'>Properties</span>, open the <span class='knopfwort'>Permissions</span> tab and tick <span class='knopfwort'>Allow executing file as program</span>. In a terminal the same thing is: <i>chmod +x Magnolie-Organizer-2.0.4-x86_64.AppImage</i></li><li>Double-click the file. The closed book appears, exactly as with an installed copy.</li></ol><p>Your data is stored in the same place as with an installed copy, so you can switch between the two without moving anything.</p><h3>What is different from an installation</h3><ul><li>No entry appears in the application menu by itself. If you want one, create a launcher for the file in your desktop environment.</li><li>The AppImage brings its own display component and <b>never</b> falls back to a browser installed on your system. An installed package may do so if its own display component is unavailable.</li><li>Updates are offered only as a new AppImage, never as a DEB — and an installed DEB is never offered an AppImage. Each way stays with its own kind.</li></ul><div class='merke'><b>Check the file before you trust it</b>Every release is published with a list of SHA-256 checksums. Compare the value for your file before the first start: <i>sha256sum Magnolie-Organizer-2.0.4-x86_64.AppImage</i></div><div class='technik'><b>For advanced readers</b>The AppImage bundles Python, PyGObject, the GTK and WebKit runtime libraries, the typelibs, all translations and the program resources. <i>--appimage-extract</i> unpacks the contents into a folder next to the file, which is useful for inspection or for systems without FUSE — the extracted <i>AppRun</i> starts the program directly. The update check reads only the AppImage section of the release manifest and accepts only an HTTPS address from the project's own repository together with a complete SHA-256 checksum.</div>":"<p><b>AppImage</b> je jedna dataja z cyłym programom. Njetrjeba pakćikowy zrjadowak, administratorowe prawa ani přidatne biblioteki, tuž běži na distribucijach bjez DEB abo RPM.</p><h3>Prěni start</h3><ol class='schritte'><li>Sćehńće <i>Magnolie-Organizer-2.0.4-x86_64.AppImage</i> a składujće ju něhdźe, na přikład w domjacym rjadowaku.</li><li>Klikńće z prawej tastu, wubjerće <span class='knopfwort'>Kajkosće</span>, wočińće <span class='knopfwort'>Prawa</span> a wubjerće <span class='knopfwort'>Wuwjedźenje dataje jako program dowolić</span>. W terminalu je to: <i>chmod +x Magnolie-Organizer-2.0.4-x86_64.AppImage</i></li><li>Klikńće dwójce na dataju. Začinjena kniha so kaž při instalowanej kopiji zjewi.</li></ol><p>Daty su na samsnym městnje kaž při instalowanej kopiji, tuž móžeće bjez přesuwanja přepinać.</p><h3>Rozdźěle k instalaciji</h3><ul><li>Zapisk w nałoženskim meniju so sam njewutwori; po přeću wutworće startowak.</li><li>AppImage ma swójsku pokazowansku komponentu a <b>ženje</b> na instalowany wobhladowak njewroći. Instalowany pakćik móže to činić, jeli jeho komponenta faluje.</li><li>Aktualizacija je jenož nowy AppImage, ženje DEB; instalowany DEB AppImage njedóstanje.</li></ul><div class='merke'><b>Dataju před dowěru přepruwować</b>Kóžda wersija ma lisćinu kontrolnych sumow SHA-256. Přirunajće ju před prěnim startom: <i>sha256sum Magnolie-Organizer-2.0.4-x86_64.AppImage</i></div><div class='technik'><b>Za pokročene čitarje</b>AppImage wobsahuje Python, PyGObject, běžne biblioteki GTK a WebKit, typelibs, přełožki a resursy. <i>--appimage-extract</i> wobsah do rjadowaka pódla dataje rozbali, štož je za inspekciju abo systemy bjez FUSE wužitne; rozbaleny <i>AppRun</i> program direktnje startuje. Aktualizaciska kontrola čita jenož AppImage-wotrězk manifesta a akceptuje jenož HTTPS-adresu ze swójskeho repozitorija projekta z dospołnej kontrolnej sumu SHA-256.</div>","<p>The <b>Contacts</b> section is your address book. The list of contacts and its alphabetical index are on the left; the contact card is on the right.</p><ol class='schritte'><li>Click the <b>Contacts</b> tab.</li><li>Click <span class='knopfwort'>New</span> at the top.</li><li>Complete the fields. You must enter at least a name or a company; you can add everything else later.</li><li>Click <span class='knopfwort'>Save</span>.</li></ol><h3>Name and company</h3><p>The last name and first name determine where the contact card is filed in the alphabetical index. For a business, you can enter only the company name instead. Use <b>+ Email address</b> to keep personal, work, and other email addresses together.</p><h3>A photo of the person</h3><p>The photo preview remains visible even when no image has been selected. The photo button then reads <span class='knopfwort'>Choose photo…</span>; when a photo is present, it reads <span class='knopfwort'>Remove photo</span>. If you do not use photos, go to <span class='knopfwort'>Settings ▸ Contacts</span> and clear <b>With photo</b>. The Organizer reduces image sizes and includes the photos in vCards and online synchronization.</p><div class='beispiel'><b>Example</b>Last name <i>Müller</i>, first name <i>Hans</i>, street <i>Hauptstraße 12</i>, postal code <i>47051</i>, city <i>Duisburg</i>, phone <i>0203 123456</i>.</div>":"<p>Wotrězk <b>Kontakty</b> je waš adresnik. Lisćina kontaktow z alfabetiskim indeksom je nalěwo, kontaktowa karta naprawo.</p><ol class='schritte'><li>Klikńće na rajtark <b>Kontakty</b>.</li><li>Klikńće horjeka na <span class='knopfwort'>Nowy</span>.</li><li>Wupjelńće pola. Dyrbiće znajmjeńša mjeno abo firmu zapodać; wšitko druhe móžeće pozdźišo přidać.</li><li>Klikńće <span class='knopfwort'>Składować</span>.</li></ol><h3>Mjeno a firma</h3><p>Swójbne mjeno a předmjeno postajatej, hdźe so kontaktowa karta w alfabetiskim indeksu zarjaduje. Za firmu móžeće město toho jenož firmowe mjeno zapodać. Z <b>+ E-mejlowa adresa</b> wobchowajće priwatne, dźěłowe a druhe e-mejlowe adresy hromadźe.</p><h3>Foto wosoby</h3><p>Fotowy přehlad wostanje widźomny, tež jeli hišće žadyn wobraz wubrany njeje. Fotowe tłóčatko potom rěka <span class='knopfwort'>Foto wubrać…</span>; jeli foto eksistuje, rěka <span class='knopfwort'>Foto wotstronić</span>. Jeli fota njewužiwaće, dźiće do <span class='knopfwort'>Nastajenja ▸ Kontakty</span> a wotstrońće hóčku pola <b>Z fotom</b>. Organizer wobrazy pomjeńšuje a fota do vCardow a online-synchronizacije zapřijima.</p><div class='beispiel'><b>Přikład</b>Swójbne mjeno <i>Müller</i>, předmjeno <i>Hans</i>, dróha <i>Hauptstraße 12</i>, póštowe čisło <i>47051</i>, město <i>Duisburg</i>, telefon <i>0203 123456</i>.</div>","<p>The <b>Magnolie phone connection</b> is separate from a Magnolienbaum branch. It binds Magnolie Notes to exactly one Organizer for Personal Sync and explicitly granted phone functions.</p><ol class='schritte'><li>Turn on <span class='knopfwort'>Enable phone connection</span>.</li><li>Keep phone and desktop in the same Wi-Fi, tap <span class='knopfwort'>Search for desktop</span> and choose <span class='knopfwort'>Connect to …</span>.</li><li>Compare code and fingerprint on both devices. Choose <span class='knopfwort'>Codes match</span> only when they agree; otherwise use <span class='knopfwort'>Codes differ</span>.</li></ol><h3>Bluetooth data fallback</h3><p>First complete the secure Wi-Fi pairing. Then enable <span class='knopfwort'>Bluetooth data fallback</span>, use <span class='knopfwort'>Open Bluetooth system pairing</span>, return to Magnolie Notes and tap <span class='knopfwort'>Choose paired device</span>. Android 12 and later may ask for nearby-device access. Magnolie binds the selected Bluetooth address only after another secure verification.</p><p>Wi-Fi always has priority. RFCOMM carries encrypted Magnolie data when a manual connection cannot use Wi-Fi; it is not the Magnolienbaum Bluetooth listener and carries no call audio.</p><div class='achtung'><b>Changing computers</b>Only one Organizer can be paired. Remove the old phone connection before pairing another; synchronized notes, notebooks and tasks remain, but keys, grants and waiting connection data are cleared.</div>":"<p><b>Telefonowy zwisk Magnolie</b> je separatny wot hałuzy Magnolienbauma. Zwjazuje Magnolie Notes z dokładnje jednym Organizerom za Personal Sync a wuraznje dowolene telefonowe funkcije.</p><ol class='schritte'><li>Zapńće <span class='knopfwort'>Telefonowy zwisk zmóžnić</span>.</li><li>Wostajće telefon a desktop w samsnej Wi-Fi, podótkńće so <span class='knopfwort'>Desktop pytać</span> a wubjerće <span class='knopfwort'>Z … zwjazać</span>.</li><li>Přirunajće kod a palčikowy wotćišć na woběmaj gratajomaj. Wubjerće <span class='knopfwort'>Kodaj so kryjetej</span> jenož při dospołnej runosći, hewak <span class='knopfwort'>Kodaj so njekryjetej</span>.</li></ol><h3>Bluetoothowe narunanje datow</h3><p>Dokónčće najprjedy wěste sparowanje přez Wi-Fi. Potom zmóžńće <span class='knopfwort'>Bluetoothowe narunanje datow</span>, wužijće <span class='knopfwort'>Systemowe Bluetoothowe sparowanje wočinić</span>, wróćće so do Magnolie Notes a podótkńće so <span class='knopfwort'>Sparowany grat wubrać</span>. Android 12 a nowši móže wo přistup k gratam w bliskosći prosyć. Magnolie wubranu Bluetoothowu adresu hakle po dalšim wěstym přepruwowanju zwjaza.</p><p>Wi-Fi ma přeco prioritu. RFCOMM přenošuje zaklučowane daty Magnolie, hdyž manuelny zwisk Wi-Fi wužiwać njemóže; njeje Bluetoothowy słuchak Magnolienbauma a zynk zawołanja njepřenošuje.</p><div class='achtung'><b>Ličak změnić</b>Jenož jedyn Organizer da so sparować. Wotstrońće stary telefonowy zwisk před sparowanjom druheho; synchronizowane notice, notatniki a nadawki wostanu, ale kluče, dowolnosće a čakace zwiskowe daty so zhašeja.</div>","<p>The <b>Magnolienbaum</b> joins several Magnolie Organizers together. Every computer is one <b>branch</b>. Nothing happens until you switch it on yourself.</p><ol class='schritte'><li>Open <span class='knopfwort'>Settings ▸ Magnolia tree</span>.</li><li>Type a short name into <b>Name of this branch</b>.</li><li>Tick <b>Participate in the Magnolienbaum</b>.</li></ol><div class='beispiel'>Useful names are the room or the person: <i>kitchen</i>, <i>workshop</i>, <i>Anna</i>. The other side sees this name.</div><p>The tick opens port <b>8737</b> in your own network, so that another branch can reach this computer. Windows may ask once whether it may allow this in the firewall. Answer yes, otherwise nobody will find you.</p><p>Underneath you will see the <b>Fingerprint</b>. That is a short row of letters and digits which belongs to this computer alone. Write it down. You will need it later to check that you are really talking to the right computer.</p><div class='merke'><b>Without the tick, nothing happens</b>As long as the tick is missing, the Organizer opens no port and sends nothing at all. You may remove the tick again at any time; existing branches are kept.</div><div class='achtung'><b>A branch is not a backup</b>The Magnolienbaum passes entries on to other people. It does not protect you against a broken hard disk. Keep a backup as well.</div>":"<p><b>Magnolienbaum</b> wjacore Organizery zwjazuje. Kóždy ličak je <b>hałuz</b>.</p><ol class='schritte'><li>Wočińće <span class='knopfwort'>Nastajenja ▸ Magnolienbaum</span>.</li><li>Zapodajće <b>Mjeno tuteje hałuzy</b>.</li><li>Wubjerće <b>Na Magnolienbaum wobdźělić</b>.</li></ol><div class='beispiel'>Mjena su <i>kuchnja</i>, <i>dźěłarnja</i>, <i>Anna</i>.</div><p>To port <b>8737</b> wočini. Windows móže wo firewall prašeć.</p><p><b>Palčikowy wotćišć</b> ličak identifikuje. Zapisajće jón.</p><div class='merke'><b>Bjez wuběra so ničo njestanje</b>Žadyn port ani słanje. Hałuzy při wupinjenju wostanu.</div><div class='achtung'><b>Hałuz njeje zawěsćenka</b>Nješkita před wobškodźenym krutym tačelom.</div>","<p>The <b>Notes</b> section is organized like a cabinet: a notebook group contains notebooks, and each notebook contains pages. Select the group, notebook, and page on the left; write on the right.</p><ol class='schritte'><li>Click the <b>Notes</b> tab.</li><li>If necessary, click <span class='knopfwort'>New group</span> to create a section. A notebook named <i>General</i> and an open blank page are created inside it immediately.</li><li>Click <span class='knopfwort'>New notebook</span> to create additional notebooks.</li><li>If the new blank page is not already open, click <span class='knopfwort'>New page</span>.</li><li>Enter a <b>Heading</b> at the top, such as <i>Shopping list</i>.</li><li>Click the lined page and start writing.</li></ol><p>There is no Save button: what you write is saved automatically. The heading appears immediately in the list on the left.</p><h3>Switch between pages</h3><p>Click an entry to open that page. Use the two selectors on the page to move it to a different group or notebook. The <b>✕</b> deletes the page after confirmation; if the recycle bin is enabled, you can recover it.</p><div class='beispiel'><b>What the notepad is useful for</b>Shopping lists, notes from phone calls, recipes, BahnCard passwords, measurements for buying a carpet, ideas: anything you might otherwise write on a scrap of paper and never find again.</div><div class='achtung'><b>Change groups and notebooks</b>Click the pencil icon beside a name to rename it, or the <b>✕</b> to delete it after confirmation. Any pages it contains are first moved to a remaining notebook.</div>":"<p>Wotrězk <b>Notice</b> je kaž šafa organizowany: skupina notatnikow wobsahuje notatniki a kóždy notatnik wobsahuje strony. Wubjerće skupinu, notatnik a stronu nalěwo; pišće naprawo.</p><ol class='schritte'><li>Klikńće rajtark <b>Notice</b>.</li><li>Jeli trjeba, klikńće <span class='knopfwort'>Nowa skupina</span>, zo byšće wotrězk wutworili. W nim so hnydom notatnik <i>Powšitkowne</i> a wočinjena prózdna strona wutworitej.</li><li>Klikńće <span class='knopfwort'>Nowy noticnik</span>, zo byšće dalše notatniki wutworili.</li><li>Jeli nowa prózdna strona hišće wočinjena njeje, klikńće <span class='knopfwort'>Nowa strona</span>.</li><li>Zapodajće horjeka <b>Nadpismo</b>, na přikład <i>Nákupna lisćina</i>.</li><li>Klikńće na linijowane łopjeno a započńće pisać.</li></ol><p>Tłóčatko Składować njeje: štož pišeće, so awtomatisce składuje. Nadpismo so hnydom w lisćinje nalěwo zjewi.</p><h3>Mjez stronami přechadźować</h3><p>Klikńće na zapisk, zo byšće stronu wočinili. Z dwěmaj wuběromaj na stronje móžeće ju do druheje skupiny abo druheho notatnika přesunyć. <b>✕</b> stronu po wobkrućenju zhaša; jeli je papjerowy koš zmóžnjeny, móžeće ju wobnowić.</p><div class='beispiel'><b>Za čo je noticnik dobry</b>Nákupne lisćiny, notice z telefonatow, recepty, hesła za BahnCard, měry za kupowanje tepicha, ideje: wšitko, štož byšće hewak na kusk papjera napisali a ženje zaso njenamakali.</div><div class='achtung'><b>Skupiny a notatniki změnić</b>Klikńće na symbol wołójčka pódla mjena, zo byšće je přemjenowali, abo na <b>✕</b>, zo byšće je po wobkrućenju zhašeli. Strony w nim so najprjedy do wostawaceho notatnika přesunu.</div>","<p>The <b>Planner</b> displays one year as twelve small calendars: January through June on the left and July through December on the right. Click a date to open it in your current Month, Week, or Day view.</p><h3>Marks in the year grid</h3><ul><li><b>Gold fill</b> - an appointment falls on this day, including a continuation day or calculated recurrence</li><li><b>Gold underline</b> - an anniversary</li><li><b>Red or green</b> - a public holiday or school holiday</li><li><b>Muted brown and gold</b> - Saturday or Sunday</li><li><b>Red outline</b> - today</li></ul><p>Enabled local planners add their own marks: an underline for a shift, a dot for a cycle marker, and a green field with a symbol for personal vacation. Point at a date for holiday and local-marker details. Waste collections are not shown in this compact year grid.</p><p>Use the arrows or <span class='knopfwort'>Choose year…</span> to open a four-digit year from 1000 through 9999. The separate Planner week-number setting adds a <b>CW</b> column only to this screen grid.</p><p><b>With the keyboard:</b> Tab enters the year grid once. Arrow, Home, End, Page Up, and Page Down move between dates; hold Shift with Page Up or Page Down to move by a year. Enter or Space opens the focused date in Calendar.</p><h3>Print and ODS</h3><p><span class='knopfwort'>Print</span> opens a layout and content choice, not a list of entries to delete. The <b>Year calendar</b> can include public holidays, school holidays, and personal vacation. The <b>Month calendar</b> can additionally include appointments, anniversaries, shifts, cycle markers, and waste collections; selected historical appointments remain in this output even when past entries are hidden on screen.</p><p>A printed month and its ODS file always include calendar weeks. A day cell shows at most five entry bars and then <b>+N</b>; cycle symbols remain separate. <span class='knopfwort'>ODS</span> exports the model currently shown in the preview. Both layouts are prepared for one A4 landscape page.</p><div class='merke'><b>Four optional local planners</b>Shift and cycle marks, personal vacation, and waste collections are initially switched off under <i>Settings ▸ Calendar</i>. The following pages explain their different assignment rules.</div>":"<p><b>Planowak</b> pokazuje lěto jako dwanaće małych protykow: januara hač junija nalěwo a julija hač decembra naprawo. Klikńće datum za aktualny měsacny, tydźenski abo dnjowy napohlad.</p><h3>Marki w lětnej šěrokosći</h3><ul><li><b>Zołćane wupjelnjenje</b> - termin, tež pokročowanski dźeń abo wuličene wospjetowanje</li><li><b>Zołćane podšmórnjenje</b> - róčnica</li><li><b>Čerwjene abo zelene</b> - zjawny swjaty dźeń abo šulske prózdniny</li><li><b>Tamno brune a zołćane</b> - sobota abo njedźela</li><li><b>Čerwjeny wobrys</b> - dźensa</li></ul><p>Lokalne planowaki přidaja podšmórnjenje za změnu, dypk za cyklus a zelene polo ze symbolom za dowol. Pokazujće na datum za podrobnosće. Wotpadkowe wotwozy tu njejsu.</p><p>Wužijće šipki abo <span class='knopfwort'>Lěto wubrać…</span> za lěto wot 1000 do 9999. Nastajenje tydźenskich čisłow přidawa stołpik <b>CW</b> jenož tutej šěrokosći.</p><p><b>Z tastaturu:</b> Tab do šěrokosće zastupi. Šipki, Home, End, Page Up a Page Down pohibuja; Shift z Page Up abo Page Down wo lěto. Enter abo Space datum wočini.</p><h3>Ćišć a ODS</h3><p><span class='knopfwort'>Ćišćeć</span> wuběr layouta a wobsaha wočini. <b>Lětna protyka</b> móže zjawne a šulske prózdniny a dowol wobsahować. <b>Měsacna protyka</b> tež terminy, róčnicy, změny, cyklus a wotpadkowe wotwozy; wubrane stare terminy wostanu, samo hdyž su na wobrazowce schowane.</p><p>Ćišćany měsac a ODS přeco protykowe tydźenje wobsahujetej. Komorka ma maksimalnje pjeć paskow a potom <b>+N</b>; cyklusowe symbole wostanu separatne. <span class='knopfwort'>ODS</span> pokazowany model eksportuje. Wobaj layoutaj stej za jednu A4-stronu w prěčnym formaće.</p><div class='merke'><b>Štyri opcionalne lokalne planowaki</b>Změny, cyklus, dowol a wotpadkowe wotwozy su spočatnje pod <i>Nastajenja ▸ Protyka</i> wupinjene. Přichodne strony připokazanje wujasnjeja.</div>","<p>The <b>Tasks</b> section is your to-do list. Open tasks appear on the left, with completed tasks in a separate section below. The task form is on the right.</p><h3>Create a task</h3><ol class='schritte'><li>Click the <b>Tasks</b> tab.</li><li>The <b>Title</b> field starts blank. Click it to choose a suggestion such as <i>Send documents</i>, <i>Errands</i>, or <i>Call</i>. You can also enter your own title, such as <i>Have the tires changed</i>.</li><li>Under <b>Priority</b>, choose how important the task is: 1 high, 2 medium, or 3 low.</li><li>If the task has a deadline, enter a date under <b>Due on</b>.</li><li>Click <span class='knopfwort'>Add</span>.</li></ol><h3>Mark a task as completed</h3><p>Each task has a checkbox in front of it. Click the checkbox to mark the task as completed: its title is struck through and it moves down to the completed section. Click it again to return the task to the open section.</p><h3>Overdue tasks</h3><p>When a due date has passed, the row turns reddish, allowing you to see overdue work at a glance.</p><div class='merke'><b>Clean up</b>A button above the completed-task list removes all completed tasks at once. If the recycle bin is enabled, you can recover them from there.</div>":"<p>Wotrězk <b>Nadawki</b> je waša lisćina nadawkow. Wočinjene nadawki su nalěwo, dokónčene w separatnym wotrězku pod nimi. Formular nadawka je naprawo.</p><h3>Nadawk wutworić</h3><ol class='schritte'><li>Klikńće rajtark <b>Nadawki</b>.</li><li>Polo <b>Titul</b> je spočatnje prózdne. Klikńće na nje a wubjerće namjet kaž <i>Dokumenty pósłać</i>, <i>Nákupy</i> abo <i>Telefonować</i>. Móžeće tež swójski titul zapodać, na přikład <i>Tačele změnić dać</i>.</li><li>Pod <b>Priorita</b> wubjerće wažnosć nadawka: 1 wysoka, 2 srěnja abo 3 niska.</li><li>Jeli ma nadawk termin, zapodajće datum pod <b>Dospěte dnja</b>.</li><li>Klikńće <span class='knopfwort'>Přidać</span>.</li></ol><h3>Nadawk jako dokónčeny markěrować</h3><p>Kóždy nadawk ma před sobu kontrolny kašćik. Klikńće na nje, zo byšće nadawk jako dokónčeny markěrowali: jeho titul so přešmórnje a nadawk so do wotrězka dokónčenych přesunie. Klikńće hišće raz, zo byšće jón do wotewrjenych wróćili.</p><h3>Zapoždźene nadawki</h3><p>Hdyž datum dospěća je nimo, so rjad čerwjenkawy stanje, tak zo zapoždźene dźěło hnydom widźiće.</p><div class='merke'><b>Porjadk činić</b>Tłóčatko nad lisćinu dokónčenych nadawk wšitke naraz wotstroni. Jeli je papjerowy koš zmóžnjeny, móžeće je stamtud wobnowić.</div>","<p>The <b>phone connection</b> links one desktop directly and encrypted with Magnolie Notes on exactly one pinned own phone. It uses its own <b>magnolie-phone/1</b> pairing and is not a Magnolienbaum branch. To change phones, remove the old one first.</p><h3>Pair once over Wi-Fi</h3><ol class='schritte'><li>Open <span class='knopfwort'>Settings ▸ Magnolienbaum</span> and select <span class='knopfwort'>Enable Magnolie Notes phone connection</span>. Under Windows, approve the security prompt if the Organizer asks for the firewall rule it needs.</li><li>Connect the computer and the phone to the same Wi-Fi and click <span class='knopfwort'>Connect phone via WLAN</span>.</li><li>Open the phone connection in Magnolie Notes and select this computer there.</li><li>Compare the six-digit code on both devices. If it differs, click <span class='knopfwort'>Codes differ</span>. Only when it is exactly the same, click <span class='knopfwort'>Codes match</span> and confirm on the phone.</li></ol><p>The dialog closes as soon as the phone is securely paired. Wi-Fi is available on Linux and Windows desktops alike. Manual connections prefer Wi-Fi, and automatic Personal Sync runs are always Wi-Fi only.</p><h3>Bluetooth as a fallback</h3><p>Linux and Android can use RFCOMM manually. Windows also carries and advertises the Magnolie RFCOMM service, but only when Windows grants Bluetooth access, an enabled radio is present, and the phone has already been paired under <i>Settings ▸ Bluetooth &amp; devices</i>. If one of these is missing, the Organizer names the reason instead of failing silently: <b>permission_missing</b>, <b>no_hardware</b>, <b>disabled</b> or <b>os_restricted</b>. Wi-Fi always has priority, Bluetooth carries encrypted data only and no call audio, and it never changes the Wi-Fi-only rule for automatic runs.</p><h3>What you permit, item by item</h3><p>Every capability is granted separately, on both devices: device status, selected read-only app notifications, dial requests, incoming-call state, the incoming number, answering, ending, <b>personal_notes_sync</b>, <b>personal_tasks_sync</b> and <b>personal_deletions_sync</b>. A protected action happens only when both sides allow it.</p><div class='achtung'><b>Separate from SMS</b>This connection never sends an SMS. Text messages belong exclusively to KDE Connect, from page <b data-page='kde-sms' class='knopfwort'></b> onwards. The sound of a call is never carried here either.</div>":"<p><b>Telefonowy zwisk</b> zwjazuje jedyn desktop direktnje a zaklučowany z Magnolie Notes na jednym připinjenym swójskim telefonje. Wužiwa porowanje <b>magnolie-phone/1</b> a njeje hałuz Magnolienbaum. Za změnu telefona najprjedy stary wotstrońće.</p><h3>Přez Wi-Fi porować</h3><ol class='schritte'><li>Wočińće <span class='knopfwort'>Nastajenja ▸ Magnolienbaum</span> a wubjerće <span class='knopfwort'>Telefonowy zwisk Magnolie Notes zmóžnić</span>. Pod Windowsom dowolće trěbne firewallowe prawidło.</li><li>Zwjazajće wobaj grataj ze samsnym Wi-Fi a klikńće <span class='knopfwort'>Telefon přez WLAN zwjazać</span>.</li><li>Wočińće zwisk w Magnolie Notes a wubjerće ličak.</li><li>Přirunajće šěsćměstnowy kod. Při rozdźělu klikńće <span class='knopfwort'>Kodej so rozeznawatej</span>; při eksaktnej zhromadnosći <span class='knopfwort'>Kodej so kryjetej</span> a wobkrućće na telefonje.</li></ol><p>Dialog so po porowanju začini. Wi-Fi funguje pod Linuxom a Windowsom. Manuelne zwiski je preferuja; awtomatiski Personal Sync je jenož Wi-Fi.</p><h3>Bluetooth jako narunanje</h3><p>Linux a Android móžetej manuelnje RFCOMM wužiwać. Windows słužbu Magnolie RFCOMM tež poskića, ale jenož z dowolnosću Bluetooth, zapinjenym radiom a hižo pod <i>Nastajenja ▸ Bluetooth &amp; graty</i> porowanym telefonom. Hewak Organizer přičinu pomjenuje: <b>permission_missing</b>, <b>no_hardware</b>, <b>disabled</b> abo <b>os_restricted</b>. Wi-Fi ma prioritu; Bluetooth přenjesuje jenož zaklučowane daty, žadyn zawołanski awdio, a awtomatiske běhi wostanu jenož Wi-Fi.</p><h3>Jednotliwe dowolnosće</h3><p>Na woběmaj gratomaj so separatnje dowola: gratowy staw, wubrane čitajomne nałoženske zdźělenki, zawołanske naprašowanja, staw a čisło dochadźaceho zawołanja, přiwzaće, zakónčenje, <b>personal_notes_sync</b>, <b>personal_tasks_sync</b> a <b>personal_deletions_sync</b>. Akcija so jenož stawa, hdyž wobě stronje dowolitej.</p><div class='achtung'><b>Separatnje wot SMS</b>Zwisk ženje SMS njesćele. Tekstowe powěsće słušeja jenož ke KDE Connect wot strony <b data-page='kde-sms' class='knopfwort'></b>. Zawołanski zwuk so tež njepřenjesuje.</div>","<p>The <span class='knopfwort'>SMS</span> button appears on a contact card only when at least one number is marked as <span class='knopfwort'>Mobile</span>. Open <span class='knopfwort'>Contacts</span>, select the card, click <span class='knopfwort'>SMS</span>, and choose the required number if several mobile numbers are stored.</p><h3>Assign the SMS action</h3><p>Right-click the card's <span class='knopfwort'>SMS</span> button to open <span class='knopfwort'>Assign SMS action</span>. The choices have different behavior:</p><ul><li><b>KDE Connect</b> opens Magnolie's SMS sheet and is the path for sending and local history.</li><li><span class='knopfwort'>System default</span> passes only an <b>sms:</b> address containing the number to the operating system. Message text and final sending are handled outside Magnolie.</li><li><span class='knopfwort'>Custom application</span> is supported only by the Linux backend. The Windows interface currently shows this choice too, but the Windows backend does not support it.</li></ul><div class='achtung'><b>Choose an honest supported path</b>Use KDE Connect for the integrated conversation, or System default for an external application. A visible Custom application choice on Windows is not a promise that it works there.</div>":"<p>Tłóčatko <span class='knopfwort'>SMS</span> so na kontaktowej karće jenož pokazuje, hdyž je znajmjeńša jedne čisło jako <span class='knopfwort'>Mobilny telefon</span> markěrowane. Wočińće <span class='knopfwort'>Kontakty</span>, wubjerće kartu, klikńće na <span class='knopfwort'>SMS</span> a při wjacorych mobilnych čisłach požadane wubjerće.</p><h3>SMS-akciju připokazać</h3><p>Klikńće z prawej myšacej tastu na <span class='knopfwort'>SMS</span>, zo byšće <span class='knopfwort'>SMS-akciju připokazać</span> wočinili. Wuběry so rozeznawaja:</p><ul><li><b>KDE Connect</b> wočini SMS-łopjeno Magnolie a słuži za pósłanje a lokalnu historiju.</li><li><span class='knopfwort'>Systemowy standard</span> přepoda systemej jenož adresu <b>sms:</b> z čisłom. Tekst a kónčne pósłanje so zwonka Magnolie wobdźěłatej.</li><li><span class='knopfwort'>Swójske nałoženje</span> podpěruje jenož Linuxowy pozadk. Windowsowy powjerch wuběr tuchwilu tež pokazuje, ale pozadk Windowsa jón njepodpěruje.</li></ul><div class='achtung'><b>Woprawdźe podpěrany puć wubrać</b>Wužijće KDE Connect za integrowanu rozmołwu abo Systemowy standard za eksterne nałoženje. Widźomny wuběr Swójske nałoženje pod Windows njerěka, zo tam funguje.</div>","<p>The <span class='knopfwort'>Settings</span> button is at the bottom right of the Organizer, between <span class='knopfwort'>Selection options</span> and <span class='knopfwort'>Create backup</span>. It opens a sheet above your current section; your appointments, addresses and other entries remain unchanged behind it.</p><h3>Open the page you need</h3><ol class='schritte'><li>Click <span class='knopfwort'>Settings</span>.</li><li>Choose one of the tabs at the top of the sheet. If the window is too narrow for one row, the Organizer arranges the tabs in rows of four without hiding any of them.</li><li>Make the required change on that page. Controls that cannot work on the current system or without the installed desktop application remain grey.</li><li>Close the sheet with <span class='knopfwort'>✕</span> or press <kbd>Esc</kbd>. The keyboard focus returns to the control from which you opened it.</li></ol><div class='merke'><b>Using the keyboard</b>Press <kbd>Tab</kbd> and <kbd>Shift</kbd>+<kbd>Tab</kbd> to move between controls. When a settings tab has focus, <kbd>←</kbd> and <kbd>→</kbd> select the previous or next tab; <kbd>Home</kbd> and <kbd>End</kbd> go to the first or last tab.</div>":"<p>Tłóčatko <span class='knopfwort'>Nastajenja</span> je deleka naprawo mjez <span class='knopfwort'>Wuběranskimi opcijemi</span> a <span class='knopfwort'>Zawěsćensku kopiju wutworić</span>. Wočini łopjeno nad aktualnym wotrězkom; terminy, adresy a druhe zapiski za nim so njezměnja.</p><h3>Trěbnu stronu wočinić</h3><ol class='schritte'><li>Klikńće na <span class='knopfwort'>Nastajenja</span>.</li><li>Wubjerće rajtark horjeka. Jeli je wokno pře wuske za jedyn rjad, rjaduje Organizer rajtarki do rjadow po štyrjoch a žadyn njeschowa.</li><li>Přewjedźće změnu na stronje. Elementy, kotrež na aktualnym systemje abo bjez instalowaneho desktopoweho nałoženja njefunguja, wostanu šěre.</li><li>Začińće łopjeno z <span class='knopfwort'>✕</span> abo <kbd>Esc</kbd>. Fokus tastatury so k wołacemu elementej wróći.</li></ol><div class='merke'><b>Z tastaturu</b>Z <kbd>Tab</kbd> a <kbd>Shift</kbd>+<kbd>Tab</kbd> pohibujće so mjez elementami. Hdyž ma nastajenski rajtark fokus, wubjeratej <kbd>←</kbd> a <kbd>→</kbd> předchadny abo přichodny rajtark; <kbd>Home</kbd> a <kbd>End</kbd> prěni abo posledni.</div>","<p>The Linux launcher observes standard session variables rather than inventing a separate configuration language.</p><ul><li><b>XDG_DATA_HOME</b> relocates user data from <i>~/.local/share</i>; <b>XDG_CONFIG_HOME</b> relocates configuration and private autostart files from <i>~/.config</i>; <b>XDG_STATE_HOME</b> relocates diagnostics from <i>~/.local/state</i>.</li><li><b>LANGUAGE</b> supplies the first preferred language when the saved or command-line choice is <i>system</i>. Standard locale variables such as <b>LC_ALL</b>, <b>LC_MESSAGES</b>, and <b>LANG</b> can additionally affect native library and terminal text.</li><li><b>TZ</b> is considered when resolving the system time zone. A time zone saved under Language &amp; region takes precedence where the Organizer explicitly uses it.</li><li><b>DISPLAY</b> and <b>WAYLAND_DISPLAY</b> identify the graphical session. The reminder monitor can recover session values from a running desktop process; under Wayland, notifications and window placement remain subject to the compositor.</li><li><b>MAGNOLIE_ORGANIZER_WEB</b> selects another directory containing <i>index.html</i>. It is supported for development and controlled testing, not as an everyday way to install or update the interface.</li></ul><div class='achtung'><b>Build and test variables are not runtime settings</b>Names such as <i>MAGNOLIE_CONTRIBUTOR_HASH</i>, <i>MAGNOLIE_UPDATE_SIGNING_KEY</i>, <i>MAGNOLIE_TEST_*</i>, <i>MAGNOLIE_PROGRAMM</i>, and <i>MAGNOLIE_LASTDATEI</i> belong to packaging, release, or automated tests. They are not a supported user configuration interface and must not be used to change an installed Organizer.</div>":"<p>Linuxowy startowak respektuje standardne posedźenske wariable a njewumysli separatnu konfiguračnu rěč.</p><ul><li><b>XDG_DATA_HOME</b> přesuwa wužiwarske daty z <i>~/.local/share</i>; <b>XDG_CONFIG_HOME</b> konfiguraciju a priwatne awtostartowe dataje z <i>~/.config</i>; <b>XDG_STATE_HOME</b> diagnostiku z <i>~/.local/state</i>.</li><li><b>LANGUAGE</b> podawa prěnju preferowanu rěč, hdyž je składowany abo přikazowy wuběr <i>system</i>. Standardne lokalowe wariable kaž <b>LC_ALL</b>, <b>LC_MESSAGES</b> a <b>LANG</b> móža tež tekst bibliotekow a terminala wobwliwować.</li><li><b>TZ</b> so při postajenju systemoweho časoweho pasma wobkedźbuje. Pod Rěč &amp; region składowane pasmo ma při wuraznym wužiwanju w Organizerje prioritu.</li><li><b>DISPLAY</b> a <b>WAYLAND_DISPLAY</b> identifikujetej grafiske posedźenje. Monitor dopominanjow móže posedźenske hódnoty z běžaceho desktopoweho procesa wobnowić; pod Wayland wotwisujetej zdźělenki a pozicija wokna wot kompozitora.</li><li><b>MAGNOLIE_ORGANIZER_WEB</b> wuběra druhi rjadowak z <i>index.html</i>. To je za wuwiwanje a kontrolowane testy, nic za wšědnu instalaciju abo aktualizaciju powjercha.</li></ul><div class='achtung'><b>Twarjenske a testowe wariable njejsu běžne nastajenja</b>Mjena kaž <i>MAGNOLIE_CONTRIBUTOR_HASH</i>, <i>MAGNOLIE_UPDATE_SIGNING_KEY</i>, <i>MAGNOLIE_TEST_*</i>, <i>MAGNOLIE_PROGRAMM</i> a <i>MAGNOLIE_LASTDATEI</i> słušeja k pakowanju, wersijam abo awtomatiskim testam. Njejsu podpěrany wužiwarski konfiguračny powjerch a njesmědźa so za změnu instalowaneho Organizera wužiwać.</div>","<p>The Magnolienbaum first tries known direct addresses. Local discovery advertises branch name, identifier, fingerprint, address and port; these are routing and comparison data, not the shared note itself. A direct target may also be reached through a deliberately configured VPN, tunnel, IPv6 route or router forwarding.</p><h3>Protection above the transport</h3><p>The direct service uses HTTP framing rather than HTTPS, but pairing, ephemeral session keys, authenticated encryption, replay protection and cryptographic receipts protect the Magnolie payload. The fingerprint and comparison code remain essential because transport encryption alone would not identify the intended branch.</p><h3>When direct delivery fails</h3><p>The outbox keeps a pending message and retries it. A configured Nextcloud mailbox is an outgoing HTTPS alternative and follows system certificate validation, same-origin DAV references and no redirects. HTTPS protects the trip to the server. Server paths, account, times and object sizes remain visible to that service.</p><div class='achtung'><b>Integrity is not always secrecy</b>A hash proves equality and an HMAC authenticates data, but neither necessarily hides readable content. Protect the Nextcloud account and storage as well as the Magnolie pairing.</div>":"<p>Magnolienbaum najprjedy znate direktne adresy pospytuje. Lokalne namakanje wozjewja mjeno hałuzy, identifikator, palčikowy wotćišć, adresu a port; to su rutowanske a přirunanske daty, nic dźělena notica. Direktny cil móže so tež přez wědomje zarjadowany VPN, tunel, IPv6-rutu abo dalesposrědkowanje routera docpěć.</p><h3>Škit nad transportom</h3><p>Direktna słužba wužiwa HTTP-ramikowanje město HTTPS, ale sparowanje, nachwilne posedźenske kluče, awtentifikowane zaklučowanje, škit před wospjetowanjom a kryptografiske wobkrućenja wobsah Magnolie škitaja. Palčikowy wotćišć a přirunanski kod wostanetej rozsudnej, dokelž same transportowe zaklučowanje cilowu hałuzu njeidentifikuje.</p><h3>Hdyž so direktne doručenje njeporadźi</h3><p>Wuchad wobchowa čakacu powěsć a pospytuje znowa. Zarjadowany póštowy kašćik Nextcloud je won dźaca HTTPS-alternatiwa a slěduje systemowemu přepruwowanju certifikatow, DAV-wotkazam samsneho pochada a njedowoli dalesposrědkowanja. HTTPS puć k serwerej škita. Serwerowe puće, konto, časy a wulkosće objektow wostanu słužbje widźomne.</p><div class='achtung'><b>Integrita njeje přeco potajnosć</b>Haš runosć dopokazuje a HMAC daty awtentifikuje, ale žadyn njetrjeba čitajomny wobsah schować. Škitajće konto a składowanje Nextcloud runje kaž sparowanje Magnolie.</div>","<p>The Organizer can keep appointments and contacts in step with an account that is already set up on your computer. Which sources are available depends on the system.</p><h3>Online accounts through the system</h3><p>On Linux, if you have configured an online account in your system settings — for example with an email or calendar provider — the Organizer can synchronize appointments and contacts with it.</p><ol class='schritte'><li>Open <span class='knopfwort'>Settings ▸ Synchronization</span>.</li><li>Under <b>Calendar</b>, select all the calendars you want, then select the address book.</li><li>Click <span class='knopfwort'>Synchronize now</span>.</li></ol><p>When versions differ, the <b>most recently changed</b> version wins. All selected calendars are synchronized together; new appointments are added to the first selected calendar. Deletions are carried in both directions. If you wish, the Organizer can synchronize whenever it starts; a separate option enables this. For contacts, multiple valid email addresses are combined, and contact photos are transferred in both directions. An empty photo field does not delete a local photo. Multi-day appointments retain their start and end. Clearly named synchronized school holidays, such as <i>Summer holidays Saxony 2026</i>, appear in green regardless of state or year and are not shown twice. Recognized public holidays appear in red and are merged with a fetched holiday of the same name on the same day. Birthdays from the online address book are added as local anniversaries; they are not permanently linked to subsequent changes to or deletion of the contact.</p><h3>The Windows Contacts folder</h3><p>On Windows, the <i>Contacts</i> folder of your user profile is available without signing in anywhere. The Organizer reads and writes only <i>.contact</i> files there and never deletes files that do not belong to it.</p><h3>Outlook.com and Microsoft 365</h3><p>Modern Microsoft contacts can optionally be connected through Microsoft Graph. Enter the client ID of your own Microsoft Entra app registration, enable the device-code flow, and grant the delegated <i>Contacts.ReadWrite</i> permission. No client secret is needed or stored.</p><p>The Organizer displays a device code and opens Microsoft’s verification page. The refresh token is protected with Windows DPAPI for your Windows account alone and is deleted when you sign out. Without an app registration, the local Windows Contacts synchronization and all file imports remain available.</p><div class='merke'><b>Recurring appointments</b>The Organizer does not currently transfer its own recurrence rules to the online account. Incoming nonannual series are imported as a single appointment only; annual calendar series are not added to the appointment list during synchronization. Keep recurring series in a complete backup as well.</div><div class='achtung'><b>If the selection remains empty</b>The components for online accounts are missing. They can be installed afterward; the Organizer displays the required command on the page. Restart the program once afterward.</div><div class='merke'><b>You can also work without an account</b>Synchronization is optional, not required. If you want to keep your data only on your own computer, simply leave this page untouched.</div>":"<p>Organizer móže terminy a kontakty z kontom synchronizować, kotrež je hižo na ličaku zarjadowane. Kotre žórła su k dispoziciji, wotwisuje wot systema.</p><h3>Online-konta přez system</h3><p>Pod Linuxom móže Organizer z online-kontom ze systemowych nastajenjow, na přikład pola e-mejloweho abo protykoweho poskićowarja, terminy a kontakty synchronizować.</p><ol class='schritte'><li>Wočińće <span class='knopfwort'>Nastajenja ▸ Synchronizacija</span>.</li><li>Pod <b>Protyka</b> wubjerće wšitke požadane protyki a potom adresnik.</li><li>Klikńće na <span class='knopfwort'>Nětko synchronizować</span>.</li></ol><p>Při rozdźělnych wersijach dobywa <b>najnowšo změnjena</b>. Wšitke wubrane protyki so hromadźe synchronizuja; nowe terminy dóńdu do prěnjeho. Zhašenja so we woběmaj směrje přenošuja. Separatna opcija zmóžnja synchronizaciju při starće. Wjacore płaćiwe e-mejlowe adresy so zjednoća a kontaktowe fota we woběmaj směrje přenošuja; prózdne fotowe polo lokalne foto njezhaša. Wjacednjowe terminy wobchowaja započatk a kónc. Jasnje pomjenowane šulske prózdniny kaž <i>Lěćne prózdniny Sakska 2026</i> su zelenje a njepokazuja so dwójce. Spóznate swjate dny su čerwjenje a z pobratym swjatym dnjom samsneho mjena a datuma so zjednoća. Narodniny z online-adresnika dóńdu jako lokalne róčnicy, ale njejsu trajnje ze změnami abo zhašenjom kontakta zwjazane.</p><h3>Windowsowy rjadowak Contacts</h3><p>Pod Windows je rjadowak <i>Contacts</i> wužiwarskeho profila bjez přizjewjenja k dispoziciji. Organizer tam jenož dataje <i>.contact</i> čita a pisa a cuze dataje ženje njezhaša.</p><h3>Outlook.com a Microsoft 365</h3><p>Modernje Microsoftowe kontakty dadźa so opcionalnje přez Microsoft Graph zwjazać. Zapodajće klientowy ID swójskeje registracije Microsoft Entra, zmóžńće běh z gratowym kodom a dowolće delegowanu dowolnosć <i>Contacts.ReadWrite</i>. Klientowe potajnstwo njetrjeba so ani njeskładuje.</p><p>Organizer pokazuje gratowy kod a wočini Microsoftowu přepruwowansku stronu. Refresh-token škita Windows DPAPI jenož za waše konto a při wotzjewjenju so zhaša. Bjez registracije wostanetej lokalna synchronizacija Windows Contacts a wšitke datajowe importy k dispoziciji.</p><div class='merke'><b>Wospjetowace so terminy</b>Organizer swoje prawidła wospjetowanja tuchwilu do online-konta njepřenjesuje. Dochadźace njelětne serije so jako jedyn termin importuja; lětne protykowe serije so při synchronizaciji do terminoweje lisćiny njepřidaja. Wobchowajće je tež w dospołnej zawěsćenskej kopiji.</div><div class='achtung'><b>Jeli wuběr prózdny wostanje</b>Komponenty online-kontow faluja. Dadźa so doinstalować; Organizer trěbny přikaz pokazuje. Potom program jónu znowa startujće.</div><div class='merke'><b>Tež bjez konta móžeće dźěłać</b>Synchronizacija je opcionalna. Jeli maja daty jenož na wašim ličaku wostać, njezměńće tutu stronu.</div>","<p>The Organizer can notify you before an appointment begins. Open <span class='knopfwort'>Settings ▸ Notifications</span>, unfold <span class='knopfwort'>Appointment reminders</span>, select <span class='knopfwort'>Enable reminders</span>, and choose a default Lead time from the appointment time to two hours before it. The master switch is also required for task and anniversary reminders.</p><h3>Due, recurring, and missed appointments</h3><p>All-day appointments are treated as starting at 8 a.m. Recurring appointments are expanded for notification, while unsupported imported alarms remain read-only and do not create a replacement reminder. <span class='knopfwort'>Also remind me about missed appointments</span> catches recent appointments after downtime; it is not an unlimited archive. Closing a notice marks it as reported; there is no snooze function.</p><h3>Appearance and sound</h3><p><span class='knopfwort'>System style (desktop notification)</span> uses the desktop notification area. Under Linux X11, <span class='knopfwort'>Organizer style (paper sheet)</span> can instead show a Magnolie sheet and offers Screen notification only, Sound only, or Notification and sound. Under Wayland only system style is offered. On Windows visual reminders use the notification area; the bundled Magnolie chime can accompany them, and Windows notification permissions decide whether they may be shown or heard.</p><h3>What runs in the background</h3><p>Linux installs a separate reminder monitor and a persistent minute check, so reminders can continue after the book closes. Windows starts the Organizer hidden at login for reminders; keep that process running or close it into the tray. <span class='knopfwort'>Quit</span> ends reminders until the next start. Browser-only use checks ordinary appointments while the page remains open, but not tasks, anniversaries, or the full recurrence service.</p><h3>Wake-up and diagnosis</h3><p><span class='knopfwort'>Wake the computer from suspend</span> is a Linux attempt for the next directly stored appointment; calculated recurrences, tasks, anniversaries, and Windows do not schedule a wake-up. Use <span class='knopfwort'>Show preview</span> to test delivery. On Linux, enable <span class='knopfwort'>Keep a troubleshooting log</span> only temporarily and use <span class='knopfwort'>Show log</span>; <i>magnolie-organizer --probe</i> gives an additional diagnostic report. On Windows, Show log opens the application logs rather than a dedicated reminder trace.</p>":"<p>Organizer móže was před započatkom termina informować. Wočińće <span class='knopfwort'>Nastajenja ▸ Zdźělenki</span>, rozwińće <span class='knopfwort'>Terminowe dopominanja</span>, wubjerće <span class='knopfwort'>Dopominanja zmóžnić</span> a standardny předčas wot časa termina hač do dweju hodźin. Hłowny přepinak trjebaja tež dopominanja nadawkow a róčnicow.</p><h3>Dospěte, wospjetowace so a skomdźene terminy</h3><p>Cyłodnjowe terminy započinaja za dopominanja w 8 hodź. Wospjetowace so terminy so rozšěrjeja; njepodpěrane importowane alarmy wostanu jenož čitajomne a žane narunanske dopomnjeće njewutworja. <span class='knopfwort'>Tež na skomdźene terminy dopominać</span> krótko za wupadnjenjom minjene terminy zapřija, ale njeje njewobmjezowany archiw. Začinjenje zdźělenki ju jako zdźělenu markěruje; funkcija drěmanja njeje.</p><h3>Napohlad a zynk</h3><p><span class='knopfwort'>Systemowy stil (desktopowa zdźělenka)</span> wužiwa zdźělenski wobłuk. Pod Linux X11 móže <span class='knopfwort'>Stil Organizera (papjerowe łopjeno)</span> město toho łopjeno Magnolie pokazać a poskića jenož wobrazowkowu zdźělenku, jenož zynk abo zdźělenku ze zynkom. Pod Wayland je jenož systemowy stil. Pod Windows su wizuelne dopominanja w zdźělenskim wobłuku a móže je zynk Magnolie přewodźeć; Windowsowe dowolnosće rozsudźa wo pokazanju a zynku.</p><h3>Što w pozadku běži</h3><p>Linux instaluje separatny monitor a trajne minutowe přepruwowanje, tuž móža dopominanja po začinjenju knihy pokročować. Windows startuje Organizer za dopominanja při přizjewjenju schowany; proces dyrbi běžeć abo so do systemoweho pola začinić. <span class='knopfwort'>Skónčić</span> dopominanja hač do přichodneho starta zastaji. Jenož wobhladowak přepruwuje zwyčajne terminy, doniž je strona wočinjena, ale nic nadawki, róčnicy abo dospołnu słužbu wospjetowanja.</p><h3>Wubudźenje a diagnostika</h3><p><span class='knopfwort'>Ličak ze spanskeho modusa wubudźić</span> je Linuxowy pospyt za přichodny direktnje składowany termin; wobličene wospjetowanja, nadawki, róčnicy a Windows wubudźenje njaplanuja. Z <span class='knopfwort'>Přehlad pokazać</span> doručenje testujće. Pod Linux zmóžńće <span class='knopfwort'>Protokol za pytanje zmylkow wobchować</span> jenož nachwilnje a wužijće <span class='knopfwort'>Protokol pokazać</span>; <i>magnolie-organizer --probe</i> dodawa dalšu rozprawu. Pod Windows wočini Pokazać protokol nałoženske protokole, nic wosebity slěd dopominanjow.</p>","<p>The Organizer normally opens as a window. Only one instance runs: starting it again brings the existing window forward instead of opening a second copy. An invocation with <i>--tray-start</i> deliberately leaves an already running instance undisturbed.</p><h3>Start in the tray</h3><p>Open <span class='knopfwort'>Settings ▸ General ▸ Tray applet</span>, enable the tray applet and then select <span class='knopfwort'>Start the organizer in the tray</span>. A hidden start is used only when the tray is enabled. Under Linux the program additionally requires a working tray indicator; if none can be created, it shows the ordinary window so that you cannot lose access to it.</p><h3>How the window returns</h3><p>Under <span class='knopfwort'>When opening from the tray</span>, choose <b>Previous window state</b>, <b>Centered on the screen</b> or <b>Maximized</b>. Previous state includes the normal size and whether the window was maximized or in full screen. Windows does not restore an exact screen position. Linux can restore it under X11; under Wayland the compositor decides the position and treats centering or maximizing as a request.</p><div class='merke'><b>Full screen</b><kbd>F11</kbd> switches full screen on and off. When Previous window state is selected, this state is remembered as well.</div>":"<p>Organizer so normalnje jako wokno wočini. Jenož jedna instanca běži; nowy start přinjese eksistowace wokno doprědka. Zawołanje z <i>--tray-start</i> běžacu instancu z wotpohladom njedótknje.</p><h3>W systemowym polu startować</h3><p>Wočińće <span class='knopfwort'>Nastajenja ▸ Powšitkowne ▸ Systemowy applet</span>, zmóžńće applet a potom <span class='knopfwort'>Organizer w systemowym polu startować</span>. Schowany start so jenož při zmóžnjenym polu wužiwa. Pod Linux trjeba program tež fungowacy indikator; jeli njeda so wutworić, pokaza normalne wokno, zo by přistup wostał.</p><h3>Kak so wokno wróći</h3><p>Pod <span class='knopfwort'>Při wočinjenju ze systemoweho pola</span> wubjerće <b>Předchadny staw wokna</b>, <b>Na wobrazowce centrowane</b> abo <b>Maksimizowane</b>. Předchadny staw zapřija normalnu wulkosć a maksimalizowany abo cyłowobrazowkowy staw. Windows eksaktnu poziciju njewobnowja. Linux móže ju pod X11 wobnowić; pod Wayland rozsudźi kompozitor a centrowanje abo maksimalizowanje ma za požadanje.</p><div class='merke'><b>Cyła wobrazowka</b><kbd>F11</kbd> cyłowobrazowkowy modus přepina. Při Předchadnym stawje wokna so tež tutón staw spomjatkuje.</div>","<p>The SMS sheet has its own small settings sheet. It is not in the main settings and cannot be reached from there.</p><h3>How to open it</h3><ol class='schritte'><li>Open a conversation with the <span class='knopfwort'>SMS</span> button on a contact card.</li><li>At the top left of the sheet, beside the name, sits a second small <span class='knopfwort'>SMS</span> button.</li><li>Click it. A sheet headed <span class='knopfwort'>SMS settings</span> opens.</li></ol><h3>How long an incoming message stays on screen</h3><p>When an SMS arrives, a notice appears on the screen. Under <span class='knopfwort'>Hide SMS notification after</span> you decide how long it remains. You may choose <span class='knopfwort'>15 seconds</span>, <span class='knopfwort'>30 seconds</span>, <span class='knopfwort'>1 minute</span>, <span class='knopfwort'>2 minutes</span> or <span class='knopfwort'>Never automatically</span>.</p><p>The choice takes effect at once; there is no button to save it. <span class='knopfwort'>Close</span> puts the sheet away.</p><div class='merke'><b>Never automatically means what it says</b>The notice then waits until you close it yourself. This is helpful if you leave the room often and do not want to miss anything.</div>":"<p>SMS-łopjeno ma swójske nastajenja.</p><h3>Wočinjenje</h3><ol class='schritte'><li>Wočińće rozmołwu z <span class='knopfwort'>SMS</span>.</li><li>Klikńće małe <span class='knopfwort'>SMS</span> pódla mjena.</li><li><span class='knopfwort'>SMS-nastajenja</span> so wočinja.</li></ol><h3>Dołhosć pokazanja</h3><p>Pod <span class='knopfwort'>SMS-zdźělenku schować po</span> wubjerće <span class='knopfwort'>15 sekundach</span>, <span class='knopfwort'>30 sekundach</span>, <span class='knopfwort'>1 mjeńšinje</span>, <span class='knopfwort'>2 mjeńšinomaj</span> abo <span class='knopfwort'>Ženje awtomatisce</span>.</p><p>Wuběr hnydom płaći. <span class='knopfwort'>Začinić</span> łopjeno začini.</p><div class='merke'><b>Ženje awtomatisce to tež rěka</b>Zdźělenka čaka na waše začinjenje.</div>","<p>The background reminder service cannot read the encrypted main data file after the Organizer has closed. Without additional consent, it therefore remains silent while the Organizer is locked.</p><ol class='schritte'><li>Open <span class='knopfwort'>Settings ▸ Security</span> and unfold <span class='knopfwort'>Password protection</span>.</li><li>Select <span class='knopfwort'>Allow notifications despite password protection</span>.</li></ol><p>The Organizer then writes a limited reminder subset unencrypted to a separate local file that only your user account may read. It contains the necessary identifiers, titles or names, dates, times, recurrence and reminder values for appointments, tasks, and anniversaries, including the anniversary type and scheduler settings. It does not contain contacts, person records or assignments, notes, links, delegation details, or synchronization metadata.</p><h3>Confidential entries need a second decision</h3><p>Appointments, tasks, and anniversaries marked confidential remain excluded unless you additionally select <span class='knopfwort'>Also disclose appointments marked as confidential</span>. Despite the shorter label, that second consent applies to all three reminder types.</p><div class='achtung'><b>Choose between secrecy and background delivery</b>Without consent, the separate file is removed and all main data remains encrypted, but no closed-program background reminder can read it. With consent, the limited values described above remain locally readable while the Organizer is locked. Disabling the permission removes the separate reminder file again.</div>":"<p>Słužba dopominanjow w pozadku po začinjenju Organizera zaklučowanu hłownu dataju čitać njemóže. Bjez přidatneho přizwolenja tohodla při zamknjenym Organizerje mjelči.</p><ol class='schritte'><li>Wočińće <span class='knopfwort'>Nastajenja ▸ Wěstota</span> a rozwińće <span class='knopfwort'>Hesłowy škit</span>.</li><li>Wubjerće <span class='knopfwort'>Zdźělenki najebać hesłoweho škita dowolić</span>.</li></ol><p>Organizer potom wobmjezowanu sadźbu dopominanjow njezaklučowanu do separatneje lokalneje dataje pisa, kotruž jenož waše konto smě čitać. Wona wobsahuje trěbne identifikatory, titule abo mjena, datumy, časy a hódnoty wospjetowanja a dopominanja za terminy, nadawki a róčnicy, inkluziwnje typa róčnicy a nastajenjow planowaka. Kontakty, wosobowe rekordy abo připokazanja, notice, wotkazy, delegowanske podrobnosće a synchronizaciske metadaty njewobsahuje.</p><h3>Dowěrliwe zapiski trjebaja druhi rozsud</h3><p>Jako dowěrliwe markěrowane terminy, nadawki a róčnicy wostanu wuwzate, chiba zo přidatnje <span class='knopfwort'>Tež jako dowěrliwe markěrowane terminy wotkryć</span> wubjerjeće. Najebać króćeho popisa płaći druhe přizwolenje za wšitke tři typy.</p><div class='achtung'><b>Mjez potajnosću a doručenjom w pozadku wubrać</b>Bjez přizwolenja so separatna dataja wotstroni a hłowne daty wostanu zaklučowane, ale dopomnjeće při začinjenym programje je čitać njemóže. Z přizwolenjom wostanu wopisane hódnoty při zamknjenym Organizerje lokalnje čitajomne. Wupinjenje dowolnosće dataju zaso wotstroni.</div>","<p>The global appointment lead time is one of <b>0, 5, 10, 15, 30, 60 or 120 minutes</b>. An appointment, task or anniversary can additionally use an individual lead time of <b>one through seven days</b>.</p><h3>Imported and extended alarms</h3><p>An appointment accepts at most <b>32 alarms</b>. A supported relative display alarm may be from 0 through <b>525,600 minutes</b> before either <b>START</b> or <b>END</b>. Unsupported EMAIL alarms, absolute alarms and alarms after the event remain visible as read-only calendar information and are not silently converted.</p><h3>Reference times and catch-up windows</h3><ul><li>All-day appointments, tasks without a due time and anniversaries use <b>08:00</b>.</li><li>Missed appointment reminders look back at most <b>72 hours</b>.</li><li>Missed task and anniversary reminders look back at most <b>14 hours</b>.</li></ul><p>On Linux, the persistent reminder service invokes a due check <b>once per minute</b>. It still depends on the user session, notification permissions and the computer being able to run; the limits are not a delivery guarantee.</p>":"<p>Powšitkowny předčas termina je <b>0, 5, 10, 15, 30, 60 abo 120 mjeńšin</b>. Termin, nadawk abo róčnica móže přidatnje indiwiduelny předčas <b>jedyn hač sydom dnjow</b> wužiwać.</p><h3>Importowane a rozšěrjene alarmy</h3><p>Termin akceptuje maksimalnje <b>32 alarmow</b>. Podpěrany relatiwny wobrazowkowy alarm smě 0 hač <b>525.600 mjeńšin</b> před <b>START</b> abo <b>END</b> ležeć. Njepodpěrane EMAIL-alarmy, absolutne alarmy a alarmy po podawku wostanu jako jenož čitajomne protykowe informacije widźomne a so mjelčo njekonwertuja.</p><h3>Referencne časy a wokna nadoknadnjenja</h3><ul><li>Cyłodnjowe terminy, nadawki bjez časa dospěća a róčnicy wužiwaja <b>08:00</b>.</li><li>Skomdźene terminowe dopominanja hladanja maksimalnje <b>72 hodźin</b> wróćo.</li><li>Skomdźene dopominanja nadawkow a róčnicow maksimalnje <b>14 hodźin</b>.</li></ul><p>Pod Linuxom woła trajna słužba přepruwowanje dospěća <b>jónu na mjeńšinu</b>. Dale wotwisuje wot wužiwarskeho posedźenja, dowolnosćow zdźělenkow a běžaceho ličaka; mjezy doručenje njegarantuja.</p>","<p>The installed Organizer retrieves holiday dates once and then keeps them locally. An Internet connection is needed only for the retrieval.</p><ol class='schritte'><li>Open <span class='knopfwort'>Settings ▸ Country &amp; Holidays</span> and make the country and region choice described on the preceding page.</li><li>Under <span class='knopfwort'>Period</span>, choose this year, this year and next year, or this year through the following two years.</li><li>Leave <span class='knopfwort'>Include school holidays</span> selected if those periods are required.</li><li>Click <span class='knopfwort'>Retrieve now</span>. The status line reports the number of public holidays and holiday periods afterwards.</li></ol><h3>Retrieving again</h3><p>A successful new retrieval replaces only entries whose date range touches one of the requested years. Entries from other previously retrieved years remain in the Organizer. This makes it possible to add the next year without losing the current one. If the service returns no dates, the requested years are nevertheless considered updated.</p><p><span class='knopfwort'>Remove entries</span> is different: after confirmation, it removes all retrieved public and school holidays and clears the retrieval status. It does not remove appointments, anniversaries, personal vacation, shifts, cycle markers, or waste collections.</p><h3>Source, limits, and privacy</h3><p>The request goes directly to the open directory <i>openholidaysapi.org</i>. It contains the chosen country, region or regions, language, requested years, and whether school holidays are wanted. Your appointments, contacts, notes, and Organizer data are not sent. At most three years and 26 regions are accepted in one operation, and the complete reply is limited to 8 MiB.</p><div class='achtung'><b>A failed retrieval changes nothing</b>If the service cannot be reached, rejects the request, or sends an unreadable or oversized reply, the stored holidays remain as they were. School-holiday information is not maintained for every region; unavailable school holidays do not prevent available public holidays from being kept.</div>":"<p>Instalowany Organizer datumy swjatych dnjow jónu wobstara a potom lokalnje wobchowa. Internet trjeba jenož za wobstarowanje.</p><ol class='schritte'><li>Wočińće <span class='knopfwort'>Nastajenja ▸ Kraj &amp; swjate dny</span> a wubjerće kraj a region kaž na předchadnej stronje.</li><li>Pod <span class='knopfwort'>Doba</span> wubjerće tute lěto, tute a přichodne lěto abo tute lěto hač do dweju přichodneju.</li><li>Wostajće <span class='knopfwort'>Šulske prózdniny zapřijeć</span> wubrane, jeli je trjebaće.</li><li>Klikńće na <span class='knopfwort'>Nětko wobstarać</span>. Statusowa linka potom ličbu swjatych dnjow a prózdninskich dobow zdźěli.</li></ol><h3>Znowa wobstarać</h3><p>Wuspěšne nowe wobstarowanje naruna jenož zapiski, kotrychž datumowy wobłuk jedne z požadanych lět dótknje. Zapiski druhich prjedy wobstaranych lět wostanu. Tak da so přichodne lěto bjez zhubjenja aktualneho přidać. Tež prózdna wotmołwa słužby požadane lěta jako aktualizowane markěruje.</p><p><span class='knopfwort'>Zapiski wotstronić</span> po wobkrućenju wšitke wobstarane zjawne swjate dny a šulske prózdniny wotstroni a status wuprózdni. Terminy, róčnicy, wosobinski dowol, změny, cyklusowe marki a wotwozy njezhaša.</p><h3>Žórło, mjezy a priwatnosć</h3><p>Naprašowanje dźe direktnje do wotewrjeneho zapisa <i>openholidaysapi.org</i>. Wobsahuje kraj, region abo regiony, rěč, požadane lěta a wuběr šulskich prózdnin. Waše terminy, kontakty, notice a daty Organizera so njesćelu. Maksimalnje tři lěta a 26 regionow so w jednej operaciji akceptuja; cyła wotmołwa je na 8 MiB wobmjezowana.</p><div class='achtung'><b>Njeporadźene wobstarowanje ničo njezměni</b>Jeli słužba njeje docpějomna, naprašowanje wotpokaza abo nječitajomnu či přewulku wotmołwu sćele, wostanu swjate dny bjez změny. Šulske prózdniny njejsu za kóždy region k dispoziciji; to wobchowanje docpějomnych zjawnych swjatych dnjow njezadźěwa.</div>","<p>The line beneath the buttons in <span class='knopfwort'>Nextcloud account</span> always states the present situation. <i>Ready.</i> means everything is set up, <i>Switched off.</i> means no tick is set, and <i>Testing…</i> means the Organizer is asking the server at that very moment.</p><h3>The usual causes</h3><ul><li><i>Server address and user name are required.</i> – one of the two fields is empty.</li><li>A complaint about a missing app password – a tick is set, but no password was ever stored. Enter it and click <span class='knopfwort'>Save</span> again.</li><li>Nothing happens for a while, then an error – the server did not answer within twelve seconds. Check the Internet connection and press <span class='knopfwort'>Test connection</span> once more.</li><li>A refused login – the app password has been withdrawn in Nextcloud. Create a new one there and enter it here.</li></ul><h3>A different server or user name</h3><p>If you enter a different server address or a different user name, you must enter an app password at the same time. The old password belongs to the old account and is not carried over.</p><h3>Removing the password</h3><p><span class='knopfwort'>Delete password</span> appears only once a password is stored. The Organizer asks once more, then deletes the password and switches both purposes off. Enter a new password whenever you want to use Nextcloud again.</p><div class='merke'><b>One thing at a time</b>You cannot delete the stored password and enter a new one in the same step. Delete it first, then enter the new password and click <span class='knopfwort'>Save</span>.</div>":"<p>Pod <span class='knopfwort'>Konto Nextcloud</span> steji <i>Hotowo.</i>, <i>Wupinjene.</i> abo <i>Testuje so…</i>.</p><h3>Zwučene přičiny</h3><ul><li><i>Serwerowa adresa a wužiwarske mjeno stej trěbnej.</i></li><li>Hesło nałoženja faluje – zapodajće a klikńće <span class='knopfwort'>Składować</span>.</li><li>Serwer w 12 sekundach njewotmołwja – klikńće <span class='knopfwort'>Zwisk testować</span>.</li><li>Přizjewjenje wotpokazane – wutworće nowe hesło.</li></ul><h3>Druhi serwer abo mjeno</h3><p>Při změnje trjebaće nowe hesło nałoženja.</p><h3>Hesło wotstronić</h3><p><span class='knopfwort'>Hesło zhašeć</span> hesło a wobaj zaměraj wupina.</p><div class='merke'><b>Jedne po druhim</b>Najprjedy stare zhašeć, potom nowe zapodać a <span class='knopfwort'>Składować</span>.</div>","<p>The lower choices on <span class='knopfwort'>Settings ▸ Language &amp; region</span> control how regional information is displayed.</p><ul><li><b>Time format</b> – follow the system, or use a 12-hour or 24-hour clock.</li><li><b>First day of the week</b> – follow the format region, or begin weeks on Monday, Sunday or Saturday.</li><li><b>Week numbering</b> – uses the ISO rule: week 1 is the week containing the year's first Thursday.</li><li><b>Weather temperature</b> – follow the format region, or show Celsius or Fahrenheit.</li><li><b>Time zone</b> – enter <i>system</i>, <i>UTC</i>, or an IANA name such as <i>Europe/Berlin</i> or <i>America/New_York</i>.</li></ul><h3>What changes and what does not</h3><p>The choices affect display, sorting, calendar grids, weather values and calculations that refer to an absolute instant. An ordinary appointment entered for 09:00 remains an appointment at 09:00; the Organizer does not shift stored local appointment times when you choose another time zone.</p><p>Click <span class='knopfwort'>Save</span>. Restart the Organizer afterwards so that the interface language, time zone and native Linux or Windows parts all use the same selection. The choices are stored locally in <i>locale.json</i>, separately from the main, possibly encrypted Organizer data.</p><div class='merke'><b>Initial choice</b>A new Windows installation follows the system regional settings. Existing Linux installations retain the established German, 24-hour, Monday and Celsius profile until you save another choice. These local choices do not travel with synchronized entries.</div>":"<p>Delnje wuběry na <span class='knopfwort'>Nastajenja ▸ Rěč &amp; region</span> regionalne pokazanje wodźa.</p><ul><li><b>Časowy format</b> – systemej slědować abo 12- či 24-hodźinski časnik wužiwać.</li><li><b>Prěni dźeń tydźenja</b> – formatowemu regionej slědować abo tydźeń póndźelu, njedźelu či sobotu započeć.</li><li><b>Čisłowanje tydźenjow</b> – ISO-prawidło: tydźeń 1 wobsahuje prěni štwórtk lěta.</li><li><b>Wjedrowa temperatura</b> – regionej slědować abo Celsius či Fahrenheit pokazać.</li><li><b>Časowe pasmo</b> – <i>system</i>, <i>UTC</i> abo IANA-mjeno kaž <i>Europe/Berlin</i> abo <i>America/New_York</i>.</li></ul><h3>Što so změni a što nic</h3><p>Wuběry wobwliwuja pokazanje, sortěrowanje, protykowe syće, wjedrowe hódnoty a wobličenja absolutnych wokomikow. Zwyčajny termin 09:00 wostanje 09:00; wuběr druheho pasma składowane lokalne časy njepřesuwa.</p><p>Klikńće na <span class='knopfwort'>Składować</span> a startujće Organizer znowa, zo bychu rěč powjercha, časowe pasmo a natiwne dźěle Linuxa abo Windowsa samsny wuběr wužiwali. Wuběry su lokalnje w <i>locale.json</i>, separatnje wot hłownych, snano zaklučowanych datow.</p><div class='merke'><b>Spočatny wuběr</b>Nowa Windowsowa instalacija systemowym regionalnym nastajenjam slěduje. Eksistowace Linuxowe instalacije wobchowaja němski profil z 24 hodźinami, póndźelu a Celsiusom, doniž druhi wuběr njeskładujete. Tute lokalne wuběry ze synchronizowanymi zapiskami njepučuja.</div>","<p>The optional forecast uses <b>wttr.in exclusively</b>. Magnolie first looks for postal code and town in your own contact address, then in locally read LibreOffice user data. It does not transmit the complete address book. If neither source provides a location, wttr.in may estimate the location from the public IP address visible to the service.</p><h3>What one request contains</h3><p>With a location, its URL-encoded postal-code-and-town text is placed in the request path. The query sends <i>format=j1</i> for the JSON response and <i>lang=</i> with the selected interface language. Without a location the path is empty, so the service sees the connection's public IP address and may use it for estimation, as with every internet request.</p><p><span class='knopfwort'>Do not retrieve weather without a location</span> prevents the network request entirely when no usable location exists. The Organizer requests and displays at most <b>three forecast days</b>.</p><h3>Temporary cache and response limits</h3><p>Successful data remains only in a volatile cache for the selected interval from <b>30 minutes through 12 hours</b>; the default is <b>3 hours</b>. A failure is retried after <b>15 minutes</b>. Linux rejects a weather response over <b>1 MiB</b>. Windows currently has <b>no analogous response-size limit</b>.</p><div class='achtung'><b>Turning weather off avoids the service</b>If you do not want location text or an IP-based estimate sent to wttr.in, leave weather disabled. The no-location switch alone still permits requests whenever an own or LibreOffice location is available.</div>":"<p>Opcionalne předpowědźenje wužiwa <b>jenož wttr.in</b>. Magnolie pyta najprjedy póštowe čisło a město we wašej kontaktowej adresy, potom w lokalnje čitanych wužiwarskich datach LibreOffice. Dospołny adresnik njepřenjesuje. Bjez městna móže wttr.in městno ze zjawneje IP-adresy přibližnje postajić.</p><h3>Wobsah naprašowanja</h3><p>Z městnom je URL-kodowany tekst póštoweho čisła a města w puću. Naprašowanje sćele <i>format=j1</i> za JSON a <i>lang=</i> z rěču powjercha. Bjez městna je puć prózdny, tuž słužba zjawnu IP-adresu widźi a ju kaž při kóždym internetowym naprašowanju za přibližne postajenje wužiwać móže.</p><p><span class='knopfwort'>Wjedro bjez městna njewobstarać</span> syćowemu naprašowanju dospołnje zadźěwa, jeli wužiwajomne městno njeje. Organizer maksimalnje <b>tři dny předpowědźe</b> wobstara a pokazuje.</p><h3>Nachwilny cache a mjezy wotmołwy</h3><p>Wuspěšne daty wostanu jenož w nachwilnym cache za wubrany interwal wot <b>30 mjeńšin hač do 12 hodźin</b>; standard su <b>3 hodźiny</b>. Po zmylku so po <b>15 mjeńšinach</b> znowa pospytuje. Linux wotmołwu nad <b>1 MiB</b> wotpokaza. Windows tuchwilu <b>žanu přirunajomnu mjezu wulkosće nima</b>.</p><div class='achtung'><b>Wupinjene wjedro słužbu njewužiwa</b>Jeli nochceće tekst městna abo IP-přibliženje do wttr.in słać, wostajće wjedro wupinjene. Sam přepinak bjez městna naprašowanja dowoli, hdyž waše abo LibreOffice-městno eksistuje.</div>","<p>The phone connection is set up under <span class='knopfwort'>Settings ▸ Synchronization</span>, in the part headed <span class='knopfwort'>Magnolie Notes phone connection</span>. Both devices must be in the same wireless network.</p><ol class='schritte'><li>Set the tick at <span class='knopfwort'>Enable Magnolie Notes phone connection</span>. A line below reports whether the listener is active.</li><li>Click <span class='knopfwort'>Connect phone via WLAN</span>.</li><li>A small window appears and waits. It names the port and says how many seconds remain. Two minutes is the usual time.</li><li>Now take the telephone in hand, open the phone connection in Magnolie Notes and select this computer there.</li></ol><p>If you change your mind, click <span class='knopfwort'>Cancel</span> in the waiting window. Nothing is stored then.</p><div class='merke'><b>Only one telephone</b>The Organizer keeps a single phone. As long as one is connected, the button <span class='knopfwort'>Connect phone via WLAN</span> stays grey. Remove the old one first.</div>":"<p>Telefonowy zwisk je pod <span class='knopfwort'>Nastajenja ▸ Synchronizacija</span> w <span class='knopfwort'>Telefonowy zwisk Magnolie Notes</span>. Wobaj grataj dyrbitej w samsnej syći być.</p><ol class='schritte'><li>Wubjerće <span class='knopfwort'>Telefonowy zwisk Magnolie Notes zmóžnić</span>.</li><li>Klikńće <span class='knopfwort'>Telefon přez WLAN zwjazać</span>.</li><li>Wokno port a zbytny čas pokazuje.</li><li>Na telefonje wubjerće tutón ličak.</li></ol><p><span class='knopfwort'>Přetorhnyć</span> ničo njeskładuje.</p><div class='merke'><b>Jenož jedyn telefon</b><span class='knopfwort'>Telefon přez WLAN zwjazać</span> je šěre, doniž stary telefon njewotstroniće.</div>","<p>The settings are divided by purpose. The names below are the exact labels used by the Organizer.</p><ul><li><b>General</b> – basic operation, accessibility, visible sections, tray applet and startup behaviour.</li><li><b>Import</b> and <b>Export</b> – bring data into the Organizer or pass a copy to another program or person.</li><li><b>Synchronization</b> – online accounts, KDE Connect and the Magnolie Notes phone connection.</li><li><b>Language &amp; region</b> – interface language, date and time conventions, week, temperature and time zone.</li><li><b>Country &amp; holidays</b> – country, region, public holidays and school holidays.</li><li><b>Typography</b> – typeface, size, colour, spelling, paper lines and mouse-wheel direction.</li><li><b>Notifications</b> – appointment and anniversary reminders, missed reminders and troubleshooting logs.</li><li><b>Contacts</b> – address use, maps, letters, social symbols, SMS and calls. This tab appears only while the Contacts section is enabled.</li><li><b>Security</b> – password protection and confidential reminders.</li><li><b>Calendar</b> – calendar display, planners and health values.</li><li><b>Magnolia tree</b> – branches, mailbox, phone connection and Personal Sync.</li><li><b>About</b> – version, licence, manual and updates.</li></ul><h3>When a change takes effect</h3><p>There is no general Apply button. Most check boxes and selections take effect as soon as you change them and are saved automatically. The Language &amp; region page has its own <span class='knopfwort'>Save</span> button because its choices must also reach the native desktop window before the next start. Closing Settings does not undo saved choices. Actions that replace, remove or transfer data ask for confirmation separately. When the desktop application reports its data path, the Organizer shows it at the bottom of the settings sheet.</p>":"<p>Nastajenja su po zaměrje rozdźělene. Slědowace mjena su eksaktne popisy Organizera.</p><ul><li><b>Powšitkowne</b> – zakładne dźěło, přistupnosć, widźomne wotrězki, systemowy applet a start.</li><li><b>Import</b> a <b>Eksport</b> – daty do Organizera přinjesć abo kopiju dale dać.</li><li><b>Synchronizacija</b> – online-konta, KDE Connect a telefonowy zwisk Magnolie Notes.</li><li><b>Rěč &amp; region</b> – rěč, datumowe a časowe konwencije, tydźeń, temperatura a časowe pasmo.</li><li><b>Kraj &amp; swjate dny</b> – kraj, region, zjawne swjate dny a šulske prózdniny.</li><li><b>Typografija</b> – pismo, wulkosć, barba, prawopis, papjerowe linije a směr koleska.</li><li><b>Zdźělenki</b> – dopominanja terminow a róčnicow, skomdźene dopominanja a protokole.</li><li><b>Kontakty</b> – adresy, karty, listy, socialne symbole, SMS a zawołanja. Rajtark je jenož při zmóžnjenych Kontaktach.</li><li><b>Wěstota</b> – hesłowy škit a dowěrliwe dopominanja.</li><li><b>Protyka</b> – protykowe pokazanje, planowaki a strowotne hódnoty.</li><li><b>Magnolienbaum</b> – hałuzy, póštowy kašćik, telefonowy zwisk a Personal Sync.</li><li><b>Wo programje</b> – wersija, licenca, přiručka a aktualizacije.</li></ul><h3>Hdy změna płaći</h3><p>Powšitkowne tłóčatko Nałožić njeje. Najwjace kašćikow a wuběrow płaći hnydom a składuje so awtomatisce. Rěč &amp; region ma swójske <span class='knopfwort'>Składować</span>, dokelž dyrbja wuběry natiwne wokno před přichodnym startom docpěć. Začinjenje Nastajenjow składowane wuběry njewróći. Akcije za narunanje, wotstronjenje abo přenjesenje datow separatnje wo wobkrućenje prosja. Hdyž desktopowe nałoženje datowy puć zdźěli, pokazuje jón Organizer deleka na łopjenje.</p>","<p>The third section is called <span class='knopfwort'>Magnolienbaum mailbox</span>. It has nothing to do with calendars and addresses. It is a fallback for the branch <b>baum-1</b>: if the other Organizer cannot be reached directly, the message is laid down in a folder on your Nextcloud and waits there until it is collected.</p><ol class='schritte'><li>Set up the account as described on the preceding pages.</li><li>Tick <span class='knopfwort'>Use the mailbox as a fallback for branch baum-1</span>.</li><li>Return to <span class='knopfwort'>Nextcloud account</span> above and click <span class='knopfwort'>Save</span>. The tick is only kept once you have saved there.</li><li>Click <span class='knopfwort'>Test connection</span>. If all is well, the reply reads <i>The mailbox is reachable.</i></li></ol><p>The Organizer creates its own folders below a folder named <i>Magnolie</i> for this purpose. The contents of every message are encrypted and sealed before they leave your computer, so the server can neither read them nor alter them unnoticed.</p><div class='achtung'><b>Both sides need the same storage</b>The mailbox only works if the other Organizer can reach the same Nextcloud storage. It carries no calendars and no contacts.</div><div class='achtung'><b>What the operator can still see</b>Whoever runs the server can see the account, the folder and file names, the sizes and the times of your messages, even though the contents themselves stay unreadable.</div>":"<p><span class='knopfwort'>Póštowa kašćik Magnolienbaum</span> je narunanski puć za <b>baum-1</b>, nic za protyki abo kontakty.</p><ol class='schritte'><li>Zarjadujće konto.</li><li>Wubjerće <span class='knopfwort'>Kašćik jako narunanski puć za baum-1 wužiwać</span>.</li><li>Pod <span class='knopfwort'>Konto Nextcloud</span> klikńće <span class='knopfwort'>Składować</span>.</li><li>Klikńće <span class='knopfwort'>Zwisk testować</span>; <i>Kašćik je docpějomny.</i></li></ol><p>Organizer zapisy pod <i>Magnolie</i> wutwori a powěsće zaklučuje.</p><div class='achtung'><b>Wobě stronje trjebatej samsny składowak</b>Kašćik protyki ani kontakty njepřenjesuje.</div><div class='achtung'><b>Što wobhospodar widźi</b>Konto, mjena, wulkosće a časy, nic wobsah.</div>","<p>The tray applet keeps the Organizer available beside the clock while its main window is hidden.</p><ol class='schritte'><li>Open <span class='knopfwort'>Settings ▸ General</span> and expand <span class='knopfwort'>Tray applet</span>.</li><li>Select <span class='knopfwort'>Enable tray applet</span>. The remaining tray choices appear immediately.</li><li>If desired, select <span class='knopfwort'>Show today's notification count on the tray icon</span>. Windows shows the number in the icon's tooltip; Linux shows a label up to <b>99+</b> where the indicator supports labels.</li></ol><h3>Where to find the icon</h3><p>Windows places it in the notification area. If it is hidden, open the taskbar-corner or additional-icons settings. Cinnamon uses XApp under X11 and Wayland; KDE usually shows the StatusNotifier immediately. Plain GNOME requires Ayatana AppIndicator and an enabled AppIndicator extension. Distribution packages may install or recommend these additions; the AppImage carries matching tray libraries with it.</p><h3>Click and menu behaviour</h3><p>On Windows a left-click opens the window. On Cinnamon and the Linux legacy icon, a left-click shows or hides it. Other Linux indicators use the menu entries <span class='knopfwort'>Open Magnolie Organizer</span> and <span class='knopfwort'>Minimize to tray</span>. The menus may also contain phones; <span class='knopfwort'>Quit</span> always ends the program.</p>":"<p>Systemowy applet dźerži Organizer pódla časa přistupny, mjeztym zo je hłowne wokno schowane.</p><ol class='schritte'><li>Wočińće <span class='knopfwort'>Nastajenja ▸ Powšitkowne</span> a rozwińće <span class='knopfwort'>Systemowy applet</span>.</li><li>Wubjerće <span class='knopfwort'>Systemowy applet zmóžnić</span>. Dalše wuběry so hnydom zjewja.</li><li>Po přeću wubjerće <span class='knopfwort'>Dźensnišu ličbu zdźělenkow na systemowym symbolu pokazać</span>. Windows ličbu w pomocnym teksće pokazuje; Linux tafličku hač do <b>99+</b>, hdźež indikator taflički podpěruje.</li></ol><h3>Hdźe symbol namakać</h3><p>Windows staji jón do zdźělenskeho wobłuka. Jeli je schowany, wočińće nastajenja róžka nadawkoweje lajsty abo přidatnych symbolow. Cinnamon wužiwa XApp pod X11 a Wayland; KDE zwjetša StatusNotifier hnydom pokazuje. Lutny GNOME trjeba Ayatana AppIndicator a zapinjene rozšěrjenje AppIndicator. Distribuciske pakćiki móža tute přidatki instalować abo doporučić; AppImage wotpowědne biblioteki sobu přinjese.</p><h3>Kliknjenje a meni</h3><p>Pod Windowsom lěwy klik wokno wočini. Pod Cinnamon a při starym Linuxowym symbolu je pokazuje abo chowa. Druhe Linuxowe indikatory maja menijowej zapiskaj <span class='knopfwort'>Magnolie Organizer wočinić</span> a <span class='knopfwort'>Do systemoweho wobłuka miniměrować</span>. Menije móža tež telefony wobsahować; <span class='knopfwort'>Skónčić</span> program přeco zakónči.</p>","<p>The update offer follows the running edition: installed Debian systems receive a <b>DEB</b>, an <b>AppImage</b> receives another AppImage, Windows receives the Windows setup, and the <b>handbook</b> has its own update action. AppImage detection prevents a DEB from being offered merely because the host system is Debian-based.</p><p>No path installs automatically. Linux opens the package manager or browser and Windows opens the visible setup only after the user chooses to continue. An <b>RPM</b> is downloaded and updated manually; the updater does not advertise it as an automatically selected platform artifact.</p><h3>Handbook packages</h3><p>A handbook package is downloaded by the application, SHA-256 hashed and only then opened. Linux limits that download to <b>128 MiB</b>; Windows limits it to <b>512 MiB</b>. The package manager or setup remains visible and requires confirmation.</p><div class='merke'><b>Checksums change with every release</b>This handbook documents the verification process, not current artifact hashes. Obtain the checksum for the exact version from its official release information.</div>":"<p>Poskitk aktualizacije běžacej ediciji slěduje: instalowane Debianowe systemy dóstanu <b>DEB</b>, <b>AppImage</b> druhi AppImage, Windows Windowsowu instalaciju a <b>přiručka</b> ma swójsku aktualizacisku akciju. Spóznawanje AppImage zadźěwa, zo so DEB jenož dla Debianoweho hostoweho systema poskića.</p><p>Žana móžnosć awtomatisce njeinstaluje. Linux pakćikowy zrjadowak abo wobhladowak wočini a Windows widźomnu instalaciju jenož po wuběrje wužiwarja. <b>RPM</b> so manuelnje sćahuje a aktualizuje; aktualizowak jón jako awtomatisce wubrany platformowy artefakt njeposkića.</p><h3>Pakćiki přiručki</h3><p>Nałoženje pakćik přiručki sćahuje, jeho SHA-256 přepruwuje a hakle potom jón wočini. Linux sćehnjenje na <b>128 MiB</b> wobmjezuje; Windows na <b>512 MiB</b>. Pakćikowy zrjadowak abo instalacija wostanje widźomna a trjeba wobkrućenje.</p><div class='merke'><b>Kontrolne sumy so z kóždej wersiju změnja</b>Tuta přiručka proces přepruwowanja dokumentuje, nic aktualne haše artefaktow. Wobstarajće kontrolnu sumu eksaktneje wersije z jeje hamtskich wozjewjenskich informacijow.</div>","<p>Three Linux command modes support reminders. They are service and diagnostic interfaces rather than three ways to open the Organizer.</p><ul><li><b>--erinnerung</b> performs one due-reminder check and exits. It is normally invoked by the session service.</li><li><b>--wecker</b> runs the reminder monitor in the background. If another monitor is already registered, the new process exits without starting a second one.</li><li><b>--probe</b> demonstrates a reminder, prints a diagnostic report about display, service, and sound, and exits.</li></ul><h3>Priority and exit behaviour</h3><p>Language selection is applied first. POT generation has the highest operating-mode priority; otherwise <i>--erinnerung</i> wins over <i>--wecker</i>, which wins over <i>--probe</i>, which wins over help. Do not combine operating modes: use one command for one purpose. These three modes and help exit with status 0 after their work; a one-shot reminder problem is printed to standard error for the service log. Syntax errors exit with status 2.</p><div class='merke'><b>No graphical singleton activation</b>Reminder and diagnostic modes finish before the graphical single-instance handling. They neither open the book nor bring an existing window forward.</div>":"<p>Tři Linuxowe přikazowe modusy dopominanja podpěruja. Su słužbne a diagnostiske powjerchi, nic tři móžnosće Organizer wočinić.</p><ul><li><b>--erinnerung</b> jednoraznje dospěte dopominanja přepruwuje a skónči. Posedźenska słužba jón zwjetša zawołuje.</li><li><b>--wecker</b> wobkedźbowak dopominanjow w pozadku wuwjedźe. Jeli je druhi hižo registrowany, so nowy proces bjez druheho wobkedźbowaka skónči.</li><li><b>--probe</b> dopomnjeće předstaji, diagnostisku rozprawu wo pokazanju, słužbje a zwuku wućišći a skónči.</li></ul><h3>Priorita a zakónčenje</h3><p>Rěčny wuběr so najprjedy nałoži. Wutworjenje POT ma najwyšu prioritu; hewak <i>--erinnerung</i> před <i>--wecker</i>, tutón před <i>--probe</i> a tutón před pomocu. Njekombinujće modusy: wužijće jedyn přikaz za jedyn zaměr. Tute tři modusy a pomoc po dźěle ze statusom 0 skónča; problem jednorazneho dopominanja so za słužbny protokol do standardneho zmylkoweho wudaća pisa. Syntaksowe zmylki ze statusom 2 skónča.</p><div class='merke'><b>Žane aktiwěrowanje grafiskeje jednotliweje instance</b>Dopominanske a diagnostiske modusy so před grafiskim wobchadźenjom jednotliweje instance skónča. Knihu njewočinja ani eksistowace wokno doprědka njepřinjesu.</div>","<p>Under <b>Personal synchronization</b>, the label <b>Not Magnolienbaum</b> marks a private link between one person's desktop and phone. Both devices must mark the other as their own device.</p><ol class='schritte'><li>Enable <span class='knopfwort'>This paired computer is my own device</span> on the phone and the matching own-device setting on the desktop.</li><li>Grant <span class='knopfwort'>Synchronize notes and notebooks</span> and <span class='knopfwort'>Synchronize tasks</span> separately on both sides.</li><li>Tap <span class='knopfwort'>Synchronize now</span> for a manual run.</li><li>Enable <span class='knopfwort'>Automatically synchronize over Wi-Fi</span> if authenticated WLAN connections may start later runs.</li></ol><p>A manual run prefers Wi-Fi but may use the permitted Bluetooth fallback. Automatic synchronization is <b>Wi-Fi only</b>. The 15-minute guard avoids duplicate or looping runs; it is not a promise of an exact schedule.</p><h3>What participates</h3><p>Own notes, notebooks and own tasks synchronize. Shared Magnolienbaum notes and delegated tasks do not. Concurrent edits preserve both versions as a conflict copy. Supported attachments are JPEG, PNG, WebP, GIF and PDF, at most <b>8 MiB</b> each and <b>64</b> per note.</p><div class='merke'><b>Revoking a grant is immediate</b>Switching off the own-device mark or an individual area also discards waiting Personal-Sync data for that permission. It does not remove already synchronized entries.</div>":"<p>Pod <b>Wosobinskej synchronizaciju</b> taflička <b>Nic Magnolienbaum</b> priwatny zwisk mjez desktopom a telefonom jedneje wosoby markěruje. Wobaj grataj dyrbitej druhi jako swójski grat markěrować.</p><ol class='schritte'><li>Zapńće <span class='knopfwort'>Tutón porowany ličak je mój swójski grat</span> na telefonje a wotpowědne nastajenje na desktopje.</li><li>Dowolće <span class='knopfwort'>Notice a notatniki synchronizować</span> a <span class='knopfwort'>Nadawki synchronizować</span> separatnje na woběmaj stronje.</li><li>Podótkńće so <span class='knopfwort'>Nětko synchronizować</span> za manuelny běh.</li><li>Zapńće <span class='knopfwort'>Awtomatisce přez Wi-Fi synchronizować</span>, jeli smědźa awtentifikowane WLAN-zwiski pozdźiše běhi startować.</li></ol><p>Manuelny běh preferuje Wi-Fi, ale móže dowoleny Bluetooth wužić. Awtomatiska synchronizacija je <b>jenož Wi-Fi</b>. 15-mjeńšinowy škit dwójne abo kołowe běhi zadźěwa; njeje slub eksaktneho časoweho plana.</p><h3>Što wobdźěli so</h3><p>Swójske notice, notatniki a nadawki so synchronizuja. Dźělene Magnolienbaum-notice a delegowane nadawki nic. Runohdobne změny wobě wersiji jako konfliktowu kopiju wobchowaja. Podpěrane přiwěški su JPEG, PNG, WebP, GIF a PDF, maksimalnje <b>8 MiB</b> kóždy a <b>64</b> na noticu.</p><div class='merke'><b>Cofnjenje dowolnosće płaći hnydom</b>Wupinjenje marke swójskeho grata abo jednotliweho wobłuka tež čakace daty Personal Sync za tutu dowolnosć zaćisnje. Hižo synchronizowane zapiski njewotstroni.</div>","<p>Under <span class='knopfwort'>Branches</span>, each paired branch shows its name, fingerprint, confirmation state, known connection paths and last contact. A confirmed branch can receive a note through <span class='knopfwort'>Share</span> or a task through <span class='knopfwort'>Hand to a branch</span>.</p><h3>Outbox and reception</h3><p><span class='knopfwort'>Receive notes (background)</span> keeps a visible Android service notification while the app listens. <span class='knopfwort'>Outbox: … waiting</span> counts deliveries still pending; <span class='knopfwort'>Send now</span> retries them. Failed deliveries stay queued and use increasing retry intervals for up to seven days.</p><h3>Decide what may arrive automatically</h3><p>With <span class='knopfwort'>Take content without asking</span> off, new offers wait under <span class='knopfwort'>Inbox</span>. Check type, sender and title, then choose <span class='knopfwort'>Accept</span> or <span class='knopfwort'>Reject</span>. Trusted branches can deliver supported notes and tasks directly. Appointments are shown as unsupported on this device and cannot be accepted.</p><p>Contact offers have their own preview and may require <span class='knopfwort'>Import</span>, <span class='knopfwort'>Import separately</span> or <span class='knopfwort'>Merge these cards</span>. Android requests contact access only when it is needed.</p><div class='achtung'><b>Removing a connection removes transport state</b><span class='knopfwort'>Remove connection</span> clears synchronization, waiting messages and metadata for that branch. Contacts already imported into the phone remain.</div>":"<p>Pod <span class='knopfwort'>Hałuzy</span> kóždy porowany hałuz mjeno, porstowy wotćišć, wobkrućenski staw, znate zwiskowe puće a posledni kontakt pokazuje. Wobkrućeny hałuz móže noticu přez <span class='knopfwort'>Dźělić</span> abo nadawk přez <span class='knopfwort'>Hałuzej přepodać</span> dóstać.</p><h3>Wuchad a přijimanje</h3><p><span class='knopfwort'>Notice přijimać (pozadk)</span> widźomne Androidowe słužbne zdźělenje dźerži, mjeztym zo nałoženje słucha. <span class='knopfwort'>Wuchad: … čaka</span> hišće čakace posłanja liči; <span class='knopfwort'>Nětko pósłać</span> je znowa pospytuje. Njewuspěšne posłanja w čakanskim rjedźe wostanu a hač do sydom dnjow narostowace interwale wužiwa.</p><h3>Rozsudźić, što smě awtomatisce přińć</h3><p>Hdyž je <span class='knopfwort'>Wobsah bjez prašenja přiwzać</span> wupinjene, čakaja nowe poskitki pod <span class='knopfwort'>Dochad</span>. Přepruwujće typ, wotpósłarja a titul, potom wubjerće <span class='knopfwort'>Přiwzać</span> abo <span class='knopfwort'>Wotpokazać</span>. Dowěryhódne hałuzy móža podpěrane notice a nadawki direktnje doručić. Terminy so jako njepodpěrane na tutym graće pokazuja a njedadźa so přiwzać.</p><p>Kontaktowe poskitki maja swójski přehlad a móža <span class='knopfwort'>Importować</span>, <span class='knopfwort'>Separatnje importować</span> abo <span class='knopfwort'>Tute karty zjednoćić</span> trjebać. Android wo kontaktowy přistup jenož po potrjebje prosy.</p><div class='achtung'><b>Wotstronjenje zwiska transportowy staw wotstroni</b><span class='knopfwort'>Zwisk wotstronić</span> synchronizaciju, čakace powěsće a metadaty tutoho hałuža wuprózdni. Hižo do telefona importowane kontakty wostanu.</div>","<p>Under <span class='knopfwort'>Settings ▸ Export</span>, choose <span class='knopfwort'>Contacts for Claws Mail (.ldif)</span>. Save the suggested file <i>magnolie-adressen-claws.ldif</i>, then import this LDIF address book in Claws Mail.</p><p>LDIF includes names, company, all email addresses, typed phone numbers, all postal addresses, notes, known-year birthdays, and JPEG contact photos. Unicode text and multiline notes are transferred safely.</p><div class='achtung'><b>Format limits</b>vCard preserves more contact details. LDIF cannot include Magnolie emergency contacts, social media, free labels, an unknown birthday year, or non-JPEG photos. The Organizer reports unusable contacts and omitted photos after export.</div>":"<p>Wählen Sie unter <span class='knopfwort'>Einstellungen ▸ Exportieren</span> <span class='knopfwort'>Kontakte für Claws Mail (.ldif)</span>. Speichern Sie die vorgeschlagene Datei <i>magnolie-adressen-claws.ldif</i> und importieren Sie dann dieses LDIF-Adressbuch in Claws Mail.</p><p>LDIF umfasst Namen, Unternehmen, alle E-Mail-Adressen, eingegebene Telefonnummern, alle Postanschriften, Notizen, Geburtstage im bekannten Jahr und JPEG-Kontaktfotos. Unicode-Text und mehrzeilige Notizen werden sicher übertragen.</p><div class='achtung'><b>Formatbeschränkungen</b>vCard behält mehr Kontaktdaten bei. LDIF kann keine Magnolie-Notfallkontakte, soziale Medien, kostenlose Labels, ein unbekanntes Geburtstagsjahr oder Nicht-JPEG-Fotos enthalten. Der Organizer meldet nach dem Export unbrauchbare Kontakte und ausgelassene Fotos.</div>","<p>Under <span class='knopfwort'>Settings ▸ Synchronization</span> the connected telephone is listed with its name, its state and its fingerprint. If none is connected, the line reads <span class='knopfwort'>No phone paired yet.</span></p><h3>Getting rid of the old telephone</h3><ol class='schritte'><li>Click <span class='knopfwort'>Remove phone connection</span> in the line of that telephone.</li><li>A question asks whether the connection, its queues and its permissions may go. Confirm it.</li></ol><p>Afterwards <span class='knopfwort'>Connect phone via WLAN</span> can be used again, and you set up the new telephone as before.</p><div class='merke'><b>Why only one</b>This connection stands for your own single telephone. If several are stored, a warning appears and asks you to remove all but one.</div><div class='achtung'><b>Removing is not deleting</b>Your notes, tasks and contacts stay. Only the acquaintance with this telephone ends. To use the same telephone again later, it must be connected and the code compared once more.</div>":"<p>Pod <span class='knopfwort'>Nastajenja ▸ Synchronizacija</span> steja mjeno, staw a wotćišć telefona. Hewak steji <span class='knopfwort'>Hišće žadyn telefon sparowany.</span></p><h3>Stary telefon wotstronić</h3><ol class='schritte'><li>Klikńće <span class='knopfwort'>Telefonowy zwisk wotstronić</span>.</li><li>Wobkrućće zwisk, čakanske rjady a dowolnosće.</li></ol><p>Potom móžeće <span class='knopfwort'>Telefon přez WLAN zwjazać</span>.</p><div class='merke'><b>Čehodla jedyn</b>Zwisk je za waš jedyn swójski telefon.</div><div class='achtung'><b>Wotstronjenje njeje zhašenje</b>Notice, nadawki a kontakty wostanu. Pozdźiše trjeba znowazwjazanje a kod.</div>","<p>Under <span class='knopfwort'>Settings ▸ Typography</span>, you can choose how your own entries look. Labels and calendar pages are not affected.</p><h3>Font</h3><ul><li><b>As usual (print)</b> – a clear print typeface</li><li><b>Handwriting</b> – a script-style font that suits the paper</li></ul><h3>Font color</h3><p><b>Black</b>, like pencil, or <b>Blue (fountain pen)</b>.</p><h3>Font size</h3><p>There are three sizes: <b>Normal</b>, <b>Medium (slightly larger)</b> and <b>Large</b>. If you find smaller text difficult to read, choose <i>Large</i>. The lines expand with the text, and the ruling in Notes adjusts as well.</p><p>A <b>preview</b> on the same page immediately shows how your entries will look.</p><h3>Paper and mouse wheel</h3><p>On the same Typography page, you can turn <b>Lined paper (lines on the writing sheet)</b> on or off and choose whether scrolling the mouse wheel upward moves a time earlier or later.</p><div class='merke'><b>In addition to the system settings</b>This setting affects only the Organizer. If everything on your computer is too small, increase the font size in the system settings as well.</div><div class='beispiel'><b>A suggestion for easier reading</b>Handwriting looks attractive, but it is harder to read. For everyday use, <i>As usual (print)</i> in <i>Large</i> is a good choice.</div>":"<p>Pod <span class='knopfwort'>Nastajenja ▸ Typografija</span> móžeće wuhotowanje swójskich zapiskow wubrać. Popisy a protykowe strony so njezměnja.</p><h3>Pismo</h3><ul><li><b>Kaž zwučene (ćišć)</b> – derje čitajomne ćišćane pismo</li><li><b>Rukopis</b> – pisane pismo, kotrež k papjerje pasuje</li></ul><h3>Pismowa barba</h3><p><b>Čorna</b> kaž wołojnik abo <b>Módra (nalěwne péro)</b>.</p><h3>Pismowa wulkosć</h3><p>Su tři wulkosće: <b>Normalna</b>, <b>Srjedźna (trochu wjetša)</b> a <b>Wulka</b>. Jeli je mały tekst ćežko čitajomny, wubjerće <i>Wulka</i>. Linki so z tekstom powjetša a linijowanje w Noticach so tež přiměri.</p><p><b>Přehlad</b> na samsnej stronje hnydom wuhotowanje pokazuje.</p><h3>Papjera a myšace kolesko</h3><p>Na samsnej Typografijowej stronje móžeće <b>Linijowanu papjeru (linki na pisanskim łopjenje)</b> zapinać a wubrać, hač kolesko horje čas doprědka abo wróćo pohibuje.</p><div class='merke'><b>Přidatnje k systemowym nastajenjam</b>Nastajenje jenož Organizer wobwliwuje. Jeli je wšitko na ličaku přemałe, powjetšće pismo tež w systemowych nastajenjach.</div><div class='beispiel'><b>Namjet za lóše čitanje</b>Rukopis rjenje wupada, ale so ćešo čita. Za wšědne wužiwanje je <i>Kaž zwučene (ćišć)</i> we wulkosći <i>Wulka</i> dobry wuběr.</div>","<p>Under <span class='knopfwort'>Symbol</span>, choose the sign that best describes the note: <b>Note</b>, <b>Shopping</b>, <b>Task</b>, <b>Appointment</b>, <b>Idea</b>, <b>Travel</b>, <b>Recipe</b>, <b>Money</b>, <b>Work</b>, <b>Person</b>, <b>Health</b> or <b>Quote</b>. The selected choice is highlighted and announced as selected by Android's accessibility service.</p><p>A new local note starts with <b>Note</b>. Magnolie Notes does not infer another symbol from words you type; change it yourself before saving if another sign is more useful.</p><h3>Plain text rather than a formatting toolbar</h3><p>The Android editor writes plain text. It has no bold, italic, underline, list, heading, Markdown or rich-text toolbar. Line breaks are retained when the note is stored, but technical HTML used inside the data is only a storage representation and does not provide visible rich formatting.</p><div class='merke'><b>Symbols organize; they do not format</b>A symbol helps identify a row in the note list. It does not alter the note text and does not turn a note into a task or appointment.</div>":"<p>Pod <span class='knopfwort'>Symbol</span> wubjerće znamješko, kotrež noticu najlěpje wopisuje: <b>Notica</b>, <b>Kupowanje</b>, <b>Nadawk</b>, <b>Termin</b>, <b>Ideja</b>, <b>Pućowanje</b>, <b>Recept</b>, <b>Pjenjezy</b>, <b>Dźěło</b>, <b>Wosoba</b>, <b>Strowota</b> abo <b>Citat</b>. Wubrana móžnosć so wuzběhnje a Androidowa słužba přistupnosće ju jako wubranu připowě.</p><p>Nowa lokalna notica so ze symbolom <b>Notica</b> započina. Magnolie Notes z wašich słow druhi symbol njewotwodźuje; změńće jón sami před składowanjom, jeli je druhe znamješko wužitniše.</p><h3>Lutny tekst město formatowanskeje lajsty</h3><p>Androidowy editor lutny tekst pisa. Nima tłuste, kursiwne abo podšmórnjene pismo, lisćiny, nadpisma, Markdown ani lajstu bohateho formatowanja. Łamanja linkow so při składowanju wobchowaja, ale techniski HTML znutřka datow je jenož składowanske zastupowanje a widźomne bohate formatowanje njedawa.</p><div class='merke'><b>Symbole rjaduja, njeformatuja</b>Symbol pomha rjad w noticowej lisćinje spóznać. Tekst notice njezměni a z notice nadawk ani termin njenadźěła.</div>","<p>Use <span class='knopfwort'>Settings ▸ Export</span> to pass your data on in common formats, whether to move it into another program or to keep a separate copy for safekeeping.</p><h3>Complete Magnolie archive (.magnolie)</h3><p>A <b>.magnolie</b> complete archive carries the selected data set between both editions of the Organizer, including notebooks, contact photos, images, PDF attachments and the recycle bin. Before an import it shows the archive contents, checks the SHA-256 integrity, keeps device-specific settings, and backs up your present data before replacing anything. Give the archive a long, unique password whenever it leaves your computer — without one, the Organizer states plainly that the file is unencrypted.</p><h3>Individual formats</h3><ul><li><b>Appointments (.ics)</b> – for any calendar program, including the end dates of multi-day appointments</li><li><b>Appointments as Lotus CSV</b> – with the original Lotus Organizer columns</li><li><b>Anniversaries (.ics)</b> – as annually recurring appointments</li><li><b>Tasks (.ics)</b> – as a task list</li><li><b>Contacts (.vcf)</b> – for any address book</li><li><b>Contacts for Claws Mail (.ldif)</b> – for importing into Claws Mail</li></ul><p>After you click an option, a window asks where to save the file. A file name is already suggested, such as <i>magnolie-termine.ics</i>. The Organizer then reports the file’s location and how many entries it contains.</p><div class='merke'><b>The Lotus columns</b>The CSV contains exactly the columns CONFIDENTIAL, CATEGORIES, START DATE TIME, END DATE TIME, DESCRIPTION, COST CENTER CODE, CUSTOMER NUMBER, and PRELIMINARY COMMITMENTS, as recognized by Lotus Organizer.</div><div class='achtung'><b>What the standard formats cannot carry</b>ICS, VCF, CSV and LDIF cannot represent every Magnolie property. Use a complete archive whenever all selected sections and attachments have to be preserved.</div>":"<p>Wužijće <span class='knopfwort'>Nastajenja ▸ Eksport</span>, zo byšće daty w powšitkownych formatach do druheho programa abo separatneje kopije přepodali.</p><h3>Dospołny Magnolie-archiw (.magnolie)</h3><p>Dospołny archiw <b>.magnolie</b> wubranu datowu sadźbu mjez woběmaj edicijomaj přenjesuje, inkluziwnje notatnikow, kontaktowych fotow, wobrazow, PDF-přiwěškow a papjernika. Před importom wobsah pokazuje, integritu SHA-256 přepruwuje, gratowe nastajenja wobchowa a aktualne daty zawěsći. Dajće archiwej dołhe jónkróćne hesło, hdyž ličak wopušći; bjez njeho Organizer jasnje praji, zo dataja njeje zaklučowana.</p><h3>Jednotliwe formaty</h3><ul><li><b>Terminy (.ics)</b> - za protykowe programy, z kónčnymi datumami wjacadnjowych terminow</li><li><b>Terminy jako Lotus CSV</b> - z originalnymi stołpikami</li><li><b>Róčnicy (.ics)</b> - jako lětnje wospjetowane terminy</li><li><b>Nadawki (.ics)</b> - jako nadawkowa lisćina</li><li><b>Kontakty (.vcf)</b> - za adresniki</li><li><b>Kontakty za Claws Mail (.ldif)</b> - za import do Claws Mail</li></ul><p>Po kliknjenju móžnosće wokno wo składowanske městno prosy. Datajowe mjeno kaž <i>magnolie-termine.ics</i> je namjetowane. Organizer potom městno a ličbu zapiskow zdźěli.</p><div class='merke'><b>Lotusowe stołpiki</b>CSV wobsahuje eksaktnje CONFIDENTIAL, CATEGORIES, START DATE TIME, END DATE TIME, DESCRIPTION, COST CENTER CODE, CUSTOMER NUMBER, a PRELIMINARY COMMITMENTS, kaž Lotus Organizer je spóznawa.</div><div class='achtung'><b>Što standardne formaty njemóža přenjesć</b>ICS, VCF, CSV a LDIF njemóža kóždu Magnolie-kajkosć zastupować. Wužijće dospołny archiw, hdyž maja so wšitke wotrězki a přiwěški wobchować.</div>","<p>Use <span class='knopfwort'>Settings ▸ Import</span> to bring appointments, contacts, and other data in from other programs. A complete Magnolie archive opens an entire data set from either edition; the other routes bring in individual sections.</p><h3>Complete Magnolie archive (.magnolie)</h3><p>A complete archive carries everything: appointments, tasks, contacts with their photos, notes with images and PDF attachments, anniversaries, planner, health, and the recycle bin. The Organizer shows the contents and checks them before anything is replaced, and it backs up your present data automatically beforehand. An archive password protects the file on either system.</p><h3>From this computer</h3><p>This is the most convenient method. Click <span class='knopfwort'>From this computer (Evolution/Thunderbird)</span> to search the data stores used by Evolution and Thunderbird. The Organizer imports contacts with their photos, appointments, tasks, and birthdays. This includes cached online accounts and current Thunderbird calendars. It reads each database only from a temporary copy and never modifies the original.</p><h3>Calendar file (.ics)</h3><p>Almost every calendar program can export appointments to an <b>.ics</b> file, including Thunderbird, the Linux Mint calendar, and online calendars. Select the file and the Organizer imports appointments with their exact end dates, tasks, and native daily, weekly, monthly and annual recurrence rules. Inclusive series ends, month-end and leap-year behavior, and the duration of recurring multi-day appointments are preserved. Complex rules with exceptions, additional dates, detached instances, multiple rules, differing time zones or unsupported rule parts are not approximated: their components become individual appointments, while the original opaque calendar data is retained for a lossless round trip where supported. Tasks are imported individually because Magnolie has no native recurring-task model.</p><h3>Contacts (.vcf)</h3><p>Address books are commonly exchanged as <b>.vcf</b> files. The Organizer imports all email addresses, phone numbers, postal addresses, birthdays, and embedded contact photos; birthdays appear under Anniversaries. Importing directly from GNOME Contacts or Evolution Data Server also handles extensive lists and locally stored images. Importing again adds any missing information. Technical placeholders ending in <i>.invalid</i> are discarded, and an unmistakably incomplete cached contact card is merged with the complete card.</p><h3>Claws Mail (.xml/.ldif)</h3><p>The dedicated button reads original <i>addrbook-….xml</i> files and standardized LDIF exports. LDIF is useful for exchanging data, but XML support means that you do not need to export first.</p><h3>Lotus Organizer CSV</h3><p>A dedicated route for people moving from Lotus Organizer is described on the next page.</p><div class='merke'><b>Nothing arrives twice</b>Every time you import, the Organizer checks what is already present and does not create it again. It then reports what it imported and what it skipped. Use a complete archive when everything has to come along; the individual formats exchange single sections.</div>":"<p>Wužijće <span class='knopfwort'>Nastajenja ▸ Import</span> za terminy, kontakty a druhe daty z druhich programow. Dospołny Magnolie-archiw wočini cyłu datowu sadźbu z woběmaj edicijomaj; druhe puće jednotliwe wotrězki.</p><h3>Dospołny Magnolie-archiw (.magnolie)</h3><p>Dospołny archiw wšitko přenjesuje: terminy, nadawki, kontakty z fotami, notice z wobrazami a PDF-přiwěškami, róčnicy, planowak, strowotu a papjernik. Organizer wobsah pokazuje a přepruwuje, před narunanjom daty zawěsći a archiwowe hesło dataju na woběmaj systemomaj škita.</p><h3>Z tutoho ličaka</h3><p>Klikńće <span class='knopfwort'>Z tutoho ličaka (Evolution/Thunderbird)</span>, zo byšće datowe składy Evolution a Thunderbird pytali. Organizer kontakty z fotami, terminy, nadawki a narodniny importuje, tež cache online-kontow a aktualne Thunderbirdowe protyki. Kóždu datowu banku jenož z nachwilneje kopije čita a original njezměni.</p><h3>Protykowa dataja (.ics)</h3><p>Nimale kóždy protykowy program móže do <b>.ics</b> eksportować. Organizer eksaktne kónčne daty, nadawki a natywne dnjowe, tydźenske, měsacne a lětne wospjetowanja importuje. Inkluziwne kónce serijow, kónc měsaca, přestupne lěto a traće wospjetowanych wjacadnjowych terminow so wobchowaja. Kompleksne prawidła z wuwzaćemi, přidatnymi datumami, wotdźělenymi instancami, wjacorymi prawidłami, časowymi pasmami abo njepodpěranymi dźělemi so njehódaja: komponenty budu jednotliwe terminy a originalne protykowe daty so za bjezstratne wróćopřenjesenje wobchowaja. Nadawki so jednotliwje importuja, dokelž Magnolie nima natywny model wospjetowanych nadawkow.</p><h3>Kontakty (.vcf)</h3><p>Organizer e-mejlowe adresy, telefonowe čisła, póstowe adresy, narodniny a zasadźene fota z <b>.vcf</b> importuje; narodniny su pod Róčnicami. Direktny import z GNOME Contacts abo Evolution Data Server tež wulke lisćiny a lokalne wobrazy wobkedźbuje. Znowaimportowanje falowace informacije přidawa. Techniske zastupniki z <i>.invalid</i> so zaćisnu a jasnje njedospołna cached kontaktowa karta so z dospołnej zjednoći.</p><h3>Claws Mail (.xml/.ldif)</h3><p>Separatne tłóčatko originalne <i>addrbook-….xml</i> a standardne LDIF-eksporty čita. Dźak XML njetrjebaće najprjedy eksportować.</p><h3>Lotus Organizer CSV</h3><p>Separatny puć za přeńdźenje z Lotus Organizera je na přichodnej stronje.</p><div class='merke'><b>Ničo njepřińdźe dwójce</b>Organizer při kóždym imporće eksistowace daty přepruwuje, dwójne njewutwori a zdźěli importowane a přeskočene zapiski. Wužijće dospołny archiw za wšitko; jednotliwe formaty wuměnja jednotliwe wotrězki.</div>","<p>Vacation planner marks your own days off separately from public and school holidays. It is initially switched off under <i>Settings ▸ Calendar</i>; switching it off later hides the periods without deleting them.</p><ol class='schritte'><li>Unfold <span class='knopfwort'>Vacation planner</span> and select <span class='knopfwort'>Enable vacation planner</span>.</li><li>Click <span class='knopfwort'>Add vacation period</span>. Both date fields initially contain today.</li><li>Enter the first day after <span class='knopfwort'>from</span> and the inclusive last day after <span class='knopfwort'>to</span>. An earlier end is corrected to the start.</li><li>Choose Palm tree, Sun symbol, or Snowman, then <span class='knopfwort'>Symbol only</span> or <span class='knopfwort'>Symbol and Vacation text</span>.</li></ol><p>Every day in the range is marked in Month, Week, Day, and the screen year grid. Pointing at a calendar mark shows the complete period. Vacation is also a separate choice in both Year-calendar and Month-calendar output.</p><div class='merke'><b>Year output</b>Every covered day is colored. The symbol or Vacation label is written only on the period's actual first day; if the period began in the preceding year, the new year's covered cells therefore have color but no repeated label.</div><div class='achtung'><b>Immediate removal</b><span class='knopfwort'>Delete vacation period</span> removes the complete period without confirmation or a recycle-bin copy. Vacation marks send no notifications and do not change appointments within the period.</div>":"<p>Dowolowy planowak waše swójske swobodne dny separatnje wot zjawnych a šulskich prózdninow markěruje. Spočatnje je pod <i>Nastajenja ▸ Protyka</i> wupinjeny; pozdźiše wupinjenje doby jenož schowa, bjez zo by je zhašało.</p><ol class='schritte'><li>Rozwińće <span class='knopfwort'>Dowolowy planowak</span> a wubjerće <span class='knopfwort'>Dowolowy planowak zmóžnić</span>.</li><li>Klikńće <span class='knopfwort'>Dowolowu dobu přidać</span>. Wobě datumowej poli spočatnje dźensniši datum wobsahujetej.</li><li>Zapodajće prěni dźeń za <span class='knopfwort'>wot</span> a inkluziwny posledni dźeń za <span class='knopfwort'>hač do</span>. Zažši kónc so na spočatk skoriguje.</li><li>Wubjerće palmu, słónčny symbol abo sněhowaka, potom <span class='knopfwort'>Jenož symbol</span> abo <span class='knopfwort'>Symbol a tekst Dowol</span>.</li></ol><p>Kóždy dźeń doby so w měsacnym, tydźenskim a dnjowym napohledźe kaž tež w lětnej šěrokosći na wobrazowce markěruje. Pokazowanje na protykowu marku cyłu dobu pokazuje. Dowol je tež separatny wuběr w lětnej a měsacnej protykowej ediciji.</p><div class='merke'><b>Lětne wudaće</b>Kóždy wobsahowany dźeń dóstanje barbu. Symbol abo popis Dowol so jenož na woprawdźity prěni dźeń doby pisa; jeli doba w předchadnym lěće započa, maja komorki noweho lěta barbu, ale žadyn wospjetowany popis.</div><div class='achtung'><b>Hnydomne wotstronjenje</b><span class='knopfwort'>Dowolowu dobu zhašeć</span> cyłu dobu bjez wobkrućenja a papjernikoweje kopije wotstroni. Dowolowe marki žane zdźělenki njepósćelu a terminy w dobje njezměnja.</div>","<p>Waste collection calendar calculates a collection series from one starting date and a fixed interval. It is initially switched off under <i>Settings ▸ Calendar</i>; switching it off later hides its series without deleting it.</p><ol class='schritte'><li>Unfold <span class='knopfwort'>Waste collection calendar</span> and select <span class='knopfwort'>Enable waste collection calendar</span>.</li><li>Choose Residual waste, Packaging / Yellow bin, or Organic waste. Each preset starts today and repeats every 14 days.</li><li>For another collection, choose <span class='knopfwort'>Custom</span> or <span class='knopfwort'>Add waste collection</span>, then enter its name and color.</li><li>Set <span class='knopfwort'>First collection</span> and an <span class='knopfwort'>Interval in days</span> from 0 through 365.</li></ol><p>An interval of <b>0</b> creates one collection. A positive interval repeats indefinitely after the first date: 7 is weekly and 14 fortnightly. No date before the first collection is marked.</p><h3>Where it appears</h3><p>Month, Week, and Day show a colored bin mark and the collection name. The compact screen year grid and Year-calendar output do not include waste collections. In Month-calendar preview, print, and ODS, <span class='knopfwort'>Include waste collections</span> adds a colored entry bar bearing the collection name, not a bin symbol.</p><div class='achtung'><b>The complete series is one definition</b><span class='knopfwort'>Delete waste collection</span> immediately removes all calculated occurrences without confirmation or a recycle-bin copy. A collection mark sends no reminder.</div>":"<p>Protyka wotpadkoweho wotwoza z jednoho spočatneho datuma a kruteho interwala seriju wuliči. Spočatnje je pod <i>Nastajenja ▸ Protyka</i> wupinjena; pozdźiše wupinjenje seriju jenož schowa, bjez zo by ju zhašało.</p><ol class='schritte'><li>Rozwińće <span class='knopfwort'>Protyka wotpadkoweho wotwoza</span> a wubjerće <span class='knopfwort'>Protyku wotpadkoweho wotwoza zmóžnić</span>.</li><li>Wubjerće zbytkowy wotpad, pakowanki / žołtu tonu abo biowotpad. Kóžde přednastajenje dźensa započina a so kóžde 14 dnjow wospjetuje.</li><li>Za druhi wotwóz wubjerće <span class='knopfwort'>Swójski</span> abo <span class='knopfwort'>Wotpadkowy wotwóz přidać</span>, potom zapodajće mjeno a barbu.</li><li>Nastajće <span class='knopfwort'>Prěni wotwóz</span> a <span class='knopfwort'>Interwal w dnjach</span> wot 0 do 365.</li></ol><p>Interwal <b>0</b> jedyn wotwóz wutwori. Pozitiwny interwal so po prěnim datumje bjez kónca wospjetuje: 7 je tydźensce a 14 kóždej dwě njedźeli. Žadyn datum před prěnim wotwozom so njemarkěruje.</p><h3>Hdźe so pokazuje</h3><p>Měsac, tydźeń a dźeń barbnu tonu a mjeno wotwoza pokazuja. Kompaktna lětna šěrokosć a lětne protykowe wudaće wotwozy njewobsahujetej. W měsacnym přehladźe, ćišću a ODS <span class='knopfwort'>Wotpadkowe wotwozy zapřijeć</span> barbny zapiskowy pask z mjenom wotwoza přidawa, nic symbol tony.</p><div class='achtung'><b>Cyła serija je jedna definicija</b><span class='knopfwort'>Wotpadkowy wotwóz zhašeć</span> wšitke wuličene wustupowanja hnydom bjez wobkrućenja abo papjernikoweje kopije wotstroni. Wotwozowa marka dopomnjeće njepósćele.</div>","<p>What happens when you click <span class='knopfwort'>Call</span> on a contact card is yours to decide. The sheet for this is reached in an unusual way.</p><div class='merke'><b>Right-click the button itself</b>Click the <span class='knopfwort'>Call</span> button on the card with the <b>right</b> mouse button. The sheet <span class='knopfwort'>Assign call action</span> opens. The same works on the <span class='knopfwort'>SMS</span> button and then opens <span class='knopfwort'>Assign SMS action</span>.</div><h3>Choosing the way</h3><ul><li><b>Magnolie Notes</b> – your own telephone dials.</li><li><span class='knopfwort'>System default</span> – whatever Windows uses for telephone numbers.</li><li><span class='knopfwort'>Custom application</span> – a program of your own. Its command goes into the field <span class='knopfwort'>Application command</span>.</li></ul><h3>Three ticks for calls</h3><ul><li><span class='knopfwort'>Notify me about incoming calls</span></li><li><span class='knopfwort'>Answer calls on the computer and talk</span></li><li><span class='knopfwort'>Lower other sounds while ringing</span></li></ul><p>The second tick sets the first one as well; without notice there can be no answering. Finish with <span class='knopfwort'>Save</span>.</p>":"<p>Akciju tłóčatka <span class='knopfwort'>Zawołać</span> sami postajeće.</p><div class='merke'><b>Prawe kliknjenje na tłóčatko</b>Klikńće na <span class='knopfwort'>Zawołać</span> z <b>prawej</b> tastu. To wočini <span class='knopfwort'>Zawołansku akciju připokazać</span>; na <span class='knopfwort'>SMS</span> wočini <span class='knopfwort'>SMS-akciju připokazać</span>.</div><h3>Puć wubrać</h3><ul><li><b>Magnolie Notes</b> – telefon wuzwoli.</li><li><span class='knopfwort'>Systemowy standard</span>.</li><li><span class='knopfwort'>Swójske nałoženje</span> – přikaz pod <span class='knopfwort'>Přikaz nałoženja</span>.</li></ul><h3>Tři zawołanske opcije</h3><ul><li><span class='knopfwort'>Wo dochadźacych zawołanjach informować</span></li><li><span class='knopfwort'>Zawołanja na ličaku přiwzać a rěčeć</span></li><li><span class='knopfwort'>Druhe zynki při zwonjenju znižić</span></li></ul><p>Druha prěnju zmóžni. Klikńće <span class='knopfwort'>Składować</span>.</p>","<p>When the telephone rings and you have permitted notice of incoming calls, a large window opens on the computer. It shows the name if the number belongs to a contact, otherwise the number, and beneath it <span class='knopfwort'>Incoming call</span>. For a call you started yourself it reads <span class='knopfwort'>Dialing…</span>, and once the other side has taken the receiver, <span class='knopfwort'>Connected</span>.</p><h3>The buttons</h3><ul><li><span class='knopfwort'>Answer</span> – present only while an incoming call is still ringing.</li><li><span class='knopfwort'>Hang up</span> – ends the running call.</li><li><span class='knopfwort'>Minimize</span> – puts the window away. A small button <span class='knopfwort'>Active call</span> with the name remains, and one click brings the window back.</li></ul><p>A button that stays grey cannot be used at this moment. Mostly the permission is missing; you set it under <span class='knopfwort'>Assign call action</span>.</p><div class='achtung'><b>You speak into the telephone, not into the computer</b>Only the operating is done here. The voice always takes the way of the telephone network and is never carried over the Magnolie connection.</div>":"<p>Při zwonjenju pokazuje wokno kontakt abo čisło a <span class='knopfwort'>Dochadźace zawołanje</span>. Při wuzwolenju <span class='knopfwort'>Wuzwoli so…</span>, potom <span class='knopfwort'>Zwjazane</span>.</p><h3>Tłóčatka</h3><ul><li><span class='knopfwort'>Přiwzać</span>.</li><li><span class='knopfwort'>Połožić</span>.</li><li><span class='knopfwort'>Minimizować</span> – wostanje <span class='knopfwort'>Aktiwne zawołanje</span>.</li></ul><p>Šěre tłóčatko trjeba dowolnosć pod <span class='knopfwort'>Zawołansku akciju připokazać</span>.</p><div class='achtung'><b>Rěčiće do telefona, nic do ličaka</b>Ličak jenož wodźi; zynk w telefonowej syći wostanje.</div>","<p>While you write an SMS or a note, a misspelled word is underlined with a red wavy line. The line alone changes nothing; it only points.</p><div class='achtung'><b>Suggestions come by right-click only</b>There is no menu entry, no toolbar and no key for this. Click the underlined word with the <b>right</b> mouse button. Only then does a small sheet with suggestions open.</div><h3>Step by step</h3><ol class='schritte'><li>Click the underlined word with the right mouse button.</li><li>The sheet first shows the word and <span class='knopfwort'>Searching for suggestions…</span>.</li><li>Click one of the offered words. It replaces the wrong one at once.</li><li>Is the word correct after all, for example a family name? Then click <span class='knopfwort'>Add to dictionary</span>. It will never be marked again.</li></ol><p>If the dictionary knows nothing better, the sheet says <span class='knopfwort'>No suggestions found.</span> Close it by clicking somewhere else.</p><div class='merke'><b>Switching the lines off</b>The check belongs to the whole program, not to the SMS sheet. You will find it under <span class='knopfwort'>Settings ▸ Typography</span> as <span class='knopfwort'>Check spelling (red wavy lines)</span>.</div>":"<p>Wopak napisane słowo ma čerwjenu falowatu linku.</p><div class='achtung'><b>Namjety jenož z prawym kliknjenjom</b>Klikńće słowo z <b>prawej</b> myšacej tastu.</div><h3>Krok po kroku</h3><ol class='schritte'><li>Klikńće prawje.</li><li>Steji <span class='knopfwort'>Namjety so pytaja…</span>.</li><li>Klikńće prawe słowo.</li><li>Abo <span class='knopfwort'>Do słownika přidać</span>.</li></ol><p>Hewak steji <span class='knopfwort'>Žane namjety namakane.</span></p><div class='merke'><b>Linki wupinyć</b>Pod <span class='knopfwort'>Nastajenja ▸ Typografija</span> je <span class='knopfwort'>Prawopis kontrolować (čerwjene falowate linki)</span>.</div>","<p>Windows stores its diagnostic files under <i>%LOCALAPPDATA%\\Magnolie Organizer\\Logs</i>.</p><ul><li><b>webview.log</b> records WebView2 and script failures in the main window and handbook.</li><li><b>bridge.log</b> records rejected or failed commands at the protected native bridge.</li><li><b>telefon.log</b> records telephone coordination and connection events.</li><li><b>kde-connect-debug.log</b> records detailed KDE Connect communication diagnostics.</li></ul><h3>Rotation and viewing</h3><p>Each log is limited to 5 MiB. On the next write, the previous portion becomes the corresponding <i>.log.old</i> file; only one old portion is retained. A single entry is limited to 64 KiB. Under <span class='knopfwort'>Settings ▸ Notifications</span>, <span class='knopfwort'>Show log</span> creates fresh display copies in the <i>Logs\\Ansicht</i> folder and opens that folder in Explorer. The source logs remain unchanged.</p><div class='achtung'><b>Inspect before sharing</b>These files can contain appointment or contact context, telephone numbers, device identifiers, file paths, error text, and network details. Share only the necessary display copy after redacting personal values. The display folder is convenient, not an anonymization service; delete exported copies when the support case is finished.</div>":"<p>Windows diagnostiske dataje pod <i>%LOCALAPPDATA%\\Magnolie Organizer\\Logs</i> składuje.</p><ul><li><b>webview.log</b> zmylki WebView2 a skriptow w hłownym woknje a přiručce protokoluje.</li><li><b>bridge.log</b> wotpokazane abo njewuspěšne přikazy při škitanym natywnym mosće protokoluje.</li><li><b>telefon.log</b> telefonowu koordinaciju a zwiskowe podawki protokoluje.</li><li><b>kde-connect-debug.log</b> nadrobnu komunikacisku diagnostiku KDE Connect protokoluje.</li></ul><h3>Rotacija a wobhladowanje</h3><p>Kóždy protokol je na 5 MiB wobmjezowany. Při přichodnym pisanju so předchadny dźěl na wotpowědnu dataju <i>.log.old</i> změni; jenož jedyn stary dźěl so wobchowa. Jedyn zapisk je na 64 KiB wobmjezowany. Pod <span class='knopfwort'>Nastajenja ▸ Zdźělenki</span> <span class='knopfwort'>Protokol pokazać</span> nowe pokazowanske kopije w rjadowaku <i>Logs\\Ansicht</i> wutwori a tutón w Explorerje wočini. Žórłowe protokole wostanu njezměnjene.</p><div class='achtung'><b>Před dźělenjom přepruwować</b>Dataje móža terminowy abo kontaktowy kontekst, telefonowe čisła, gratowe identifikatory, datajowe šćežki, zmylkowy tekst a syćowe podrobnosće wobsahować. Dźělće jenož trěbnu pokazowansku kopiju po začornjenju wosobinskich hódnotow. Pokazowanski rjadowak je přijomny, ale njeje anonymizaciska słužba; zhašejće eksportowane kopije po zakónčenju podpěrowanskeho pada.</div>","<p>You are holding the handbook for <b>Magnolie Organizer</b>, an appointment calendar, address book, task list and notepad for your computer, designed to look and feel like a leather-bound paper organizer.</p><p><b>Handbook 2.0.4</b> · For Magnolie Organizer 2.0.4</p><p>This handbook is intended for anyone who does not feel at home using a computer. It assumes <i>no prior knowledge</i>. Every action is explained step by step, with examples and illustrations. Any unfamiliar term is explained where it appears.</p><h3>How to turn the pages</h3><p>At the bottom right of the page is a turned-down corner known as a <b>dog-ear</b>. Click it to move forward one two-page spread. The dog-ear at the bottom left takes you back. You can also use the <kbd>&rarr;</kbd> and <kbd>&larr;</kbd> arrow keys on your keyboard.</p><p>The bar at the bottom contains two buttons: <span class='knopfwort'>Contents</span> takes you to the table of contents, while <span class='knopfwort'>Print / PDF</span> prints the entire handbook or saves it as a PDF if you select “Print to File” in the print dialog.</p><div class='merke'><b>A suggestion before you begin</b>Read through the first few chapters at your leisure, even if you do not try anything yet. You can use the table of contents to find every topic again later.</div>":"<p>Dźeržiće podręčnik za <b>Magnolie Organizer</b> w rukomaj, terminowu protyku, adresnik, lisćinu nadawkow a noticnik za waš ličak, kotryž je tak wuhotowany, zo kaž papjerowy organizer w kožanej wjazbje wupada a so tak posłužuje.</p><p><b>Podręčnik 2.0.4</b> · Za Magnolie Organizer 2.0.4</p><p>Tutón podręčnik je za wšitkich mysleny, kotřiž so při wužiwanju ličaka njewěsće čuja. Njepředpokłada <i>žane předznajomosće</i>. Kóžda akcija so krok po kroku z přikładami a ilustracijemi wujasnja. Kóždy njeznaty zapřijeć so tam wujasnja, hdźež so zjewi.</p><h3>Kak strony wobroćić</h3><p>Deleka naprawo na stronje je zahnuty róžk, kotryž so <b>psowe wuško</b> mjenuje. Klikńće na njón, zo byšće wo jednu dwójnu stronu doprědka šli. Psowe wuško deleka nalěwo was wróćo wjedźe. Móžeće tež šipkowej tasće <kbd>&rarr;</kbd> a <kbd>&larr;</kbd> na tastaturje wužiwać.</p><p>Delni pask wobsahuje dwě tłóčatce: <span class='knopfwort'>Wobsah</span> was k zapisej wobsaha wjedźe, <span class='knopfwort'>Ćišćeć / PDF</span> pak cyły podręčnik ćišći abo jako PDF składuje, jeli w ćišćenskim dialogu „Do dataje ćišćeć“ wubjerće.</p><div class='merke'><b>Namjet do započatka</b>Přečitajće sej prěnje někotre kapitule w měrje, byrnjež hišće ničo njewupruwujeće. Ze zapisom wobsaha móžeće kóždu temu pozdźišo zaso namakać.</div>","<p>You can type times, but using the mouse wheel is more convenient. On the appointment sheet, move the pointer over a time field without clicking, then turn the wheel:</p><ul><li>By default, turning the wheel <b>up</b> moves the time <i>earlier</i>; turning it down moves the time <i>later</i>. You can reverse this direction under <i>Settings ▸ General</i>.</li><li>Each notch changes the time by <b>five minutes</b>.</li><li>Hold down <kbd>Shift</kbd> while turning the wheel to move in <b>whole hours</b>.</li></ul><h3>The end time moves with the start time</h3><p>When you adjust the <i>start time</i>, the end time moves by the same amount. For example, 09:00–10:15 becomes 09:05–10:20: the duration remains unchanged and the entire appointment moves. This is exactly what you need when rescheduling an appointment.</p><p>Turning the wheel over the <i>end-time field</i>, by contrast, changes only the end time, allowing you to extend or shorten the appointment. The end time cannot move earlier than the start time; an appointment cannot end before it begins.</p><div class='beispiel'><b>Try it yourself</b>Create an appointment from 14:00 to 15:00. Turn the wheel down twice over the left-hand field: the times now read 14:10 to 15:10. Then turn the wheel down twice over the right-hand field: the times now read 14:10 to 15:20.</div><div class='merke'><b>New appointments already have times</b>When you create an appointment, the Organizer suggests the next quarter-hour as its start time and a duration of half an hour.</div>":"<p>Časy móžeće zapisać, ale myšace kolesko je pohódniše. Na terminowym łopjenje sunńće pokazowak nad časowe polo bjez kliknjenja a potom kolesko wjerćće:</p><ul><li>Po standardźe wjerćenje koleska <b>horje</b> čas <i>zažnišo</i> staja; wjerćenje dele čas <i>pozdźišo</i>. Směr móžeće pod <i>Nastajenja ▸ Powšitkowne</i> nawopačně nastajić.</li><li>Kóždy krok koleska změni čas wo <b>pjeć mjeńšin</b>.</li><li>Dźeržće <kbd>Shift</kbd> při wjerćenju koleska, zo byšće po <b>cyłych hodźinach</b> pohibowali.</li></ul><h3>Kónčny čas so ze započatnym časom přesuwa</h3><p>Hdyž <i>započatny čas</i> změnjeće, so kónčny čas wo samsnu dobu přesunie. Na přikład 09:00–10:15 budźe 09:05–10:20: dołhosć wostanje samsna a cyły termin so přesunie. Runje to trjebaće při přesunjenju termina.</p><p>Wjerćenje koleska nad <i>polom kónčneho časa</i> napřećo tomu změni jenož kónc, tak zo móžeće termin podlěšić abo skrótšić. Kónčny čas njeda so před započatny čas přesunyć; termin njemóže před započatkom skónčić.</p><div class='beispiel'><b>Wuspytać</b>Wutworće termin wot 14:00 do 15:00. Wjerćće kolesko dwójce dele nad lěwym polom: časy su nětko 14:10 do 15:10. Potom wjerćće dwójce dele nad prawym polom: časy su nětko 14:10 do 15:20.</div><div class='merke'><b>Nowe terminy maja hižo časy</b>Při wutworjenju termina namjetuje Organizer přichodnu štwórćhodźinu jako započatny čas a poł hodźiny jako dołhosć.</div>","<p>You have received a pairing file. Read it in on your computer to establish the connection.</p><ol class='schritte'><li>Open <span class='knopfwort'>Settings ▸ Magnolia tree</span> and make sure the tick <b>Participate in the Magnolienbaum</b> is set.</li><li>Click <span class='knopfwort'>Import pairing file …</span>.</li><li>Select the file ending in <b>.magnolie-paarung</b> and open it.</li></ol><p>If everything fits, the message <b>Securely connected to …</b> appears with the name of the other branch. No code has to be compared.</p><div class='achtung'><b>A file connection is trusted immediately</b>A branch connected in this way counts as confirmed <i>and</i> as trusted straight away. Its tasks and notes are accepted without a further question. Read in a pairing file only if you know for certain who created it.</div><p>You can withdraw the trust at any time afterwards: remove the tick <b>Trust and accept tasks and notes automatically</b> in that branch's line.</p><p>If the file is too old, already used, or damaged, the Organizer refuses it and says so. Ask for a fresh file; nothing is broken.</p>":"<p>Začitajće dóstatu sparowansku dataju.</p><ol class='schritte'><li>Wočińće <span class='knopfwort'>Nastajenja ▸ Magnolienbaum</span> a wubjerće <b>Na Magnolienbaum wobdźělić</b>.</li><li>Klikńće <span class='knopfwort'>Sparowansku dataju importować…</span>.</li><li>Wočińće <b>.magnolie-paarung</b>.</li></ol><p>Steji <b>Wěsće zwjazane z…</b> bjez koda.</p><div class='achtung'><b>Datajowy zwisk je hnydom dowěry hódny</b>Hałuz je wobkrućena <i>a</i> dowěry hódna. Jenož dataje znateho awtora začitajće.</div><p>Z <b>Dowěrić a nadawki a notice awtomatisce přiwzać</b> dowěru cofńće.</p><p>Stara, wužita abo wobškodźena dataja so wotpokazuje; prosyće wo nowu.</p>","<p>You need three things from your Nextcloud: the address of the server, your user name, and an <b>app password</b>. An app password is an additional password that applies only to this one program. Your ordinary account password is never used and never stored here.</p><h3>First create the app password</h3><p>Sign in to your Nextcloud in the web browser and create an app password there under Settings, Security. Nextcloud shows a long row of letters once only. Write it down or copy it before you close the page.</p><ol class='schritte'><li>Open <span class='knopfwort'>Settings ▸ Synchronization</span>. The first section is called <span class='knopfwort'>Nextcloud account</span>.</li><li>Type the address of the server into <span class='knopfwort'>Server address</span>, for example <i>https://cloud.example.org</i>.</li><li>Type your Nextcloud user name into <span class='knopfwort'>User name</span>.</li><li>Type the app password into <span class='knopfwort'>App password</span>.</li><li>Click <span class='knopfwort'>Save</span>.</li><li>Click <span class='knopfwort'>Test connection</span> and wait for the reply beneath the buttons.</li></ol><p>If all is well, the line beneath the buttons reads <i>Ready.</i> The password field stays empty afterwards and shows <i>stored – leave empty to keep</i>. That is intended: the password is kept on this computer in protected form and is never shown again.</p><div class='achtung'><b>The address must begin with https</b>An address beginning with <i>http</i> is refused, as is one containing a question mark or a user name. Enter only the plain address of the server, with nothing appended.</div>":"<p>Trjebaće serwerowu adresu, wužiwarske mjeno a <b>hesło nałoženja</b>. Zwučene kontowe hesło so njewužiwa.</p><h3>Hesło nałoženja wutworić</h3><p>Přizjewće so do Nextcloud a wutworće je pod Nastajenja, Wěstota. Jednorazowy rynk zapisajće.</p><ol class='schritte'><li>Wočińće <span class='knopfwort'>Nastajenja ▸ Synchronizacija</span> a <span class='knopfwort'>Konto Nextcloud</span>.</li><li>Pod <span class='knopfwort'>Serwerowa adresa</span> zapodajće <i>https://cloud.example.org</i>.</li><li>Zapodajće <span class='knopfwort'>Wužiwarske mjeno</span>.</li><li>Zapodajće <span class='knopfwort'>Hesło nałoženja</span>.</li><li>Klikńće <span class='knopfwort'>Składować</span>.</li><li>Klikńće <span class='knopfwort'>Zwisk testować</span>.</li></ol><p><i>Hotowo.</i> wuspěch woznamjenja. Polo pokazuje <i>składowane – prózdne wostajić za wobchowanje</i>.</p><div class='achtung'><b>Adresa dyrbi z https započeć</b><i>http</i>, prašak abo wužiwarske mjeno so wotpokazuja.</div>","<p>You now have a complete overview of what Magnolie Organizer can do. Take your time: you do not need to use everything at once. Many people use only the Calendar and Contacts for years, then gradually discover the other sections.</p><h3>A suggestion for getting started</h3><ol class='schritte'><li>Enter your family's birthdays under <b>Anniversaries</b>.</li><li>Retrieve the <b>public holidays</b> for your state (page <b data-page='fetching-public-and-school-holidays' class='knopfwort'></b>).</li><li>Enable <b>reminders</b> (page <b data-page='appointment-reminders' class='knopfwort'></b>).</li><li>Create a few <b>contacts</b> you use frequently.</li><li>Create a <b>backup</b> (page <b data-page='backing-up-and-restoring' class='knopfwort'></b>).</li></ol><p>The Organizer is then ready, and you can use it like a book: open it, look something up, add an entry and close it again.</p><div class='merke'><b>One start-menu entry</b>Only one <i>Magnolie Organizer</i> entry remains in the application menu; obsolete duplicate launchers are no longer shown. Open this handbook from <i>Settings ▸ About ▸ Open manual</i>. If you prefer a paper copy, print it using <span class='knopfwort'>Print / PDF</span> below.</div><p style='margin-top:18px;text-align:center;font-family:Georgia,serif;font-style:italic;color:#5a4630'>Enjoy organizing.</p>":"<p>Nětko maće dospołny přehlad, što Magnolie Organizer zamóže. Wzmiće sej čas: njetrjebaće wšitko naraz wužiwać. Wjele ludźi lěta jenož Protyku a Kontakty wužiwa a druhe wotrězki po času wotkrywa.</p><h3>Namjet za započatk</h3><ol class='schritte'><li>Zapodajće narodniny swojeje swójby pod <b>Róčnicy</b>.</li><li>Wobstarajće <b>zjawne swjate dny</b> za swój region (strona <b data-page='fetching-public-and-school-holidays' class='knopfwort'></b>).</li><li>Zmóžńće <b>dopominanja</b> (strona <b data-page='appointment-reminders' class='knopfwort'></b>).</li><li>Wutworće někotre <b>kontakty</b>, kotrež husto trjebaće.</li><li>Wutworće <b>zawěsćenje</b> (strona <b data-page='backing-up-and-restoring' class='knopfwort'></b>).</li></ol><p>Organizer je potom hotowy a móžeće jón kaž knihu wužiwać: wočinić, něšto napytać, zapisk přidać a zaso začinić.</p><div class='merke'><b>Jedyn zapisk w startowym meniju</b>W aplikaciskim meniju wostanje jenož jedyn zapisk <i>Magnolie Organizer</i>; zestarjene dwójne startowaki so wjace njepokazuja. Wočińće tutón podręčnik pod <i>Nastajenja ▸ Wo programje ▸ Podręčnik wočinić</i>. Jeli maće radšo papjerowu wersiju, ćišćće ju z <span class='knopfwort'>Ćišćeć / PDF</span> deleka.</div><p style='margin-top:18px;text-align:center;font-family:Georgia,serif;font-style:italic;color:#5a4630'>Wjele wjesela při organizowanju.</p>","All-day appointments":"Cyłodnjowe terminy","Anniversaries":"Róčnicy","Answering and ending a call":"Zawołanje přiwzać a skónčić","Appendix":"Dodawk","Appointment reminders":"Dopominanja na terminy","Back one spread":"Wo jednu dwójstronu wróćo","Backing up and restoring":"Zawěsćenja wutworić a wobnowić","Basics":"Zakłady","Birthdays and special occasions":"Narodniny a wosebite składnosće","Branches, sending, and the Android inbox":"Hałuzy, pósłanje a dochad Androida","Calendar":"Protyka","Calendars and contacts from the server":"Protyki a kontakty ze serwera","Calls from the desktop":"Anrufe vom Desktop","Choosing country and region":"Kraj a region wubrać","Choosing the language and format region":"Rěč a formatowy region wubrać","Choosing the number before dialling":"Čisło před wuzwolenjom wubrać","Click to open":"Kliknyć za wočinjenje","Click to open the book":"Kliknyć, zo by so kniha wočiniła","Close search":"Pytanje začinić","Command line and manual page":"Přikazowa linka a strona přiručki","Comparing the pairing code":"Sparowanski kod přirunać","Comparing the six-digit code":"Šěsćměstnowy kod přirunać","Components required for the user interface are missing. Install them with:\n  sudo apt install python3-gi gir1.2-gtk-3.0 gir1.2-webkit2-4.1\n":"Komponenty, kotrež su za wužiwarski powjerch trěbne, faluja. Instalujće je z:\n  sudo apt install python3-gi gir1.2-gtk-3.0 gir1.2-webkit2-4.1\n","Conflicts and attachments":"Konflikte und Bindungen","Connecting over a network or the Internet":"Přez syć abo internet zwjazać","Connecting over the Internet":"Přez internet zwjazać","Connecting the phone, step by step":"Telefon krok po kroku zwjazać","Contact details and anniversaries":"Kontaktowe podrobnosće a róčnicy","Contacts":"Kontakty","Contacts for Claws Mail":"Kontakte für Claws Mail","Contents":"Wobsah","Contents (continued)":"Wobsah (pokročowanje)","Could not create POT template: %s":"POT-předłoha njeda so wutworić: %s","Creating a contact":"Kontakt wutworić","Creating a pairing file":"Sparowansku dataju wutworić","Deciding what a call may do":"Postajić, što zawołanje smě","Delegating tasks":"Aufgaben delegieren","Deleting SMS histories":"SMS-historije zhašeć","Deletion proposals and synchronized trash":"Löschvorschläge und synchronisierter Papierkorb","Editing and deleting appointments":"Terminy wobdźěłać a zhašeć","Editing, saving, and deleting Android notes":"Androidowe notice wobdźěłać, składować a zhašeć","Enabling Health and finding your way around":"Strowotu zmóžnić a so w njej orientować","Entering an appointment":"Termin zapodać","Every second Thursday: the monthly weekday":"Kóždy druhi štwórtk: tydźenski dźeń w měsacu","Exporting":"Eksportować","Exporting data to other programs":"Daty do druhich programow eksportować","Fetching public and school holidays":"Zjawne swjate dny a šulske prózdniny wobstarać","Finding your way around Magnolie Notes":"W Magnolie Notes so orientować","Font, size and color":"Pismo, wulkosć a barba","Formatting and spell checking":"Formatowanje a prawopisna kontrola","Forward one spread":"Wo jednu dwójstronu doprědka","Getting timely anniversary reminders":"Zahe dopominanje na róčnicy","Glossary: A–M":"Glosar: A–M","Glossary: N–Z":"Glosar: N–Z","Go to the table of contents":"K zapisej wobsaha","Health":"Strowota","Holidays":"Swjate dny","How a Magnolienbaum message finds a secure route":"Kak powěsć Magnolienbauma wěsty puć namaka","How the book is laid out":"Kak je kniha zbudowana","How update checks establish trust":"Kak přepruwowanje aktualizacijow dowěru zawěsća","Import results, duplicates, and archive limits":"Importowe wuslědki, duplikaty a mjezy archiwow","Importing":"Importować","Importing data from other programs":"Daty z druhich programow importować","In closing":"Na kóncu","Installing and updating Magnolie Notes safely":"Magnolie Notes wěsće instalować a aktualizować","Installing the Organizer":"Organizer instalować","Invalid language: %s (expected de, en, or system).":"Njepłaćiwa rěč: %s (wočakowane de, en abo system).","Keyboard shortcuts at a glance":"Tastowe skrótšenki w přehladźe","License and acknowledgments":"Licenca a dźak","Linux diagnostic and reminder logs":"Diagnostiske a dopomnjenske protokole Linuxa","Linux without installing: the AppImage":"Linux bjez instalacije: AppImage","Local data, passwords, and integration keys":"Lokalne daty, hesła a integraciske kluče","Long lists: Show more and Show all":"Dołhe lisćiny: Wjace pokazać a Wšitko pokazać","Looking at a single message closely":"Podrobnosće jednotliweje powěsće","Magnolie Organizer - Handbook":"Magnolie Organizer – Podręčnik","Magnolie Organizer - User Guide\n\nUsage:\n  magnolie-handbuch          Open the handbook\n  magnolie-handbuch --help   Show this overview\n  magnolie-handbuch --sprache SPRACHE / --language LANGUAGE\n                             Use de, en, or system for this invocation\n  magnolie-handbuch --pot [DATEI] / --pot-template [FILE]\n                             Create a gettext POT template\n":"Magnolie Organizer – Wužiwarski nawod\n\nWužiwanje:\n  magnolie-handbuch          Podręčnik wočinić\n  magnolie-handbuch --help   Tutón přehlad pokazać\n  magnolie-handbuch --sprache SPRACHE / --language LANGUAGE\n                             Za tute wołanje de, en abo system wužiwać\n  magnolie-handbuch --pot [DATEI] / --pot-template [FILE]\n                             Gettext-POT-předłohu wutworić\n","Magnolie Organizer · Handbook":"Magnolie Organizer · Podręčnik","Magnolie mit einem Kaffee unterstützen":"Podpěrajće Magnolie z kofejom","Magnolienbaum":"Magnolienbaum","Making your first call from a contact card":"Prěnje zawołanje z kontaktoweje karty","Maps, routes, and messages":"Karty, ruty a powěsće","Minimizing, closing and quitting":"Minimizować, začinić a skónčić","More appointment fields":"Dalše pola termina","Moving from Lotus Organizer":"Z Lotus Organizer přeńć","Multi-day appointments":"Wjacednjowe terminy","My projects":"Moje projekty","No matching handbook pages.":"Žane wotpowědowace strony přiručki.","Note symbols and text formatting on Android":"Noticowe symbole a tekstowe formatowanje na Androidźe","Notebooks and pages":"Notatniki a strony","Notes":"Notice","Notes and notebooks on Android":"Notice a notatniki na Androidźe","Opening and navigating Settings":"Nastajenja wočinić a wobdźěłować","Option %s requires a language.":"Opcija %s rěč žada.","Organizer · User Guide":"Organizer · Wužiwarski nawod","POT template written to: %s":"POT-předłoha je so zapisała do: %s","Page":"Strona","Pairing KDE Connect for SMS":"KDE Connect za SMS sparować","Pairing an Android branch with the Magnolienbaum":"Androidowu hałuzu z Magnolienbaumom sparować","Pairing the phone connection and enabling Bluetooth fallback":"Telefonowy zwisk sparować a Bluetooth jako narunanje zmóžnić","Password protection and encryption":"Hesłowy škit a zaklučowanje","People, filters, and reminders":"Wosoby, filtry a dopominanja","Personal Sync":"Persönliche Synchronisierung","Phone":"Telefon","Phone data, SMS, control, and call audio":"Telefonowe daty, SMS, wodźenje a zynk zawołanja","Planner":"Planowak","Platform and security matrix":"Plattform- und Sicherheitsmatrix","Ports, discovery, and firewall rules":"Porty, namakanje a prawidła wohnjoweje murje","Preface":"Předsłowo","Print / PDF":"Ćišćeć / PDF","Print the entire handbook or save it as a PDF":"Cyły podręčnik ćišćeć abo jako PDF składować","Printing":"Ćišćenje","Printing and duplicate contacts":"Ćišćenje a dwójne kontakty","Printing and saving as PDF":"Ćišćeć a jako PDF składować","Progress, printing, ODS, and deleting records":"Wuwiće, ćišćenje, ODS a zhašenje zapiskow","Reading in a pairing file":"Sparowansku dataju začitać","Reconnect and renew pairing":"Znowa zwjazać a sparowanje wobnowić","Recording blood pressure and blood sugar":"Krejny ćišć a krejny cokor zapisać","Recovery snapshots in Magnolie Notes":"Wobnowjenske kopije w Magnolie Notes","Recurring appointments":"Wospjetowace so terminy","Recurring appointments and ICS round trips":"Wospjetowace so terminy a ICS-wuměna tam a wróćo","Reminder command modes":"Přikazowe modusy dopominanjow","Reminder time limits":"Časowe mjezy dopominanjow","Reminders":"Dopominanja","Reminders with password protection":"Dopominanja při hesłowym škitje","Removing a branch again":"Hałuzu zaso wotstronić","Removing and replacing a phone":"Telefon wotstronić a narunać","Reviewing synchronized deletion proposals on Android":"Synchronizowane namjety zhašenja na Androidźe přepruwować","Ring binding":"Rynkowe wjazanje","SMS with KDE Connect":"SMS mit KDE Connect","Search":"Pytać","Search handbook":"Přiručku přepytać","Searching and using the alphabetical index":"Pytać a alfabetiski indeks wužiwać","Searching for a branch in your own network":"Hałuzu we swójskej syći pytać","Searching with Ctrl+F":"Pytanje z Ctrl+F","Searching, organizing, and adding attachments":"Pytać, rjadować a přiwěški přidawać","Security":"Wěstota","Seeing and controlling an incoming call":"Dochadźace zawołanje widźeć a wodźić","Sending your first SMS from a contact card":"Prěnju SMS z kontaktoweje karty pósłać","Setting times with the mouse wheel":"Časy z myšacym koleskom nastajić","Setting up KDE Connect and using the SMS sheet":"KDE Connect zarjadować a SMS-łopjeno wužiwać","Setting up the Nextcloud account":"Konto Nextcloud zarjadować","Setting up the tray applet":"Systemowy applet zarjadować","Setting up your own branch":"Swójsku hałuzu zarjadować","Settings":"Nastajenja","Shared notes and workgroups":"Zhromadne notice a dźěłowe skupiny","Sharing entries securely":"Zapiski wěsće dźělić","Sharing text, images, and PDFs into Magnolie Notes":"Tekst, wobrazy a PDF-dataje do Magnolie Notes dźělić","Shift and cycle day markers":"Dnjowe marki za změny a cyklus","Spelling help while writing":"Prawopisna pomoc při pisanju","Starting and reopening the Organizer":"Organizer startować a znowa wočinić","Starting automatically at sign-in":"Při přizjewjenju awtomatisce startować","Starting for the first time":"Prěni start","Supported environment variables":"Podpěrane wokolinowe wariable","Switches that hide, and never delete":"Přepinaki, kotrež chowaja, ale ženje njezhašeja","Synchronizing branch contacts":"Filialkontakte synchronisieren","Synchronizing with online accounts":"Z online-kontami synchronizować","Synchronizing your own notes and tasks":"Synchronisieren Sie Ihre eigenen Notizen und Aufgaben","Taking notes over from files and folders":"Notice z datajow a rjadowakow přewzać","Tasks":"Nadawki","Tasks and reminders in Magnolie Notes":"Nadawki a dopominanja w Magnolie Notes","Technical limits for files and quantities":"Techniske mjezy za dataje a mnóstwa","The SMS settings sheet":"Łopjeno SMS-nastajenjow","The SMS sheet at a glance":"SMS-łopjeno w přehladźe","The day view":"Dnjowy napohlad","The encrypted mailbox":"Zaklučowana póštowa kašćik","The handbook directory could not be found.":"Rjadowak podręčnika njeda so namakać.","The month view":"Měsacny napohlad","The recycle bin":"Papjerowy koš","The right export format for each notes app":"Prawy eksportowy format za kóžde noticowe nałoženje","The tabs along the edge":"Rajtarki po kromje","The task list":"Lisćina nadawkow","The thirteen Settings pages":"Třinaće stronow Nastajenjow","The vacation planner":"Planowak dowola","The waste collection calendar":"Protyka wotwoza wotpadkow","The week view":"Tydźenski napohlad","The year at a glance":"Lěto na jedyn pohlad","Time, week, temperature and time zone":"Čas, tydźeń, temperatura a časowe pasmo","Transferring the Magnolie Notes APK to the phone":"APK Magnolie Notes na telefon přenjesć","Troubleshooting":"Rozrisać problemy","Turning pages and moving around":"Listować a po knize so pohibować","Update paths on each platform":"Aktualizaciske puće na kóždej platformje","Using Personal Sync on Android":"Personal Sync na Androidźe wužiwać","Version and updates":"Wersija a aktualizacije","Weather requests and privacy":"Wjedrowe naprašowanja a priwatnosć","Welcome":"Witajće","What Nextcloud does for you":"Što Nextcloud za was čini","What a recovery snapshot is":"Što je wobnowjenska kopija","What the Organizer can do for you":"Što Organizer za was móže činić","What the call window tells you":"Što zawołanske wokno zdźěluje","What your computer needs":"Što waš ličak trjeba","When Nextcloud does not answer":"Hdyž Nextcloud njewotmołwja","When the text has to be adjusted":"Hdyž dyrbi so tekst přiměrić","Which connection belongs to which function":"Kotary zwisk ke kotrej funkciji słuša","Why the SMS button is missing":"Čehodla SMS-tłóčatko faluje","Windows diagnostic logs":"Diagnostiske protokole Windowsa","Writing letters":"Listy pisać","and":"a","of":"z","Über den Programmierer und Autor dieses Buches":"Wo programowarju a awtorje tuteje knihy","Über dieses Projekt":"Wo tutym projekće"}});
